3335324264	Schlosskeller Gourmetstube	Seggaubergstraße 5	Austria	Leibnitz	Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.schlosskellersuedsteiermark.at/	1 Star	Modern Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€€€	t	t	This well-preserved listed building boasts a picturesque location in a small village near Leibnitz. Inside, a blend of modern design and historical architecture creates an inviting atmosphere^ outside, the terrace with its magnificent views is a popular spot during the summer months. Consummate professional Markus Rath is in charge of the kitchen. Using select, locally sourced produce, he crafts modern dishes, occasionally incorporating Asian elements. He proposes a surprise menu comprising five or seven courses. To complement the food, there are expertly chosen wine pairings, as well as non-alcoholic alternatives. Attentive service comes courtesy of a friendly and experienced team – often supported by the chef.	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
3336755562	Lieperts	Arnfelser Straße 2	Austria	Leutschach an der Weinstraße	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.lieperts.at	1 Star	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	t	t	This establishment is officially named Lieperts Café, Dinner, Rooms, which accurately reflects its offerings: You can come for a wonderful breakfast Fri-Sun, then later in the day, a selection of appealing snacks and drinks are available. Owner and eponym Manuel Liepert serves up fine dining cuisine Mon-Tue and Fri-Sat (reservations required). This comes in the form of a five- to seven-course surprise menu preluded by a number of delectable amuse-bouches. Dishes such as chicken, papaya, peanut and sweet potato or pan-seared pike-perch, beurre blanc, green strawberry and mushrooms showcase a contemporary approach with regional and international influences. Maître d' Lisa Kürbisch provides interesting recommendations from the wine impressive list dominated by labels from the region. There are four tastefully decorated, modern guestrooms.	valentinicolas	\N	\N
3332693265	Verdi	Pachmayrstraße 137	Austria	Linz	Car park,Terrace	https://verdi.at/restaurant/	1 Star	International, Creative	5.0	€€€	t	f	Located on the edge of a forest in the countryside above Linz, this restaurant is a fine dining institution in the city, thanks to the unwavering commitment of owner Erich Lukas. His son Philipp has now joined him in the kitchen. Their modern and pleasingly accessible cuisine based on classical foundations is pared back to the essentials, with the odd Asian influence thrown in here and there. Take, for example, the piglet belly cooked until crispy on the outside and wonderfully tender on the inside, combined with the subtle acidity of a Calamansi gel and served in an intense broth flavoured with the hot and spicy notes of Karashi mustard and the appealing pungency of lemongrass – a dish that represents the scale of their ambition and is real pleasure to eat! The chic interior (some tables with view of Linz), fantastic terrace, judicious wine suggestions, and exceedingly charming and professional service team also play their part.	huberflorin	\N	\N
3338011100	Rossbarth	Klammstraße 7	Austria	Linz		https://rossbarth.at/	1 Star	Modern Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	t	f	Modern, concise and pared-back – the description of the stylish restaurant design could also be applied to the set menu devised by the chef-patron pair Marco Barth and Sebastian Rossbach. When it comes to the ingredients, the focus is on all that the region has to offer, with a particular insistence on organic produce^ the saltwater fish they serve is caught in the wild. Their thoughtful creations yield interesting subtle contrasts – for instance, their maple syrup-glazed shiitake mushrooms served on beautifully seasoned braised leeks, and lent a refreshing fruitiness by an apple brunoise. The attentive and well-drilled front-of-house team is supported by the chefs, who are happy to provide diners with information about the provenance of the produce. Housed in a distinctive barrel vaulted room in a listed historical townhouse, this restaurant with minimalist decor has a small window providing a view into the kitchen.	tudoroh	\N	\N
3337752441	Mangold	Pfänderstraße 3	Austria	Lochau	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.restaurant-mangold.at	1 Star	Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	f	This friendly family-run restaurant serving contemporary regional cuisine proposes a range of very different dining spaces. Stube is cosy and rustic, Rossini is Mediterranean and the Wintergarten is light and airy. Plus there is the secluded inner courtyard.	guerravictor	\N	\N
3333587688	Yu Yue Heen	71F	China Mainland	Guangzhou	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://www.fourseasons.com/guangzhou/dining/restaurants/yu_yue_heen	1 Star	Cantonese	3.0	¥¥¥¥	t	f	The head chef, who hails from Guangdong, has been cooking professionally since the age of 15 and has extensive experience at hotels in Shanghai and Nanjing. Each dish embodies the utmost finesse and attention to detail. The range of dim sum at lunch is dazzling – especially the deep-fried taro dumplings with shrimp and chicken filling. His signature crispy-skin chicken, made with birds from Qingyuan, boasts robust flavours and a velvety texture.	ionescuamy	\N	\N
3333541597	Mesnerhaus	Markt 56	Austria	Mauterndorf	Car park	http://www.mesnerhaus.at	1 Star	Seasonal Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	f	t	Set in the Salzburg mountains, in the UNESCO Biosphere Park, Mesnerhaus has been run by Maria and Josef Steffner since 2007. The modern interior design within the venerable walls of this building dating back to 1420se, incorporates the historical architecture beautifully. An extremely warm and welcoming hostess, Maria is responsible for the wine cellar, restaurant and hotel, which has six cosy rooms and a suite. With just as much dedication, Josef delivers expressive, creative cuisine made from regional and seasonal produce, served as a set menu or à la carte. The signature dish Lungau potato with sour cream, egg yolk and Grüll caviar is fabulous.	romaniriccardo	\N	\N
3336558665	Ois	Unternberg 6	Austria	Neufelden	Car park,Interesting wine list	https://www.muehltalhof.at/	2 Stars	Modern Cuisine, Austrian	3.0	€€€€	t	t	The Mühltalhof is a marvellous combination of traditional and modern. Not only do they have appealing guestrooms but also, most importantly, great food! Boasting a modern interior design characterised by chic black furnishings and fittings, Ois has just five tables. A 12-course set menu is prepared in kitchens that can be glimpsed through the open sliding door. Owner and chef Philip Rachinger has a style of his own, which is characterised by intense and skilfully combined flavours, not least in ‘Lake trout BBQ, chanterelles, yolk and lettuce’. The excellent service team includes a fantastic sommelier: charming, relaxed and professional Daniel Schicker recommends very interesting wine pairings. Alternatively, the second restaurant serves a four-course carte-blanche menu.	pagliucahans	\N	\N
