3333552165	Verschil	Bruggesteenweg 164	Belgium	Gits	Car park,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.bistrotverschil.be/	Nessun premio	French Contemporary	3.0	€€€	t	f	A pleasant atmosphere reigns in this rustic looking restaurant, where the owner provides service with a smile. The refined dishes are made with quality ingredients.	rossiyuri	\N	\N
