3330317543	In Love (Gongti East Road)	Next to East 2 Gate	China Mainland	Beijing	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Terrace		1 Star	Hunanese	3.0	¥¥¥	f	f	This is a Hunanese restaurant, but its décor easily passes for a modern bistro with sleek furniture and a muted palette, punctuated by lime green banquettes. The same degree of eclecticism is at work on the menu, as the Hunanese chef puts a new spin on the classics. Steamed fish head with pickled chilli duo uses bighead carp shipped daily from Qiandao Lake in Zhejiang. Pre-order this dish alongside others when booking a table.	sommerlaura	\N	\N
