3336771966	Yong Fu (Hongkou)	56F	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view		1 Star	Ningbo	3.0	¥¥¥¥	t	t	The swanky room overlooking the Pudong skyline and Huangpu River boasts marble walls and exquisite chandeliers. Half of the menu features Ningbo classics, while the other half presents novelty dishes made with ingredients from all over China. Live seafood is shipped daily from Zhejiang Province in the small hours to ensure freshness. Try stir-fried white crabmeat, sautéed cattail with shrimp roe, and sticky rice balls with black sesame filling.	marinescumario	\N	\N
3336610256	Yong Fu (Huangpu)	12F	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Car park		1 Star	Ningbo	5.0	¥¥¥	f	t	Shanghainese are no strangers to Ningbo cuisine and they know what they like! This restaurant with bags of old Shanghai charm serves wild-caught seafood shipped daily from Ningbo then meticulously prepared to highlight its natural flavours. Portion sizes can be tailored to your party size, and the emphasis is on seasonal items, such as razor clams from Ninghai (available Mar-May). The yellow croaker roe aspic and handmade glutinous rice balls are also worth trying.	fontanagiuseppe	\N	\N
