3336076851	Traditional Hakka Lui Cha	Jurong West 505 Market & Food Centre	Singapore	Singapore	Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	4.0	$	f	t	Hakkanese Lui Cha is a soupy rice dish in which chicken, cabbage and pickles meet the nuttiness of sesame and peanuts plus a hint of herbs. Order the fish cake, stuffed tofu or fried egg toppings.	ionescuamy	\N	\N
