3335352326	L'Orchidée	33 rue Gilardoni	France	Altkirch	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	http://www.orchidee-altkirch.com	1 Star	Thai, Asian Contemporary	4.0	€€€	t	t	This orchid invites us on mouth-watering, gourmet voyage. The modern, scrupulously crafted Thai cuisine is elegant and perfumed, illustrated by a tom yam of blue lobster, coconut milk and galanga or Vosges squab, served with sweetcorn, girolles mushrooms, polenta and red curry. Delicious from start to finish and a phenomenal success story.	krausmartina	\N	\N
