3330868651	Babel	Piarista Köz 2	Hungary	Budapest	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.babel-budapest.hu	1 Star	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	f	t	A city institution, Babel represents the perfect blend of tradition and modernity. Its walls still show marks from the 1838 Great Flood of Pest, yet it’s also a chic, stylish place thanks to passionate owner Hubert and interior designer Annamaria Dekany. The cooking follows in a similar vein, with the multi-course tasting menu comprising consummately seasoned, creative modern dishes which simultaneously exhibit references to their Hungarian heritage. Highlights include red shrimp with tomato and plankton, and guinea fowl with a steamed bun^ be sure to go for the casino egg ‘add-on’ too.	m�llercristian	\N	\N
