3332008546	nent	B1F	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning	https://www.nent-osaka.com/	1 Star	French	3.0	¥¥¥	f	f	An intimate restaurant by a chef and sommelier. The team’s experience extends to Italian and Spanish, with French cuisine as the pivot. Imaginative food combinations and spices establish the eatery’s unique character. Creativity is not limited to Western traditions: the team takes pointers from Japanese cuisine as well. The name is Latin for ‘spin’, as the raison d’être is to spin food and wine into a few hours of happiness.	georgesculalla	\N	\N
3333164606	ORIGIN	1-4-3 Tsuriganecho	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning	https://origin-french.com/	1 Star	French	3.0	¥¥¥	t	t	French cuisine that respects the flavours of each ingredient. The chef honed his craft in Paris and Nice. True to his restaurant’s name, the chef pays close attention to ingredients, terroir and season. Seafood is sourced from Ehime, where the chef’s roots are. Appetisers are light, meat dishes prepared with a feel for the classics. During hunting season, game baked in a pastry shell is a masterpiece^ seasonal specialities are something to look forward to.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
