3334143456	Feng Wei Ju	5F	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.starworldmacau.com/restaurant/feng-wei-ju	2 Stars	Hunanese, Sichuan	4.0	$$	f	t	The opulent room is covered in gold and red, the festive colours for the Chinese. The menu offers Sichuan classics, such as sautéed chicken with peanuts and chilli, and Hunanese fare like steamed carp fish head with chilli. Hand-pulled noodles are also worth trying – watching the chefs pulling them in the display kitchen adds to the entertainment. Boiled mandarin fish fillets in chilli oil comes in portions generous enough for a few to share.	novotnycecilia	\N	\N
