3335835273	Molina	51F	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Great view,Interesting wine list,Valet parking	https://www.restaurant-molina.com/	1 Star	Innovative	3.0	$$$$	f	t	Perched atop a skyscraper, the restaurant affords panoramic vistas of KL's skyline. Chef Sidney Schutte hails from the southern shores of the Netherlands. His seven- to nine-course menu is a delectable amalgam of French techniques, Nordic sensibility and Asian twists^ seafood and vegetables are his strong suits. His carrot dessert is the final bow, imparting depth and sweetness. With a menu spanning 3 hours, it's the perfect setup for a date.	benesemily	\N	\N
