3332730499	Knystaforsen	Rydöforsvägen 4	Sweden	Rydöbruk	Car park,Garden or park,Great view	https://knystaforsen.se	1 Star	Modern Cuisine, Creative	3.0	€€€€	f	f	A meal at Knystaforsen is truly a delight and staying the night further enhances the experience. A former sawmill, it sits in a wonderful spot beside the river, surrounded by woodland, and nature really is at every turn, be that through the panoramic windows or on your plate. Superb ingredients are from the local area and traditional wood-fired cooking adds a smoky edge – one course is even served outside by the campfire. You might sample such delights as moose tartare, trout with lingonberries or duck hearts with wild garlic, which are paired with both wines and interesting non-alcoholic creations.	iordachelilly	\N	\N
3337805501	VYN	Höga vägen 72	Sweden	Simrishamn	Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://www.vynrestaurant.se	2 Stars	Creative	5.0	€€€€	t	t	On the southern tip of Sweden, Chef-Owner Daniel Berlin has taken a former farmhouse and turned it into the latest platform for his thrillingly impressive cooking. A dish of milk-fed lamb encapsulates so many of VYN’s strengths: the produce is superb^ the cooking over fire is precise and technically accomplished^ and the accompanying brunoise of lamb heart, neck and sweetbreads underlines how using the whole animal bolsters both flavour and sustainability. The full operation also includes 15 hotel rooms and the more relaxed Food and Wine bar.	grasomarkus	\N	\N
3335584912	Adam / Albin	Rådmansgatan 16	Sweden	Stockholm	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://www.adamalbin.se/	1 Star	Creative	4.0	€€€€	f	t	The eponymous Chef-Owners offer an exciting all-round experience at this intimate restaurant, where they finish dishes at the table while they explain the make-up of these original, intricate creations. Luxury Nordic produce is to the fore in the boldly flavoured dishes, but the influences are global, from Provençal (artichoke barigoule) to Japanese (mushroom chawanmushi). Service is personable and the room has a lovely moody-chic feel.	petrovmelissa	\N	\N
