3332420095	Frantzén	Klara Norra Kyrkogata 26	Sweden	Stockholm	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Interesting wine list	https://www.restaurantfrantzen.com/	3 Stars	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	t	t	World-renowned Chef Björn Frantzén provides a truly immersive experience that you won't forget in a hurry at his uber-stylish restaurant. Ring the bell to enter, before enjoying an aperitif in the top-floor lounge while the day's ingredients are explained, then head to the dining room with its beautiful counter seating to witness the exceptionally talented chefs at work as they craft creative, perfectly executed dishes. The service works like clockwork to enhance the experience.	brandtclara	\N	\N
