3332596734	AIRA	Biskopsvägen 9	Sweden	Stockholm	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://www.aira.se	2 Stars	Modern Cuisine, Swedish	4.0	€€€€	f	t	This strikingly designed restaurant sits near the beautiful Royal Djurgården. Its stage is the open kitchen, with the chefs often adding their finishing touches tableside. Beautifully composed dishes use top quality Nordic ingredients and deliver well-judged flavours and textures, featuring the likes of halibut with fermented melon, sesame and jalapeno. Service is top-notch and it’s worth opting for either a wine pairing or the creative non-alcoholic option featuring ingredients from their garden. Be sure arrive early for a drink on the waterside terrace too.	bernardiliam	\N	\N
