3336209484	Les Montagnards - Le Sommet	Rue de Montsalvens 4	Switzerland	Broc	Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://lesmontagnards.ch/	1 Star	Creative, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	f	f	The small fine dining establishment of Les Montagnards Hotel commands a jaw-dropping view over the Moléson and the Château de Gruyères. Diners enjoy modern cuisine by Kaiichi Arimoto, a Swiss-trained chef who boasts a stint with Peter Knogl in Basel’s three-star Cheval Blanc. Arimoto’s subtle, expressive score never fails to deliver, courtesy of premium ingredients, spot-on technique, a focus on flavour and an aversion to gimmicks. Examples: gambero rosso, silky beurre blanc, wild salmon roe^ suckling lamb, spinach and paprika-flavoured broad beans. Slick service and insightful wine tips. Guestrooms are available for those interested in hiking around the glorious countryside.	vargalucia	\N	\N
