3334796882	Mammertsberg	Bahnhofstrasse 28	Switzerland	Freidorf	Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.mammertsberg.ch/	2 Stars	Creative, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	f	t	The exclusive boutique hotel is only one side of this beautiful old establishment with a fabulous view that reaches all the way to Lake Constance. Another is the restaurant run by the duo of MICHELIN-starred chefs, Andreas Caminada and Silvio Germann: here, the latter, as head chef, uses the best ingredients to cook up creative dishes – elaborate but not fussy, reduced yet with real depth of flavour. The whole service team is truly outstanding! The decor is an elegant blend of traditional and modern, and the terrace is wonderful.	novotarskymariia	\N	\N
