3332714711	Damien Germanier	Rue du Scex 33	Switzerland	Sion	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://damiengermanier.ch/	1 Star	Creative	5.0	€€€€	t	f	After deciding on the number of courses (from four to ten) with chef Damien Germanier, who can often be found chatting to diners, you will give him carte blanche. His creativity and original ideas, primarily vegetable, are invariably spot on and you need not be fearful of putting yourself in his hands. A modern interior with designer touches, striking photo prints, stylish seating and a rock’n roll soundtrack sets the buzzy scene. The service is attentive and charming.	orlandofernando	\N	\N
3331234611	Du Cerf	Rue du Collège 4	Switzerland	Sonceboz	Car park,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://www.cerf-sonceboz.ch/	1 Star	Classic French, Farm to table	3.0	€€€€	f	t	Set in the heart of the peaceful village of Sonceboz, this establishment is a culinary landmark in what is known as the Jura Arc and also throughout Switzerland. Chef Jean-Marc Soldati, at the helm for many years now, has played a major role in the restaurant's success. For this alumnus of Crissier, where he worked alongside Fredy Girardet and Philippe Rochat, tradition is a serious business. His classic cuisine is rigorous and harmonious, drawing mainly on local and French ingredients and even the chef's own kitchen garden. The wine list features a selection of regional, Swiss and French wines, as well as terrific picks by the glass. Book yourself into one of the modern, well-appointed guestrooms and stay on after dinner.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
