3332149241	La Bourse et la Vie	12 rue Vivienne	France	Paris		https://www.labourselavie.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	This bistro owned by an American chef is a big hit. So what is the secret of his success? Distinctly French dishes, slightly tweaked, quality ingredients and flavours that are on point. Leeks with vinaigrette^ onglet de bœuf (a skirt steak) with peppercorn sauce^ chocolate mousse: all manner of bistro classics that you'll be delighted to come across (again).	lazarmaya	\N	\N
