3337718673	Le Du	399/3 Soi Si Lom 7	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park	https://www.ledubkk.com	1 Star	Thai contemporary	4.0	฿฿฿฿	t	t	Chef “Ton” Thitid creatively re-interprets Thai cuisine, with a rotating seasonal menu – Le Du comes from a Thai word meaning ‘season’. In summer, highlights include their signature Khao Chae, as well as Khao Khluk Kapi^ the organic rice, cooked with salty aromatic shrimp paste and pork jam, is served with perfectly done river prawns. A relaxed ambience makes this a welcome retreat for diners.	toscanomarek	\N	\N
