3332258852	The Kitchin	78 Commercial Quay	United Kingdom	Leith	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://thekitchin.com/	1 Star	Modern Cuisine	4.0	££££	t	f	Housed in the historic Port of Leith, this restaurant has been at the forefront of the Edinburgh dining scene for years. It’s no wonder it’s such a success, given the quality found in the balanced, flavoursome dishes that champion seasonal Scottish produce – come in grouse season and you won’t be disappointed. An array of menus includes a well-priced lunch option and the Prestige surprise menu, which offers the most complete experience. Try to get a table by the kitchen, which lets you in on the action via a large viewing window.	hatajfiorello	\N	\N
3333841649	Martin Wishart	54 The Shore	United Kingdom	Leith	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://restaurantmartinwishart.co.uk	1 Star	Modern Cuisine, Contemporary	5.0	££££	f	t	For over 20 years, Martin Wishart has been welcoming diners to his eponymous restaurant in the historic and characterful port of Leith. Over the years, he has continually tweaked and reassessed the food and the décor, and the bright, modern style of the dining room is a great match for the current cooking. The kitchen shows great skill in marrying top Scottish produce like grouse and Orkney scallops with classic French technique, resulting in dishes that deliver the flavours they promise, with nothing unnecessary on the plate.	palombasauro	\N	\N
