3338051194	Taku	36 Albemarle Street	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Notable sake list	https://www.takumayfair.com/	1 Star	Japanese, Sushi	4.0	££££	f	f	The home of internationally renowned sushi chef Takuya Watanabe and right-hand man Long Ng, this 16-seater restaurant is centred around its striking counter fashioned from fine English oak. The omakase menu has a similar focus on quality, using only the finest ingredients, mostly from European waters. There’s a purity and elegance to every mouthful, exemplified by the superlative 'tuna two ways'. There’s one sitting at lunch and two at dinner – and as all guests are served together, be sure to arrive on time.	leonechristian	\N	\N
3331409646	The Ninth	22 Charlotte Street	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.theninthlondon.com/	1 Star	Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	£££	t	t	It was a great relief – and a cause for celebration – when The Ninth reopened in 2023 after a fire. Jun Tanaka’s place may be on Charlotte Street, with its plethora of dining options, but this feels very much like a neighbourhood spot, with its two floors of closely-set tables creating a lively, busy atmosphere. The menu is immeasurably appealing and comes with more than twist of Mediterranean flavour^ dishes are meant for sharing but there’s no pressure. It’s the boldness and the confidence of the cooking that impresses, with dishes that are succulent and delicious.	petrovmelissa	\N	\N
