3335362617	The Sportsman	Faversham Road	United Kingdom	Seasalter	Car park,Garden or park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://www.thesportsmanseasalter.co.uk	1 Star	Modern British	5.0	£££	t	f	An inn has stood here since 1642 and The Sportsman’s reputation continues to bring diners from across the country to this windswept spot by the sea wall. The Thames Estuary provides wonderfully fresh fish and oysters, and the adjacent marshes, woodlands and soils provide meat, game and vegetables. While the place has a comfortingly traditional feel, the dishes mix old favourites (like pot-roast pork loin) with newer ideas. The cooking is assured and satisfying, with seamless flavour combinations and an understated level of complexity. Wooden cabins in the garden are available for a peaceful night's rest.	palmieridaniel	\N	\N
