3337681180	Osteria 1126	località Cinciano 2	Italy	Poggibonsi	Car park,Terrace	https://www.cinciano.it/	Nessun premio	Tuscan	3.0	€	t	f	The 1126 in the name of this restaurant refers to the year in which the hilltop hamlet in which it is situated was founded. Today the hamlet is home to apartments with their own kitchen, as well as the main villa. In the restaurant, a young enthusiastic couple serves contemporary - style cuisine made from local ingredients.	parisibenjamin	\N	\N
