3330545769	La Barrière de Transinne	rue de la Barrière 4	Belgium	Transinne	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.barrieredetransinne.be/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	t	f	There is no question as to the rich heritage of the Barrière de Transinne, but rather than the ubiquitous olde worlde clichés, this former hunting lodge is a picture of modernity and Ardennes hospitality. Enticing gastronomic nosh is served à la carte and in set menus (named after the owners’ sons). A fervent upholder of Gallic culinary traditions, the Barrière respects its region and the seasons.	carlinikita	\N	\N
