3332782827	Zafferano	viale Icilio Vanni 1	Italy	Città della Pieve	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.hotel-vannucci.com/ristorante/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, Country cooking	4.0	€€	t	f	Famous for its saffron, Città della Pieve is also well worth a visit to admire the Baciadonne alley (“one of the narrowest streets in Italy”) in its beautiful historic centre. This welcoming restaurant in a quiet and elegant hotel boasts an attractive veranda for summer dining that provides the perfect backdrop for delicious cuisine that is influenced by Umbria and Tuscany alike.	baranovrachel	\N	\N
