3334992618	Cucina	Via Giano della Bella 3r	Italy	Florence	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://c-ucina.it/	Nessun premio	Tuscan, Home Cooking	3.0	€€	t	f	At this restaurant, local ingredients (mainly from the market) take pride of place on the daily menu which changes in accordance with whatever produce is available at the time. The rustic-style dishes are full of intense flavours, with meat and vegetables often cooked in the wood-fired oven. The pleasantly informal dining room with its many cookery books dotted here and there was designed by the owner-architects themselves.	palombogiada	\N	\N
