3331002255	Da Fausto	piazza Cesare Beccaria 6	Italy	Fondi	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.dafausto.it	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	Situated in these premises since 2015, Fausto has become a local favourite thanks to the quality and style of its cuisine which combines classic flavours and regional influences. Two of the chef’s great passions (chocolate and ice cream) always feature on the dessert menu, while the cool outdoor space near the entrance adds to the appeal.	benettisergey	\N	\N
3337941552	Riso Amaro	viale Regina Margherita 22	Italy	Fondi	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ristoranterisoamaro.it	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	This elegant, contemporary-style restaurant is situated right in the historic centre. The menu features a host of gourmet dishes as well as more modern fish and meat options, all created by the talented owner-chef.	rossiyuri	\N	\N
3331667467	Alle Ciaspole	località Plazze 4	Italy	Fondo	Car park	https://www.alleciaspole.it/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	The name of this excellent hotel-restaurant on the border with the Alto Adige region is a clear reference to the snowshoes used in winter excursions in Tret, as well as to the local traditions which inspire the cuisine created here by the owner-chef. Precise, classic cooking methods plus the use of locally sourced produce (with the exception of the fish dishes which also feature on the menu) are showcased in the cuisine, with dishes announced by the chef’s wife at your table in the unexpectedly elegant Alpine-style dining room.	novotarskymariia	\N	\N
