3330157399	La Gallina	frazione Monterotondo 56	Italy	Gavi	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.villasparinaresort.it/it/hotel-gavi/1-0.html	Nessun premio	Piedmontese, Contemporary	3.0	€€€	t	t	This attractive restaurant offers three tasting menus featuring traditional and more creative dishes, in which influences from Piedmont, Liguria and Campania (the chef’s native region) combine, with truffles taking centre stage in autumn and home-grown vegetables in spring. Culinary highlights include Piedmontese-style Fassona beef tartare (the beef is sourced from the La Granda consortium) and cream ice-cream whipped in a 1982 Carpigiani machine served with a selection of sweet delicacies. The decision to offer wine uniquely from Champagne and Piedmont is somewhat unusual but works well – we recommend the house Barbera del Monferrato, preferably one that has been laid down for a few years.	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
3333056164	Locanda La Raia	Località Lomellina 26	Italy	Gavi	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.locandalaraia.it	Nessun premio	Piedmontese, Contemporary	5.0	€€	t	t	The magnificent biodynamic La Raia farm, an enchanting 180-hectare oasis between Novi Ligure and Gavi, is home to a contemporary art foundation, the Rossi Cairo family winery, a Steiner school for employees’ children, guest accommodation, and this restaurant which benefits from a fertile ecosystem that provides much of its zero-mile produce. The cuisine is rooted in local traditions which have been reinterpreted in contemporary style. In the evening (and at lunchtime at weekends), choose between an à la carte, a tasting menu inspired by wines from the property’s estates between Gavi and Langhe, and a delicious “Sei mezze” menu featuring small samples of the restaurant’s most iconic dishes.	bauergiulia	\N	\N
3337704358	Etra	piazza De Ferrari 4	Italy	Genoa	Air conditioning	https://www.etra.art/	Nessun premio	Creative, Italian Contemporary	5.0	€€€	f	f	Etra is an anagram of the Italian word “arte” – an apt name for this restaurant, which is housed in Palazzo Doria De Fornari on the beautiful and famous Piazza Ferrari. This palazzo is one of Genova’s magnificent “Rolli” palazzi (noble palaces once used to house famous visitors to the city). Despite the setting, the dining room is modern in style and adorned with elegant works of contemporary art. Here, chef Davide Cannavino consolidates his reputation with a concise menu of creative dishes: around a dozen meat and fish options inspired by the beauty that surrounds him and showcased on two tasting menus from which individual dishes can be chosen à la carte style.	svobodagreta	\N	\N
3331128801	Osteria della Foce	via Eugenio Ruspoli 72r	Italy	Genoa	Terrace	http://www.osteriadellafocegenova.it	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Country cooking	5.0	€€	t	f	This simple restaurant stands out for its delicious, authentic cuisine which is influenced by Ligurian and Italian traditions alike. The culinary techniques used are classic, both in its meat dishes (the roast veal is excellent) and fish options (raw fish dishes often feature on the menu). First courses include a home-made bronze-cut pasta (“trafilata al bronzo”) which is served with sauces inspired by whatever is in season or available in the market.	venturaroman	\N	\N
3333361386	20Tre	via David Chiossone 20 r	Italy	Genoa	Air conditioning	https://www.ristorante20tregenova.it/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	Run by three partners, this contemporary-style restaurant is situated in the heart of Genova’s historic centre. The cuisine here is prepared using the best seasonal ingredients, all presented in an array of modern dishes. Meat and fish feature on the menu, with a focus on regional recipes and the occasional Asian twist (for example, the amberjack and ponzu bonbon).	cellericelina	\N	\N
