3334857142	Tano Passami l'Olio	via Francesco Petrarca 4	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.tanopassamilolio.it/	Nessun premio	Creative, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	t	f	Tano Simonato, chef-patron of this stylish modern restaurant located in a fine residential district, offers his creative cuisine that reinterprets Italian flavors in a modern key: food for him is not just nourishment, but also fun. He will then come to your table to advise you and tell you about his dishes, suggesting the best wine pairing, also thanks to a well-stocked cellar. The inspector recommends: Tiramisù of cuttlefish and potatoes, as well as Almond Cannoli stuffed with mousse of ricotta with almonds, candied lemon and chocolate drops, with citrus fruit cream and almond jam.	popovchloe	\N	\N
3332410988	Il Capestrano	via Gian Francesco Pizzi 14	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.ilcapestrano.it/	Nessun premio	Cuisine from Abruzzo	4.0	€€	f	f	This restaurant takes its name from the warrior statue dating back to the 6C BC which was discovered in Capestrano (Aquila province) in 1934. The statue, carved from a single block of local stone, is one of the most mysterious finds in history. No such mystery surrounds the dishes served in this restaurant, which focuses on cuisine from the Abruzzo, including top-quality hams and cheeses produced by small-scale producers, as well as mutton, lamb, beef, barbecued lamb kebabs and other culinary delights.	rizzogabriele	\N	\N
3332493214	Un Posto a Milano	via Cuccagna 2	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.unpostoamilano.it	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Italian Contemporary	5.0	€€	t	f	Un Posto a Milan is a farmhouse in the city: an ideal place to spend a few hours outdoors, but also an agricultural market, a kitchen serving food, a carpentry workshop and a venue offering a host of other activities. The menu features traditional Italian dishes (sometimes given a modern twist), made with top-quality fresh, seasonal and – as far as possible – organic ingredients.	santoronicola	\N	\N
3339587020	Autem*	via Serviliano Lattuada 2	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://autem-milano.com/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	Situated in a lively district just a stone’s throw from the Porta Romana, this modern restaurant with an open-view kitchen (also visible from outside) now has a new wine cellar which is accessed via a flight of stairs and also doubles as a convivial dining room. Menus are handwritten on rice paper by the chef, emphasising the artisanal approach here, with recipes then explained by staff at your table. Luca Natalini, originally from Tuscany but also with experience from around the world, creates personalised meat and fish dishes such as red mullet and seasonal vegetables with a hollandaise sauce and lobster reduction.	cellericelina	\N	\N
3337016016	Bentōteca	via San Calocero 3	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://www.bentoteca.com/	Nessun premio	Fusion, Asian Contemporary	3.0	€€€	t	t	Top-quality Japanese cuisine with heavy Mediterranean influences takes pride of place at this restaurant, where talented chef Toku Yoji Tokuyoshi creates dishes such as horsemeat tataki with a pizzaiola sauce, and barbecued fish neck with friggitello pepper. If you opt for a seat on the large bench facing the kitchen, you’ll be able to watch the chefs at work and admire the precision required to prepare different types of sushi. Modern, understated decor.	pavlovsabrina	\N	\N
3336299795	Finger's Garden	via Keplero 2	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace	https://www.fingersrestaurants.com/i-ristoranti/fingers-garden/	Nessun premio	Fusion, Asian Contemporary	3.0	€€€	f	f	Firmly aimed at a trendier crowd, this restaurant has soft lighting and an Oriental feel. The chef here skilfully creates a range of dishes, including raw fish options and original fusion cuisine with a hint of Brazilian flavour. Gourmet diners will be happy to give full rein to the chef on his surprise menu.	benesemily	\N	\N
3337332945	Bites	via Lambro 11	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Counter dining	http://www.bitesmilano.net	Nessun premio	International, Small eats	4.0	€€€	t	t	The cuisine at this tiny, simply furnished restaurant includes barbecued dishes and fermented ingredients, all of which feature on a tasting menu. Guests can also choose à la carte: the small portions (as the restaurant name suggests) make it possible to taste several dishes at a reasonable cost. Booking is essential in the evening and also advisable at lunchtime.	orlovclaire	\N	\N
3336255770	Locanda Perbellini	via Moscova 25	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://locandaperbellini.it/	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	€€	f	f	Highly renowned in his native Verona, Michelin - starred chef Giancarlo Perbellini has now opened a restaurant in Milan, where he continues to offer traditional Italian cuisine from the north and south of the country, with a nod to new techniques and contemporary trends. Situated in the central Brera district, his warm and welcoming restaurant is small, discreet and, of course, highly elegant.	scarpatacco	\N	\N
3331715772	Aimo e Nadia BistRo	via Matteo Bandello 14	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning	https://www.aimoenadia.com/bistro-aimo-e-nadia	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	€€€	f	f	This bistro with a small yet charming and original dining room is a simpler and more informal version of the famous starred restaurant. The focus is the same, with an emphasis on Italian ingredients used in dishes which bring out their full flavour and integrity.	benedettifilip	\N	\N
3334599281	Belé	via Angelo Fumagalli 3	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.beleristorante.com	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	€€	t	t	The name says it all – in Milanese dialect, “belé” means beautiful and the word is an apt description of this restaurant. Belé is charmingly lit by an old-fashioned chandelier on which the pieces of crystal create a play of light resembling an intricate and shifting lace-like pattern. The dining rooms are decorated in attractive contemporary colours, with comfortable armchairs and acoustics perfect for conversation, while the cuisine is Italian with a modern twist.	leonoscar	\N	\N
3336158148	Il Ristorante - Niko Romito	via Privata Fratelli Gabba 7/b	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.bulgarihotels.com/it_IT/milan/dining/il-ristorante	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	5.0	€€€€	f	t	Housed within the Bulgari hotel, a secluded haven of elegance right in the heart of the most exclusive district in Milan, this restaurant alternates the trusted chefs at its helm, all of whom continue to serve light, contemporary Italian cuisine in dishes that focus more on substance than form. Choose between tasting menus and a generous à la carte selection featuring meat and fish dishes alike, including classic local favourites such as risotto and vitello alla Milanese (breaded veal cutlet).	montesialessandro	\N	\N
3338276153	Terrazza Gallia	piazza Duca d'Aosta 9	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.terrazzagallia.com/it/	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	5.0	€€€€	f	t	Situated on the seventh floor with panoramic views of the city, this restaurant is an excellent choice for a light lunch, a cocktail or an informal dinner. Two young brothers from Naples are at the helm here, creating traditional Italian and Lombardian dishes with a creative and contemporary touch.	stracciaantonio	\N	\N
3339669583	Voce Aimo e Nadia	piazza della Scala 6	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning	https://www.aimoenadia.com/voce-aimo-e-nadia	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	€€€€	f	f	Situated in the heart of Milan, this restaurant owned by the historic Aimo e Nadia in Via Montecuccoli is accessed via its bar-cum-pastry shop which includes a bistro serving a selection of simpler dishes. From here, you enter the main dining room with an open-view kitchen serving excellent Italian dishes reinterpreted in contemporary style. Voce in Giardino, the restaurant’s outdoor summer dining space adorned with interesting sculptures, is a green oasis in the heart of the city.	serrakevin	\N	\N
3332197199	Armani/Ristorante	via Manzoni 31	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.armanihotels.com/it/restaurant/armani-ristorante-milano/?hotel=armani-hotel-milano	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary, Asian Influences	5.0	€€€€	f	t	Elegant and carefully prepared contemporary cuisine served on the seventh floor of a palazzo which is totally dedicated to the world of Armani. Superb views of Milan combine with a decor of black marble and backlit onyx to create an exclusive and fashionable ambience.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3339733549	DanielCanzian	via Castelfidardo 7	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.danielcanzian.com	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary, Venetian	4.0	€€€	f	t	Situated in the heart of Brera and refurbished in the autumn of 2019, this restaurant showcases Italian artisanal skills through its bespoke furnishings, creating a fine setting for Canzian’s superb cuisine. A great choice for anyone looking for classic Italian dishes plus a few more inventive options, all of which are prepared using the very best ingredients. Simpler fare available at lunchtime.	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3334651909	Ratanà	via G. de Castillia 28	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.ratana.it/	Nessun premio	Italian, Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	This lively, dynamic restaurant is in a converted building that once housed a cinema and later belonged to the railways. Top quality ingredients take pride of place here, while the pleasant outdoor area overlooking a small park is an added attraction.	tohnjohn	\N	\N
3338624058	Rovello	Via Ariberto 3	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://www.ristorante-rovello.it	Nessun premio	Italian, Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	t	This lively and welcoming bistro furnished with smart wooden furniture is the setting for cuisine which focuses on carefully chosen ingredients presented with the minimum of fuss. Although the menu features a few specialities from Milan, most of the dishes here are Mediterranean in style. Interesting wine selection, including by the glass.	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
3336683272	Nobuya	Via San Nicolao 3/a	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Notable sake list	https://www.nobuya.it/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary, Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	f	Nobuya boasts a minimalist elegance that is typical of Japanese restaurants, with brown tables, dark wooden beams on the ceiling, attractive subdued lighting, plus an illuminated wine cabinet to add a touch of colour. Here, the talented Japanese chef creates top-quality cuisine using the freshest ingredients. At lunchtime, there’s also a lighter “Bento box” and an omakase tasting menu (“Mi affido a te”) which is completely vegetarian.	krausmartina	\N	\N
3333865624	Ichikawa	via Lazzaro Papi 18	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.ichikawa.it	Nessun premio	Japanese, Asian	5.0	€€€	t	f	Ichikawa is one of the culinary masters who played a part in introducing Japanese cuisine to Italy. After decades in the country working in various restaurants, this chef has finally opened his own eatery, where he serves top-quality Japanese cuisine ranging from familiar favourites such as sushi and sashimi to other less-known family dishes and street food from the land of the Rising Sun. A good place to discover the joys of Japanese cuisine!	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
3336212679	Wicky's Innovative Japanese Cuisine	corso Italia 6	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://wicuisine.it/	Nessun premio	Japanese, Asian Contemporary	5.0	€€€	f	t	Although the contemporary, minimalist-style decor is typical of Japanese restaurants, the cuisine will come as more of a surprise, with its magical blend of classic Japanese dishes made from Mediterranean ingredients, beautifully presented and full of flavour. There are two dining rooms: one overlooking the road, and the other with an open-view kitchen and sushi bar, where the chef serves an evening tasting menu for guests happy to put their faith in his imaginative improvisational skills.	bergmannalexandru	\N	\N
3336927868	Hazama	via Savona 41	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Notable sake list	https://www.ristorantehazama.com	Nessun premio	Japanese, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	f	t	Japanese cuisine served in a small restaurant where both the cuisine and decor are minimalist in style. Here, young chef Satoshi Hazama creates light dishes full of Japanese flavour, all made from top-quality ingredients. The kaiseki menu served in the evening consists of seven or nine different courses.	beloveva	\N	\N
3337653269	Zero Milano	corso Magenta 87	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.zero-milano.it/	Nessun premio	Japanese, Fusion	3.0	€€€	t	f	There’s absolutely zero compromise on attention and quality in this restaurant, where the cuisine is made from top-quality ingredients using all the technical expertise typical of Japanese cooking. Chef Hide is now assisted by two of his compatriots who are real sushi experts, emphasising Zero Milano’s ambition to be one of the best Japanese restaurants in Milan, with its menu featuring Japanese specialities alongside dishes with a more contemporary Western flavour.	ferrettivladislav	\N	\N
3338950097	Osaka	corso Giuseppe Garibaldi 68	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Notable sake list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.milanoosaka.com	Nessun premio	Japanese, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	Tucked away in a short arcade on the old road from Milan to Como, this restaurant has a simple, minimalist style with a bar where diners can watch the skilful chefs slicing and preparing the fish. Set menus dominate at lunchtime, while in the evening the à la carte options include sukiyaki, a celebratory dish in Japan.	horvathmaria	\N	\N
3335197128	Trattoria del Nuovo Macello	via Cesare Lombroso 20	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning	https://www.trattoriadelnuovomacello.it/	Nessun premio	Lombardian, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Named after the slaughterhouse opened opposite the premises in 1927, this restaurant was taken over 30 years later by the grandfather of one of the current partners, as he was convinced that the restaurant’s busy location would contribute to its success – and he wasn’t wrong! The traditional, regional cuisine served here is reinterpreted with a contemporary flavour and includes delicious specialities such as cotoletta alla milanese made from meat matured for 40 days.	venturaroman	\N	\N
3334781891	Giannino dal 1899	via Vittor Pisani 6	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	httpss://gianninoristorante.it	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, International	5.0	€€€	f	f	A renowned name in Milan, this restaurant is the setting for a Mediterranean cuisine  with an international twist. Although recently renovated, the dining room has an attractive old-fashioned feel with old photographs of celebrities who have eaten here since it opened more than 120 years ago.	horvathmaria	\N	\N
3330101702	177 toledo	via Toledo 177	Italy	Naples	Air conditioning	https://www.giuseppeiannotti.it/177-toledo/	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary, Creative	4.0	€€€€	f	t	On the fifth floor of 177, via Toledo this restaurant exhibits works of art by contemporary artists in its elegant dining room. Delightful artisanal skills from Campania are also featured on the menu, which is made from handmade paper from Amalfi^ the manner in which the menu is written recalls the game of Tombola (which originated in Naples), in original and creative reinterpretations of classic regional dishes.	casiniivan	\N	\N
3333718949	uovodiseppia Milano	via Amerigo Vespucci 11	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.uovodiseppiamilano.it	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Sicilian	3.0	€€€	f	f	This completely renovated restaurant is situated in a pedestrianised area near Piazza Gae Aulenti, a new elegant restaurant district in Milan. Here, a wood-fired stove, attractive bar counter and small bistro-style tables provide the setting for carefully prepared Sicilian cuisine. Octopus, grouper and Mazara red prawns are just some of the top-quality Sicilian ingredients on the menu here, which includes reinterpreted recipes such as the “fuori Norma”, where the pasta is wrapped around the stuffed aubergine to create a dish full of Mediterranean flavours and aromas. The outdoor dining space in the pedestrianised street is perfect for early summer evenings, with its almost bohemian feel.	cellericelina	\N	\N
3330580778	Antica Osteria il Ronchettino	via Lelio Basso 9	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://www.ronchettino.it/	Nessun premio	Milanese, Lombardian	3.0	€€	t	t	The name seems to originate from the broken horseshoe (ronchetto) of Napoleon, who in 1800 appears to have stayed the night here, where there was indeed a post house where horses were shoed. Later converted into a bakery, butcher’s shop, but also a trattoria with an annexed bowling alley, today it is a restaurant of rustic elegance^ the regional cuisine expresses itself in specialties such as fried brains and the ever-present Milanese-style cutlet that here becomes even “imperial”, definitely to be shared.	caputostefan	\N	\N
3337956544	28 Posti	via Corsico 1	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace	http://www.28posti.org	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	The main focus of 28 Posti is its ethical stance, with seasonal ingredients sourced from small producers and an emphasis on making the most of each and every ingredient in order to keep food waste to a minimum – a philosophy that has been important to the restaurant for many years now. New chefs Franco Salvatore and Andrea Zazzara, both from the Abruzzi, have brought their own personal touches to cuisine which has its roots in the rich gastronomic traditions of central Italy and their native region.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
3332094940	Ceresio 7	via Ceresio 7	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.ceresio7.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	This designer-style restaurant is housed on the fourth floor of the historic ENEL palazzo, remodelled and converted into the Dsquared2 building. It combines the use of brass, marble and wood to create a successful blend of attractive colours and vintage decor. The view of Milan (even better from the long outdoor terrace with its two swimming pools) completes the picture, while the cuisine reinterprets Italian classics with a contemporary twist.	orlovclaire	\N	\N
3337929049	La Cucina dei Frigoriferi Milanesi	via Piranesi 10	Italy	Milan	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.lacucinadeifrigoriferimilanesi.it/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€	f	f	An interesting location in the artistic-cultural setting of the Frigoriferi Milanesi industrial complex for this restaurant with a modern feel both in its decor and its market cuisine.	winternoemi	\N	\N
3330471281	Remulass	via Nino Bixio 21	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.remulass.it	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	“Cooking with roots” is the mantra at Remulass, a phrase that has inspired the restaurant’s name (“wild radish” in the local Milanese dialect). This small, lively restaurant gets very busy in the evenings when booking is highly recommended. The attractively modern and colourful dishes here always feature plenty of root vegetables and aromatic herbs. We recommend the fermented vegetables with baked ricotta and a gin dressing.	pierimarco	\N	\N
3334429444	ZELO	via Gesù 6/8	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Brunch,Garden or park,Terrace	https://www.fourseasons.com/it/milan/dining/restaurants/zelo/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	f	t	The elegant ZELO restaurant enjoys a beautiful setting in the garden of a 15C inner courtyard, which also boasts an attractive summer terrace. The cuisine is modern in style, created by a chef who uses the best Italian ingredients to prepare creative and contemporary dishes, as well as a few Italian classic favourites such as vitello tonnato and breaded veal. Some dishes are not available at lunchtime, when they are replaced by salads, while in the evening raw fish and seafood options take centre stage.	stannaomi	\N	\N
3335243728	Procaccini	Via Giulio Cesare Procaccini 33	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	http://procaccini.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Contemporary	4.0	€€€€	f	f	Originally from Kosovo, talented chef Emin Haziri grew up in Italy and has plenty of professional culinary experience behind him. Here, he creates contemporary cuisine with a personal flavour, with raw seafood dishes such as oysters, caviar, Sicilian prawns and scampi available alongside his more imaginative options. In the elegant and stylish dining room with a harmonious colour scheme and fine furnishings, the open-view kitchen and marble chef’s table with velvet-covered stools really catch the eye. The restaurant also boasts a cocktail bar where guests can enjoy a drink and appetisers from the small tapas menu which is designed for sharing.	tarasovangela	\N	\N
3330512927	Quadri Bistrot	Via Solferino 48	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.quadribistrot.it/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Contemporary	4.0	€€	f	t	A modern bistro with a cocktail-bar, trendy decor, soft lighting and lounge-style background music, as well as a small outdoor space on the pavement which needs to be booked well in advance. The imaginative cuisine comes courtesy of a talented chef who creates dishes full of character from top-quality seasonal ingredients. Our inspectors particularly enjoyed the Bresse chicken stuffed with a cherry sauce.	karpovlucy	\N	\N
3336637239	Motelombroso	Alzaia Naviglio Pavese 256	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Terrace	http://motelombroso.it	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative	3.0	€€€	f	f	An old, carefully restored road worker’s house on the Alzaia Naviglio Pavese canal is the setting for this modern, stylish restaurant where Alessandra and Matteo welcome guests in a graceful, elegant and yet informal manner. The menu features contemporary meat and fish dishes accompanied by a good choice of wines. If you’re curious about the restaurant’s name, ask the owners for an explanation: could it be something to do with the private dining room perhaps?	basileryan	\N	\N
3335041027	Pellico 3	via Silvio Pellico 3	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://pellico3milano.it/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative	4.0	€€€€	f	t	Situated in the luxury Park Hyatt hotel just a few metres from the Galleria Vittorio Emanuele, this restaurant is home to a young chef who serves elegant and occasionally complex cuisine. His dishes include sauces and traditions learned from his time working in France, as well as plenty of vegetables and Mediterranean influences.	martinifederico	\N	\N
3336742860	Acanto	piazza della Repubblica 17	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.dorchestercollection.com/it/milan/hotel-principe-di-savoia/ristoranti-e-bar/ristorante-acanto	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, International	4.0	€€€€	f	t	At Acanto, the young new chef at the helm, Matteo Gabrielli, who has experience of working abroad, focuses firmly on traditional cuisine – the risotto alla Milanese remains one of the highlights here! In a classic-style dining room inside the Principe di Savoia hotel, enjoy Italian meat and fish dishes prepared using modern techniques that allow the quality of the ingredients to shine through. Attentive, professional service adds to the appeal.	fabbrijuan	\N	\N
3334765801	L’Alchimia	viale Premuda 34	Italy	Milan	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://ristorantelalchimia.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Italian Contemporary	5.0	€€€	t	t	The parquet floor, wood-beamed ceiling and exposed brickwork lend a warm ambience to this restaurant, which is bright and airy during the day and romantic in the evening thanks to its soft lighting. With Giuseppe Postorino at the helm, the cuisine here includes classic recipes alongside more personalised dishes all prepared using top-quality ingredients that are typical of Italian cuisine. Additional features include a small, beautiful brick-vaulted wine cellar (open to visitors), plus an adjacent bar-bistro which serves quick lunches and excellent aperitifs.	palmieridaniel	\N	\N
