3332467474	Locanda Sensi	località Case Negri 116	Italy	Rivergaro	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.locandasensi.eu	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	We highly recommend this pleasant country restaurant run by friendly and enthusiastic staff, where the owner appears frequently in the dining room. The ambience is modern and comfortable, the outdoor dining area boasts typical views of the Piacenza hills, and – last but not least – the food is excellent! The options on the fine-dining menu range from regional specialities to fish-based dishes, as well as various delicacies cooked on the barbecue grill, such as pigeon breast (served with pigeon leg, marinated breast, offal and rice timbale). The wine selection is also excellent.	balazsaurora	\N	\N
3335766656	Between	viale Partigiani d'Italia 98/c	Italy	Rivoli	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	http://www.betweenristorante.it	Nessun premio	Contemporary	4.0	€€	f	t	This top-quality restaurant occupies just one simple, minimalist-style dining room, where the young female chef serves a happy combination of Piedmontese ingredients and more creative dishes acquired during her time working abroad.	palombasauro	\N	\N
3337491601	Osteria dello Strecciolo	via Indipendenza 2	Italy	Robbiate		http://www.osteriadellostrecciolo.it	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	€€€	t	f	Situated in the centre of the village, this popular and professionally run restaurant has an informal atmosphere. The cuisine is inspired by Mediterranean recipes and more regional traditions, with great care taken in the choice of ingredients and beautifully presented dishes. A business lunch menu is also available.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3336923645	Anto e Robi	Piazza della Libertà 8	Italy	Robbio	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	http://www.antoerobi.it	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Situated in the heart of a small town surrounded by rice fields, this restaurant has a charming and personalised feel. The cuisine is often (but not always) based around fish, which is showcased in dishes inspired by regional traditions. While Robi oversees the front of house with skill and expertise, offering recommendations on wine (over 300 labels, including many by the glass) and rum (his particular passion), Anto prepares a host of delicious recipes in the kitchen.	huberflorin	\N	\N
3338750663	Chichibio	via Guglielmo Marconi 1	Italy	Roccaraso	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Cuisine from Abruzzo	4.0	€€	t	f	Despite its lack of awards, this restaurant stands out for the quality of its cuisine. Situated in the town centre, it has a small intimate dining room with just a few tables (it’s best to book ahead) that acts as a backdrop for good-quality dishes made from local, seasonal ingredients, as well as a few modern and imaginative fish options. Highly recommended!	molnarbianca	\N	\N
3333705024	La Cascina 1899	strada statale 106	Italy	Rocella Jonica	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Terrace	https://www.ristorantelacascina1899.it	Nessun premio	Calabrian, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Situated on the main road running alongside the sea, this pleasant restaurant with a large car park occupies a late-19C building that has been transformed into an attractive, rustic-style eatery with plenty of outdoor areas and air-conditioned rooms with exposed-stone walls and wooden ceilings that provide welcome respite from the heat of summer. It’s no surprise that fish and seafood take pride of place on the menu, although meat dishes also feature. The shop next door sells regional specialities, some produced by the restaurant itself, including the famous local bergamot citrus fruit.	vogelbeatrice	\N	\N
3339724399	Il Colmetto	via Finilnuovo 9	Italy	Rodengo Saiano	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ilcolmetto.it	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Farm to table	3.0	€€€	t	f	A true gourmet agriturismo, Il Colmetto changes its menu almost week by week in line with the changing seasons. Full of flavour, the ingredients here (many of which are produced on the property, while others are sourced locally) are cooked with precision, avoiding overly fussy and complicated techniques. Instead, the focus is on good, honest cuisine with its roots in peasant traditions, in which the aim is to create comforting dishes that will appeal to the palate. The barbecued specialities, such as the sweetbreads and the excellent Jerusalem artichokes, are particularly delicious, while the superb goats’ milk butter, served soft and fluffy as a cloud with bread and focaccia, is truly delicious – its only drawback is that it can be addictive!	florescufrancesca	\N	\N
3334886946	Ca' Apollonio Gourmet	via Molinetto 5/a	Italy	Romano d'Ezzelino	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list	http://www.caapollonio.com	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€€	f	f	This restaurant is housed in the Salone delle Colombe (the name comes from the fresco of doves on the ceiling) of a villa which dates back to the 16C, although its present appearance dates mainly from the 19C. Here, chef Alessio Longhini serves two tasting menus prepared partly using ingredients from the property’s own kitchen garden, which is surrounded by 18ha of grounds. Elaborate, creative and top-quality dishes served in an elegant setting.	rossiyuri	\N	\N
3336402701	Da Cesare	via Crescenzio 13	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning	https://www.ristorantecesare.com	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, Italian	4.0	€€	f	f	As the Florentine lily on the glass at the entrance implies, the specialities of this place are Tuscan in origin as well as seafood. Friendly atmosphere, ample wine list.	ricciardisimone	\N	\N
3331686462	Almatò	via Augusto Riboty 20/c	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.almato.it	Nessun premio	Contemporary	4.0	€€€	f	t	Situated in the elegant, residential streets of the Prati district, this modern, minimalist-style restaurant is the setting for top-quality creative cuisine. For the most part, the menu eschews traditional Lazio dishes making this a good choice for anyone looking for something a little different.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
3332522372	Carter Oblio	via Giuseppe Gioachino Belli 21	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.carteroblio.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	5.0	€€	t	f	Following years of experience in renowned restaurants, owner-chef Ciro Alberto has achieved his dream of opening his own place. With its clean lines and natural colour scheme, his restaurant has a slightly Nordic feel, while the reasonably priced cuisine demonstrates the imagination and creativity of a chef who is keen to stand out. Expertly prepared and attractively presented contemporary dishes are to the fore here.	d'angelonino	\N	\N
3338179323	Diana's Place	via Volturno 54	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning	http://www.dianasplace.it	Nessun premio	Contemporary	5.0	€€	f	f	Facing the square in front of Termini station, this wine bar-cum-restaurant is striking for its fresh and creative approach to cuisine. Nearly all the top-quality ingredients are local and can be purchased from the food counter. The excellent staff are happy to help with your choice of wine, which is also available by the glass.	sorrentinosantiago	\N	\N
3331214161	San Baylon	via di Ripetta 232	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.sanbaylon.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	3.0	€€€	f	f	Not far from Piazza del Popolo and Rome’s most exclusive shopping streets, this restaurant is situated in the Palazzo Ripetta hotel, in what was once the refectory of a 17C convent. Today, the ambience here is more informal, with an almost bistro-like feel, while the cuisine is inspired by classic Italian dishes, including various grilled options among the main courses. Meals are served in the palazzo’s inner courtyard in fine weather.	brunettibruno	\N	\N
3338477596	Osteria Fernanda	via Crescenzo Del Monte 18/24	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning	https://www.osteriafernanda.com	Nessun premio	Creative, Contemporary	5.0	€€€	f	f	In the district famous for its Porta Portese market, this restaurant run by two talented business partners is definitely worth a visit. Andrea oversees the minimalist-style dining room, while Luca demonstrates real passion in his creative cuisine made from locally sourced ingredients, as well as produce from further afield. Among the desserts, we highly recommended the Porter beer ice-cream with black garlic mousse, chocolate and tuber peelings.	cellericelina	\N	\N
3337620918	Luciano Cucina Italiana	piazza del Teatro di Pompeo 18	Italy	Rome	Terrace	https://www.lucianocucinaitaliana.com	Nessun premio	Creative, Italian	4.0	€€	f	f	It is widely accepted that the best carbonara in Rome is served in this restaurant. We have to agree – and this is no mean feat, given that this is one of the capital’s iconic dishes. However, Luciano Monosilio’s culinary experience also extends to other equally delicious dishes, some inspired by the traditions of Lazio, others more creative in style, but all full of intense flavours.	morozovmegan	\N	\N
3335739769	Bistrot 64	via Guglielmo Calderini 64	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.bistrot64.it/	Nessun premio	Creative, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	t	The classic-style dining room in this restaurant situated in the Flaminio district belies the gourmet discoveries that await here, with echoes of traditions from Lazio that act as inspiration for creative, top-quality dishes with the occasional Asian twist.	tarasovangela	\N	\N
3337178333	Colline Emiliane	via degli Avignonesi 22	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning	https://www.collineemiliane.com/	Nessun premio	Emilian, Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Just a stone’s throw from Piazza Barberini, this simple, friendly, family-run restaurant has just a few tables arranged close together. It serves typical dishes from the Emilia region, including fresh pasta stretched by hand in the traditional way.	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
3332116025	aede dining & wines	via Federico Cesi 22	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://aederestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	5.0	€€	t	t	A small gem of a restaurant with a contemporary minimalist-style decor. The highly creative and technically modern cuisine has the same Nordic style as the dining room, influenced by the chef’s experience working in a number of Michelin-starred restaurants in Scandinavia. The menu changes every month and consists of twelve different dishes, with a minimum of four in the evening. Organic wines and a small outdoor dining space complete the picture.	salajakub	\N	\N
