3335931952	Il Ristorante - Niko Romito	via di Ripetta 73	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.bulgarihotels.com/it_IT/rome/dining/il-ristorante-niko-romito	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	€€€€	f	f	Situated on the fifth floor of the Hotel Bulgari with views of the Mausoleum of Augustus, Il Ristorante - Niko Romito boasts a spacious terrace and an elegant, welcoming dining room with mahogany walls adorned with works of art. The menu features traditional Italian cuisine reinterpreted with a light and imaginative touch as demonstrated by memorable dishes such as the chef’s own take on classic spaghetti in a tomato sauce.	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
