3333302764	Campocori	via di Santa Maria de' Calderari 49	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.chapter-roma.com/?page_id=3199	Nessun premio	Italian, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	This gourmet fine-dining restaurant, the brainchild of the South African designer Tristan Du Plessis, has arrived in the Italian capital where it’s overseen by chef Alessandro Pietropaoli. Here, choose from the à la carte or opt for one of the tasting menus (5 or 7 courses). Elegant, contemporary and cosmopolitan cuisine.	florescufrancesca	\N	\N
3335661844	Kohaku	via Marche 66	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Notable sake list	https://www.kohakurome.com/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary, Japanese	4.0	€€	f	t	As if by magic, once you step over the threshold at this restaurant you feel as though you are in Japan, thanks to the soft music, elegant ambience and stylish decor. Japanese Kaiseki dishes take pride of place here, all made from seasonal ingredients with a real respect for integrity. We particularly enjoyed the duck with miso cooked at low heat for eight hours. An interesting sake selection and a lighter menu at lunchtime add to the appeal.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
