3330472927	Gainn	via dei Mille 18	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning	https://www.gainnrome.com/	Nessun premio	Korean, Asian	3.0	€	t	f	Since 2007, Gainn has showcased the fascinating and delicious flavours of colourful Korean cuisine, with its rice-based dishes, soups, meat, fish, plenty of vegetables and soya. The best way to experience the food here is to order a selection of different dishes to be shared with your dining companions. Those with a sweet tooth, be warned – there are no desserts on the menu.	costanzomaurizio	\N	\N
