3334192676	Antica Pesa	via Garibaldi 18	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.anticapesa.it/	Nessun premio	Roman, Cuisine from Lazio	3.0	€€	t	f	Typical Roman dishes made from carefully selected ingredients grace the menu of this restaurant, which is housed in a grain storehouse that once belonged to the neighbouring Papal State. Large paintings by contemporary artists hang on the walls and there is a small lounge with a fireplace near the entrance.	bauergiulia	\N	\N
