3331292087	La Ciambella	via dell'Arco della Ciambella 20	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://www.la-ciambella.it	Nessun premio	Roman, Italian	5.0	€€€	t	t	Originally from Testaccio, the district of Rome that is historically associated with butcher’s shops, chef Francesca Ciucci serves some of the best meat dishes in the Italian capital, including offal such as sweetbreads, a delicious Roman-style tripe dish and her own reinterpretation of “coda in carrozza” (an oxtail recipe). Meat dishes, often with a creative twist, take centre stage here, offering a delightful gastronomic experience that is not to be missed!	caputostefan	\N	\N
3335102932	Roscioli	via dei Giubbonari 21	Italy	Rome	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://www.salumeriaroscioli.com/	Nessun premio	Roman, Italian	3.0	€€	t	f	This restaurant is part of one of the best food outlets in Rome, which offers delicacies such as typical Roman pastas, cooked and raw fish, meat, an impressive selection of cured hams and cheeses, as well as top-quality ingredients such as anchovies and mozzarella. Excellent home-baked bread and a varied wine list complete the picture. Make sure you book ahead, as it’s hard to get a table here without a reservation.	smirnovjessica	\N	\N
