3332342893	Zur Dankbarkeit	Hauptstraße 39	Austria	Podersdorf am See	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://dankbarkeit.at/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	Steeped in tradition, this inn in the centre of Podersdorf has been run by the same family for four generations. Their attachment to the region is reflected in delicious dishes such as Kalbsrahmbeuschel (veal lights ragout) with bread dumplings, which are made with ingredients from the owner's native Burgenland. The establishment also boasts its own winery, a nearby wine tavern (open Fri, Sat and Sun) and five cosy and inviting double rooms.	moltenirene	\N	\N
3331132532	Kupferdachl - Wirtshaus	Hauptstraße 275	Austria	Premstätten	Car park,Terrace	https://kupferdachl.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	Brother-and-sister team Lisa and Daniel Edelsbrunner are continuing their parents' commitment to Kupferdachl – she in service, he in the kitchen. Based on traditional Austrian recipes, the cuisine takes its cue from the region and the seasons, mindful of the provenance and quality of the ingredients. Aromatic dishes such as oven-baked pumpkin with Nuart sheep's cheese, walnut and chickweed, or Tafelspitz (prime boiled beef) from Chianinahof farm in Dobl with roasted apples, chive sauce and apple and horseradish sauce are served à la carte or as a set menu. At lunchtime (Wed-Fri), there is also a moderately priced daily special. The well-curated wine list includes a fine selection of regional and Austrian labels, as well as organic and biodynamic wines. The lovely covered terrace overlooks a well-kept garden complete with a koi pond and knobby olive trees. Tip: Also in the building, fine dining restaurant, Das Edelsbrunner serves an ambitious surprise set menu (open Fri and Sat).	fiorellifiorello	\N	\N
