3335562965	Do & Co Restaurant am Stephansplatz	Stephansplatz 12	Austria	Vienna	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.doco.com/	Nessun premio	Asian	3.0	€€	f	f	Up on the seventh floor, this is one of the city's hotspots: a modern, elegant restaurant with a great terrace and a view of St Stephen's Cathedral. In the open kitchen the team cooks up international cuisine. Alongside the many Asian-influenced dishes, including sushi, the menu also features Austrian classics.	demurtasarianna	\N	\N
3334063856	Le Canut et les Gones	29 rue Belfort	France	Lyon	Interesting wine list	https://lecanutetlesgones.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	A unique atmosphere, somewhere between bistro and secondhand shop – formica bar, wooden floorboards, vintage tapestry, collection of old clocks on the walls –, modern cuisine in tune with the seasons, a wine list boasting over 300 types... In a little - frequented area of La Croix - Rousse, this is definitely one to try out.	beckerradu	\N	\N
