3338235715	Weibel's Wirtshaus	Kumpfgasse 2	Austria	Vienna	Terrace	http://www.weibel.at	Nessun premio	Austrian	4.0	€	f	t	Just a few minutes’ walk from St Stephen’s Cathedral, Weibel’s Wirtshaus is the archetypal Viennese restaurant – warm and friendly, rustic and snug! It also has a charming garden in the small alleyway. The food is traditional and Viennese.	langalice	\N	\N
