3330356793	OPUS	Kärntner Ring 16	Austria	Vienna	Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurant-opus.at/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€€	t	t	This restaurant is decorated in the style of the Wiener Werkstätte of the 1930s and located in the prestigious historical building that is home to the Hotel Imperial, which has been an integral part of Viennese life since opening in 1873. This is the elegant backdrop against which diners enjoy classic cuisine with seasonal influences. A five-course tasting menu in two versions (omnivore and vegetarian) is served, as well as an à la carte selection. Friendly and professional service.	volkovnatalie	\N	\N
3333547663	Schaarschmidt's	Coppistraße 32	Germany	Leipzig	Terrace	https://schaarschmidts.de/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	3.0	€€	t	t	This building on a corner plot with a gorgeous leafy façade is home to a cosy restaurant that is run with great dedication. Its many regulars come in droves to enjoy specialities of Saxon cuisine – the beef roulade is a firm favourite! The friendly waitstaff will gladly talk you through the options on the menu. Head for the lovely small terrace planted with trees.	popafarah	\N	\N
3339821433	Beletage Zum Schwarzen Kameel	Bognergasse 5	Austria	Vienna	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.kameel.at	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	The setting alone is a huge draw: the first floor of a 1901 Jugendstil building in a super-central location. The interior decor is at once elegant yet cosy, and the front-of-house team is experienced and pleasingly laid back, while operating in the classical style, like a well-oiled machine. And, of course, there is the exceptional food: a celebration of Viennese classics, elevated by creative seasonal additions. There is a well-curated à la carte selection with a set menu option – diners are spoilt for choice, with dishes such as the rustic hand-carved ham being just as tempting as the oven-baked pike-perch with a ginger and citrus butter.	mancinialberto	\N	\N
3337497852	Kutschker 44	Kutschkergasse 44	Austria	Vienna	Terrace	https://www.kutschker44.at/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, International	4.0	€	t	t	This relaxed and friendly, modern restaurant is very popular with locals, and no wonder given the delicious fare on offer. Menu options include chanterelle terrine with walnuts, lamb’s lettuce and bresaola as well as Viennese specialities such as veal lights and Black Angus rib-eye steak. The terrace looks onto the pedestrian zone.	neagufilippo	\N	\N
3334914168	HAUSBAR Wien	Karlsplatz 5	Austria	Vienna	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	http://www.hausbar-wien.at	Nessun premio	Vegetarian	3.0	€€€€	t	t	Tucked away in the basement of the remarkable Künstlerhaus, this appealing modern restaurant also boasts a gorgeous covered terrace in the inner courtyard. The friendly team delivers an imaginative take on vegetarian cuisine (vegan options also available) in the form of a set menu, whose seven courses are only hinted at with pictures of the main ingredients. The waitstaff then proudly talk you through the dishes at your table. If you want meat or fish, you can also order a main course that suits you in advance. A range of perfectly paired cocktails and a fairly priced wine list complete the picture.	bertinimilan	\N	\N
