3336651221	Frierss Feines Haus	Gewerbezeile 2b	Austria	Villach	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://feines-haus.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Fusion	4.0	€€€	f	f	The Frierss family are renowned for their sausages and other meat products. These wares are on site in their butcher's shop and well-stocked delicatessen, and are also to be found on the menu in this modern restaurant. Barbecued steaks feature among the mouth-watering specialities of the house, but there are fish and vegetarian options prepared in the open kitchen. Good selection of wines. A budget-friendly lunch deal is available, too. The staff are incredibly dedicated and friendly. Tip: You can also have breakfast here.	fiorellifiorello	\N	\N
3335001418	Bär & Schaf Wirtschaft	2.-Mai-Straße 18	Austria	Völkermarkt	Terrace	https://www.baerundschafwirtschaft.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	What started as a pop-up has now become a permanent fixture in the historical Gasthaus zum Prinz Johann. The proprietor duo, Martin Nuart and Philipp Medved, offer their guests a very personal dining experience. Philipp manages things front-of-house with delightful ease, friendliness, and proficiency, while Martin heads up the sustainability-focused kitchen. His intriguing plant-forward set menu showcases select seasonal ingredients from his family's own farm or neighbouring agricultural producers. In terms of wine, Austria takes centre stage, and is accompanied by offerings from Slovenia and Italy. The setting is wonderfully inviting – with lovely old floorboards, simple wooden benches and chairs and decorative contemporary artwork, the historical charm of the centuries-old inn has been retained with style.	enacheisabella	\N	\N
3331034699	Hofmeisterei Hirtzberger	Hauptstraße 74	Austria	Wösendorf in der Wachau	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.hofmeisterei.com/	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	5.0	€€€	f	t	This building has a long history. Built in 1320, it was originally part of a monastery – Stift St Florian. Today, it is home to a charming and elegant restaurant with a lovely vaulted ceiling. Drawing on Asian influences, the food here is a contemporary take on classic cuisine. As an alternative to the two set menus, a number of classic dishes can be ordered à la carte, and everything is prepared using select ingredients. The fantastic wine list includes an enticing selection of champagnes and Veltliners.	karpovlucy	\N	\N
3336733116	Himmelreich	Ortsstraße 4	Austria	Zaußenberg	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-himmelreich.at/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	3.0	€€€	t	t	This restaurant is located in a charming old farmhouse right next to the Josef Fritz winery. The interior is elegant and attractive, with minimalist-style decor^ outside, the courtyard offers a delightful setting for summer dining. The kitchen presents a four- or six-course set menu that draws inspiration from Nordic cuisine but also incorporates international influences. The dishes are packed with flavour and many of the herbs used are grown in the courtyard. A vegetarian version of the set menu can be arranged if you order in advance.	testagabriel	\N	\N
3338437685	Erlhof	Erlhofweg 11	Austria	Zell am See	Car park,Terrace	http://www.erlhof.at	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	t	First mentioned in records in 1137, the Erlhof can look back on a remarkably long history. Since 2002, the Brüggler family has been running this hotel and restaurant set in a beautiful location with a view of Lake Zell and the mountains – the terrace beckons in summer. In the kitchen, father-and-daughter team Josef and Sonja deliver classic cuisine and traditional regional fare with international influences, while mother-and-daughter front-of-house team Renate and Kathrin take good care of their guests. The warm, rustic-style interior complete with vaulted ceilings is inviting^ one dining area has an open fireplace. In addition to cosy guestrooms, hotel patrons have private access to the lake just down from the hotel.	medvedevkatie	\N	\N
3339352196	Schulhaus Tirol	Zellberg 162	Austria	Zellberg	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.schulhaus.tirol	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	The steep approach to this beautiful inn situated above the village is well worth the effort – both for the fantastic view of the valley and for the delicious food. Classic cuisine and traditional regional fare are served here, in the form of aromatic dishes packed with flavour. The menu features local char as well as Tristan rock lobster, Tauern lamb two ways, and a classic Wiener schnitzel. Diners can also look forward to a good selection of wines. An experienced team provide friendly service^ cosy atmosphere.	farinalucas	\N	\N
3332633556	Schloss Farrach - Das Restaurant	Schlossweg 13	Austria	Zeltweg	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace	http://www.schlossfarrach.at/restaurant/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Behind its striking mosaic façade, this 17C castle houses a beautiful restaurant with a cross-vaulted ceiling. There is also a delightful terrace. In the evenings, diners have a choice of two set menus showcasing seasonal and regional specialities^ at lunchtime, the options are more limited. Some of the ingredients come from organic farms or the restaurant's own garden. Owner Alexander Stöhr is in charge of the kitchen^ his son manages the front-of-house team and expertly recommends wine pairings. Tip: Various cultural events take place on specific dates. This is also a fantastic venue for private functions.	cervigaia	\N	\N
