3339556076	Thurnher's Restaurant	Zürs 295	Austria	Zürs am Arlberg		https://thurnhers.com/de/kulinarik/restaurant	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	Along with its gorgeous guestrooms and exclusive spa facilities, Thurnher's Alpenhof also houses this fine dining restaurant. The setting is tastefully elegant, and the service team go about their work in a remarkably friendly manner, bringing in a personal touch. Cuisine with classical foundations is served in the evening à la carte and in the form of a set menu. The fine wine list is mainly geared towards Austrian and French labels, but Italy and Germany are also represented. At lunchtime, a more down-to-earth offering is served in the bar, but you can also order dishes from the evening à la carte menu if you wish.	stepanekgrace	\N	\N
3337616453	Die Ente von Zürs	Haus 217	Austria	Zürs am Arlberg	Car park	https://www.albonanova.at/de/genuss/die-ente-von-zuers	Nessun premio	Contemporary	4.0	€€€€	t	f	For many years, this small, classic restaurant in the ‘Albona Nova’ hotel has stood for high-quality cuisine. If you manage to get one of the few seats, you can look forward to a menu with pleasantly reduced and excellently prepared dishes made from excellent products - the eponymous duck is always present, for example in the wonderfully puristic combination of a crispy baked slice of sourdough bread with aromatic, melt-in-the-mouth duck liver cream, carpaccio of fresh tuna and Himalayan salt. The harmonious picture also includes a fine selection of wines, charming service and an intimate atmosphere.	parisibenjamin	\N	\N
3334547223	Hertebos	Wijnegemsteenweg 132	Belgium	s-Gravenwezel	Car park,Terrace	https://hertebos.be/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	4.0	€€€	f	f	In Yasmine and Yoshi's living room-style restaurant, photographs on the walls give a glimpse into their past, and an open fireplace lends the place a cosy feel. In both the set menu and the repertoire of à la carte classics, the freshness of the ingredients stands out. The two chefs are as creative with textures as they are with their intensely flavoursome sauces. For instance, they bring out all the facets of raspberry and yoghurt, combined with a cake soaked in Amaretto, to create a dazzling dessert.	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
3339898306	Octo	Aalbekeplaats 8	Belgium	Aalbeke	Credit cards not accepted	https://www.octorestaurant.be/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	This updated, new age brasserie is the work of a youthful chef and the trendy vibe and slick service are paired with traditional old-school cooking, albeit tailored to modern tastes. Rossini tournedos with a port-flavoured gravy, eel in sorrel and poached brill in a shrimp sauce. An establishment that never disappoints, all the more so as you can also pop in for just a drink or a snack.	veselyolivia	\N	\N
