3332304120	Tablàvins	Zwaluwenlaan 12	Belgium	Knokke	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://tablavins.be/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	This wine-decked, book-lined eatery sports a trendy colour scheme that reeks of the Flemish flair for interior decorating. The wine-food pairing suggestions are equally inspired. The food in the zeitgeist sports a subtle blend of tradition and exoticism: you may taste a generous saddle of rabbit or a sole sprinkled in Asian flavours. A deep-rooted respect for heritage paired with a streak of daring.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
3332738740	De Normandie	Koninklijke Baan 1	Belgium	Koksijde	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.denormandie.be/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	4.0	€€€	t	f	It may look like a ship washed up on the dunes, but don’t be mistaken: this 1936 boat-shaped edifice is home to a well-oiled, contemporary brasserie. Super fresh seafood takes pride of place with lobster dishes playing the leading role! Generous, legible fare with a strong French bias, although the chef has no qualms about adding a new spin to classical recipes.	romanosimone	\N	\N
