3335071380	Maxime Colin	Pastoorkesweg 1	Belgium	Kraainem	Garden or park,Great view,Terrace	https://maximecolin.be/	Nessun premio	Creative French	5.0	€€€	t	f	Maxime Colin’s artistically appointed romantic establishment was made for a date night (or lunch), while the patio, tucked away in the garden of Jourdain castle, drips with alfresco charm come summertime. The menu quickly reveals the chef’s passion for stellar ingredients and international influences. His modern culinary style features subtlety, spot-on craftsmanship and a constant quest for innovation. For example, he may coat scallops wrapped in a cabbage leaf in a house-made XO sauce and pair them with a salad of green peas jazzed up by a zest of refreshing lemon juice.	vecchiatomichael	\N	\N
3336713073	De Ceder	Molenstraat 1	Belgium	Kruibeke	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://www.restaurantdeceder.be	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	Vintage black and white photos, the father-in-law’s old bicycle and a Berkel meat slicer offset this restaurant’s elegant, fresh interior. De Ceder has been a blue-ribbon establishment in the area for some 40 years now. The chef knows all the classics of Franco-Belgian cuisine and often whips things up at the last minute, as is demonstrated by his steak with a subtle pepper sauce and fresh fries. He’s also keen on full-bodied oriental spices and Asian notes. We warrant you will adore the attractive wine list and, why not, even treat yourself to a night in the B&B…	siliprandipiergiorgiofranco	\N	\N
