3332049980	Guzzi	Frederik Lintsstraat 5	Belgium	Leuven	Terrace	https://www.ristoranteguzzi.be/	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	€€	t	f	This characteristic town house with a small garden is a stalwart champion of Italian simplicity. The chefs add a new, yet respectful spin to authentic flavours. The menu is devised according to the availability of fresh, preferably organic ingredients, occasionally jazzed up with a Mediterranean twist. We recommend their sourdough pizzas cooked in a clay oven – your tastebuds won’t know what has hit them!	benedettifilip	\N	\N
3339497698	Bistro Tribunal	Vaartstraat 9	Belgium	Leuven	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.bistrotribunal.be/	Nessun premio	Meats and Grills, Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	f	Have you ever heard of a meat sommelier? Well, in this traditional bistro, one such will help you make your choice among the fine cuts of meat supplied by the prestigious Rondou butchers. A refrigerated meat display counter and a lobster tank catch the eye. Rather than prissy, complex preparations, you can expect spot-on cooking, freshly prepared sauces and regular refills of hot, crunchy French fries. The wine list (splendid selection of Bordeaux wines) is at bargain prices.	benesemily	\N	\N
3337313797	Cum Laude	Groot Begijnhof 14	Belgium	Leuven	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://restaurantcumlaude.be/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	f	The rich heritage of the Grand Béguinage provides the perfect foil for the bold contemporary interior of Cum Laude. The plating is exquisite, while contrasting textures, finely crafted ingredients and crisp flavours set the scene for suave dining tailored to today’s appetites. A word of advice: often fully booked at lunchtime.	lombardiemanuele	\N	\N
3331669841	Gastrobar Hop	Vaartkom 1a	Belgium	Leuven	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.hopgastrobar.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Hop is a gastrobar that celebrates wine and craft beer. The head-spinning choice is fortunately accompanied by the owner’s knowledgeable insights. Whether you choose an unusual natural wine or a craft beer, the chefs will always find a playful combination to enhance your dish. Eschewing luxury ingredients, they have honed in on the flavours of yesteryear and subtly textured variations. Gourmet dining in a delightfully casual setting that hits the spot every time!	veselyolivia	\N	\N
3336612374	Zappaz	Schipvaartstraat 22	Belgium	Leuven		http://www.zappaz.be	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	Zappaz, noted for its friendly vibe, is living proof that fine dining doesn’t have to be starched and stuffy. The several-course menu is an ode to punchy sauces, featuring a playful approach to vegetables, jazzed up with subtle globetrotting influences. Fascinating flavours add whoomph to each dish – a gourmet pageant of ingredients!	k�nigsara	\N	\N
3330779433	Zarza	Bondgenotenlaan 92	Belgium	Leuven	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.zarza.be/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	t	Zarza, an authentic cosy bolthole with a pretty town garden, is the type of place that inspires loyalty. Chef Cordemans pampers his diners with flawlessly sourced ingredients. The patriotic line-up of Belgian fare is jazzed up by the occasional dash of creativity, illustrated by masterfully cooked langoustine, paired with a gutsy shellfish jus and crunchy courgettes. Sophisticated yet full-bodied flavours. The lunchtime menus are always a safe bet!	testagabriel	\N	\N
