3331160204	't Sleutelgat	Kasseide 78	Belgium	Lieferinge	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://restaurant-sleutelgat.be/	Nessun premio	Creative French	4.0	€€€	t	t	The daughter Laetitia warmly welcomes guests to this family business, whose terrace overlooks the lush green countryside of the village of Lieferinge. Dad, mijnheer Van Holder, demonstrates his technical precision and eye for detail in dishes served in several plates. From a new spin on traditional flammkuchen to veal jazzed up with a punchy medley of international accents, the food is surprisingly complex and fascinating. Don’t forget to book!	martinooliver	\N	\N
3338018644	Au Moriane	En Neuvice 55	Belgium	Liège		https://aumoriane.be	Nessun premio	Creative, Modern French	5.0	€€€	f	t	This 1693 edifice adds a contemporary touch to the historic character of En Neuvice lane by way of bare stone walls and modern comforts. The exquisitely presented food is the handiwork of a gifted chef who demonstrates his international eclecticism, delving freely into the establishment’s cottage garden for his fruit and veggies. The accent is on tradition first and foremost.	brunojulian	\N	\N
