3337000994	Ember	Guldenstraat 9	Belgium	Mechelen	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://embermechelen.be/	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Grills	5.0	€€€	f	t	A smoky live fire focus is at the core of the DNA of Ember, as the wood-burning BBQ in the open-plan kitchen illustrates. In fact, as soon as you cross the threshold of this splendid 17C castle, your tastebuds are taken by storm by the enticing aromas. The interior is as minimalist as the menu. Zino Jacobs is a fan of local produce and his cooking embodies a zero waste ethos. Jacobs wholeheartedly conveys his culinary vision via unusual dishes presented in a set menu. The food is carefully crafted and steeped in fresh, acidic notes. Examples include charred whole pumpkin, which is then mashed and enhanced by a shiitake-based XO sauce^ melt-in-the-mouth Brasvar pork undergoes the same treatment with a punchy gravy that is offset by crushed hazelnuts, smoked bacon and grilled almonds. Truly fascinating!	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3332489420	Cosma	Befferstraat 24	Belgium	Mechelen	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.cosma.be/	Nessun premio	Sharing, Contemporary	4.0	€€	t	f	The bright, hip, relaxed vibe of this restaurant immediately sets everyone at ease. This enthusiasm is further enhanced when you take a glance at the menu which sports a wide range of dishes to be shared, countless vegetarian suggestions and excellent side dishes – bravo! An unusual formula and heart-warming international influences.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
3334664896	Auberge Napoleon	Bouchoutlaan 1	Belgium	Meise	Car park,Terrace	https://www.aubergenapoleon.be/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Classic French	3.0	€€€	f	f	Auberge Napoleon has been a favourite with foodies for years. With high ceilings and charming old beams, the restaurant is entirely done out in white. The chandelier is a particularly impressive feature. On the terrace, you can take in the full beauty of the garden, a tranquil green escape. The extensive menu features classic cuisine – expertly done, down to the dishes finished table side. Think duck breast with an intensely flavoursome port sauce, sole meunière or hop shoots in hollandaise sauce. Many of the dishes can be shared, which ups the fun factor!	wagnerpaul	\N	\N
3336760564	La Traverse	Hundelgemsesteenweg 580	Belgium	Merelbeke	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://la-traverse.be/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	La Traverse is the quintessence of a contemporary brasserie, sporting a warm, welcoming interior and a menu that mingles Flemish classics with more up-to-date dishes, of which shrimp fritters and braised pork cheeks or dimsum and cauliflower steak are just a few examples. We recommend the matured beef, cooked to perfection in a Josper oven. On Saturday evenings, La Traverse offers a menu of varied dishes to share and a platter of cured meats to nibble on.	benedettifilip	\N	\N
3332045657	De Blauwe Artisjok	Gaversesteenweg 182	Belgium	Merelbeke	Car park,Terrace	https://www.deblauweartisjok.be/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	f	t	Satisfied customers are the raison d’être of this stylish villa, where you are graciously greeted by Nathalie before taking a seat in the elegant dining room. Veteran chef Kurt Verhaege aims to work with fresh, seasonal produce. He boasts a classical training and his textbook perfect champagne sauce is a model of French culinary technique, as are his main courses and side dishes, which also feature a subtle international slant. Delicious eater-friendly prices.	virgolinifrancesco	\N	\N
