3332654016	Les Gribaumonts	rue d'Havré 95	Belgium	Mons	Interesting wine list	https://www.lesgribaumonts.be/	Nessun premio	Creative French, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	f	The façade of this restaurant is adorned in colourful frescoes, which also set the scene in the contemporary interior. The harmony between Nicolas’ inspired wine pairings and Lisa’s elegant culinary prowess is irresistible. The chef has a fondness for local ingredients, whose rich flavours are further enhanced by delicate touches and a consummate wine list.	vargalucia	\N	\N
