3332973525	De Koolputten	Koolputten 2	Belgium	Waasmunster	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.dekoolputten.be/	Nessun premio	French Contemporary	4.0	€€€	t	t	These former coal shafts overlooking the Mirabrug bridge have been carefully restored and are now home to a comfortable B&B, an exhibition area, an events venue and this restaurant. A trendy, pleasant setting in which to sample contemporary fare with classical roots, with a very open feel. Up-to-date cuisine with gastronomic flair.	contimatteo	\N	\N
