3331753626	Datenbank	28 East Zijing Road	China Mainland	Chengdu	Credit cards not accepted		Nessun premio	Innovative	4.0	¥¥¥	t	f	Its name conjures up images of rows of servers with flickering lights, but the room is designed like a cavern with raw, handmade stoneware to match. The “data” here refers to the deconstruction and re-assembly of taste memories for an original experience. It opens for dinner only with one set menu that blends the heat in Sichuanese and Mexican food seamlessly to a surprisingly good effect. Also try the house-brewed kombucha in seasonal flavours.	kozakjennifer	\N	\N
