3333869479	Qian Li	E2008	China Mainland	Chengdu	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Taizhou	5.0	¥¥	t	t	The on-trend decor feels laid back^ the menu showcases an array of home-style Taizhou classics, including seafood from the East China Sea, which can be steamed, braised, served in a sizzling claypot or even fried with chillies and aromatics. The pork tripe and chicken in gingery broth, a winter favourite, is served piping hot in a claypot for exceptional flavours. Try also shi bing tong – a pancake roll filled with pork, eel and vegetables.	stracciaantonio	\N	\N
3336268904	Chanyue Vegetarian	19F	China Mainland	Chengdu	Air conditioning,Foreign credit cards not accepted		Nessun premio	Vegetarian	3.0	¥¥	f	f	Bamboo blinds, wooden furniture, elegant plants and sheer curtains impart serenity. The set menu changes every 15 days to reflect the 24 solar terms in the Chinese calendar^ even the house-fermented vinaigrette used is different. Seasoned with ginger, garlic and chilli, the food is mostly Sichuan-style, with vegan items craftily disguised as meat and fish – bovine bolete as pork liver, bamboo fungus as beef tripe, konjac as squid.	landirobert	\N	\N
