3334761437	Harmony Garden (Xierhuan North Road)	No.32	China Mainland	Fuzhou	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Fujian	4.0	¥¥	t	f	With nine private rooms in a two-storey villa, Harmony Garden offers warm, friendly service and Fujian cooking with creative twists. The owner used to run a tea leaf business, which explains the antique tea ware and tea leaves on sale. Signatures include stir-fried sliced conch in red yeast rice wine lees, which marries lingering aromas and a crisp texture. Drunken pork ribs are deep-fried before being tossed in a tangy wine vinegar glaze.	barbierisalvatore	\N	\N
