3338907378	Sir Elly's	13F	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Brunch,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.peninsula.com/en/shanghai/5-star-luxury-hotel-bund	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	4.0	¥¥¥¥	t	f	Named after the hotel's founder, the opulent space punctuated by red accents commands gorgeous river views. The upscale ambiance makes this a perfect venue for a date. The kitchen turns local ingredients into original creations with bold flavours, dramatic plating and modern Asian twists. The substantial wine list will keep any oenophile happy. If you're not quite ready to call it a night, consider heading to the rooftop bar for digestifs.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
