3330894589	Coquille	29 Mengzi Road	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://www.coquille.com.cn/	Nessun premio	French	4.0	¥¥¥	t	f	(The restaurant is temporarily closed for renovation.) Next to Italian trattoria Scarpetta, its younger sibling, Coquille, occupies two floors. On the seafood-focused menu, French classics come with subtle Asian twists. Signature dishes include foie gras crème brûlée and oven-roasted Dungeness crab. Finish off with coconut soufflé – golden and fluffy and with sea salt coconut ice cream on the side. Besides à la carte choices, there is a set menu for two. The beef Wellington needs to be pre-ordered.	longoethan	\N	\N
3336268384	Jean Georges	4F	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Brunch,Great view,Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.threeonthebund.com/en/restaurant/102008183386	Nessun premio	French	5.0	¥¥¥¥	f	f	Those who are familiar with Jean-Georges Vongerichten’s New York flagship will recognise some of the menu items here at his Shanghai outpost, such as toasted egg yolk with caviar, and tuna tartare with avocado. The cooking is light and fragrant, with plenty of choice on offer. The comfortable room comes with views and an open kitchen^ it’s warmly lit and run by a well-organised and professional team.	stannaomi	\N	\N
3335188129	Villa Le Bec - Bistro 321	321 Xinhua Road	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://lebec.com.cn/	Nessun premio	French	4.0	¥¥¥	t	f	A lovely renovated villa, dating from 1924, is home to this French bistro. It is divided into several rooms, each decorated differently^ the garden terrace is a delightful spot for a round of drinks on a balmy night. Classic bistro dishes include an excellent pâté en croute and côte de boeuf prepared barbecue style. From time to time, the kitchen rustles up seasonal creations that feature local Chinese produce prepared in traditionally French ways.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
