3337318683	Cellar to Table	1A	China Mainland	Shanghai	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace		Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	¥¥¥	f	f	With an Italian chef on board since 2024, this place exuding an appealing wine-bar vibe has a revamped menu that is unmistakably Italian. The dishes are rife with bold flavours and the extensive wine list meanders across the globe. The handmade pasta is perfectly al dente^ the grilled Shandong red prawn smoky and juicy^ Sichuan tomatoes and Yunnan mushrooms work magic in Italian recipes. On a balmy night, ask for a courtyard table.	marinescumario	\N	\N
