3334260186	Yong Feng Mian Guan	320 Hankou Road	China Mainland	Shanghai	Cash only		Nessun premio	Noodles	3.0	¥	f	t	Now run by the second generation, this family-run halal noodle shop has been around since 1962. Forced to close due to urban renewal, many regretted the demise of the original venue. Recently re-opened in a new spot, the original kitchen team proudly delivers its distinctive culinary score. The signature red-braised lamb noodles are served in curry beef stock or tossed in scallion oil. Either way, order an over-easy egg so the yolk spills over the noodles.	rivaalexei	\N	\N
