3334492343	Kaiseki	Château de la Gaude	France	Aix-en-Provence	Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://chateaudelagaude.com/kaiseki	Nessun premio	Japanese, Fusion	3.0	€€€€	f	t	In the magical setting of an 18C bastide, the Kaiseki upholds Japanese gourmet dining traditions with its “Omakase – The Great Journey” tasting menu that gives the chefs carte blanche. Chefs Matthieu Dupuis Baumal and Kazunari Noda have pooled their skill and talent to create a genuine culinary voyage poised between France and Japan. The next-door brasserie, Le K, offers a varied, more affordable score.	horvathmaria	\N	\N
