3334741685	Les Cordois Autrement	15 rue Bocquillot	France	Avallon	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://lescordois.fr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	This restaurant, run by the same family since 1910, now abuts a 12C church. Take a seat and admire the bright colourful interior or relax on the shaded terrace, as you sample a cleverly updated version of regional country nosh: Burgundy snails, eggs in red wine, veal kidneys in mustard sauce without forgetting the odd intriguing creation such as an escalope of salmon with Morteau sausage and a creamy sauce of runny cheese…	schneidermihai	\N	\N
