3330509656	Le Chicoula, bistrot d'Art	22 rue de Cursol	France	Bordeaux	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.lechicoula.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	This tiny bistro opened without fanfare, yet there is plenty to write home about. The chef is a dab hand, as demonstrated by the single set menu that changes every month with its original flavours and harmonious presentations. The decoration is just as noteworthy, including work by local artists. Opening nights are occasionally held – the chef himself paints in his spare time…	krausmartina	\N	\N
3338826728	Le Clos d'Augusta	339 rue Georges-Bonnac	France	Bordeaux	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace	https://www.leclosdaugusta.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	With its inviting bottle-green façade and pleasant terrace in the garden to the rear, this restaurant is run by a couple whose genuine dedication inspires confidence. The deft and creative dishes lay the emphasis on local ingredients. One example of their fresh, flavourful and seasonal starters is the generous carpaccio of Zebra tomatoes, smoked scamorza, fresh peas, leeks, basil and a green apple sorbet. Diners can expect a very warm welcome. At lunchtime, the set menu du jour is a bargain.	bernardiliam	\N	\N
3333564078	Le Quatrième Mur	2 place de la Comédie	France	Bordeaux	Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.quatrieme-mur.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	The quatrième mur (‘fourth wall’) of a theatre is the invisible one that separates the actors from the audience. An apt name for this restaurant set in Bordeaux’ iconic Grand Théâtre. Philippe Etchebest plays a gloriously simple, understated score focusing on first-rate ingredients, high-flying technique, a side dish and a jus. The terrace on one of the opera house’s outdoor side galleries is heavenly. Bookings essential – two sittings at lunchtime and in the evening. The menus change weekly.	fontanagiuseppe	\N	\N
