3333264478	L'EssenCiel	37 boulevard Jean-Jaurès	France	Fougères	Wheelchair access	http://lessenciel-restaurant.fr	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	Chef Jean-Marie Baudic (formerly of the Youpala bistro in St Brieuc) chose this modern eatery to craft a bistronomic repertory with his second chef Julien Rouault. Premium seasonal ingredients and intelligently crafted recipes are the focus: seabream and crunchy veggies^ melt-in-the-mouth wing of skate with crunchy diced vegetables and a gutsy jus^ shoulder of lamb paired with arancini… Different set menus at lunchtime, in the evening and at weekends.	costanzomaurizio	\N	\N
