3333655619	La Table de Kamiya	52 promenade de la Plage	France	Cagnes-sur-Mer	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.la-table-de-kamiya.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	Japanese chef Takayuki Kamiya and pastry chef Claire, his French-Japanese wife, have set up shop on the seafront of Cagnes-sur-Mer. The food is inspired by their adopted homeland (Provence) and their family backgrounds. Their set menus feature dishes inspired by France and Provence (sea bass in an almond crust, courgettes and pistou) and elevated by discreet Japanese touches (wakame, oloshi sauce, yuzu). Both the delicious peach dessert with verbena jelly and the rum baba, a house classic, are out of this world.	pirijiri	\N	\N
