3331761302	Le Bistro 1911	5 avenue Charles-de-Freycinet	France	Cahors	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://www.terminus-1911.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€	f	f	The chef enthusiastically prepares up - to - date dishes, served in an elegant room adorned with stained glass. Magnificent wine list and a simpler lunchtime menu.	baguettebenois	\N	\N
