3336072235	La Barbacane	Place Auguste-Pierre-Pont	France	Carcassonne	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park	https://www.restaurant-labarbacane.com/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	t	Set deep in historic Carcassonne, the Hôtel de la Cité is a superb example of neo-Gothic architecture, built in 1909 on the site of the former episcopal palace, whose magnificent gardens abut the ramparts. Inside, stained-glass windows, coats of arms and wainscoting lend it an ambience worthy of 19C French architect Viollet-le-Duc. Based on top quality ingredients, notably Mediterranean fish and seafood, as well as game and mushrooms in autumn, the menu champions the region’s terroir in dishes that add a new spin to classical recipes.	valentimatteo	\N	\N
3332437539	La Table d'Alaïs	32 rue du Plô	France	Carcassonne	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://table-alais.fr/fr/accueil-restaurant/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	Within the medieval walled city, this is your best bet if you want to avoid the tourist traps. Up the stairs, you'll find the pared-back dining area leading onto a courtyard terrace for dining in fine weather. On the menu, traditional and modern go hand in hand: 64-degree egg, truffle and button mushrooms^ cassoulet with Castelnaudary beans and duck confit^ pavlova with seasonal fruit and vanilla mascarpone cream.	stepanekgrace	\N	\N
