3332778882	La Brasserie du Corton	Avenue du Revestel	France	Cassis	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://lavillamadie.com/la-brasserie-du-corton/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	The brasserie offshoot of Villa Madie continues to foster simplicity with its market-fresh ingredients and enticing surf and turf combinations. The set menus are different at lunch and dinner, as well as being changed on a weekly basis. Less expensive than at the original restaurant, the dishes here are just as tasty (beef tartare with Tamaris oysters, real Marseille sôcisse with fennel, lemon tart. When the weather is fine, head for the terrace, which commands a knockout view of the pretty bay.	langalice	\N	\N
