3336244756	La Lozerette	Route du Pont-de-Montvert	France	Cocurès	Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.lalozerette.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	In the heart of the Cévennes, this charming inn is the domain of a chef who specialises in cleverly crafted dishes using regionally sourced produce. On the wine side, Pierrette, a talented sommelier, will help you choose from the 300 references available… Let’s not forget the splendid cheeseboard!	vecchiatomichael	\N	\N
3333112138	La Maison	1 rue du 14-Juillet	France	Cognac	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurant-lamaison-cognac.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	This attractive house in the town centre is built of white stone and has a relaxed atmosphere inside. The cuisine is eclectic, with multiple influences (Asia, the Mediterranean, South America): pan-fried squid with garlic and red chilli^ lamb shoulder confit with cumin, tchoutchouka (roasted pepper and tomato salad)^ beef tenderloin, panko with herbs and chimichurri sauce. Be sure to try the house cocktails featuring cognac.	tottifrancesco	\N	\N
3330661545	Notes	Hôtel La Nauve	France	Cognac	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://almae-collection.com/lanauve/restaurants/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	A little way from the town centre, this fine 19C town house is now a luxury hotel. It has undergone first-rate restoration work, the fruits of which are particularly evident in the restaurant's dining area, which is set in an intimate and elegant lounge. Chef Anthony Carballo proposes two multi-course surprise set menus inspired in part by the estate's vegetable garden. Tomato, basil, burrata^ pollack, courgette, fish fumet: a lovely symphony of flavours, accompanied by a well-devised wine list! Alternatively, you can also enjoy a meal at the Brasserie des Flâneurs, in what was once the estate's distillery.	schulzchiara	\N	\N
3339858663	Poulpette	46 avenue du Maréchal-de-Lattre-de-Tassigny	France	Cognac	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative	5.0	€€	t	f	Now, this is a place that has it in the bag. The deliberately short menu offers tasty market-based cooking, with flights of fancy far and wide^ it is made with fine ingredients prepared with care and originality. Amandine, once a dance teacher, now head of service and partner, and Antoine, alumnus of the elite Paris Institute of Political Studies but passionate about food (stints at Lucas Carton and Jadis) have joined forces to offer a delightful culinary experience.	montanarijack	\N	\N
