3332882521	Le Collet	9937 route de Colmar	France	Col de la Schlucht	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://chalethotel-lecollet.com/fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Country cooking	4.0	€€	f	t	“Instinctive, last-minute” regional dishes, rustled up by a seasoned veteran who has trained many a local chef. In a picture postcard swish Alpine chalet décor, each dish celebrates and pays tribute to authentic regional produce.	pingliu	\N	\N
3337052031	Mamma - Les Roches Brunes	15 route de Port-Vendres	France	Collioure	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://hotel-lesrochesbrunes.com	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	t	Clinging to a rocky outcrop, Les Roches Brunes is a feast for the eye: the hotel overlooks the sea and offers a breathtaking view of the Château royal de Collioure opposite. In the bohemian-chic restaurant, the gourmet score celebrates local produce. You will taste creative, hearty Catalan recipes with a weakness for seafood: Palamos prawns, mushrooms and a coffee emulsion^ arroz seco, baby squid and blue crab stock^ fillet of dentex cooked on a plancha served with a seafood suquet (sort of Catalan fish stew).	grafpaola	\N	\N
3333298871	Le 5ème Péché	16 rue de la Fraternité	France	Collioure	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	This small restaurant in Collioure's old town is run by a chef from Tokyo, who is passionate about French food and wine. Here, Japan meets Catalonia in fusion cuisine that stars ultra-fresh fish. A prime example is the rockfish soup with coconut milk, braised ox cheek with banyuls and prawns. Remember to book well in advance.	winternoemi	\N	\N
