3338612734	L'Altitude	Le K2 Altitude	France	Courchevel	Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.lek2altitude.com/fr/deguster/l-altitude.html	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	t	t	At Le K2 Altitude, this restaurant is comfortably installed in a chic mountain-style decor with an intimate atmosphere. The menu comprises traditional French cuisine, and the eye immediately homes in on the classics, the likes of which are served at the great Parisian restaurants – think calf sweetbread, truffle and crayfish vol-au-vent. Flavour and generosity certainly do not fall short, and the whole experience is thoroughly enjoyable, right through to the desserts by Sébastien Vauxion.	rivaalexei	\N	\N
