3336173447	La Croix Blanche	2 place du Marché	France	Donnemarie-Dontilly	Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurant-croixblanche.fr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Hard at work in the kitchens, the chef makes it a point of honour to use great seasonal ingredients. The dishes are a taste sensation, for example, the chicken supreme with mixed vegetables. Definitely a place you will want to tick off.	schneidermihai	\N	\N
3339459235	Le Périgord	9 avenue de Paris	France	Donzenac	Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€	t	t	If you pay a visit to this restaurant covered in Virginia creeper, be sure to try the calf's brains in gribiche sauce. This is one of the house specialities and highly renowned! This place is rustic in the best sense of the word.	rossettijonas	\N	\N
3331638326	La Table des Échevins	Maison Prévost	France	Douai	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://maisonprevost.fr/la-table-des-echevins/accueil/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	f	Chef Jérôme Prévost (a local man and formerly sous-chef at Le Cerisier in Laventie) has brought panache to these premises – once an antique dealers' – in the heart of Douai. The elegant vestiges of the past (marble fireplace etc) blend in seamlessly with the restaurant's modern decor (with designer features such as circular banquettes, light fittings, swivel chairs). The chef makes the most of fish from the Côte d'Opale and vegetables from local producers^ in season, he dedicates a menu to lobster. Boterzing, part of the same group, serves simpler bistronomy cuisine.	rivaalexei	\N	\N
3334897100	L'Insolite	4 rue Jean-Jaurès	France	Douarnenez	Terrace	https://lafrance-dz.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	This establishment is run by a seasoned chef, Gaël Ruscart, whose inventive cuisine gives pride of place to fish and seafood. Grilled prawns in a Béarnaise emulsion, Chinese cabbage salad with peanuts and crunchy vegetables^ blue lobster from Brittany's coasts in a creamy emulsion of coral and sweet spices… An institution in this town.	sokolovabigail	\N	\N
