3330494841	La Garenne	Le Dracy	France	Dracy-le-Fort	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ledracy.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	An appealing place where you can enjoy, for example, melt-in-the-mouth salmon gravelax with a creamy carrot purée and potato espuma, and, for dessert, chou au craquelin, lemon yuzu mousse and citrus fruit flavours. The low-key decor incorporates some pretty prints of artwork by Alain Thomas, and the veranda overlooks the terrace and grounds. The hotel, meanwhile, boasts pleasant guestrooms, a swimming pool and a spa.	contimatteo	\N	\N
