3336798130	La Tour	7 ter route du Fraisse	France	Dunières	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.hotelrestaurantlatour.com	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Local ingredients (Puy green lentils, Grazac snails, free - range guinea fowl etc) are transformed into appetising meals by the chef. The food is good and hearty, as well as carefully prepared. The cheese trolley, which includes lots of cheeses from Auvergne, is an added bonus. It is all very appealing, not least the very well - appointed rooms.	wagnerpaul	\N	\N
