3335183784	Ruche	Domaine les Bruyères	France	Gambais	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://domainelesbruyeres.com/ruche-le-restaurant/	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€	f	t	On the outskirts of Rambouillet Forest, chef Cybèle, who also runs the Table de Cybèle in Boulogne Billancourt, fell in love with this estate dating from 1850, where she now grows practically everything she cooks according to permaculture methods… Fresh greens thus play a pivotal role, flanked by fermentation techniques and produce from local growers. The bread, butter and yoghurt are all homemade and the wine list is rich in biodynamic and natural vintages. The interior displays a Scandinavian slant and offers five pretty guestrooms for peaceful wellness retreats.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
