3333743450	Avelan	Hôtel Coquillade Provence	France	Gargas	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://coquillade.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€€	f	f	Part of a luxury resort in the midst of the sweet-scented Luberon gorse land, this restaurant sports a Provençal-style interior and a patio shaded by a pergola overlooking the surrounding hillsides. Chef Pierre Marty crafts distinctive cuisine, packed with rugged flavours (chilli, ginger, etc.) and strong Mediterranean influences, yet his consummate signature dish is a textbook pithiviers of poultry and foie gras. Vegetarian menu, trolleys brimming with home-made bread and splendid cheeses, plus a remarkable wine list, in which the estate’s wines figure prominently. A bistronomic alternative is available at Les Vignes restaurant.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
