3337108803	La Maison	1 rue du Presbytère	France	Gaujac	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.lamaison.gaujac.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	f	You are made to feel right at home here at La Maison, once a winegrowers' home, with a magnificent stone interior. Creative cuisine is served in the form of dishes in which a number of different elements are juxtaposed. Ludovic Davouze always makes sure to showcase local producers, and enjoys adding an element of surprise, with original combinations of flavours such as just-seared little tuna marinated with chives, with smoked aubergine and miso sauce. The patio is a joy in fine weather.	baranovrachel	\N	\N
