3336129332	La Musardière	123 rue Claude-Monet	France	Giverny	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.lamusardiere.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	f	Located in the heart of the village, close to Claude Monet's house and the Musée des Impressionnismes Giverny, La Musardière serves a bistronomy lunch menu at Le M and more ambitious dining options in the evening at Révélations. The convivial, contemporary bistro setting is complemented by a pleasant terrace that receives plenty of sun in summer. A number of guestrooms are available, should you wish to extend your stay.	bellandigiorgio	\N	\N
