3339026297	Auberge de Grilly	34 ruelle de l'Église	France	Grilly	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.aubergedegrilly.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	In a charming village between Gex and Divonne, Auberge de Grilly stands close to the church. While the interior decor tends toward the rustic, the cuisine is modern, with dishes based on fine ingredients cleverly curated into just one generous tasting menu. Service with a smile, plus a pleasant terrace.	rossigiovanni	\N	\N
