3336603327	Les Gentianettes	73 route de Chevenne	France	La Chapelle-d'Abondance	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.gentianettes.fr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	f	A mountain chalet decor with exposed beams, a traditional dining room with a fireplace in the middle and decorated with a collection of bells – it doesn't get much more inviting than this! The kitchen serves both traditional dishes, including beef tenderloin with a morel mushroom sauce, and slightly more modern and creative recipes such as carpaccio of sea bass with passion fruit. For Savoyard specialties, guests can head to La Baratte, the restaurant's ground-floor eatery, to tuck into authentic cuisine in a friendly atmosphere.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3331027607	Roche Belle	455 corniche du Liouquet	France	La Ciotat	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://roche-belle.fr/	Nessun premio	Provençal	3.0	€€	f	f	This small house, smothered in Virginia creeper and complete with a patio planted with olive trees, paints an archetypal portrait of Provence. The aromatic, sun-soaked cuisine, steeped in the fragrant aroma of the Mediterranean, illustrates a culinary quest whose goal is “simply good food” (to quote chef Arnaud). The bargain lunchtime set menu is as devilishly tempting as the à la carte lineup. We sampled snails in parsley and garlic and hazelnut-flavoured squash^ veal blanquette stew with girolle mushrooms and red rice from Camargue^ roast figs in muscat grapes and fennel, honey mousse and raspberry sorbet. The house speciality is whole fish and poultry (seabream, capon, etc.). Cheerful welcome and service.	testagabriel	\N	\N
3338497797	L'Atelier des Saveurs by Stéphane Garcia	51 rue Georges-Clemenceau	France	La Colle-sur-Loup	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://restaurant-latelierdessaveurs-sg.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	Fruit and veg from local producers, fish from local fishermen, meat from Southwest France and a knockout selection of Basque cheeses: the “flavour workshop” is fully equal to its name! Examples include a ballotine of Gers poultry stuffed with truffles and hazelnuts with green asparagus from St-Paul-de-Vence… A 100% Basque menu is available to order, in tribute to the youthful chef’s roots.	montanarijack	\N	\N
