3331504884	L'Azimut	1 rue du Men-Du	France	La Trinité-sur-Mer	Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.lazimut-latrinite.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	A resolutely maritime ambience pervades this cosy restaurant, an institution in La Trinité-sur-Mer since 1965. On the menu: seafood and fish as well as meat cooked in the open fire… The dishes are packed with textures and flavours: pollack gravlax served ceviche-style, citrus cream, parsley oil, Calamansi vinegar pearls and lace tuile. Fine selection of wines^ large terrace with a view of the harbour. A delightful dining option!	kralrosa	\N	\N
3339150892	La Maison Badine	2 rue du Pont-Prouiller	France	La Tronche	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.maison-badine.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	This welcoming modern establishment, named after one of the chef’s forebears, is depicted by a trendy, casual vibe that mirrors its tattooed maestro. From his open-plan kitchen, Florian Poyet crafts a legible bistronomic score with a strong focus on the seasons: squid in parsley and garlic and white asparagus, Trièves lamb with wild garlic and black limes, slow-baked rhubarb and strawberries in Kampot white pepper…	berninialex	\N	\N
