3332729136	Ar Maen Hir	15 bis rue du Prieuré	France	Locronan	Terrace,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	For his first restaurant, youthful Thibaud Érard chose the picturesque, medieval village of Locronan, near Quimper, where he is clearly flourishing. His traditional, wholesome cuisine quietly feeds you well. Pleasant, casual service.	impeiluca	\N	\N
3339153218	Auberge de la Diligence	4 rue de la Libération	France	Loiré	Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.diligence.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	f	Something of a local culinary landmark, this delightful inn marries old stones with a tasteful makeover. Tania Cudraz cheerfully escorts you to your seat where you will sample the handiwork of her hubbie, Michel. The veteran chef’s varied, individual repertory is scattered with herbs from their kitchen garden and spices discovered on their numerous trips to distant lands, Asia in particular. The stonking wine bin boasts over 400 references. The enchanting terrace is set in the inner courtyard of this former post house.	virgolinifrancesco	\N	\N
