3331877033	Regain	3 rue d'Algérie	France	Lyon	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.regainrestaurant.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Near the Saône embankment, a youthful team crafts appetising market-fresh fare (tempura of white tuna, aubergines, blackberries^ veal cutlet and sweetbread from Clavisy farm, samphire, potatoes and white butter^ figs and goat’s milk). The lunchtime menu offers a concise choice of dishes, while more extensive tasting menus are available in the evening. The interior sports an artfully distressed industrial vibe.	caprinivaleria	\N	\N
3338997490	Monsieur P	8 place des Célestins	France	Lyon	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.monsieurp.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	On Place des Célestins, Monsieur P is the stomping ground of good food lovers. In the kitchen, Florent Poulard, who trained at the Paul Bocuse Institute and honed his skills in top houses, deftly prepares tasty modern cuisine. He loves to work with vegetables (after a stint with Alain Passard) and whole fish and cuts of meat. Love at first bite!	mazziandrei	\N	\N
