3338643231	Le Bistrot des Voraces	13 rue d'Austerlitz	France	Lyon	Terrace	https://www.bistrotdesvoraces.com	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€	f	f	Do you just have a healthy appetite or are you downright starving? Either way, this bistro in the Croix-Rousse district will sate you. Youthful Cédric Blin honed his skills in top establishments like Les Crayères (Reims), before going solo here. Genuinely eater-friendly, almost bargain prices – not to be missed!	salajakub	\N	\N
3334565181	Les Boulistes	9 place Tabareau	France	Lyon	Terrace	https://www.lesboulistes.fr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€	t	f	On La Croix-Rousse plateau of Lyon, this restaurant, overlooking a square popular with boules’ players (hence the name), proposes authentic cuisine with a twist and, more recently, jazzed up with a few inspired Mediterranean tributes: Moroccan harira, portokalopita (a Greek, orange-flavoured pastry), etc. Meals are served in the bistro interior or on the al fresco patio, which is taken by storm as soon as the temperatures begin to rise.	brunojulian	\N	\N
