3334436436	Le Clos Monteils	7 chemin du Moulin	France	Monteils	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.leclosmonteils.fr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Françoise and Bernard Bordaries turned this 1771 presbytery into an intimate restaurant that feels like a family home. She extends a genial welcome, while he cracks on with the cooking. He builds dishes on simple foundations to highlight seasonal ingredients in well-crafted recipes.	medvedevkatie	\N	\N
