3339006325	Les 16 Clochers	91 chemin des 16-Clochers	France	Monthion	Car park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.16clochers.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	The terrace of this restaurant boasts a superb panoramic view over the valley's 16 church towers. The new, young and energetic team swear by local and organic producers (for their mushrooms, eggs and vegetables in particular) to create their well-crafted and market-fresh cuisine. The menu changes regularly and the terrace is popular in summer.	marinotommaso	\N	\N
3338677546	ro.bo	Hôtel de Bouilhac	France	Montignac-Lascaux	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurantrobo.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	f	In the Périgord Noir area of the Dordogne, the Hôtel de Bouilhac is housed in a 17C mansion. Its restaurant welcomes guests in a magnificent courtyard or in one of two salons with stone walls that bear the marks of their long history. Diners will be happy to discover that chef Nick Honeyman, of the MICHELIN-starred Le Petit Léon, just 10km away, is also at the helm here. His creative cuisine is already renowned for its freshness and pronounced flavours, particularly those of citrus fruits, which he uses to excellent effect. A case in point is his take on île flottante: elderflower-infused blancmange, citrus foam, on a bed of Périgord strawberries, served with a peaty whisky cream.	vogelbeatrice	\N	\N
