3331051496	La Table du Château	4 chaussée des Capucins	France	Montreuil	Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.chateaudemontreuil.com/	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€	f	f	In the hushed, elegant decor of this Montreuil-sur-Mer institution, a young chef from Lille serves creative, eco-responsible cuisine (fermentation, decoction). He puts the emphasis firmly on plants and vegetables and showcases small-scale local producers. The yellow pollack, courgette from the market gardener, fish roe and elderflowers is a surprising, hearty dish with wonderful marriages of flavours.	krausmartina	\N	\N
