3331663340	L'Auberge de la Vallée	7 route de Brionne	France	Nassandres-sur-Risle	Terrace		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	This charming half-timbered house set in a bucolic location is extremely pleasant. In this setting you can tuck into simple, seasonal cuisine concocted with the finest ingredients, such as a charlotte of andouille sausage with cabbage.	schmittelisa	\N	\N
3334526362	L'Obélias	7 boulevard Eugène-Viala	France	Naucelle	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://restaurantobelias.wixsite.com/obelias	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	In the Ségala region, nestling in a village that is famous for its Cistercian church, this recently renovated little restaurant is accommodated in a half-timbered house. A well-travelled couple of industry professionals, Gilhem and Léonie, chef and pastry chef respectively, put a skilful spin on traditional fare such as shredded shoulder of lamb served tajine-style or, for dessert, citrus millefeuille with caramel and blood orange sorbet. The well-balanced and appealing menu they have come up with abounds with fresh and colourful dishes – plus it's excellent value for money. In short, they've got it all figured out. Delightful terrace laid out in the shade of an albizia and a magnolia.	impeiluca	\N	\N
3338862335	Mr Guss	7 avenue Mondenard	France	Nérac	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://mr-guss.fr	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Augustin Guibert aka Guss, a chef with an impeccable track record, is going solo with this contemporary restaurant set at the foot of a beautiful 19C stone building. This inventive cook impresses with his substantial technical prowess, which allows him to play with flavours and textures, as he does with his violetta aubergine, roasted then glazed with honey and satay, potato fritters, hollandaise sauce with caramelised onions. Without fail, the arrival of the delicious dishes bursting with colour puts a smile on your face. Congratulations, too, for showcasing the finest local produce, most notably the vegetables.	longoethan	\N	\N
