3334957421	Liberté	19 rue de la République	France	Neuillé-le-Lierre	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.liberte-restaurant.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	A former village inn, this restaurant is committed to rolling out a sustainable fine dining ethos. At lunchtime, they offer a simpler set menu, in which the chef, whose CV includes a stint at La Table de Marçay, crafts tasty modern cuisine. It is during dinner that the chef exercises his liberty of expression and crafts a more ambitious menu that celebrates regional produce: chilled green pea soup, runny organic egg yolk, oil of lemon balm from the garden^ farm-reared poultry cooked two ways, a gutsy jus, grandma’s potatoes and chilled turnip.	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3338842463	Yushin	77 rue Chauveau	France	Neuilly-sur-Seine	Air conditioning	http://www.yushin.fr	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	€€€	f	f	Between Île de la Jatte and the American Hospital of Neuilly, this traditional Japanese restaurant offers a variety of menus: sushis, bento, omakase and a tasting menu. The fish is of the freshest quality and meticulously prepared as one would expect. The traditional Japanese desserts are exquisitely presented. The interior is unsurprisingly pared down with light wooden fixtures and white walls and the 100% Japanese staff is dutifully attentive. The tea service is carried out with full ceremony and each diner is walked out to the street and thanked on leaving.	tottifrancesco	\N	\N
