3332305782	Epiro	53 boulevard Stalingrad	France	Nice	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace		Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	€€	f	t	After a stint in Rome, where they ran a highly sought-after bistro, Alessandra and Marco are giving it another go near the port in Nice. Appetising Roman delicacies, heart-warming home-made pasta, lashings of generosity and tingling tastebuds, without forgetting the splendid Italian wine list – bang on every time!	valentimatteo	\N	\N
3334531081	La Rotonde	Le Negresco	France	Nice	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.hotel-negresco-nice.com/fr	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	The rotunda-shaped brasserie of the legendary luxury hotel has resolutely entered the modern world. In this light-filled space (with a terrace), you choose from a menu (designed by Michelin-starred chef Virginie Basselot) that celebrates a flavoursome and colourful cuisine full of Mediterranean flair, with nods to Nice's traditions.	costantinitomas	\N	\N
3332464378	Rouge	2 rue de Foresta	France	Nice	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.rouge-restaurant.fr	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Sharing	3.0	€	f	t	Behind the port, in the antique dealer neighbourhood, a disciple of Yves Camdeborde is at the helm of this friendly wine bar. The chef prepares lovely Mediterranean sharing plates, concocted with ultra-fresh produce. It is delicious and hearty, and the wallet doesn't take too heavy a hit. A hundred or so lively wines feature on the list, also at reasonable prices. Open all day from noon (no reservations taken).	benedettifilip	\N	\N
3336243014	Chabrol	12 rue Bavastro	France	Nice	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.le-chabrol-restaurant-nice.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	“Faire Chabrol” is an ancient custom in rural southern France, which consists in adding a little wine to the dregs of soup to further dilute the stock, before gulping it down. In the restaurant of the same name, two childhood buddies seek to enhance simple (but high-quality) ingredients, thanks to modern recipes, strewn with a sprinkling of intelligent inventiveness – to the delight of diners.	iordachelilly	\N	\N
