3333346118	Les Mérovingiens	32 avenue Émile-Cossonneau	France	Noisy-le-Grand	Air conditioning,Brunch,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.lesmerovingiens.fr	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Jacky Ribault (L'Ours in Vincennes, Qui Plume la Lune in the 11th arrondissement in Paris) opened this brasserie on the ground floor of a residential building in the centre of Noisy-le-Grand. It pays homage to the history of the town, which was built on a Merovingian and Carolingian necropolis. The menu proposes good classic dishes – slightly revamped – made from impeccable produce. Pleasant contemporary setting.	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
3339787372	La Sassa	à la tour de Nonza	France	Nonza	Great view,Terrace	https://www.lasassa.com	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	This unusual restaurant, without an inside dining room, nestles at the foot of the watchtower built by Paoli (18C), a veritable crow's nest, perched 160m up, offering an exceptional view over the coast of Cap Corse and Saint Florent bay. The terraces with their many nooks and crannies mean you can enjoy the good, Corsican - accented Mediterranean cuisine with a certain amount of intimacy.	kozakjennifer	\N	\N
3338265933	Boccafine	au village	France	Nonza	Terrace	https://www.boccafine.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	A small, listed village on the Cap Corse road is home to this demure restaurant, hidden by a curtain of Virginia Creeper and tall plane trees. The chef unveils his know-how as he crafts painstakingly sourced, local and seasonal ingredients, illustrated by ultra-fresh croaker, pancetta and pork jus in a surf and turf recipe of wondrous harmony. Love at first bite.	stracciaantonio	\N	\N
3333660209	À l'Agneau d'Or	99 rue Général-Gouraud	France	Obernai	Wheelchair access	https://alagneaudor.e-monsite.com	Nessun premio	Alsatian	4.0	€€	f	t	Head cheese with vinaigrette sauce, fillet of pikeperch on sauerkraut with Riesling sauce, a different kind of home-made tart every day. These are examples of the delights this Alsace establishment, typical both in appearance and philosophy, has in store for you. The decor is eminently inviting and the dishes exude the great flavour of the region's recipes.	novotnycecilia	\N	\N
