3339017631	Madame FAN	18 rue Bayen	France	Paris	Air conditioning	http://www.madame-fan.com	Nessun premio	Chinese	4.0	€€	t	t	This restaurant celebrates the delights of Chinese cuisine courtesy of a short menu devised by Chinese-born executive chef. He produces masterful dishes using quality ingredients – raw bluefin tuna, marinated cucumber^ Padrón peppers, beef and chicken stuffing^ Kung Pao prawns with cashew nuts^ chocolate bao, black sesame ice cream... to savour in a contemporary-style interior with a glass-paned roof.	voicucatu	\N	\N
3330855360	Taokan	8 rue du Sabot	France	Paris	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.taokan.fr/	Nessun premio	Chinese	4.0	€€	f	f	Come inside this pretty restaurant in the heart of St-Germain-des-Prés to enjoy light and fragrant Cantonese cuisine, with a few detours to the territory of Southeast Asia: the obligatory dim sum, steamed fish, spicy beef or lok lak. Lovely presentation and good ingredients: a real ambassador for Chinese food.	rossigiovanni	\N	\N
3336223063	Imperial Treasure	44 rue de Bassano	France	Paris	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://www.imperialtreasure.com/france/	Nessun premio	Chinese, Shanghainese	5.0	€€€€	f	t	If you are in the market for some authentic Chinese cuisine served in a luxurious and elegant setting close to the Champs Elysées, then this is the place for you. Dishes such as imperial shrimp carabinero with sticky rice, Peking duck, and smoked eel with green tea are all prepared according to time-honoured tradition by an outstanding chef from Shanghai. Fine ingredients, subtle flavours and flawless service. Don't miss the dim sum at lunch.	santoronicola	\N	\N
