3332015149	Caïus	6 rue d'Armaillé	France	Paris	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://caius-restaurant.paris	Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€	t	t	This restaurant is named after the chef's great-grandfather. Indeed, Jean-Marc Notelet keeps one eye on the past, seeking out spices and other ideas with which to reinvent recipes and put together a delightfully creative culinary experience. Quality ingredients are expertly prepared – the starter of pointed cabbage and clams is a masterclass^ the snapper fillet, seared with great precision, is accompanied by a good helping of slightly spiced vegetables and a flavourful creamy bisque of green crab^ the pear dessert is hearty and delicious. Inside this restaurant with a plain, discreet façade, two areas coexist: metal and leather on one side, velvet and light wood on the other, which has a view of the kitchen. Efficient and precise service.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
3337776491	Campelli	36 rue Croix-des-Petits-Champs	France	Paris		https://campelli.paris/	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€	t	t	This diminutive restaurant with a midnight-blue and gold façade boasts a chic yet understated decor (velvet banquettes, wooden chairs upholstered in matching velvet, exposed stone walls) – all the better to showcase the creative cuisine and multicultural culinary experience of chef Vartivar Jarkezian. Firmly rooted in French tradition, his cooking also draws discreetly on the influences and pantry of the Middle East (cumin, pistachio, turmeric, yoghurt sauce).	florescumelissa	\N	\N
