3333881120	La Condesa	13 rue Rodier	France	Paris	Air conditioning	http://www.lacondesa-paris.com	Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€€€	t	f	La Condesa, a district of Mexico City, has lent its name to this restaurant run by Indra Carrillo. The Mexican-born chef came to study at the Lyfe (formerly Paul Bocuse) Institute, before working in top establishments such as Le Bristol and L'Astrance. Trained by MOF chefs, notably in fishmongery and bakery, he has also worked in Japan. Although his techniques are purebred Gallic, his inspiration is more multicultural than simply Mexican. A chic, pared-back vein depicts the interior.	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
3337054673	Liquide	39 rue de l'Arbre-Sec	France	Paris	Terrace	https://www.liquide.paris	Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€€	t	t	The quirky decor is delightfully amusing: a horn chandelier and mismatched armchairs, chairs or sofas, plus a 12m-long marble table d'hôte by Philippe Starck. Trendy, but friendly and ideal for hanging out with the mates, sharing dishes, sampling cocktails and a fine bottle (or two). The brainchild of Matthias Marc, variety and creativity set the culinary scene at Liquide.	colombostefano	\N	\N
