3338596718	Toyo	17 rue Jules-Chaplain	France	Paris	Air conditioning	https://www.restaurant-toyo.fr/	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€€€	t	t	In a former life, Toyomitsu Nakayama was the private chef of fashion designer Kenzo. Nowadays, he excels in the art of fusing flavours and textures. Breaded monkfish, Buddha's hand, seaweed and Mimolette^ beef, myoga ginger and red shiso sauce… This is fresh, fragrant cuisine, perfectly washed down with a glass of Burgundy and served up by an attentive but unobtrusive team. Terrific.	valentimatteo	\N	\N
3333213054	Tracé	15 rue de Richelieu	France	Paris	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€€€	f	t	In his zen-feeling contemporary premises close to the Comédie Française, Clément Vergeat continues to give expression to his inspiration in a carte blanche menu, which for all its deft creative touches does not neglect flavour: mushroom and coriander tart^ suckling lamb with cockles, cauliflower and black garlic^ medley of rhubarb with fennel. We should also mention what he accomplishes when it comes to sauces and fermentations. The restaurant's commitment to sustainability, its organic and natural wine list, and its friendly service make for an engaging and sincere dining experience.	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
