3339728341	La Charrue	4 rue du 1er-Décembre	France	Sand	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.lacharrue.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	In the heart of a two-centuries-old edifice, Nicolas Laurent (who trained in places such as the Chambard, the Auberge de l’Ill and the Vieux Couvent) offers contemporary cooking highlighting the region (eel from the Rhine, local game), along with “noble” produce (Cotentin lobster, wild turbot etc.). Regulars will be happy to note that the carp fillets, with fries and Alsatian horseradish cream, remain on the menu.	bellandigiorgio	\N	\N
3339978442	L'Ouillette	Place du Jet-d'Eau	France	Santenay	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ouillette.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	An enthusiastic young couple is at the helm of this family - run inn on the village square. In the kitchen, Simon hops between traditional (eggs in red wine sauce, marbled, seasoned ham, coq au vin) and more modern creations^ Maude ensures that her guests’ every need is met in the dining room. Definitely to be recommended.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
