3330074166	Wintergarten	Schillerstraße 4	Germany	Baden-Baden	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.oetkercollection.com/de/hotels/brenners-park-hotel-spa/restaurants-bars/restaurant-wintergarten/	Nessun premio	Contemporary, Seasonal Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	t	t	The tastefully designed conservatory restaurant of the long-established Brenners Park-Hotel & Spa is a light and airy space with floor-to-ceiling glazing that affords a splendid view of the leafy gardens – and the terrace is, of course, especially inviting. In the evening, the classic and seasonal dishes can be enjoyed as a set menu or ordered à la carte. Vegetarian options are also available. A three-course set menu is served at lunchtime from Monday to Friday.	bergmannalexandru	\N	\N
