3332831672	Die Klosterschänke	Klosterschänke 1	Germany	Baden-Baden	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-klosterschaenke.de/	Nessun premio	International, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Idyllically set a few kilometres from the city centre, this warm and welcoming family-run restaurant boasts a magnificent terrace affording splendid views of the Rhine plain. The chef cooks up regional and seasonal cuisine along with a selection of Italian dishes. The mouthwatering options include a classic cordon bleu with Black Forest ham and Alpine cheese, and saltimbocca alla romana from the chef's homeland.	serafinidmitri	\N	\N
3337377889	Weinstube Baldreit	Küferstraße 3	Germany	Baden-Baden	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace		Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Home Cooking	3.0	€€€	t	t	This lovely wine tavern may be somewhat hidden away in its pleasantly quiet location, but it is well worth seeking out – especially in summer, when the charming secluded courtyard terrace comes into its own. Along with a relaxed atmosphere with rustic charm and friendly service, diners can look forward to an array of different flammkuchen, speciality mussel dishes and regional classics. The seasonal specials of the day are written up on a wooden board or presented verbally. The restaurant has plenty of regulars and is always busy, so it's advisable to make a reservation!	colombostefano	\N	\N
3332141810	Schwarzmatt	Schwarzmattstraße 6a	Germany	Badenweiler	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://schwarzmatt.de/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Served à la carte or as a set menu, classic cuisine made with seasonal produce is the order of the day here. The upscale interior is very comfortable, with harmonious, lovingly arranged decorative objects – it certainly does full justice to the luxurious setting of the traditional holiday hotel of the same name in which this restaurant is housed. For overnight stays, there are elegant country-house-style guestrooms – this is after all the sister hotel of Baiersbronn's Hotel Bareiss. Make a beeline for the gorgeous garden terrace in summer. A must in the afternoon: cakes made to Hermine Bareiss's old recipes!	florescumelissa	\N	\N
