3339378486	Engelwirts-Stube	Rechtmurgstraße 28	Germany	Baiersbronn	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.engel-obertal.de/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Country cooking	5.0	€€	f	f	This lovely restaurant with its delightful terrace overlooking the garden serves regional and seasonal cuisine with the odd nod to international culinary traditions. A friendly and well-drilled front-of-house team help to create an inviting atmosphere. Tip: If you want to be close to the action, book the Chef's Table in the kitchen ( minimum 6 people). And if you wish to spend a little longer here, Hotel Engel Obertal offers comfortable, stylish guestrooms and fantastic facilities to help make your stay a relaxing one.	bianconathan	\N	\N
3339820700	Restaurant zum Bären	Bahnhofstraße 24	Germany	Balduinstein	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.landhotel-zum-baeren.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Farm to table	4.0	€€	t	f	The Buggle family has been running this traditional restaurant in the idyllic Lahn Valley since 1827. With chef Joachim Buggle, the eighth generation is now at the helm and his concept is impressive. He has dedicated himself to culinary classics, serving flavour-intensive, pleasantly pared-back dishes prepared without fuss or frills. Examples from the menu include dishes such as braised veal shank with root vegetables, leek, and potato and cheese purée, or fillet of line-caught sea bass with stuffed courgette, wild garlic risotto and a crustacean foam. The restaurant, with its delightful country-house style interior, has a pleasant and cosy atmosphere, while the Weinstube exudes a slightly more rustic feel. And then they have another ace up their sleeve in the form of a wonderful terrace in the shade of the lime trees! The front-of-house team provides charming and friendly service. The Landhotel zum Bären is also an excellent option, should you wish to spend the night here.	marianiadrian	\N	\N
