3337539641	Rocus	Bahnhofstraße 16	Germany	Baunach	Car park,Credit cards not accepted,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-rocus.de/	Nessun premio	International, Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	t	Housed in an attractively converted railway building dating from 1904, this restaurant proposes ambitious cuisine that takes its cue from the seasons – available à la carte or as a set menu. Dine al fresco in the courtyard or on the terrace facing the railway line. A table in the wine cellar, surrounded by Spanish red wines, comes highly recommended.	basileryan	\N	\N
3337230358	Johann Grill	Hintereck 1	Germany	Berchtesgaden	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.kempinski.com/berchtesgaden	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, Farm to table	3.0	€€€	t	f	Overlooking Berchtesgaden, surrounded by stunning natural beauty and with a magnificent mountain backdrop, the location is to die for! At the restaurant of the luxurious Kempinski Hotel Berchtesgaden, you can enjoy delicious seasonal cuisine made with fresh, local ingredients. For dessert, we highly recommend the Eckerbichl-Haustorte! The sleek, modern interior design is a draw in itself. Incidentally, the restaurant is named after the first person to climb the east face of the Watzmann and Germany's first official mountain guide. Hotel guests can even take in the panoramic view here at breakfast.	novotnycecilia	\N	\N
