3334852602	Limbourg	Limburger Straße 35	Germany	Cologne	Terrace	https://limbourg.restaurant/	Nessun premio	French Contemporary, International	3.0	€€€	t	t	A wonderful addition to the Belgian Quarter's fine dining scene. The atmosphere is pleasantly laid-back and the vibe tasteful, whether you dine in the ground-floor space or at BelEtage. Chef-patron Alen Radic showcases his cosmopolitan cuisine, which draws on French influences and is made with fresh, good-quality ingredients – served as a set menu (vegetarian version available) or à la carte. The slightly shorter set menu served at lunchtime is also popular. The sheltered courtyard terrace is particularly inviting in summer.	caprinivaleria	\N	\N
3330553061	ACHT	Spichernstraße 10	Germany	Cologne	Terrace	https://www.restaurant-acht.de/	Nessun premio	International	4.0	€€	t	f	A trendy, urban establishment in the Spichern Höfe complex on the edge of the Belgian Quarter. Diners sit at wooden tables in a pleasantly unpretentious atmosphere^ attentive service provided by charming waitstaff. Flavoursome, down-to-earth dishes based on regional and international ingredients are cooked up in the open kitchen. In summer, the gorgeous courtyard is much sought after.	grafpaola	\N	\N
3333200013	RIVA	Seestraße 25	Germany	Constance	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.hotel-riva.de/de/	Nessun premio	International, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	The fantastic location on the lake is a draw in itself – a spot on the lovely terrace with a view of the water is of course particularly sought after! But the interior of this bright, elegant restaurant inside the hotel of the same name is also appealing – the floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the lake can be opened up. The cuisine is based on classical and international influences, here and there with an Asian touch, and often on regional products. Chic bar and relaxed outdoor lounge.	popovchloe	\N	\N
3333741535	Porte Neuf	Woldemarstraße 9	Germany	Detmold	Terrace	http://www.porteneuf.de	Nessun premio	French	3.0	€€€	f	f	A good tip if you are looking for a place to eat in Detmold is this restaurant on the edge of the old town. Chef-patron Daniel C. Fischer awaits you in his compact, smartly designed establishment with a modern, feel-good atmosphere. In this setting, he serves up predominantly French-inspired classic cuisine with a modern twist. You can dine à la carte or opt for the set menu.	veselyolivia	\N	\N
3334350979	Lou im Cavalierhaus	Zum Kavalierhaus 9	Germany	Cottbus	Garden or park,Terrace	https://cavalierhaus-branitz.de	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	3.0	€€€€	t	f	The estate is worth a visit in its own right. Along with the palace, there is the 620ha Branitz Park, landscaped by Prince Hermann von Pückler in the 19C. Lou (a nickname given to Prince Pückler) is an elegant restaurant housed in the smart Kavaliersbau (squire's lodge). Here, chef-patron Tim Sillack serves up a modern and seasonal take on classic cuisine, drawing on international influences, cf. his saddle of venison with chanterelles, Lieblingsbrot and wild berries. The chef also refers to the prince's own recipes, creating a link between past and present. The Pücklereis (Neapolitan ice cream) – something of a signature dessert – is a permanent feature of the menu. There are also three tastefully furnished guestrooms for overnight stays.	vogelbeatrice	\N	\N
3336176294	Osteria La Fenice	Nordersteinstraße 6	Germany	Cuxhaven	Terrace	https://www.osterialafenice-cuxhaven.de/	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	€€	t	t	A slice of Italy in Cuxhaven! Behind a rather unassuming façade on a busy shopping street, a truly welcoming osteria ambiance awaits – the decor features decorative wine racks, closely spaced marble tables and even a Vespa! Not to forget the authentic Italian cuisine made with high-quality, fresh ingredients – the sourdough bread and pasta are both made in-house. The wine list showcases Italian labels. Tip: Italian food items can be purchased to take home.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3337090633	Kucher's Weinwirtschaft	Karl-Kaufmann-Straße 2	Germany	Darscheid	Car park,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.kucherslandhotel.de	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	The mismatched antique tables and chairs, the pretty decoration and the almost familial atmosphere lend this place a charming feel. The Swabian-style sour kidneys with sautéed potatoes have been on the menu here forever – a classic with its own loyal following. In addition, the menu includes contemporary dishes such as braised Ellscheid lemon chicken with Mediterranean vegetables. Most of the meat used by Florian Kucher and his team to create their seasonal regional fare comes from the Eifel area. Be sure to peruse the wine list – wine is a passion of senior chef Martin Kucher and he will be happy to advise you.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
3332438214	Leopold	Weinstraße 10	Germany	Deidesheim	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.von-winning.de/de/	Nessun premio	International, Country cooking	3.0	€€	t	t	This lavishly converted stable of the Von Winning winery (part of the Bassermann-Jordan empire) is an impressively modern and extremely popular restaurant that serves excellent food. The menu includes a selection of international and Palatinate dishes. Lovely terrace. It can also be booked as a fantastic location for events. The restaurant was named after Leopold von Winning, founder of the winery.	pierimarco	\N	\N
3336292222	riva	Weinstraße 12	Germany	Deidesheim	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.kaisergarten-deidesheim.com/	Nessun premio	International, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	f	Housed in Kaisergarten Hotel – the sister establishment of Ketschauer Hof, also located in central Deidesheim – this restaurant has a sleek interior done out in light natural tones. In this setting, pleasingly laid-back, friendly and professional waitstaff serve up delicious international and Mediterranean cuisine. The menu also features barbecued meats prepared on the Big Green Egg, along with options for fans of pizza. The selection of wines from the hotel group's own vineyards is excellent. RIVA Bar-Lounge is the perfect spot for a cocktail. The terrace overlooking the garden is delightful in summer.	baroneandres	\N	\N
3338338138	Restaurant 1718	Ketschauerhofstraße 1	Germany	Deidesheim	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ketschauer-hof.com/restaurants/rest...	Nessun premio	International, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	At 1718, elegant period architectural elements blend beautifully with modern design. Part of Ketschauer Hof hotel, the restaurant sits across from the fine dining restaurant L.A. Jordan – separating them is a lovely terrace in the peaceful, verdant courtyard. On the menu, French and international cuisine are the order of the day, accompanied by a superb selection of wines from the Palatinate and beyond. Tip: The establishment runs a wine shop around the corner.	popafarah	\N	\N
3336270940	Schupps	Bahnhofstraße 30	Germany	Deisenhofen	Terrace	http://www.schupp-s.de	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Regina and Markus Schupp, after whom this restaurant is named, are both professionally trained chefs. Here they rustle up seasonal dishes inspired by the cuisines of France and Germany. Delicious examples include scallops au gratin with green asparagus, Jerusalem artichoke and almond, or venison ragout with cranberries, Brussels sprout leaves and sour cream. Those who wish to savour a more extensive meal can put together their own set menu comprising three to five courses for a fixed price. At lunchtime, the inexpensive daily specials are ideal for a quick meal. This friendly little restaurant also has a terrace for sunny days. Tip: free parking available along the street.	polakcristina	\N	\N
3331441245	ESSperiment	Schöninger Straße 74	Germany	Delbrück	Terrace	https://www.restaurant-essperiment.de/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	t	This relaxed modern restaurant with its lovely terrace offers a bistro menu at lunchtimes and fine dining in the evenings. The food is fresh and flavoursome. Try the saddle of venison with muesli, black salsify, pear and layered potato cake.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
3332292456	Kantiners	Graf-Sporck-Straße 34	Germany	Delbrück	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.waldkrug.de/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, French	4.0	€€	f	f	Hotel Waldkrug is a traditional family business in a green and leafy location, and its restaurant is tastefully designed with modern touches. The menu includes good modern bistro dishes in a French vein – think beef carpaccio, Caesar salad or grilled steaks – but also traditional regional dishes, such as beef consommé with marrow dumplings, or schnitzel. In addition, they have pretty terraces at the front and to the rear of the building. The cosy Barstube in the front area is another really lovely option.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
3337089393	Rebstock-Stube	Hauptstraße 74	Germany	Denzlingen	Car park,Terrace	https://www.rebstock-stube.de/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	A lot has changed at this inn run by the Frey family, as the entire building has been given a facelift. Nonetheless, it has retained its original charm. The space remains elegant and cosy^ the garden terrace is a wonderful spot. Chef Axel Frey cooks up classic dishes bursting with bold flavours – à la carte or as a set menu. It's also worth having a look at the wine list. The service is friendly and attentive, with the senior chef also getting in on the act front of house.	serrakevin	\N	\N
3335919053	Hofgut Albführen	Albführen 5	Germany	Dettighofen	Car park,Garden or park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.albfuehren.de/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, International	4.0	€€€	f	f	This farmhouse set against a verdant backdrop of paddocks, woods and fields makes for a wonderful location. On top of that, you will eat well: seated in a tasteful interior, enjoy classical cuisine that draws on different international culinary traditions and makes full use of regional produce. Pretty and comfortable guestrooms, should you wish to stay the night.	de angelislucas	\N	\N
3330945875	Landhaus Halferschenke	Hauptstraße 63	Germany	Dieblich	Terrace	https://halferschenke-dieblich.de/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, Farm to table	4.0	€€€	f	t	In this beautiful quarry-stone building dating from 1832, the Schmah family serve ambitious cuisine that revolves around top-notch ingredients and the seasons – from sole meunière and Aubrac beef to oysters and turbot from Brittany. You can opt to dine à la carte or go for a set menu. In addition to the food, diners can look forward to attentive service in a tasteful setting with a country-house feel. In summer, the gorgeous terrace beckons. In addition, MA PETITE CHAMBRE is a small gourmet haven serving a set menu. They have four well-kept guestrooms for overnight stays.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3337680940	La Cuisine Mario Kalweit	Lübkestraße 21	Germany	Dortmund	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://mariokalweit.de/	Nessun premio	Classic French	3.0	€€€	f	f	A nicely restored building from the late 19th century houses this stylish, modern, elegant restaurant serving creative cuisine. Pleasant terrace.	volkovnatalie	\N	\N
3332065432	Wibbelings Hof	Wittichstraße 23	Germany	Dortmund	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	http://www.wibbelings-hof.de	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	f	Sandra and Jörn Haumann have turned the family-owned estate, which dates back to 1899, into a charming restaurant. While he takes care of the service, she prepares an ambitious set menu that takes its cue from the seasons^ some of the ingredients are home-grown. Food is served in a lovely high-ceilinged room, whose modern interior design incorporates decorative features such as a wine rack, a workbench and large pictures. This space also makes an ideal venue for events and weddings. Tip: the farm shop (open on Wed and Thu afternoons).	stannaomi	\N	\N
3337078101	VEN	Rampische Straße 9	Germany	Dresden	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.ven-dresden.de/	Nessun premio	International, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	This place sets itself apart with its loft vibe and a streamlined urban chic design. International cuisine inspired by the region and the seasons. Then there is the extremely friendly service. The sheltered terrace in the inner courtyard also beckons. VEN is located in the Innside by Meliá hotel, which proposes stylish guestrooms.	brunettibruno	\N	\N
3333149204	Torschänke	Philippsheimer Straße 1	Germany	Dudeldorf	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://torschaenke-dudeldorf.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Regional Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	Right next to the Obertor (the historical city gate), Torschänke is a really inviting restaurant. The atmosphere inside is cosy and pleasingly down to earth, and outside there is a lovely, leafy terrace. Dishes with French and Mediterranean influences are prepared using top-notch fresh produce and served by a friendly, attentive and proficient front-of-house team.	d'angelonino	\N	\N
3334121070	Küppersmühle Restaurant	Philosophenweg 49	Germany	Duisburg	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://kueppersmuehle-restaurant.de/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, International	5.0	€€€	f	t	A fantastic location with an old industrial atmosphere, view of the inner harbour, and terrace right next to the water. This urban-style interior is the backdrop for modern cuisine with classic and international influences, served as fresh and precisely cooked dishes. Slightly simpler menu at lunchtime. Küppersmühle Museum of Modern Art next door is worth a visit.	donatidiego	\N	\N
3335141483	Rebstock	Halbgütle 30	Germany	Durbach	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.rebstock-durbach.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Farm to table	3.0	€€	f	f	Rebstock offers comfortable, country-style dining rooms, attentive service and good regional fare including snail soup, pike dumplings and venison ragout. In summer the idyllic terrace offers views of the surrounding parkland and the Black Forest, while another attraction is the large selection of home-made cakes and pastries.	orlovclaire	\N	\N
3335156095	Rubens	Kaiserstraße 5	Germany	Düsseldorf	Terrace	https://www.rubens-restaurant.de/	Nessun premio	Austrian, Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	This pretty restaurant owned by friendly hosts Cornelia Stolzer and Ruben Baumgart – she is Austrian and he is German-Austrian – is something of an Alpine hot spot. Accordingly, classics such as Backhendl (breaded fried chicken), Alt-Wiener Tafelspitz (prime boiled beef) or Kaiserschmarrn (shredded pancake), as well as modern dishes feature on the menu. Charming, well-trained waitstaff and a decent selection of Austrian wines. Incidentally, the pumpkin seed oil comes from the proprietress's village.	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3331538611	Brasserie Stadthaus	Mühlenstraße 31	Germany	Düsseldorf	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://brasserie-stadthaus.de/	Nessun premio	Classic French	4.0	€€	t	f	This attractive brasserie with its striking high coffered ceiling and pretty interior courtyard promises a genuine French dining experience. Try the tourte de queue de boeuf (oxtail pie) or the seafood platter followed by the tarte au citron. All the wines are French.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
3335111627	Schorn	Martinstraße 46a	Germany	Düsseldorf	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-schorn.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	3.0	€€€€	f	f	With Franz-Josef Schorn as maitre d' and Lukas Schild as chef, this restaurant in the Bilk neighbourhood boasts two big names in the Düsseldorf fine dining scene. Ambitious and flavourful dishes such as braised tri-tip of Wagyu beef from the Eifel region, with a balsamic jus, mashed potatoes, Brussels sprouts and watercress are served as part of the set menu and à la carte. The appealing wine list comprises mostly German and French labels. Friendly service. The dining space has a charming, intimate feel, with decorative features including an old stove, a wine barrel serving as a digestif table and modern paintings.	morozovmegan	\N	\N
3331435934	The Duchy	Königsallee 11	Germany	Düsseldorf	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://www.theduchy-restaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	3.0	€€€	t	f	On the first floor of the luxurious Breidenbacher Hof, overlooking Heinrich-Heine-Allee, this is an elegant brasserie. The cuisine is a broad mix, from sashimi and ceviche to beef tartare or ravioli, not to mention the steaks. They set great store by the origin of their ingredients, working with regional producers – and they keep their own chickens and cows. Decent wine selection.	fabbrijuan	\N	\N
3333601099	Bistro Fatal	Hermannstraße 29	Germany	Düsseldorf	Credit cards not accepted,Terrace	https://www.bistro-fatal.com/	Nessun premio	French	5.0	€€	t	f	It would be a shame to not to get to know Alexandre and Sarah Bourgeuil's pleasantly unpretentious bistro, because the food is excellent. Why not start with a pastis as an aperitif, accompanied by some house-baked baguette with butter? You could follow that with skate à la grenobloise served with mashed potatoes and mesclun salad, and then finish off with crêpes Suzette for dessert. Delightful terrace in front of the building. NB: Finding a parking space nearby is not easy.	stepanekgrace	\N	\N
