3330540260	Lucente	Rüttenscheider Str. 212	Germany	Essen	Terrace	http://www.ristorante-lucente.de	Nessun premio	Italian, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	If you are on the lookout for good Italian cuisine in Rüttenscheid then this ristorante is the place for you. The menu includes classics such as vitello tonnato and house-made ravioli. The daily specials on the blackboard and recommendations announced by waitstaff are also interesting. The atmosphere is young, fresh, friendly - Italian joie de vivre is in the air here!	valentinicolas	\N	\N
3332189568	Müllers auf der Rü	Rüttenscheider Straße 62	Germany	Essen	Terrace	https://www.nelson-mueller.de/pages/mullers-auf-der-ru	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Farm to table	4.0	€€€	f	f	Nelson Müller's fine dining restaurant, Schote, may have moved to Bergisch Gladbach, but this cherished Essen-based establishment at Rüttenscheider Stern U-Bahn station has stayed put. This is a market hall-style brasserie integrated into a shopping arcade. Sitting at high tables, diners tuck into delicious dishes ranging from currywurst to turbot, prepared in the centrally positioned open kitchen. Friendly service. Tip for motorists: public multi-storey car park around the corner.	vargalucia	\N	\N
3338649933	Posthörnle	Pliensaustraße 56	Germany	Esslingen am Neckar	Terrace	https://posthoernle.de/	Nessun premio	International	5.0	€€	t	t	This casual, minimalist-style little restaurant is housed in one of the oldest taverns in the town. It serves fresh, seasonal cuisine with dishes ranging from venison rissoles with black mustard to pan-fried zander with oranges and chicory.	cellericelina	\N	\N
3337614443	Die Ratsstuben	Kirchenplatz 1	Germany	Ettlingen	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://die-ratsstuben.de/	Nessun premio	International	4.0	€€€	t	t	One draw of this restaurant is its beautiful location in the centre of the pretty old town on the Alb River^ another is its chic modern interior. The cuisine is international and seasonal – you can opt for a set menu or order à la carte. The waitstaff are friendly and professional. In summer, the terrace facing the square is a pleasant spot to sit and eat.	enacheisabella	\N	\N
3333736090	Hartmaier's Villa	Pforzheimer Straße 67	Germany	Ettlingen	Car park,Terrace	https://www.hartmaiers.de/	Nessun premio	International, Farm to table	5.0	€€€	f	f	This modern restaurant is housed in a pretty villa dating back to 1816. The Hartmaier family and their team have been serving up good food here for many years. The menu is wide-ranging, characterised by seasonal, regional and international influences – from Zwiebelrostbraten (steak with onion rings), beans with bacon and roast potatoes to wild-caught Icelandic redfish fillet with pak choi and spinach and ricotta ravioli. At lunchtime, people flock here for the bargain set menu with a choice of starters and mains. The feel of the place is both elegant and more casual, with a lovely leafy terrace in front of the building. Tip: You can buy wines to take home at their Vinothek.	farinellifarah	\N	\N
3338575379	Eiflers Zeiten	Burg Flamersheim	Germany	Euskirchen	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://burgflamersheim.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, International	4.0	€€	f	f	The pleasant, rustic-style alternative to Bembergs Häuschen has a distinctly cosy feel. The menu features mouthwatering regional classics such as roast Eifel beef with roast potatoes, as well as internationally influenced dishes such as cod with a lemon crunch topping and Chinese cabbage. There are also daily changing specials. The two chandeliers fashioned from bottles are sure to draw the eye! The view through the windowed façade onto the pond is also lovely.	berninialex	\N	\N
3334763183	Sawito	Spandauer Straße 14	Germany	Falkensee	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://restaurant-sawito.com/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, International	3.0	€€€	f	f	In this pleasant restaurant done out in a timeless, refined style, chef Marco Wahl injects quality, flavour and personality into seasonal dishes – this is where the Palatinate-born chef's experience in some prestigious establishments comes into play. You can dine à la carte or opt for the set menu. Tuesday to Thursday (except public holidays) they also offer a surprise menu with three to four courses. The fact that you feel in good hands here is also down to the very friendly service team under the management of Patrik Schwabe.	popescumaya	\N	\N
3336582938	James Farmhouse	Fördepromenade 30	Germany	Flensburg	Car park,Terrace	https://www.dasjames.com/genusswelt/james-farmhouse	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Fresh and tasty cuisine is served here, and the menu is strongly influenced by the restaurant's own farm. For example, they raise their own Husum red pied pigs, chickens and German Angus cattle – exceptionally tender rump steaks guaranteed. The decor is a blend of industrial chic and charming retro style. Very friendly service. There is a smaller menu at lunchtime. Alongside the restaurants Das Grace and Minato, this is another dining option at the Hotel Das James, which enjoys a charming location on the harbour.	nagyemma	\N	\N
3339653283	SonneStuben	Marktplatz 2	Germany	Frankenberg	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://sonne-frankenberg.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Regional Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	The regional and seasonal cuisine served here wins diners over with the flavours it exudes and technical prowess it evinces. The menu features mouthwatering options such as saddle of venison with a chestnut and parmesan crust or fillet of sea bass with seafood risotto. The pretty, cosy dining area affords views of the old town's historical half-timbered façades^ having your meal out on the terrace that overlooks Marktplatz is a pleasant option. They are also open for lunch. Tip: It is worthwhile taking a stroll through the town. You can spend the night at Die Sonne Frankenberg hotel.	fiorellifiorello	\N	\N
