3335787378	Atable im Amtshaus	Hauptstraße 29	Germany	Freinsheim	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.amtshaus-freinsheim.de	Nessun premio	Farm to table, International	4.0	€€€	t	t	Surrounded by the town wall, the Amtshaus boasts a lovely location in Freinsheim's old town, which is well worth a visit. The courtyard with its idyllic terrace leads to this chic restaurant, where you will notice a white cross vault supported by columns. Chef Swen Bultmann cooks classic French dishes that are made from fine ingredients and inspired by the seasons. The food is accompanied by an appealing and extensive selection of wines. There is also accommodation – in the tasteful guestrooms, as in the restaurant itself, the decor harmoniously incorporates modern design into the historical setting.	smirnovjessica	\N	\N
3335007867	Bistro Villa Merton	Am Leonhardsbrunn 12	Germany	Frankfurt on the Main	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://restaurant-villa-merton.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, International	4.0	€€	t	t	Located just outside Frankfurt, north of the Palmengarten, Bistro Villa Merton is a lovely alternative to the fine dining restaurant. While the latter welcomes diners in the evening, the bistro is only open at lunchtime. In the spruce villa built in neo-Baroque style, you can take a seat in an inviting decor done out with an elegant touch to enjoy high-quality regional and international cuisine infused with seasonal influences. An appealing lunchtime set menu is on offer, as well as several à la carte options. The appetising dishes include breast and leg of guinea fowl and classics such as Wiener schnitzel made with veal. Excellent wine recommendations are to be had from the friendly and knowledgeable front-of-house team. Tip: There is a fantastic selection of champagnes. The terrace is also a pleasant place to sit. Good to know: Regular events are also held here.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
