3330294804	Regional	St.-Erentrudis-Straße 12	Germany	Freiburg im Breisgau	Brunch,Car park,Terrace	https://www.schlossreinach.de/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	After being refurbished and rejuvenated, Regional has moved into the former Herrehus of Schloss Reinach. The name says it all: to create their tasty, punchy dishes, almost exclusively Baden and Black Forest produce is used, and the majority of it is also organic. It's a joy to sit on the patio terrace!	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
