3336321894	Selmer's	Bi Heef 1	Germany	Munkmarsch	Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.faehrhaus-sylt.de	Nessun premio	Classic French, Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Attention to detail is apparent everywhere: original blue and white tiles, antiques, Nordic style, and a wonderful terrace… The restaurant in the lovely Fährhaus hotel serves ambitious classic French cuisine with regional and international influences. At lunchtime the menu is smaller^ in the afternoon there is an array of home-made cake specialities to tempt you.	costasergio	\N	\N
3333349719	Spielweg	Spielweg 61	Germany	Münstertal	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.spielweg.com/	Nessun premio	Asian Influences, Regional Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	First mentioned in records in 1705, the original Spielweg building, managed by the Fuchs family, makes for a wonderfully cosy setting. The charming dining rooms are done out in traditional Black Forest style and the service is extremely friendly and attentive. Diners can expect classic regional cuisine that is ambitious and full of flavour, as in the warm smoked char from the Wutach in a cold potato and leek broth. It also draws on Asian influences, cf. their wild boar dim sum with soy sauce – Asian cuisine is one of the young chef's passions. The lunchtime menu proposes somewhat simpler fare, making this place an ideal stop-off for a light meal during a hike. You can stay overnight in well-kept, individually furnished guestrooms.	gattimauro	\N	\N
3337204093	Ostaria da Gino	Querstraße 3	Germany	Nagold	Terrace	https://www.dagino-nagold.de/	Nessun premio	Italian, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	This delightful family-run restaurant's enduring popularity among regulars is a testament to the unwavering dedication and passion that have been poured into its operations for the past 40 years. Authentic Italian cuisine is served in a laid-back setting with bags of charm! Staff will be happy to guide you through the options written up on the board and recommend the right wine. Tip: the moderately priced lunch deal. Delicatessen goods can be purchased to take home.	rusnakhannah	\N	\N
