3333243087	Christians Restaurant	Neckarstraße 40	Germany	Neckargemünd	Great view,Terrace	https://restaurant-christian.de/	Nessun premio	Contemporary, Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	t	Run by Sandy and Christian Heß, this is an appealing restaurant – and that goes for the atmosphere as well as the cuisine. The interior is sleek, bright and welcoming, with beautiful arched windows affording a view of the Neckar River. And then there's the terrace overlooking the water – a truly idyllic spot in which to dine in fine weather! The cuisine is contemporary with a Mediterranean touch – opt for a set menu or order à la carte. This lovely space can also be used for private functions.	de lucaenrico	\N	\N
3332447839	Zum Rössl	Heidelberger Straße 15	Germany	Neckargemünd	Car park,Terrace	https://www.roessl-waldhilsbach.de/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	This long-standing family-run place is in a former post station dating from 1642. It is a pretty, traditional-style restaurant that offers a choice of regional classics as well as Mediterranean and seasonally influenced daily specials. A surprise menu is also available on reservation. Tip: the idyllic terrace!	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
3330712125	Stephans Stuben by Marco Langer	Bahnhofstraße 65	Germany	Neu-Ulm	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	http://www.stephansstuben.com	Nessun premio	Creative, Farm to table	4.0	€€€	t	f	This restaurant is run by Marco Langer, a well-known chef in the region. His dishes are meticulously prepared, creatively modern, and made with the finest ingredients. Plus he is not afraid to create bold flavour combinations. A prime example is the tomato, onion, and basil, each presented in different variations and paired with an incredibly flavoursome blend of mascarpone and parmesan. Comprising four or six courses, there are two set menus, one of which is vegetarian. The restaurant's clean, tasteful design is very inviting. Friendly, professional service creates a welcoming atmosphere, and the chef himself often interacts with diners. Wine recommendations come courtesy of the enthusiastic sommelier. Alongside wine pairings, non-alcoholic alternatives are available to go with the set menu.	salluis	\N	\N
3330769915	Goldene Sonne	Vorstadt 2	Germany	Neuenstein	Terrace	https://goldene-sonne.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€€€	f	f	A quaint historical half-timbered building provides the setting where Heiner Bohnet and Constanza Piccolo welcome diners into their inviting dining space, which has retained its traditional charm. The pair approach their work with tremendous dedication and enthusiasm – she provides friendly and attentive service, and he creates a new vegetable-forward set menu every week, always guided by what is in season. Ingredients are sourced almost entirely from the local area (except for the sustainably line-caught fish from the coast of Brittany). The chef-patron is a member of a farming collective and grows his own vegetables. A great deal of fermenting, pickling and preserving is done in-house, plus they bake their own bread. Tip: They offer three lovely double rooms for overnight stays.	reinhardtgabriela	\N	\N
3334402776	H'manns	Am Goldberg 2	Germany	Neuleiningen	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.hmanns.de/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	f	The Hegmanns run this genuinely charming restaurant that is a hit with diners. Only the best produce makes its way into the dishes, which are meticulously prepared to bring out the full flavour of the ingredients. You can opt for a set menu or order à la carte. On Thursdays, only tapas are served. Excellent wine list. Extremely friendly waitstaff. Tip: the chef's table is very close to the kitchen, but sheltered from the thick of the action.	reinhardtgabriela	\N	\N
3330123162	Am Kamin	Propstenstraße 13	Germany	Neumünster		https://www.am-kamin.info/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine, Farm to table	4.0	€€€	t	f	The atmosphere in this lovingly decorated restaurant is charming and welcoming. Over the service counter you can take a look into the partly open kitchen and watch chef-patron Karl Ress at work. He is a master of his craft and works meticulously to bring out the full flavour of his ingredients. The dishes on the menu are classical and seasonal – you can opt for the surprise menu or order à la carte.	farinellifarah	\N	\N
