3332543924	Man Kee Cart Noodle	121 Fuk Wing Street	Hong Kong	Hong Kong	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	3.0	$	f	t	The number of topping choices can be overwhelming, but Chinese chive dumplings and Swiss chicken wings are especially good. Fancy a spicy kick? Try the house-made chilli sauce over your noodles.	fiorentinolukas	\N	\N
