3334081744	So Kee	Shop 15	Hong Kong	Hong Kong	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	4.0	$	f	t	There’s just one item on the menu – double-steamed egg white custard with milk, boasting a silky runny centre under a firmer crust. Order the chilled ones if you’re in a rush, or wait patiently as the hot ones are made to order.	grimaldimorko	\N	\N
3332539685	Temple Street Beef Offal	18 Arthur Street	Hong Kong	Hong Kong	Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	3.0	$	f	f	This long-standing shop is popular with locals. Tripe, intestine, pancreas or lung can be ordered individually or as an assortment, on a skewer or in a bowl. The offal soaks up the broth nicely, with three sauces on the side.	bergmannalexandru	\N	\N
