3339323775	NOON	Lua Resort	Hungary	Balatonfüred	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://luaresort.com/en/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	An exclusive lakeside resort plays host to this elegant restaurant (if you’re not staying the night, then pre-booking is essential in high season). Grab a cocktail in the stylish bar before enjoying a carefully curated selection of contemporary Hungarian dishes which fuse tradition with inventive modern touches. Local wines are a feature, and the smooth service shows the team’s knowledge and care. If the chocolate and cherry dessert is on the menu, be sure to choose it.	rizzogabriele	\N	\N
3338532414	Zelna Borbisztró	Zákonyi Ferenc utca 3-5	Hungary	Balatonfüred	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://zelnaborbisztro.hu/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	A smart, modern wine bar in the livelier part of this seasonal town, Zelna is named after the wine company whose biodynamic wines it serves – and also offers for purchase. This is a place to kick back and relax, and the small menu mixes light bites with more substantial Hungarian dishes so you can tailor-make your own experience – the beef cheeks are a hit and be sure to save room for the golden walnut dumplings for dessert! Every table is located on the large terrace, which stays open until 2am.	parisibenjamin	\N	\N
