3332842092	IKON	Piac utca 23	Hungary	Debrecen	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.ikonrestaurant.hu/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Hungarian	3.0	€€	f	t	Set on a main street in the heart of the city, IKON stands out among the other eateries for its smart look, structured service and confident cooking. The chef spent time working in England and his dishes are an intriguing mix of reworked Hungarian classics and some British influences – go for something from the ‘Traditions Reborn’ section and be sure not to miss dessert. For a more immersive experience, book the chic Kitchen Table.	brunojulian	\N	\N
3333684054	Piac 42	Simor János u. 26-32.	Hungary	Esztergom	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://piac42.hu/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€	t	t	The more casual sister to Michelin-Starred 42 is a smart, informal bistro set amongst upmarket artisan businesses in the recently opened Esztergom Market. Find a seat in the cosy bistro-cum-bar or on the sun-drenched terrace and choose from a concise menu of fresh, flavour-packed dishes crafted from local produce. Tradition leads the way, with the likes of pork rillettes and pancakes with cottage cheese. Come for breakfast, a leisurely lunch or a lively evening out.	marianiadrian	\N	\N
