3333267484	Kővirág	Fő útca 9/A	Hungary	Köveskál	Car park,Terrace	https://kovirag.hu/	Nessun premio	Hungarian	3.0	€€	t	f	Located in a lovely little village near Lake Balaton, this delightful thatched farmhouse, with its white-gravelled courtyard, has something of a Mediterranean feel. The interior sports a vintage-chic look, and there’s a pretty candlelit terrace for warmer days. Colourful dishes come with a Hungarian heart and modern overtones, and the cottage cheese fried dumplings with seasonal jam are something of a speciality. Service is incredibly welcoming, and the wines are carefully sourced from the local area. If you’re touring the lake and the wine region, the bedrooms here make an ideal base.	leonoscar	\N	\N
