3334449989	Camino	29-1 Fukuchiincho	Japan	Nara	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Italian	4.0	¥¥	f	t	Chef Takeshi Kamiji presents his guests with the hometown cooking of regions throughout Italy, from north to south. He is especially fascinated by pasta, pouring his efforts into handmade dishes such as Apulian orecchiette and Ligurian trofie. The array of dishes from each area are complemented by wines from every region of Italy. The warmth of the cheerful service in a machiya (merchant’s house) over a century old brings joy to the soul.	caputostefan	\N	\N
3330716778	cucina regionale YANAGAWA	12 Shibatsukinukecho	Japan	Nara	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	¥¥¥	t	t	Mami Yanagawa has followed the path of Italian cuisine. She enjoyed her cooking classes so much that she became a chef herself. To study Italian gastronomy in its home, Yanagawa travelled to Italy, where she learned the depth and richness of regional variation. Her choice of name for her restaurant, ‘cucina regionale’ (‘hometown cooking’) proclaims the importance she attaches to the network of local and regional producers she has cultivated. Yanagawa links Italy and Nara to showcase the appeal of hometown traditions.	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
