3335277015	macua	2-2-3 Fushimimachi	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	French	4.0	¥¥¥	f	f	‘Macua’ is a contraction of three French words: magnifier, to make larger: cuisine^ and agréable, enjoyable. Chef Daisuke Nakayama derives his creative inspiration from picturing the smiles of his guests. Hors d’oeuvres in small servings on multiple plates are a delightful surprise. Rossini burgers borrow from the classic fare of beef with foie gras. Colourful dishes prepared with edible flowers engage the eye with beautiful shades and tones.	ferraririccardo	\N	\N
