3331864841	Numata Sou	3F	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.tenpura-tenboshi.com/sou/	Nessun premio	Tempura	3.0	¥¥¥	f	t	Opened as a branch of the main Numata restaurant in Kitashinchi as a place where the chef’s disciples could flex their gastronomical muscles. ‘Sou’ means ‘twins’, as both locations are tempura eateries. Meals begin at the same time, so artisans can showcase their talents to maximum effect. The amount and thickness of the batter and temperature of the oil all depend on the item^ for variety, seafood and vegetable items are served in turns. The aroma sealed in each item and the modulation of sweet and bitter in the ingredients makes this ‘twin’ one-of-a-kind.	vecchimirko	\N	\N
3332123496	OIMATSU Tempura Suzuki	4-4-2 Nishitemma	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://oimatsu-tempura-suzuki.com/	Nessun premio	Tempura	5.0	¥¥¥	t	t	The tempura here shows an awareness of the start and end of each ingredient’s season, reflecting the chef’s experience in Japanese cuisine. Thinly battered items are lightly fried in safflower oil to convey their flavour plainly and honestly. Tiger prawn and cod milt are wrapped in perilla leaves for added fragrance. Wagyu fillet is grilled to a rosy pink with consummate skill. Red pickled ginger added to kakiage (all-in-one seafood and vegetable tempura blend) is a unique touch that is pure Osaka.	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
