3331324651	à table	3-1-1 Yushima	Japan	Tokyo	Air conditioning	https://atable-tokyo.co.jp/	Nessun premio	French	5.0	¥¥¥	t	t	Owner-chef Yoichi Nakaaki pours his heart into creating cuisine that would win the approval of a person from France, the land of epicures. His classic dishes such as pâté en croûte, roast lamb and tarte Tatin are the result of painstaking research. He is especially adept at preparations of fillings, such as pigeon, foie gras and game, wrapped in pastry and dressed in sauces. Dishes here are meant for two, so reservations are for two people or more.	szabosofia	\N	\N
3338359146	ABBESSES	2F	Japan	Tokyo	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	French	5.0	¥¥	f	t	‘Abbesses’ is the name of a train station in the Montmartre district of Paris. The damask patterns on the walls, red bench seating and antique furnishings conjure the atmosphere of a bistro from the good old days. À la carte menu items are meant for sharing. Popular items include mackerel marinated in vinegar and roast wagyu. The freshly cooked truffle soufflé omelette shares its fresh-cooked scent.	testagabriel	\N	\N
