3331544485	Regalo	B1F	Japan	Tokyo	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.regalo-ristorante.com/	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	¥¥¥	t	t	‘Regalo’ is Italian for ‘gift’. Chef Tomomi Ogura uses Japanese ingredients such as bamboo shoots, sweetfish and Pacific saury to bring the seasons of Japan to his guests. Combinations of ingredients are to be kept to a minimum^ set menus should offer variety . These two principles summarise cucina Ogura, which literally means ‘Ogura’s Kitchen’. A calculated minimalism creates precisely the desired effect.	puglieseadam	\N	\N
