3336783146	Shiomachi	2F	Japan	Tokyo	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Izakaya	4.0	¥¥¥	f	f	‘Shiomachi’ means waiting for the right tide to push out to sea. The name expresses the owner-chef’s wish to create a shop where people congregate, just as fishermen gather to await favourable conditions. Yearning for the sea, the chef was drawn to a job where he handles fish. He visits Toyosu Market daily, ever on the lookout for that once-in-a-lifetime catch. He chats with brokers as he makes purchases and drains fish of blood to preserve freshness. Gather here to enjoy your fill of high-quality fish.	georgesculalla	\N	\N
