3338176142	Riviera	Dzirnavu iela 31	Latvia	Riga	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://rivierarestorans.lv	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	This large restaurant has a warm Mediterranean style and a menu to match, offering an appealing selection of dishes from oysters and tartares to fish and steaks, followed by old favourites like tiramisu. Everything is generously sized, with well-defined flavours and textures, and the sizeable wine list (1,000+) offers some great choices from around the globe. There’s a choice of two rooms in which to dine, but the terrace is the place to be when the weather’s right.	palombasauro	\N	\N
3336624436	3 Chefs	Torņa iela 4	Latvia	Riga	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.3pavari.lv	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	t	Located in Jacob’s Barracks – a restored 18C building overlooking the Powder Tower and Swedish Gate – this restaurant lives up to exactly what you might expect. It’s run by three chefs – who help serve the dishes and love chatting with their guests – and the menu sticks with the traditional theme by offering classical flavour combinations, albeit updated with touches of creativity and a little refinement. The tasting menu is the best route to having a great all-round experience, and they hold cookery classes for those who like to get hands-on.	vitalimercuzio	\N	\N
3337704110	B7	Ausekla iela 7	Latvia	Riga	Air conditioning,Terrace		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	Be sure to book ahead at this homely neighbourhood restaurant,which has an experienced chef at its helm. The room has a pleasingly simple rusticity, and the atmosphere and service have a laid-back feel, with the owner both cooking for and serving the guests himself. Pick from around 16 dishes – sharing 4 between two diners is a great way to sample a range of flavours – or simply choose the tasting menu. The flavoursome modern cuisine takes its influences from around the globe, ranging from Cantabrian anchovies to salmon ceviche^ desserts are a highlight and the wine list offers great value.	rusnakhannah	\N	\N
3338002649	Barents	Smilšu iela 3	Latvia	Riga	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.barents.lv/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€€	f	t	An early 20C art nouveau property on the edge of town plays host to this spacious restaurant with a large front terrace and a distinct Nordic style. The seasonally changing menu comprises modern dishes that are made up of numerous elements and combine many flavours and textures in great harmony. Seafood is a strength – with some sourced from the Barents Sea – and the produce is displayed on ice in the middle of the room and explained to diners as they arrive. The champagne selection provides a noteworthy accompaniment.	basileryan	\N	\N
