3339564252	JOHN	Ausekļa iela 22	Latvia	Riga	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://en.johnrestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	f	Set within the striking A22 hotel, this chic restaurant overlooking the historic Viesturdārzs park is named after John F Kennedy, who stayed here back in 1939^ be sure to keep an eye out for some of the original art nouveau features, which have been carefully restored. The room now has a romantic feel, helped along by a ceiling bedecked in roses, and the menu is modern too, with a diverse selection of dishes highlighting seasonal local produce, from Arctic char to locally farmed ostrich. The King crab with lemon aioli and pickled apples is a hit, as is the delicious honey cake.	martinifederico	\N	\N
