3339321036	Hostellerie du Grünewald	10 route d'Echternach	Luxembourg	Luxembourg	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Terrace	https://hdg.lu/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€€	t	t	Fresh, healthy food, but also deliciously generous. This very pleasant bistro with a fine terrace provides an opportunity to sample simple ingredients devoid of unnecessary frills. Save room for the scrumptious desserts. Elegant guestrooms ensure sweet dreams.	venturialessia	\N	\N
3337400925	Tomo Ya	675 Rue de Neudorf	Luxembourg	Luxembourg	Air conditioning,Cash only	https://www.gastronomie.lu/details.php?id=3403	Nessun premio	Sushi	3.0	€€	f	f	Sushis are the speciality of this minimalist establishment. The extensive menu also offers a wide range of noodle dishes, but we particularly recommend you try the mind-blowing lineup of fresh fish dishes. Salmon maki, beef gyoza or wafer-thin sashimi: forthright, authentic flavours blessedly free of fancy frills.	kozakjennifer	\N	\N
3334270983	Brasserie des Jardins	27b boulevard Marcel Cahen	Luxembourg	Luxembourg	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://brasseriedesjardins.lu/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Classic French	3.0	€€	t	t	If only we lived next-door to this modern brasserie… Slick, seamless service, a peaceful patio and a traditional lineup crafted by expert hands. The calf’s liver, cooked to perfection, is paired with a shallot sauce, the salmon, raw, cooked or smoked, glistens in an unusual starter, flanked by, among others, kiwi, mango and a coulis of red beetroot: the chef clearly knows his business. The knockout wine list further confirms the establishment’s commitment to fine produce.	fabbrijuan	\N	\N
