3335819748	Domaine la Forêt	36 route de l'Europe	Luxembourg	Remich	Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://foret.lu/fr/restaurant/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	f	This elegant, classical restaurant commands a stunning view over the Luxemburg Moselle valley. Chef, Claude Wallerich, concocts tasty dishes of traditional inspiration that will introduce you to delicious regional produce. The well - stocked wine cellar is an added bonus!	orlandofernando	\N	\N
3332328642	Gusto Naturale	Z.A.C op Herbett	Luxembourg	Schifflange	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.gustonaturale.lu/	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	€€	t	f	Walk through the sleek grocery store (we recommend stopping off to make a few purchases as you leave) to take a seat in Marc Bernardi’s urban eatery. The chef, who hails from Bolzano, Italy, adds his own spin to authentic Italian dishes. For example, he might pair homemade tortellini stuffed with shredded beef and veal with a spot-on veal gravy. He has a knack for mixing powerful, rich flavours and his flair for vegetables and fresh textures is entirely in the zeitgeist.	szabosofia	\N	\N
