3335011601	Bistronome	373 route d'Arlon	Luxembourg	Strassen	Car park,Terrace	https://www.bistronome.lu/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	f	f	At this chic bistro, chef Hospital imparts a lesson in bistronomy every day, giving popular dishes and flavours a gourmet spin. The food is as exquisite to behold as it is to taste. Throw in the occasional creative twist and a fine dose of generosity and the scene is set. Along with dishes that have been revamped with seasonings from around the globe, the menu also features classics such as braised beef cheeks in a bold red wine sauce and al dente pappardelle.	iordachelilly	\N	\N
3332418116	Hostellerie Stafelter	rue de Dommeldange 1	Luxembourg	Walferdange	Car park,Terrace	https://www.hostellerie-stafelter.lu	Nessun premio	Farm to table	3.0	€€€	f	t	Tom Brosius is the culinary guardian of this modern, elegant hotel. He sources excellent market-fresh produce and locally grown ingredients which are assembled using modern techniques. Varied and delicious, with an appetising vegetarian menu. Comfortable guestrooms.	rossigiovanni	\N	\N
3338472020	Imperial Court	GF	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.mgm.mo/en/macau/dining/imperial-court	Nessun premio	Cantonese	5.0	$$	f	f	On the same floor as the hotel’s VIP lobby, this sleek, contemporary dining room wows guests with a vividly carved Chinese dragon entwined around a marble pillar. The head chef has over 20 years of experience and updates the menu regularly to star seasonal dishes. Try his crispy-skin fried baby pigeon, and dim sum with a creative twist – order as few or as many pieces as you like. The impressive wine list boasts over 2,000 labels.	mancinialberto	\N	\N
3337273188	Palace Garden	Shop 306	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.grandlisboapalace.com/tc/restaurants-n-bars/palace-garden	Nessun premio	Cantonese	4.0	$$$	f	t	The room is the epitome of lavish maximalism – one wall is covered in a 35-metre-long Suzhou silk embroidery with a chrysanthemum theme. On the menu, ingredients from around the world are used to make refined Cantonese dishes, including labour-intensive items from ancient recipes. Crispy skin squab with lemongrass uses 18-day birds from Shiqi, boasting juicy flesh and mild smokiness. The menu can appear overwhelming, so ask servers for recommendations.	marinescumario	\N	\N
3336203744	Pin Yue Xuan	Shop 1016	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Valet parking	https://www.venetianmacao.com/restaurants/signature/pin-yue-xuan.html	Nessun premio	Cantonese	4.0	$$$	f	f	The high-ceilinged room, which sports a smart modern Chinese vibe, is the quintessence of stylish flair. The Hong Kong head chef, who has been honing his skills in Macau for many a year, imbues the mostly Cantonese menu with creative touches and luxe delights, such as crispy quinoa on smoked tofu skin rolls, and steamed savoury custard made with Breton blue lobster and Japanese Ranou eggs. The exquisitely crafted petit fours are not to be missed.	taddeisimone	\N	\N
3330703839	Yi	21F	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.cityofdreamsmacau.com/en/dine/chinese/yi	Nessun premio	Chinese Contemporary	5.0	$$$$	t	t	Established on the 21st floor of a sky bridge, Yi’s knockout location is matched by stunning views, impressive architecture and an exotic interior. The 9-course seasonal-driven tasting menu refers to the 24 solar terms of the Chinese calendar, incorporating quality produce from around the world. Rare, premium ingredients, such as nodoguro and A4 Wagyu from Miyazaki, Japan, are deftly and creatively crafted with artful plating.	bassioleg	\N	\N
3334271342	The Ritz-Carlton Café	GF	Macau	Macau	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.ritzcarltoncafemacau.com	Nessun premio	French	5.0	$$	t	f	Tiles, mirrors and marble are used to great effect in this bright, lively French brasserie with an all-day dining concept. It prides itself not only on its friendly service, but also the array of classic French food on offer. Besides the daily special, steak is big on the menu with many prime cuts to choose from. Seafood lovers should try freshly shucked oysters. Round out your dinner with the spectacular tableside Grand Marnier flambéed crepes.	moltenirene	\N	\N
