3334753936	La Vie	Le Dream Boutique Hotel	Malaysia	George Town	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	European Contemporary	4.0	$$$	t	t	This casual neighbourhood dining spot started out as a steakhouse, but switched to serving European cuisine with Asian influences. Their signature kataifi prawn is tiger prawn wrapped in crispy noodles, fried and served in a prawn bisque sauce. Meat lovers should check out the Australian Wagyu ribeye which is cooked to perfection on a charcoal grill. It comes with a range of condiments but the wasabi works best. Wine is available by the bottle only.	vecchimirko	\N	\N
3330074813	Bite N Eat Dindigul Biriyani	43 Lebuh Penang	Malaysia	George Town	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Indian	5.0	$$	t	t	Since 2014, this simple shop in Little India has been serving authentic dishes from all over India. The namesake signature biriyani is a rice dish with Indian spices and a must-try for all. Pair it with kongu nadu kozhi fry, or spicy dry-fried chicken with grated coconut, a speciality from Tamil Nadu in southern India that imparts tangy flavours. Portion sizes are not huge^ perfect for solo diners and small groups. They are closed on Tuesdays randomly.	riccidaniele	\N	\N
