3338612358	Lucky Hole	23N Lebuh Pantai	Malaysia	George Town		http://www.thisisluckyhole.com	Nessun premio	Innovative	4.0	$$	t	f	Once a factory, this space furnished in retro industrial style fizzes with energy – not only because of the sizzling charcoal grill in the open kitchen, but also the fun, passionate service team. Chargrilled meats, seafood, and vegetables are the main event^ the wild-caught giant shrimps with crispy garlic crumbles and chilli oil are a very popular choice. The warm banana cake with Baileys ice cream presents interesting contrasts in temperature.	impeiluca	\N	\N
