3336069456	Marini's on 57	57F	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://marinisgroup.com/marinis-on-57	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	$$$	t	f	At this iconic rooftop venue, diners enjoy superb sunsets and panoramic cityscapes through floor to ceiling windows. Besides the à la carte menu, there are several tasting menus that offer a knockout selection of Italian dishes, featuring innovative elements, choice cuts of imported beef and artisan pasta. The intriguing tiramisu, which comes in a tin of caviar, is made with coffee caviar (rather than fish eggs!).	rizzogabriele	\N	\N
3338470931	Ushi	3A	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Valet parking	http://www.taka-ushi.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	5.0	$$$$	f	t	An elegant, black wave opens up to an intimate room where 12 counter seats face a cooking station. The chef has worked for decades in top-tier restaurants. He crafts an omakase kaiseki-style menu that prominently features Ozaki beef^ the epitome of tender, marbled beef. Dishes include beef sashimi with sea urchin, and beef cooked on binchō-tan that accentuates the natural flavour. There’s a good collection of sake served in beautiful glasses. Advanced booking highly recommended.	fischerbogdan	\N	\N
3339579965	Wagyu Kappo Yoshida	Unit 3-48	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Great view	https://wagyu-kappoyoshida.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	$$$$	f	t	Based on Kappo cuisine, chef Yoshida's philosophy aims to establish a bond between the diner and the chef. Veteran chef Hattori dons the role of culinary host by tailoring this omakase beef experience at the counter for 12 guests in an intimate setting. This satisfying feast for beef lovers uses different parts of premium Wagyu from Japan in each dish. The chef also makes his own soba, onsen tamago and truffle ice cream.	popovchloe	\N	\N
3339108189	Tanglin (Bukit Damansara)	57G	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Car park,Cash only		Nessun premio	Malaysian	4.0	$	f	f	Founded in 1948, the family-owned Tanglin is now run by the second generation and the two-storey establishment is well known for its nasi lemak. This delicious family recipe is paired with either sotong (squid), daging (meat) or ayam goreng (fried chicken). Its fragrant rice has the right mix of coconut milk and its sambal tumis, the right level of spiciness. Whether dining in or taking away, the queues are long. Generous portions and prices that make sense.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
3336721195	Eat and Cook	H6-1	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Valet parking	http://www.eatandcook.asia	Nessun premio	Malaysian, Contemporary	3.0	$$$	f	t	Out of the city centre, Eat and Cook is owned by two young, accomplished chefs whose ambition and creativity define the unique dining experience. Featuring local ingredients, the set menu changes every three to four months. While the seasonality of Malaysian cuisine may not be obvious, each new chapter showcases different types of seafood and seasonal vegetables. The counter seats, known as The Stage, offer a knockout view of the kitchen team in action.	parisibenjamin	\N	\N
3331109452	Terra Dining	91 Jalan Aminuddin Baki	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Malaysian, Contemporary	5.0	$$$	f	f	Chef Chong, a self-taught chef with a unique vision who hails from Ipoh, strives to use distinctive Malaysian produce to imbue his French leaning 11-course tasting menu with local colour and flavour. His lobster bisque uses a sweet and sour fish stock based on asam laksa^ his beurre blanc incorporates a creamy curry with turmeric and coconut milk á la masak lemak. The wine pairing options of three or five glasses are an excellent choice.	schr�derfedericha	\N	\N
3336582165	Dancing Fish	Lot T120 & 121	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Bring your own bottle,Car park,Valet parking	http://www.dancingfish.asia	Nessun premio	Malaysian, Indonesian	5.0	$$	t	f	On the third floor of a shopping mall, Dancing Fish specialises in classic Malay-Indo flavours with a distinct local identity. The nicely fried namesake fish dish boasts tender flesh in crunchy batter. It comes in numerous versions, with different toppings, sambal and savoury sauces. In addition, they serve classic varied cuisine rooted in local culture, including whole fish cooked over coals, barbecue chicken, ribs and beef.	contimatteo	\N	\N
3333149354	Limapulo	50 Jalan Doraisamy	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Terrace		Nessun premio	Peranakan	3.0	$	f	f	Opened seven years ago, the restaurant has a rustic edge with vintage canteen-style furniture that evokes waves of nostalgia across a dimly lit venue. Limapulo (which means fifty in Malay), is managed by a team of Malaysian chefs. It’s best to choose plates for sharing and be sure to order the popular Nyonya laksa – a standout dish indeed. The signature sate has a special sauce homemade from star fruits and pineapple. Some menu items are only available on certain days.	medvedevkatie	\N	\N
3337619903	Shanghai Restaurant	1F	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Car park,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.shanghairestaurant.com.my/	Nessun premio	Shanghainese	4.0	$$$	t	f	In business since 1999, the restaurant was updated in 2021 and now sports a bright, modern interior. The veteran chef traditionally crafts Shanghainese classics, and his xiao long bao is a must-try – soupy pork filling enrobed in paper-thin, meticulously pleated skin. Stir-fried flat glass noodles with shredded pork and preserved vegetable boasts remarkable wok hei, and the salted potherb mustard greens impart briny umami.	venturaroman	\N	\N
3332537593	Marble 8	56F	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Great view	https://marinisgroup.com/marble-8/	Nessun premio	Steakhouse	3.0	$$$	t	t	It takes a few lift rides to get to Marble 8, but as soon as you set foot in the dining room, you know it’s all worthwhile. The stunning skyline with the Twin Towers in the foreground is the perfect backdrop for a sumptuous meal featuring top-quality halal-certified Wagyu and Angus beef straight from Australia. Premium cuts are dry- or wet-aged for at least 21 days for deep flavours and tender texture, and then grilled to perfection.	neagufilippo	\N	\N
3333585151	Vantador	38 Jalan 25/70A	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning	http://www.vantador.co	Nessun premio	Steakhouse	5.0	$$$	f	t	Vantador’s vintage yet modern interiors are drenched in soft lighting. Aussie and Spanish beef is either dry-aged for up to 30 days in unsalted butter, or vacuum-sealed and wet-aged in its own juices for 14 days. Steaks are precisely grilled over charcoal and wood to desired doneness, striking a fine balance between smoky and full-bodied, meaty flavours. Non-steak dishes are also available, together with meticulously prepared desserts.	donatidiego	\N	\N
3338811882	Sushi Masa	Lot 1-03	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining	https://sushimasa.com.my	Nessun premio	Sushi	3.0	$$$$	f	t	Following the success of his Edomae-style sushi restaurant in Tokyo, acclaimed chef Masakazu Ishibashi brings his expertise to KL. His unique approach to sushi, founded on a 200-year-old tradition, is presented as a beautiful multi-course meal prepared by his apprentice, Chef Yoshi. The omakase menus showcase creative twists on traditional dishes. The nigiri is made with high quality produce sourced straight from Japan, while the Botan Ebi with egg yolk sauce and caviar is packed with umami.	polakcristina	\N	\N
3331076059	Sushi Ori	Unit PG-01	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://sushi-ori.com	Nessun premio	Sushi	5.0	$$$$	t	t	Tucked away from the main street, Sushi Ori is famous locally for its sushi sets and omakase. The eponymous Japanese chef has lived in Malaysia for over 10 years and opened this traditional restaurant in 2019. Seasonal ingredients are delivered from Japan three times a week. The sushi rice comes from Akita and contains a secret mix of vinegar. With only limited seats at the counter, book well in advance for the personalised omakase experience. Private rooms are also available.	huberflorin	\N	\N
3335587042	Sushi Taka	3A	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Notable sake list	https://taka-ushi.com/	Nessun premio	Sushi	5.0	$$$$	f	t	Since 2016, this upmarket sushi-ya in a prestigious hotel has been prized for their authentic sushi made with the freshest and most seasonal fish flown in from Japan. The Japanese chef is specific about every detail, including the sushi rice from a town in Niigata. To experience his culinary vision in full glory, opt for the omakase menu with 10 nigiri sushi, appetisers and sashimi. Oenophiles should check out the well-curated sake list.	fiorentinolukas	\N	\N
3335377696	Tenmasa	Unit 3.3 (annexe)	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining	https://tenmasa-restaurant.com	Nessun premio	Tempura	3.0	$$$	f	f	Watch the chefs weave their culinary magic from the 10-seater counter, but book in advance. The omakase menus showcase classic signature dishes and seasonal specials made with fresh local produce and high-quality Japanese imports. The seafood and vegetable tempura are lightly battered and deep fried for a light crisp coating. The signature uni with shiso leaf comprises fresh, sweet uni from Hokkaido, served on a tempura shiso leaf.	lehmannlucian	\N	\N
3337325496	Teochew Lao Er	6 Jalan Brunei	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Car park		Nessun premio	Teochew	5.0	$$	t	f	In 1984, Lao Er started out as a street stall. In 2011, the third generation opened a restaurant and established itself as a household name in Pudu district. Teochew classics are given a slight tweak to cater to the local palate. The signature dish, meat marinated in spiced soy, is a great hit – try the assorted platter. Teochew congee with pomfret, mackerel, and traditional kueh are also popular.	pellegriniloren	\N	\N
3336070287	Gai by Darren Chin (Taman Tun Dr Ismail)	26A Lorong Datuk Sulaiman 1	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Car park	https://www.gai-kl.com	Nessun premio	Thai	5.0	$$	f	t	Gai (Thai for chicken) delivers tasty northern Thai food to the people of KL. The restaurant embodies the spirit of family and dishes are best shared for a group. Don’t miss Papa Suwit's tom saeb oxtail stew^ a spicy-sour broth that boasts intense flavour from a mix of vegetables and herbs. The signature free-range chicken is grilled with a secret family recipe that emits a pleasant, chargrilled aroma. There are several seafood options too, including the flower crab.	friedrichteresa	\N	\N
3333723805	Malai	M1 Floor	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.malaithai.restaurant	Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	$$	f	f	Every detail, from the imported tableware to the authentic Thai dining experience, has been pondered and puzzled over. Malai relocated to this venue at the end of 2022 to offer greater comfort and more spacious dining on two floors. It’s regularly packed with office workers, especially at lunchtime. The mostly Thai team of chefs conjures up a traditional Thai menu with modern twists. Don’t miss the tom yum soup or the gaeng keaw waan (green curry).	galassiniccolo	\N	\N
3339668273	Tamarind Hill	19 Jalan Sultan Ismail	Malaysia	Kuala Lumpur	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace		Nessun premio	Thai, Burmese	5.0	$$	f	t	The glowing stairs lead you to a colonial bungalow amid lush greens with a beautiful terrace. Behind the French doors, the high-ceilinged room feels exotic and resort-like, priming diners for a serene culinary retreat just minutes away from the busy city centre. The menu is dominated by authentic no-frills Thai and Burmese cooking. Though without fancy plating, the food is astutely executed with fresh, quality ingredients.	vitaleraffaele	\N	\N
3336889589	Bee See Heong	4166 Jalan Kampung Benggali	Malaysia	Seberang Perai	Car park,Cash only		Nessun premio	Malaysian	4.0	$	t	t	Since 1966, this simple shop has been welcoming hungry guests who fancy home-style Malaysian food. Every dish is made à la minute and you can hear the wok sizzling after you place your order. Specialties include prawn curry – nice and thick, it has a good kick that goes well with the prawns. The fried threadfin with a sweet black sauce is not to be missed! The crispy fish fillet in sticky caramel soy sauce stands out, too. Arrive early to beat the crowd.	kozakjennifer	\N	\N
3334044163	Terroir	13 Triq Il-Kbira	Malta	Attard	Terrace	https://www.terroir.mt/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Situated in a charming square with an old fountain, this 16C building boasts original brick walls and a rustic, romantic ambience – the intimate dining room is on the first floor, where there is even a small table on the balcony (make sure you book this in advance). The cuisine focuses on local and Mediterranean ingredients and includes highlights such as ricotta gnocchi with a Maltese sausage ragù, while the wine list also features a few international labels.	haascamilla	\N	\N
3334742120	Level Nine at The Grand	58 Triq Sant Antnin	Malta	Għajnsielem	Great view,Terrace	https://www.levelninegozo.com/	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary, Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	The menu at this restaurant has been designed by German chef Oliver Glowig, now an ambassador for the type of Italian cuisine showcased here. We highly recommend the tasting menu, which will give you a delicious overview of the chef’s different dishes, but if you do decide to order from the à la carte, the tournedos Rossini with foie gras and spinach is an excellent choice. Various local labels stand out on the wine list, including a remarkable Marsovin Antonin 2021 which is full and round yet retains a fruity character. From the charming terrace, the stunning views of the small harbour at Mgarr add to the appeal in summer.	morettipaolo	\N	\N
3336605808	Tmun	Martino Garces Street	Malta	Għajnsielem	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://tmunrestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	€€	f	t	This restaurant serves delicious Mediterranean cuisine which is often inspired by the fresh fish caught that day. The atmosphere here is informal, with friendly, welcoming staff, plus there’s an attractive sunny terrace for summer dining.	leonechristian	\N	\N
3335690289	Briju	Triq l-Imsida	Malta	Gzira	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://briju.com.mt/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	The chef at Briju has a passion for all things local and sustainable. 90% of his ingredients are sourced from nearby farms and he even uses regional salt and olive oil. Cooking blends Maltese and Mediterranean flavours and the place has a pleasingly relaxed, neighbourhood feel.	pingliu	\N	\N
3337242075	Marea	Marina street	Malta	Kalkara	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://marea.mt/	Nessun premio	Asian, Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	This chic, contemporary-style lounge bar-cum-restaurant near the Grand Harbour boasts fine views of the marina. The menu features Mediterranean cuisine alongside more Asian-influenced options, while the excellent wine list includes sparkling wines and a good choice of cocktails. Perfect for a relaxing meal, with an extensive outdoor space that adds to its appeal.	cernyfrida	\N	\N
3333087722	Tartarun	20 Fisherman's Wharf	Malta	Marsaxlokk	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	http://www.tartarun.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	€€	t	t	This elegant restaurant on the harbourside of a small fishing village has been run by the Schiavone family for over 10 years. Son James treats diners to a daily changing selection of simply cooked whole fish and other, more modern, imaginative seafood dishes. Apart from fishermen they support the local baker that provides daily bread for the village and a hydroponic farmer which is a few kilometers from the restaurant. Their 150+ bin wine list is renowned locally.	shirocky	\N	\N
3336966734	The Fork and Cork	20 Saqqajja Hill	Malta	Mdina	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.forkandcork.com.mt/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Behind the stone walls of a historic building sits this charming restaurant. Chef-owner Carl Zahra seems to be everywhere at once: you’ll find him not only in the kitchen but also out front recommending regional wines to go with the tasty pastas and other Mediterranean-inspired dishes.	florescufrancesca	\N	\N
3339586015	The Medina	7 Holy Cross Street	Malta	Mdina	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://medinarestaurant.xaracollection.com/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Hidden away in the enchantingly narrow streets of Mdina is this equally characterful 500 year old restaurant. Dine beneath a vaulted stone ceiling or in the internal courtyard beside an ancient vine. Local ingredients underpin well-executed dishes which exhibit subtle modern twists.	hofmannelena	\N	\N
3337921271	Rebekah's	12	Malta	Mellieħa	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://rebekahsrestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	This former farmstead is over 200 years old and boasts thick walls of golden Maltese rock. Prime local produce and luxury imported ingredients are used to create modern, hearty dishes with bold Mediterranean flavours. Service is overseen by the proud chef-owner^ ask for a table in the central courtyard.	grimaldimorko	\N	\N
3339526171	Giuseppi's	Salini Resort	Malta	Naxxar	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://giuseppisrestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	Situated within the attractive Salini Resort hotel overlooking the bay of the same name, this exquisite restaurant uses top-quality ingredients to create Mediterranean-style dishes, although modern trends are starting to make a fleeting appearance in some recipes. Lunchtime options are slightly simpler than those served in the evening.	vitolajose	\N	\N
3338670968	Root 81	22A Saqqajja Hill	Malta	Rabat	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.root81.mt	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	This pleasant restaurant serves Mediterranean-style cuisine skilfully prepared by the talented chef with a focus on local ingredients. The outdoor space has an attractive and relaxing vibe, plus there’s an excellent selection of wines and cocktails.	smirnovjessica	\N	\N
3333720164	Grotto Tavern	9/10/12 St Pauls Square	Malta	Rabat	Air conditioning	https://www.grottotavern.net/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	Boasting an excellent location in the historic centre of Rabat, this restaurant full of character has a bar, a garden room and a “cave room”, the latter a grotto which has been excavated out of the limestone rock and is available for private dining (book in advance). The cuisine bears the signature of the new chef Nikolai Abela, who uses local and seasonal ingredients. Professional service completes the picture.	carusoleonardo	\N	\N
3338547133	The Golden Fork	31 Triq L-Isptar	Malta	Rabat	Air conditioning	https://www.thegoldenfork.com.mt/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative	3.0	€€	f	t	Situated along one of Rabat’s typical narrow alleyways, this elegant restaurant’s new venue boasts a courtyard setting in a historic building dating from the 16C. The chef Letizia Vella here creates surprisingly creative and technically skillful cuisine full of distinctive Mediterranean flavours. Careful attention is paid to using seasonal and locally sourced ingredients.	rossettijonas	\N	\N
3332581963	Chophouse	Censu Xerri	Malta	Sliema	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://chophouse.com.mt/	Nessun premio	Grills, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Its superb location on Tigné Point means that The Chophouse affords wonderful views across the harbour to Valletta, both from its modern dining room and heated terrace. The cuisine served here is influenced by culinary trends from across the globe and includes top-quality cuts of meat such as Scottona, Angus and Wagyu. These are hung and matured in an ageing cabinet in the dining room, and then grilled on one of the largest barbecue grills in Malta!	rossigiovanni	\N	\N
3333625691	Zest	25 St. George's Road	Malta	St Julian's	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.zestflavours.com/	Nessun premio	Asian	4.0	€€	f	f	Zest is a stylish, laid-back spot, set within a chic hotel in the bustling St Julian’s district. The menu mixes influences from many Asian countries, so you can choose anything from tempura of local red prawns to sushi or spicy Thai curry^ whatever you pick, freshness and quality are assured.	cervigaia	\N	\N
3335393058	KuYa	20 St. George's Road	Malta	St Julian's	Air conditioning,Counter dining	http://www.kuyamalta.com	Nessun premio	Asian, International	3.0	€€	t	t	Head up the spiral staircase and past the kitchen to this modern, light-filled room, where they offer an appealing blackboard menu of Asian classics. Cooking is fresh and authentic, with bold, vibrant flavours. Choose one of the craft beers from their wide-ranging list.	bellandigiorgio	\N	\N
3331876240	Caviar & Bull	St George's Bay	Malta	St Julian's	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://caviarandbull.com.mt/	Nessun premio	Beef	3.0	€€€	t	f	The name says it all, as the menu at this restaurant is based on a selection of different caviars and aged beef, the latter on display in a glass cabinet near the entrance. Although fish also makes an appearance on the menu, we recommend the excellent beef tartare or Argentine ribs, grilled and served with roast potatoes and sautéed onions. The location is delightful and includes a cocktail bar, where chef Gauci’s recipes are listed in a personalised book, alongside a selection of Cuban cigars. The service is elegant and attentive, akin to dining in a private club.	beloveva	\N	\N
3336195816	LOA	Saint Geraldu	Malta	St Paul's Bay	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.loamalta.com/	Nessun premio	South American, Fusion	5.0	€€	f	f	Facing the sea on Malta’s Sirens coast, this modern restaurant named after the ancient Loa river (the longest river in Chile) serves South American fusion cuisine which is both varied and delicious. The atmosphere here is relaxed and inviting with a contemporary vibe. A good choice of pre-dinner cocktails is also available.	farinellifarah	\N	\N
3331893298	59 Republic	St George's Square	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.fiftyninerepublic.com/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	t	This basement restaurant is cosy and characterful but, if it’s sunny, the terrace overlooking the Grandmaster's Palace is the place to be. Generously sized dishes blend classical French techniques with Mediterranean flavours. The 'bites to share' are imaginative, and Beef Wellington is the house speciality.	morettipaolo	\N	\N
3336536614	AKI	Corner of Strait Street and Santa Lucia Street	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.akimalta.com/	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	€€	f	f	Look for the entrance to this sleek, stylish basement restaurant next to the Embassy Hotel, and once inside, grab a cocktail from the bar running along one side of the room. Every table has a view of the open kitchen^ watch the chefs as they carefully prepare Asian-inspired – mostly Japanese – dishes. Salmon tiradito and scallop roll are the favourite choices from our inspectors.	enacheisabella	\N	\N
3335018187	One80 St.Christopher Street	45A St. Christopher's Street	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://one80.com.mt/valletta/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	From the various options on the menu, we recommend starting with one of the excellent snacks such as crab croquette, Joselito chorizo and black garlic and then continuing with pistachio carbonara, a delicious pasta made with traditional guanciale and roasted pistachios. Main courses include excellent meat options, such as chateaubriand for two served with gravy. The restaurant has a chic, bistro-style decor and a lively atmosphere typical of the restaurants in La Valletta’s historic centre.	pavlovsabrina	\N	\N
3338503743	Kaiseki	77	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Terrace	http://www.kaiseki.mt	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Asian Influences	4.0	€€	t	f	If you find yourself on one of the most beautiful islands in the Mediterranean Sea and hungering for Mediterranean-Asian fusion cuisine, then head for Noel Azzopardi's Kaiseki. There's a cosy vibe to this basement restaurant and the Chef-Owner's kitchen produces interesting creations like soy-marinated tuna belly carpaccio, goat's cheese and grapefruit crostino, BBQ pork dumplings with teriyaki, sesame seeds and spicy mayo or roasted duck breast with pickled beetroot, pak choi and crispy duck & mozzarella roll. The different cooking styles are combined well, and the informal, casual atmosphere makes the experience all the more enjoyable.	krausmartina	\N	\N
3331521219	The Harbour Club	4/5 Barrierra Wharf	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.theharbourclubmalta.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	Take in impressive views over the Grand Harbour from the sunny terrace or head down to the appealing restaurant below^ the building was constructed in the 18C as an ice house and provides a unique and intimate setting. Well-presented, creative dishes showcase some top island ingredients.	fiorentinolukas	\N	\N
3335406965	DOC	Estrada Nacional 222	Portugal	Folgosa	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.docrestaurante.pt/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	(Temporarily closed for refurbishment) This restaurant in a contemporary - style is beside the Douro river and has an attractive terrace over the river. Enjoy the good views and taste its traditional cuisine with a creative flair.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3339573775	Legligin	Triq Santa Lucia 116-119	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning	https://legliginmalta.com/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	This small, rustic restaurant in the historic centre has limited space and a vaguely bohemian feel thanks to its informal tables, ceramics and candles. Delicious, simple, home-made cuisine full of Mediterranean and Maltese flavours takes pride of place here, with just one tasting menu that changes almost every day. There’s a shorter menu at lunchtime, while dessert can be chosen separately from a mini dessert menu. Excellent bread baked in a wood-fired oven, olives, extra-virgin olive oil from Gozo, pasta, and slow-cooked meat are just some of the attractions here. Booking in advance is recommended.	battagliadaniela	\N	\N
3336410894	Aaron´s Kitchen	107 Archbishop Street	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://aaronskitchenvalletta.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	This bistro in the town centre with a welcoming ambience and an attractive, colourful decor is the setting for Mediterranean fish dishes and typical island fare. Very popular with locals and tourists alike, the restaurant also offers a few outdoor tables which need to be booked well in advance.	fioreerik	\N	\N
3335207259	Guzé	22 Old Bakery Street	Malta	Valletta	Air conditioning	https://guzebistro.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	A striking 17C palazzo houses this cosy cellar bistro. Glance into the kitchens from street level, then head down the narrow staircase at the side to reach the two rustic, romantic dining rooms adorned with knick-knacks. Traditional Maltese dishes are generously proportioned.	tarasovangela	\N	\N
3334133098	Al Sale	32 Victory Square	Malta	Xagħra	Air conditioning,Terrace		Nessun premio	Meats and Seafood	3.0	€€	f	f	In the middle of Xaghra lies this outwardly inconspicuous restaurant that extends over two floors and boasts a small terrace out front. The Chef-Owner hails from Toronto and forged his independent business here in the middle of the pandemic, showing just how much heart and soul is behind his cooking! If you love simple cuisine based on fresh produce – especially when it comes to meat and seafood – try the prawn & scallop-filled ravioli with prawn bisque, or the delicious veal rack with salsa verde. Everything is uncomplicated, ingredient-led and freshly prepared. An international wine list and the friendly, attentive yet unstuffy service round off the overall experience.	palmieridaniel	\N	\N
