3339443604	Maizajo	Fernando Montes De Oca 113	Mexico	Cuauhtémoc		https://www.maizajo.com	Nessun premio	Mexican	3.0	$$	t	f	While their downstairs taqueria is standing room only, upstairs at Maizajo, diners are encouraged to pull up a chair. There is a clear industrial chic aesthetic to this dining room, where I-beams stand in for legs at metal tables and chairs are made from heavy rebar.You'll be greeted with some tostadas and a spicy habanero and pepita salsa at your table as you peruse Chef Santiago Muñoz Moctezuma's menu. Top picks include an oven-roasted blue corn tostada topped with avocado puree and sliced raw yellowfin tuna in a black sesame oil and soy dressing, as well as the tamal de boda. This vegetarian corn tamal filled with stewed poblano chile, leeks, and chard in an achiote, tomato and habanero salsa is topped with thinly sliced tubers for a dish that is equal parts sweet and earthy.	balazsaurora	\N	\N
3339612052	Restaurant Chocolat	Torenstraat 9A	Netherlands	Breda	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-chocolat.nl/	Nessun premio	World Cuisine, Creative French	5.0	€€	t	t	Beneath the gaze of elegant women on pictures adorning the walls to the trendy chocolate-coloured furniture, Chocolat exudes a “sexy” ambience. The overall feel is enhanced by Dorus Clement’s equally exciting creativity in the kitchen where he toys with a palette of varied flavours and is never frightened of introducing delicacies such as vadouvan and yuzu in his French-inspired recipes, showcasing his willingness to experiment.	schmittelisa	\N	\N
