3339399278	Manzanilla	Teniente Azueta 139 Recinto Portuario	Mexico	Ensenada		https://rmanzanilla.com/	Nessun premio	Mexican, Contemporary	4.0	$$	t	f	Manzanilla offers a truly worthwhile dining experience brought to you by chefs and partners Benito Molina and Solange Muris. A local favorite, the establishment feels like a world unto itself, located within a gated area and unwinding into a prettily arranged courtyard area and spaciously arranged dining rooms anchored by an ornate, carved wood bar. Speaking of drinks, an extensive selection of classic cocktails is on offer, as well as wines from the Valle de Guadalupe.The dishes lean simple but remain elevated and refined, showcasing a mastery of flavor and impeccable quality with dishes like their arroz de mar with guajillo chili and a myriad of seafood. The meal is not complete without their daily rotating crème brûlée, perhaps adorned with fig leaves from their garden.	molnarbianca	\N	\N
3330136240	María Dolores	Condominio Playa Mujeres	Mexico	Isla Mujeres	Interesting wine list	https://atelierdehoteles.com.mx/atelier-playa-mujeres-restaurante-maria-dolores	Nessun premio	Mexican, Contemporary	4.0	$$$$	f	t	Expect to be pampered like royalty from the second you step into this luxurious enclave within the sprawling Atelier Playa Mujeres hotel. Apart from hyper-attentive hospitality (including top-notch beverage service), the grand space features a balcony from which diners are serenaded with live music. The menu of contemporary Mexican cuisine, curated by celebrated chef Edgar Nuñez, is similarly ornate, featuring a multitude of à la carte offerings and specials, in addition to a signature tasting menu. The flavorful, original cooking draws upon the breadth of Mexico’s culinary landscape, reimagining familiar regional dishes with a refined modern style, whether it’s a tempura-fried shrimp taco in honor of Sonora, or a complex Oaxacan mole coloradito paired with roasted quail.	colombostefano	\N	\N
