3336788488	Mari Gold	Gob. Protasio Pérez de Tagle 66	Mexico	Miguel Hildalgo	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Fusion, Indian	4.0	$$	f	f	From its dining room to the kitchen turning out plates with an India-meets-Mexico slant, Mari Gold comes with a dose of fun. Pop by for lunch or brunch for tasty dishes, as in the freshly made picadas with flaky fish that are livened up with flecks of soft tomato, slices of green olive and a tart chutney. Servers are quick to offer suggestions if you're stumped but whatever you do, be sure to order a jugo verde for a refreshing start and finish with the very satisfying falooda dessert with plenty of rich and tangy marmalade, creamy-smooth ice cream, and rice flour noodles.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
