3336123494	De Jonge Dikkert	Amsterdamseweg 104a	Netherlands	Amstelveen	Car park,Terrace	https://jongedikkert.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative French, Regional Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	De Jonge Dikkert has given a new lease of life to this windmill dating from 1672, with its chic decor, intimate atmosphere and attractive dining room with wooden beams. This is the epitome of Dutch charm! The chef has a penchant for Dutch produce and Asian seasonings. His dishes are meticulously prepared with a nod to classic culinary tradition, and always likes to delight diners with something unexpected. For example, he complements pink-roasted lamb saddle with a puttanesca garnish and an aromatic lamb jus, and he combines crispy lamb neck with a goat's cheese cream. This chef has a passion for bold flavours and creates dishes that pack a punch.	galbanielena	\N	\N
3334810995	SAAM restaurant	Amstelzijde 59	Netherlands	Amstelveen	Interesting wine list	https://www.saamrestaurant.nl	Nessun premio	South African, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	South Africa comes to the Netherlands in this cosy establishment, which resembles a glass conservatory from the outside. Here on the Amstelzijde strip, some big names in the hospitality industry, including chefs and sommeliers, have joined forces in an endeavour to marry the two culinary cultures. Ingredients such as granadilla, suurvygie and goat meat are incorporated into modern creations with distinct flavours. Those not familiar with South African ingredients can rest assured that the waitstaff are always on hand to offer guidance.	farinellifarah	\N	\N
