3337916290	Drogaria	Rua Joaquim Casimiro 8	Portugal	Lisbon	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.drogaria-restaurante.pt/index.php/en/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	This restaurant, with its small entrance, is located on the exact spot of the erstwhile Drogaria do Sr. Albino (hence the name) in the busy Lapa district. Its retro ambience, featuring marble tables, various mirrors dotted around the two dining rooms and a checkered floor (all of which provide added personality) is in perfect harmony with a modern and sophisticated decor. The menu here is based around classic Portuguese dishes, albeit with a contemporary flair. Iconic dishes such as cod croquettes, “bacalhau à bras”, roast suckling pig, and rice pudding are all attractively presented and full of surprising textures. The delightful atmosphere on the charming outdoor terrace comes into its own on a summer evening!	novotarskymariia	\N	\N
3335840249	Graphite by Peter Gast	Paardenstraat 11	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://graphite.amsterdam/	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€€	t	f	A scanner next to an unassuming façade on Paardenstraat marks the beginning of your adventure. Scan the QR code you received when you reserved and enter this speakeasy restaurant, an intimate, nightclub-like space with trendy music playing in the background. Peter Gast's cuisine is detailed and inventive, at times even complex. This chef likes to play with tangy and sweet-and-sour nuances. For example, he combines melon and red/yellow beetroot with a zesty herb vinaigrette and various edible flowers. The mysterious Graphite is a world unto itself.	marinotommaso	\N	\N
3333871389	Green	Beethovenstraat 305	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://gastrobargreen.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€€	f	t	The sustainable Valley building, which houses Green, is a visually impressive piece of architecture. To get to this sleek, luxurious restaurant, walk through the Moltenifurniture shop, to the top floor, from where the view is stunning! Plant-based creations showcase the power of nature here, with the occasional addition of fish or meat. It is fresh, original and with surprising contrasts. Using every part of the vegetables from the seed to the leaf, this cuisine is a celebration of the produce.	vecchimirko	\N	\N
3339279354	Lastage	Geldersekade 29	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning	https://www.restaurantlastage.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€€	f	t	Hospitality and conviviality are the bedrock of this cosy little restaurant in the heart of Amsterdam, where you can enjoy good food in a relaxed atmosphere. Rogier van Dam's dishes are full of character, and nothing on the plate is superfluous. If he serves up a fillet of venison, the whole dish revolves around that ingredient. Naturally, there is also a focus on sauces and creative garnishes. The dessert of brioche stuffed with creamy Époisses is a classic of the house, and rightly so!	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3332614578	VanOost	Mauritskade 61	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.vanoostrestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€€€	t	f	Once upon a time, medical students used to perform dissections in the space that houses this chic restaurant today. Luxury and design go hand in hand here^ a seat at the dining counter is an experience. Chef Floris van Straalen has an international outlook and a focus on local produce. His cuisine is sophisticated and creative. You can start with some modern amuse-bouches that take you on a journey from East to West, or try the Anjou pigeon with a delicate cream sauce, green pepper and anchovies.	grimaldimorko	\N	\N
3332456636	De Mark	Durgerdammerdijk 73	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Great view,Terrace	https://www.restaurantdemark.com/nl	Nessun premio	Creative French	5.0	€€	f	t	Leave your car outside Durgerdam and embrace the charm of this dike village as you walk to De Mark. From the terrace, you have an exceptional view over the water – simply breathtaking! The attractive interior is done out in natural tones and makes the most of the character of the building. Dinner here is a cosy affair. Each dish revolves around three main ingredients, cooked over the wood fire. Think textures of onion – from crisp and crunchy to sweet and grilled – elevated with a Zaandam mustard ice cream. The experienced chefs offer a fresh perspective on natural flavours. If you really want to explore the extensive wine list, luxurious guestrooms are available on the first floor.	dvorakgiorgia	\N	\N
