3339489830	Sinck	Prinsengracht 422	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Terrace	https://www.sinckamsterdam.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	3.0	€€€	f	t	Locals and tourists alike love to meet up at this bustling place. This old building on the Prinsengracht boasts a charming waterfront terrace and a lovely bistro-style interior. The renowned wine list (there is a wine bar at basement level) and modern culinary creations complement each other perfectly. The chef has a no-nonsense approach to cooking – a few elements that are full of flavour plus sauces for a fine accompaniment. This is Amsterdam at its coolest!	santoronicola	\N	\N
3331860807	Troef	Schollenbrugstraat 8	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Counter dining	https://troefamsterdam.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	3.0	€€€	f	f	This bistro exudes an endlessly appealing nostalgic charm, as well as a fully à la carte menu and a chef who is able to impart his infectious enthusiasm to his team and to diners. In short, it has enough aces up its sleeve to convince any self-respecting foodie. First and foremost among them is the creative spin the chef puts on classic French dishes. Take, for instance, his perfectly cooked langoustines, topped with slivers of lardo di Colonnata and served with a delicate butter sauce infused with vin jaune and vanilla. Troef epitomises the laid-back vibe of Amsterdam!	impeiluca	\N	\N
3335393985	Wolf Atelier	Westerdoksplein 20	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.wolfatelier.nl/nl	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	t	f	Michael Wolf likes to experiment with sophisticated flavours and surprising ideas, giving diners the opportunity to test them out and then refining them to retain their best features. He is just as happy to cook up a turnip-based vegetarian take on Beef Wellington as he is to concoct surf and turf combinations that put a new spin on familiar flavours. The name Atelier is therefore particularly appropriate in this trendy, industrial-style restaurant, which is located on an old railway bridge with a beautiful view of the IJ.	krausmartina	\N	\N
3337098396	Choux	De Ruyterkade 128	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.choux.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French, Vegetarian	5.0	€€€	f	f	Cabbage in winter, peas in spring, tomatoes in summer, kale in autumn: in this trendy, industrial-style restaurant, seasonal produce takes centre stage. Embracing sustainable practices, this restaurant places the emphasis on vegetables and boasts an extensive selection of organic and natural wines. Merijn van Berlo uses his creativity to bring intensity to the plate. For instance, he infuses spelt risotto with chlorophyll in a smoked eel broth and combines it with an emulsion of horseradish and pike-perch gravlax. This cuisine bursts with floral and spicy notes and just the right amount of kick to bring the seasons to life. A captivating ode to nature's rich bounty!	marchettimarko	\N	\N
3338053634	Nazka	Van Ostadestraat 352	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	http://www.nazka.nu	Nessun premio	Peruvian, World Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	You might, for a moment, feel as if you have stumbled across a wine cellar, but you will soon see that this hip South American eatery is very much at home in this cosmopolitan city. Nazka unleashes a whirlwind of bold flavours on your palate, from pisco cocktails to ceviche and other Peruvian specialities. This is exhilarating cuisine featuring a captivating interplay of spicy and sweet chilli peppers, Asian umami and the zing of leche del tigre. The well-curated selection of wines from around the globe adds extra character to this unique dining experience.	bellinicarlos	\N	\N
3337167804	Arca	Martelaarsgracht 5	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning	https://arcaamsterdam.nl/	Nessun premio	Portuguese, Asian Influences	3.0	€€	f	f	Top Portuguese chef Henrique Sá Pessoa is the creator of the enticing sharing menu at this trendy, cosmopolitan establishment. Traditional, home-style dishes such as gambas ao alhinho are expertly given a modern twist, perhaps even a little Asian finesse. But the portions remain typically generous. The bespoke cocktails are fabulous, as is the lunch menu in the cool bar!	pirijiri	\N	\N
3337805445	Mont Blanc	Govert Flinckstraat 308	Netherlands	Amsterdam		https://www.restaurantmontblanc.nl	Nessun premio	Savoyard, Creative	5.0	€€€	f	f	From the chalet vibe to the cowbells in the toilets, the space is an ode to French chef Thibault's native Savoie, as are the food and the selection of wines. He skilfully combines authentic flavours and creative inspirations. He likes, for instance, to work with cheese (the cheese trolley is excellent), using Bleu des Aravis to give a dish based on various mushrooms extra punch. This is Alpine cuisine with natural undertones and a focus on preparation techniques.	pagliucahans	\N	\N
3332925824	Bridges	O.Z. Voorburgwal 197	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://bridgesrestaurant.nl/	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	€€€	f	t	Fish reigns supreme at this sleek restaurant, which also offers a beautiful view of the canals. Salted delicacies take centre stage in dishes that are distinctly contemporary in style. The chef combines classic sauces with the occasional Asian twist to showcase the fresh flavours of his ingredients.	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3339148087	Visaandeschelde	Scheldeplein 4	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Air conditioning,Terrace,Valet parking	https://visaandeschelde.nl/	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	€€€	t	t	Visaandeschelde has been a haven for seafood enthusiasts since 1999. The maritime theme of this brasserie is emphasised by details such as anchors and fish drawings on the tiles, scale patterns on the windows and the blue and white colour scheme. In this lively establishment, you can savour briny oysters, sumptuous seafood platters and the freshest fish. The dishes are rather traditional in style – it is the quality of the produce that counts. When you order lobster, expect it to be perfectly cooked and served with a subtly sweet olive oil vinaigrette with parsley and a crisp salad. The lunchtime menu comes highly recommended!	colombostefano	\N	\N
3338694618	Oud-Zuid	Johannes Verhulststraat 64	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Terrace	https://www.restaurantoudzuid.nl/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	Oud-Zuid is a restaurant that is full of character. Take a seat inside to admire the trendy brasserie-style decor or sit out on the pleasant pavement terrace where you can enjoy the vibe of this neighbourhood. The chef puts a modern spin on tradition in his tempting and no-nonsense menu that has a focus on fish, seafood and organic produce. There is something for everyone in the impressive wine selection. Less than 10 minutes' walk from the renowned Concertgebouw.	pagliucahans	\N	\N
3334165714	Foer	Cruquiusweg 9	Netherlands	Amsterdam	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://foeramsterdam.nl/	Nessun premio	Vegetarian	4.0	€€€	t	t	Foer certainly has character both in terms of the stylish decor – nab a place at the dining counter if you can – and the food. The focus here is on vegetables and herbs, perhaps complemented by a fish or meat dish. Using inventive preparation techniques, Steven Broere succeeds in elevating vegetables in original combinations. For instance, he marries intense beetroot cooked in a salt crust and an emulsion of egg yolk with subtle acidity to create a remarkable flavour sensation. The select wines add to this unique sense of harmony.	dvorakgiorgia	\N	\N
3335663262	Sizzles at the Park	Kerklaan 17	Netherlands	Apeldoorn	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.sizzlesatthepark.nl/	Nessun premio	International	4.0	€€	f	t	The monumental building that provides the setting for Sizzles is truly impressive – the contemporary elegance, trendy ambience and terrace almost whisk you away to Ibiza! You can eat here morning, noon and night, enjoying Leon Habers’ family-inspired and highly original dishes that include a dynamic twist, a hint of Asia and an acidic touch. Fascinating!	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
3339192834	Le Nord	Soestdijkseweg Noord 492	Netherlands	Bilthoven	Car park,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-lenord.nl/	Nessun premio	Classic French	3.0	€€	f	f	This authentic farmhouse dating from 1885 combines rural charm and modern design – the ideal setting in which to experience Grégory Nicole's cuisine. The finesse with which this French chef pays tribute to his homeland is a testament to his expertise. More modern inspirations add a dash of excitement without overcomplicating things. He surprises diners with, for instance, his own take on Poire Williams, or a beautiful cod fillet infused with zesty notes. Be sure to try the tuna pizza, a tribute to master chef Joop Braakhekke. Le Nod is also a sure bet at lunchtime!	kuznetsovella	\N	\N
3338653578	The Church	Ir J.P. Van Muijlwijkstraat 19A	Netherlands	Arnhem		https://the-church.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	€€€	t	f	With its stained-glass windows, sculptures, murals and old pews, this Lutheran church has been beautifully preserved. The juxtaposition of modern opulence with the venue's rich past is truly inspired. Take in the spectacle of the open kitchen while enjoying a meal prepared right before your eyes. Nestled in the church's rafters, there are a few cosy guestrooms. But first, it's time to let yourself be spoiled by Bart Leussink, a chef who embraces creativity and boldness in his cooking. For instance, he elevates lamb neck with a crispy herb crust and lamb fillet with a vibrant sweet-and-sour cucumber garnish and a rich lamb jus. The chef has a penchant for fish and seafood dishes, into which he likes weave zesty flavours. An extraordinary experience!	ferrijacopo	\N	\N
3336667360	Locals	Stationsplein 1	Netherlands	Arnhem	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://locals-arnhem.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	3.0	€€	f	f	Housed in the same building as Hotel Haarhuis, just across from Arnhem Central train station, Locals boasts a cosmopolitan atmosphere. Ingredients are sourced as locally as possible, according to the principles of Dutch Cuisine. The abundance of plants and warm colours reflects that philosophy. Upstairs, there is even a vertical farm. The chef delights in working with vegetables, eg incorporating lentils from the Netherlands into a curry with herbs from the farm, seasonal vegetables and briny seaweed, and most of the fish and meat are locally sourced. . This place really lives up to its name!	galbanielena	\N	\N
3333211245	Trattoria Da Giulio	Markt 37	Netherlands	Arnhem	Air conditioning	https://www.dagiulio.nl/	Nessun premio	Italian	4.0	€€	t	f	Giulio keeps the traditions of his native Sardinia alive in this cheerful trattoria. He makes his own pasta and bread every day, and the orata (gilt-head bream) in a salt crust is even filleted at the table. Here the Italian art of simplicity is at its most exuberant. House-made pappardelle with a creamy duck sauce, an aromatic panna cotta topped with a subtly flavoured juniper jam... Da Giulio is undeniably the best Italian in Arnhem!	popescumaya	\N	\N
3338615479	De Steenen Tafel	Weg achter het Bos 1	Netherlands	Arnhem	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://desteenentafel.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	Fans of fine food put on their Sunday best to dine at this elegant conservatory restaurant on the edge of the pretty Klarenbeek park (what a view!). They come here for the traditionally prepared lobster or the wild game from the Veluwe region, although the chef also prepares more original fare such as the occasional oriental dish with foie gras. Rich, authentic cuisine is to the fore here.	guerravictor	\N	\N
3339844185	The Green Rose	Koningstraat 50	Netherlands	Arnhem	Terrace	https://www.thegreenrose.nl/	Nessun premio	Organic	5.0	€€€	f	f	Vegetables, fish or meat – the wonderful produce that the Netherlands has to offer is the biggest source of inspiration for Jin Hu and his team of artisans. He takes his cue from the micro seasons and lets nature dictate what goes into his French-Asian fusion dishes. Sustainability is at the heart of this cuisine, which is characterised by the intense authentic flavours of ultra fresh ingredients, as well as an element of surprise. Be sure to sample the extraordinary range of natural wines and special beers.	sommerlaura	\N	\N
3331996832	Restaurant Vannu	Gilzeweg 24	Netherlands	Bavel	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.restaurantvannu.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Vegan	4.0	€€€	t	f	Today's culinary landscape is characterised by a shift towards plant-based, zero-waste dishes underpinned by long-established techniques such as fermentation and pickling. At Restaurant Vannu, Gijs Kemmeren gives his creativity free rein, incorporating all those sustainable elements into a multi-course set menu. With seaweed, for example, he adds nuance to the earthiness of beetroot and fresh celery. He also whisks up an intensely flavoursome chanterelle sauce to tie together al dente vegetables and a millet polenta cake. His cuisine is sophisticated, playful and certainly intriguing. The accompanying natural wines and juices underscore the ethos of this establishment. A memorable dining experience is guaranteed.	monticristian	\N	\N
3336023398	Lyf's	Hoofdstraat 73	Netherlands	Beetsterzwaag	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.lyfs.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	4.0	€€	t	t	One of this neighbourhood restaurant's main assets is its convivial atmosphere. The commitment to quality is palpable on every plate that is brought to your table. Martijn Stroosma serves up beautifully presented dishes that showcase his creativity. This astute chef never goes over the top. For instance, he will mellow the combination of langoustine tail tempura and confit bacon with touches of mango and celeriac. He always strikes the right balance, including in the mouth-watering à la carte and lunch options.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3331625969	Puur Sanh	Zevenheuvelenweg 87	Netherlands	Berg en Dal	Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.puursanh.nl	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€	f	t	Puur Sanh's cuisine is captivating with its creative, daring, and exciting flavours. Chef Witte focuses on plant-based dishes and likes to think outside the box. For instance, he combines textures of pineapple with a sweet potato beignet, coconut and curry cream, spicy fennel and sesame seeds, and a potato crème brûlée. Daring, but it absolutely works! Treat yourself to a seat on the terrace and sample the wonderful selection of whiskies and wines. A feast for the senses!	salluis	\N	\N
