3335938096	De Hemel	Moeregrebstraat 35	Netherlands	Bergen op Zoom	Terrace	https://www.dehemelboz.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French, Home Cooking	5.0	€€	f	t	Enjoy an intimate dinner in a romantic dining room, or on the rear terrace in fine weather, and choose from a selection of tasty dishes prepared in French style, with a nod to modern cuisine. A delightful dining experience.	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
