3339277771	Hoog Holten	Forthaarsweg 7	Netherlands	Holten	Car park,Garden or park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://hoogholten.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Your experience at Hoog Holten begins with the drive there: the charm of the surrounding Salland countryside is captivating in itself. The terrace of this romantic establishment, housed in an old hunting lodge, happens to be one of the most beautiful in the country! Brasserie Birds keeps things traditional – go to the restaurant for more varied, contemporary cuisine. The set menu changes daily, but always seeks inspiration abroad for its sometimes truly innovative dishes.	vogelbeatrice	\N	\N
3336001311	Den Burgh	Rijnlanderweg 878	Netherlands	Hoofddorp	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.denburgh.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	4.0	€€	t	t	This impressive farmhouse dating from 1859 has retained its original charm and gained in elegance since its refurbishment. Inlaid with golden coins, the main bar is sure to draw the eye, as is the terrace. This bustling establishment is popular with business people, not only due to its proximity to a business park and the airport. The extensive menu includes appetisers, salads, steak tartare and bouillabaisse. The succulent pan-fried halibut accompanied by an exquisite fish sauce shows that, although the dishes may have a modern look, they are rooted in beautiful classic flavours.	benesemily	\N	\N
3339789293	De Kromme Bistro	Slijkplaat 6	Netherlands	Hoofdplaat	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://krommewatergang.nl/bistro/	Nessun premio	Grills, Meats and Seafood	5.0	€€€	t	t	Walk through the wine cellar to discover this charming bistro, an extension of the renowned De Kromme Watergang. The lush garden and open kitchen, complete with a sturdy charcoal grill instantly catch the eye. With every bite, you will sense the chefs' deep-rooted passion for the seafood of Zeeland, which is showcased here in all its briny glory. Think cockles with finely chopped chives and a rich beurre blanc infused with the cockles' juices and a hint of lemongrass. But rest assured, they can just as easily barbecue a bavette steak or whip up a vegetarian creation. Brasserie cuisine with a unique twist.	marinotommaso	\N	\N
3330907725	Marque	Bierkade 2	Netherlands	Hoorn	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.marquerestaurant.nl/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	The open kitchen and spacious bar (which you can eat at) will grab your attention as soon as you walk into this former cheese warehouse (1618). The character of this property is enhanced by the elegant decor. Marque is proud of its Mediterranean soul, and the experienced head chef wins diners over with modern textures, delicate acidic touches, and all the panache and exuberance of the South.	ferrettivladislav	\N	\N
3332509466	QuiDine	West 52	Netherlands	Hoorn	Air conditioning	https://quidine.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€€	f	t	Drawing on experience gained at various top-flight establishments, Quirijn Bakker proposes an accessible take on fine dining. QuiDine exudes sophistication but also has a cosy, living room-like feel. Meticulously crafted dishes are served in the form of a set menu^ diners simply choose the number of courses. The chef brings his culinary creations to life with ingenious flavour combinations and international influences. For instance, ajo blanco cream elevates the fillet of smoked trout, and strawberry vinegar and chilli pep up a refreshing dessert. This young chef demonstrates a maturity beyond his years.	horvathmaria	\N	\N
3330255288	Tante Kee	Julianalaan 14	Netherlands	Kaag	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.tantekee.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Asian Contemporary	5.0	€€€	f	t	The back and forth of the ferry bringing guests to this magnificent establishment makes for a wonderful spectacle in the evenings. Inside, the decor has been given a makeover and creates a modern yet intimate atmosphere, with the surrounding water playing an integral part in the overall look. The intriguing flavour combinations in the modern, occasionally oriental dishes provide the basis for an exciting culinary experience. Think an exotic/fresh/zesty combination of mango, passion fruit, coconut and fried rice noodles. Dinner at Tante Kee is quite an adventure!	urbanalessia	\N	\N
3333797309	Morille	Biggekerksestraat 3	Netherlands	Koudekerke		https://www.restaurantmorille.nl/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	At Morille, they strive to source all their produce from within a 15km radius of the restaurant. It feels like nature has taken root in this cosy place – and with good reason. Floris Vriens has taken over the reins and is maintaining the restaurant's commitment to sustainability: ingredients harvested from his own kitchen garden, foraged in the wild or purchased from producers in the vicinity are presented in a 14-course set menu accompanied by drinks sourced solely from the Netherlands and Belgium. This inspired, modern culinary approach – with its respect for micro-seasons – is an ode to Zeeland's (mostly vegetable-based) riches.	galassiniccolo	\N	\N
