3339722497	Harry's	Wycker Brugstraat 2	Netherlands	Maastricht	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.harrysmaastricht.com/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	This luxury brasserie is as cosmopolitan as it is vibrant. French flair characterises both the ambience and the cuisine. On the menu, international flavours and vegetarian options show that the chefs are keeping up with the times, but not at the expense of the golden rules of superior brasserie cuisine. The kitchen garden is a manifestation of their sustainable approach (more details on the website). Creative, local, seasonal: Harry's ticks all the boxes!	grecodavide	\N	\N
3336193487	Bar Beurre	Sint Pieterstraat 54	Netherlands	Maastricht	Terrace	https://barbeurre.nl/	Nessun premio	French	3.0	€€	f	t	Once a traditional café, this place is now a no-nonsense bistro, complete with upbeat background music. Bar Beurre certainly lives up to its name. Just like in traditional French cooking, butter (beurre) is a key ingredient here, but this cuisine is not at all lacking in sophistication. For example, the chef uses it to prepare megrim à la meunière, which he serves with anchovies, broad beans and an exquisite beurre blanc finished with a dash of sherry. The short menu features dishes that are bold and playful. Le beurre, c'est la vie!	pierimarco	\N	\N
