3336584042	Rantrée	Het Wilhelmus 30 L	Netherlands	Maastricht	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.rantree.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	f	f	Rantrée welcomes you to its eclectic restaurant on the eighth floor of the Dormio Resort hotel. The interior radiates a golden glow and affords magnificent views of Maastricht and its surroundings. Diners have the choice between à la carte options showcasing first-rate ingredients and an appealing set menu (vegan version available). The chef unites French technique with complex Asian flavours^ think prawn seasoned with a koji and dill oil vinaigrette. He takes pride in the beautiful presentation of his dishes and also has an interesting wine list up his sleeve.	ttuyungim	\N	\N
