3339683902	Gaar	Klinkenberg 173	Netherlands	Meerssen	Terrace	https://www.restaurantgaar.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	The world is Joachim Müller's culinary playground. Generous dishes such as Limburg pork terrine or crispy tortilla with Asian-style marinated tuna and wasabi give expression to the chef's sense of fun. The extensive and varied menu never disappoints, and diners will enjoy the interesting wine pairings. Chef Joachim and front-of-house manager Myrthe make it their mission to show guests a good time. The pops of turquoise in the decor are in keeping with the convivial spirit of this place.	balazsaurora	\N	\N
