3330336689	Scherp	Wijngaardstraat 1	Netherlands	Middelburg	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://restaurantscherp.nl/	Nessun premio	World Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	Mart Scherp's restaurant, which also offers accommodation, merges the historical charm of Middelburg's town centre with a trendy vibe. The talented chef likes to work with Zeeland's local produce and Asian seasonings. Enticing flavours and subtle spiciness are common features, so it's no surprise that he has gathered a loyal following.	huberflorin	\N	\N
3334949278	't Golfje	Heereweg 22a	Netherlands	Midsland	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://restaurant-tgolfje.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€€	t	f	Housed in a quintessential Terschelling farmhouse just outside Midsland, this is a charming restaurant where diners are made to feel right at home. The gorgeous natural surroundings not only foster a mood of tranquillity, but they also determine what ends up on your plate. Many of the ingredients are picked by the staff themselves or sourced from the restaurant's own vegetable garden. These then feature in modern dishes which also draw on Mediterranean and Asian influences. This is no-nonsense cuisine. Think a perfectly fried quail fillet, a robust chicken stock and Jerusalem artichoke in cream and deep-fried. Divine!	semenovirene	\N	\N
3333245719	SEAson - Arsenaal	Kooltjesbuurt 1	Netherlands	Naarden	Car park,Terrace	https://www.season-arsenaal.nl/	Nessun premio	Seafood, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	Originally erected in 1688 as a military barracks, this building was converted many years later by renowned interior designer Jan des Bouverie. Today, the place is chic and inviting, and the terrace is a real draw on sunny days. Dennis Koopmans specialises in seafood, but does cater to meat eaters as well. If you're looking for a plateau de fruits de mer or the freshest of seasonal fish, it doesn't get much better than this. Think pan-fried red mullet and a rich shellfish bisque, with finely chopped fennel providing a hint of zesty flavour, complemented by salty samphire and crispy croutons. As the name suggests, this restaurant is a celebration of the finest and freshest seasonal produce.	vecchiatomichael	\N	\N
3335549684	Red Chilli	Oude Provincialeweg 2	Netherlands	Nieuwe-Niedorp	Car park,Terrace	https://www.redchilli.nl/	Nessun premio	Asian, Fusion	3.0	€€€	f	f	Asia is a world away from the peaceful polders but this intimate restaurant creates a real Eastern ambience. Its fusion Asian cuisine is authentic yet modern in style. Red Chilli will definitely spice up your evening!	beckerradu	\N	\N
3337276041	Céline	Fort Jutphaas 3	Netherlands	Nieuwegein	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	http://www.restaurantceline.nl	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€€	f	t	The austere appearance of Fort Jutphaas is in marked contrast to the restaurant it houses, which boasts an intimate atmosphere with subdued lighting and cosy terrace. Chef Rick works principally with Dutch produce, such as Dutch yellowtail, which he likes to season with subtle Asian flavours. This is original and modern cuisine, in which vegetables take pride of place. In fact, why not opt for the appealing vegetarian set menu?	testagabriel	\N	\N
3332817717	Bistrotel 't Amsterdammertje	Rijksstraatweg 35	Netherlands	Nieuwersluis	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Terrace	https://bistrotelamsterdammertje.nl/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Brimming with character, this building by the Vecht River is enchanting, but just wait until you're sitting on the terrace… At Bistrotel, you can truly escape the hustle and bustle for a while! Before you retire to your comfortable guestroom, be sure to pop into the spacious bistro downstairs. André Gerrits has assembled a team here who know their way around bistro classics and flavours from all over the world. With options on the menu such as steak tartare, spicy rendang or farmhouse chicken from the spit^ this is the kind of place where anything goes.	beckerradu	\N	\N
3331699444	Het Sluishuys	Arkersluisweg 31	Netherlands	Nijkerk	Car park	https://restauranthetsluishuys.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	3.0	€€€	f	f	Hand-cut steak tartare with fine acidity, turbot à la meunière with a beurre blanc cooked in time-honoured tradition and ravioli stuffed with oxtail: these are the kind of classic dishes for which Erik Hendriksen is renowned. At this warm and welcoming restaurant, in an idyllic location by an old lock and close to a small harbour, familiar flavours are given the attention they deserve.	szabosofia	\N	\N
3332839632	De Salentein	Putterstraatweg 7	Netherlands	Nijkerk	Car park	http://www.landgoeddesalentein.nl	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	Argentina and Uruguay are the main sources of inspiration for the elegant De Salentein. Not only does the menu feature the traditional cuisines of those countries, with dishes such as chimichurri and empanadas, but the restaurant even raises its own beef cattle and has its own winery in Argentina. Led by chef Rik Jansma, the kitchen team elevates robust South American flavours with a touch of sophistication. The distinctive aromas of a sea bass ceviche, for instance, are enhanced with a leche del tigre vinaigrette. Cooked to perfection over flames, the picanha is paired with a rich brown sauce. For something a little more down-to-earth, head to Bodega Portillo, housed in the same building. A Latin American adventure awaits!	vitaleraffaele	\N	\N
3339384738	DYLANS	Oude Zeeweg 63	Netherlands	Noordwijk aan Zee	Air conditioning,Car park	https://www.dylansnoordwijk.nl/	Nessun premio	Meats and Grills, Creative	3.0	€€€	f	f	The founder of Alexander Hotel was born a butcher's son and can be proud of this restaurant for meat lovers. The trendy intimacy of the decor, the gold elements, the hip lounge and cocktail bar all make for a magnificent venue. Many of the modern dishes are prepared on the Josper charcoal oven, resulting in robust, pure flavours. A fine côte de boeuf, a salt-crusted tenderloin to share, a choice cut of Japanese Wagyu beef: a feast for carnivores!	salajakub	\N	\N
3332185082	Villa de Duinen	Oude Zeeweg 74	Netherlands	Noordwijk aan Zee	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.villadeduinen.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	Arriving at this Anglo-Norman-style villa (1902) feels like coming home. The cosy interior, reminiscent of a cottage, and the endearing personality of the hostess are irresistible. The youthful kitchen team favours a resolutely modern approach to cooking. They play with textures, allow the main ingredient to shine and sometimes come up with surprisingly imaginative ideas. Hand them a butternut squash, and they will turn it into something amazing, with great technical skill and subtle influences from around the globe.	sannamateo	\N	\N
3332616340	Restaurant Calva	Dorpsstraat 30	Netherlands	Nootdorp	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.restaurantcalva.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	t	f	This intimate restaurant is a love story in itself, where chef Tom enjoys explaining his dishes at the table and is always happy to recommend the best wine to accompany his well-constructed culinary creations. As an example, his traditional savoir-faire shines through in the way he cooks pigeon to perfection as well as his intensely flavoured sauces. His exquisite and more modern side dishes provide the perfect harmony.	m�llercristian	\N	\N
3339017524	Ni Hao	Harderwijkerweg 85	Netherlands	Nunspeet	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.ni-hao.nl/	Nessun premio	Chinese, Cantonese	3.0	€€	f	t	This restaurant with an intimate Eastern feel introduces its guests to “chistro” dishes, a combination of bistro and Chinese cuisine. Chef Chen creates delicious contemporary dishes, which are made to share and which include specialities from Sichuan, Guangdong, Beijing and Wenzhou. An innovative approach to authentic Chinese cuisine.	ferraroedoardo	\N	\N
3330017550	Reua Thai	Dorpstraat 45b	Netherlands	Nuth	Air conditioning	https://reuathai.com/	Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	€€	f	t	Reua Thai has a rather rough-hewn feel, with wooden ornaments adding to the unique character of the space. Pattama Simons is an aficionado of authentic Thai cuisine but adds a touch of finesse. She often works with produce from her own garden or local suppliers and takes the time to create depth in her cooking. For example, she infuses beef stock with cinnamon, lemongrass, peanut and coriander to achieve a vibrant and subtly spicy flavour profile. This broth serves as a rich foundation to elevate chopped beef, rice noodles and daikon. With a choice of options for each course, the set menu is recommended to fully appreciate this aromatic cuisine.	pirijiri	\N	\N
3334935781	Suzie's en Van Aken	Geversstraat 63a	Netherlands	Oegstgeest	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.suziesenvanaken.nl/	Nessun premio	French, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Chef Tom is no stranger to the concepts of nose-to-tail eating and zero waste. With a keen sense of the zeitgeist, this is a creative chef who draws inspiration from his extensive travels, especially to Asia. For example, a beurre blanc sauce with dashi that adds depth to a salty dish based on oyster and samphire. The jovial Suzanne plays her part, serving up excellent wine and dessert recommendations. The natural vibe of this cosy establishment will make your dinner that little bit more enjoyable.	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3333811874	de Molenaar	Uiterdijk 4	Netherlands	Onderdendam	Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restaurantdemolenaar.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€€	t	t	The charm of the converted Hunsingo windmill (1855) is as captivating as this picturesque village, and it houses a really special restaurant. Chef Kooijker works only with a surprise menu in which he brings to bear all his creativity, paying special attention to the presentation, creating elaborate garnishes and giving a new perspective on familiar flavours. Rest assured, you are in good hands here. And why not treat yourself to an overnight stay in the mill or granary?	giordanopietro	\N	\N
3330074326	Kook Atelier op Oost	Oost 76	Netherlands	Oosterend	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	http://www.kook-atelier.nl	Nessun premio	Organic, Country cooking	3.0	€€€	f	t	Nature takes centre stage at this tastefully converted farmhouse, which also has splendid guestrooms. The restaurant's Nordic-inspired design and large windows that make you feel connected to the outdoors reflect the house's commitment to sustainability. The menu is centred on ingredients from the Wadden Sea and Texel, which they have either grown themselves or sourced from friendly local purveyors. Produce such as peas, algae and lamb are showcased in vibrant creations, in which techniques such as fermentation and koji add intensity and depth. This exploration of Texel's ecosystems is truly fascinating.	de lucaenrico	\N	\N
3336035672	Wijnhuis De Blauwe Camer	Kloosterdreef 3	Netherlands	Oosterhout	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list	http://www.wijnhuisdeblauwecamer.nl	Nessun premio	French Contemporary, Creative French	5.0	€€€	t	t	The medieval site of St Catherine's Valley convent is an oasis of charm. The coach house has been turned into a modern restaurant, bathed in natural light and with a rustic vibe. There is also a kitchen garden and several hectares of vineyards (hence the wine barrels at the entrance). The food has just as much character as the site. Home-grown vegetables, influences from around the globe and spicy/subtly acidic details skilfully combined to create expressive dishes. Highly impressive.	magnanipavel	\N	\N
3339442472	de Wanne	Winhofflaan 2	Netherlands	Ootmarsum	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.parkhotel-dewiemsel.nl/restaurant/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	It is no surprise that German guests feel at home in de Wanne, with its good choice of German wines and recommendations offered by the experienced maître. Original, contemporary dishes full of flavour prepared by a classically trained chef, plus a beautiful terrace overlooking the hotel gardens.	serrakevin	\N	\N
3332264728	Cèpes	Houtkampweg 1	Netherlands	Otterlo	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://cepes.nl	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	Hotel de Sterrenberg's restaurant draws on its natural surroundings. The interior is sleek yet warm, combining lots of wood with concrete, and a large wooden stag's head that draws the eye. The chef believes in sourcing his produce locally, using local suppliers such as Gert van Eldik and the Veluwe asparagus farm. Diners are served a surprise menu composed of intricate and beautifully presented dishes. Think venison from the region with carefully considered vegetable accompaniments and a game jus enhanced with vermouth. A proud ambassador for the Veluwe!	dinusauru	\N	\N
3333334326	Plantage 87	Plantage 87	Netherlands	Oude-Wetering	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.plantage87.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Cuisine from the Marches	4.0	€€€	t	t	The first thing that strikes you at Plantage 87 is the phenomenal view of the surrounding marina. Stephan Möllers's biggest source of inspiration, however, lies a little further away, in his generously sized vegetable garden. He likes to express his creativity by working with vegetables so that they yield the right acidity or spiciness to bring out the best of the main ingredient – letting it speak for itself.	vogelbeatrice	\N	\N
3330322275	La Mère Anne	Dorpsweg 110	Netherlands	Oudendijk	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.lamereanne.nl/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	La Mère Anne is a huge business encompassing a range of activities. You can hire the venue for parties, spend the night in modern guestrooms, but above all, enjoy good food! The chef favours regional produce, which he showcases in contemporary dishes. These steer clear of frills, focusing instead on straightforward, delicious flavours.	orlandofernando	\N	\N
3336175834	De Voetangel	Rondehoep Oost 3	Netherlands	Ouderkerk aan de Amstel	Car park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.voetangel.nl	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	This cosy family restaurant rises up out of the Ronde Hoep polder, from where it enjoys magnificent views across pastureland and streams. The chefs here veer more towards the traditional, although modern dishes are starting to creep into their cuisine. Organic, vegetarian and international options give the menu extra appeal.	virgolinifrancesco	\N	\N
3334173098	't Pakhuus	Haven 8	Netherlands	Oudeschild	Great view,Terrace	https://pakhuus.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	5.0	€€€	f	f	This restaurant's designer decor is delightful, with a moss-clad wall that brings a touch of nature into the dining room. However, the ultimate appeal of this historical warehouse is its view of the harbour and the shrimp boats. Fish and seafood are the speciality of the house – the centrepiece is the fish tank, which is replenished daily. Think fresh Wadden oysters or scallops, enhanced by Asian flavours such as ponzu, ginger and pimento. Of course, the menu also features other local delicacies, such as Texel lamb. To cap it all off, why not spend the night in one of the designer suites?	kozakjennifer	\N	\N
