3330758822	fago	Travessa da Praça 2A	Portugal	Marvão	Air conditioning	https://fagomarvao.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	5.0	€€	f	t	This restaurant is situated in Marvão, a village at the highest point of the Serra de São Mamede, just a few kilometres from the Spanish border. It occupies a small house that has been completely remodelled by Diogo Branco, a chef from Porto, and Daniel Boto, a native of this region. The concise à la carte here changes constantly according to the seasons and availability from local producers. Three main dishes are always available: one vegetarian, one meat, and one fish or seafood.	costasergio	\N	\N
3333209397	De Ertepeller	Slobbengorsweg 149	Netherlands	Papendrecht	Air conditioning,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.ertepeller.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€€	f	t	The steady stream of boats passing by provides a captivating backdrop for this bright and airy restaurant located at a point where three rivers meet. Large windows afford uninterrupted views. During the week, Arjan Kuipers serves up an appealing selection of simple dishes, including crispy battered fish and freshly cut chips. Alternatively, you can opt for a more ambitious and adventurous set menu. A variety of textures and international flavours are expertly combined, and the dishes are beautifully presented. With an accomplished chef at the helm, De Ertepeller offers the best of both worlds, and the quality is second to none.	dinusauru	\N	\N
