3333239691	In Den Rustwat	Honingerdijk 96	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://idrw.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	In den Rustwat adds an exotic touch to metropolitan Rotterdam with its thatched roof, history dating back to the 16C and an idyllic setting close to an arboretum. The food here is anything but traditional, offering contemporary-style dishes with an abundance of ingredients and cooking methods.	reinhardtgabriela	\N	\N
3339239659	Putaine	Antoine Platekade 996	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://restaurantputaine.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative French	5.0	€€€	f	f	The Rotterdam skyline and Nieuwe Maas river form the backdrop to your dining experience at Putaine. On a pontoon floating in the Rijnhaven, this on-trend restaurant has large windows and a fabulous terrace. You could happily spend the whole day here working your way through the creative à la carte menu. Chef Schook makes a point of working with Dutch produce, giving vegetables special emphasis^ he has a penchant for crisp, vibrant nuances. A cosmopolitan and exciting place!	ciobanuciprian	\N	\N
3337826900	NY Basement	Koninginnenhoofd 1	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning	https://hotelnewyork.nl/nybasement/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, French Contemporary	4.0	€€€	t	t	A jazzy vibe reigns supreme in the cellar of the New York hotel, which is reminiscent of the Big Apple of the 1920s and 1930s. After a delicious cocktail at the 11m-long bar, guests can enjoy the modern cuisine on offer here. Choose from a delicious fish or meat dish, vegetables prepared on the charcoal grill and an array of trendy suggestions.	morettipaolo	\N	\N
3338439134	Restobar Vista	Holland Amerikakade 104	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://vistarotterdam.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	f	f	Dine against the stunning backdrop of the Rotterdam skyline and the Nieuwe Maas River at Restobar Vista. On the ground floor of the De Rotterdam building, the tastefully modern restaurant is done out in muted colours. The team assembled by Henrie van der Heijden, head chef at Vista in Willemstad, creates distinctly French dishes, with the occasional nod to the Mediterranean. Think succulent roasted tournedos on a bed of caramelised onion, accompanied by a rich Madeira sauce and potato rösti. The chefs eschew complexity and delight diners with their unpretentious dishes. The extensive menu and fantastic value for money will bring a smile to your face.	serafinidmitri	\N	\N
3339731053	River Bar	Westerkade 8	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Counter dining,Great view,Terrace	https://riverbar.nl	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	t	t	The maritime decor inside this striking oval pavilion is indeed enchanting, yet one of its main draws is the view of the Nieuwe Maas River. As you soak up the vibrant atmosphere and watch the cruise ships dock, you can choose from a fine selection of wines by the glass and the European-inspired menu. Eschewing any unnecessary frills, the chef comes up with some truly original dishes. His repertoire includes perfectly cooked Mediterranean-style turbot, foie gras as rich as anywhere in France – and even beef Wellington! The wide selection promises a delightful culinary journey along Europe's rivers.	bertinimilan	\N	\N
3333616010	Restaurant Renilde	Museumpark 24	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurantrenilde.nl	Nessun premio	Organic	5.0	€€€	t	f	Renilde Hammacher-van den Brande served as a curator at the Museum Boijmans van Beuningen for many years and would no doubt have been proud of the restaurant that bears her name. Located in a creatively landscaped rooftop garden on the sixth floor of what is now Depot Boijmans, this place affords stunning views over the city. In the afternoon, the restaurant is reserved for museum visitors^ in the evening, it opens its doors to everyone who wishes to discover chef De Jong's surprise menu. This creative chef has a penchant for vegetables and bold combinations. His culinary audacity shines through in his sublime combination of elderflower ice cream, the subtle bitterness of Belgian endive caramel and rhubarb root. Prepare to be blown away!	voicucatu	\N	\N
3332121015	Aji	Pannekoekstraat 40A	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restaurantaji.nl/	Nessun premio	South American, Asian	3.0	€€€	f	f	Immerse yourself in the tropical world of Aji. The vintage, lounge-style decor exudes an adventurous spirit, a quality that Pelle Swinkels's cuisine also possesses. His technique is rooted in French culinary tradition, and he draws on experience gained in Asia and South America. He combines tuna tartare, for instance, with a spicy emulsion and leche del tigre vinaigrette, lime and crispy corn. With a sure touch, he uses flavour enhancers, such as sambai and aji amarillo, in original ways to add depth and complexity with umami, fruity and sweet notes. Intriguing!	lorenziarthur	\N	\N
3334970420	De Herberg van Smallingerland	Muldersplein 2	Netherlands	Rottevalle	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.herbergvansmallingerland.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€€	f	f	Dating back to 1791, this charming inn is full of character and extremely popular. Tables in the gorgeous courtyard garden are in high demand, as are the guestrooms. With a special emphasis on vegetables, Chef Freddy and son Jurmen showcase Frisian cuisine at its best. For instance, they will draw on the distinct flavours of beetroot, cherries and capers to give a fillet of red mullet a special twist. The menu at de Herberg is full of surprises!	vitaleraffaele	\N	\N
3339776631	Bistrobar Beaune	Beekhuizenseweg 1	Netherlands	Rozendaal	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.bistrobarbeaune.nl/	Nessun premio	French	4.0	€€	f	f	The magnificent Rosendael Castle houses this fashionable upscale bistro that affords views over the delightful surrounding grounds. This is a seriously cool bistro bar! The wide-ranging menu proposes a range of appealing entrées served in modest portions that diners will find hard to resist. Vegetarian options, a classic cod dish, meat specialities, the house version of an eclair for dessert… You'll be spoilt for choice!	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
3330094531	Stiel Oriental	Markt 23	Netherlands	Schagen	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurantstiel.nl/	Nessun premio	Indonesian, Fusion	3.0	€€	f	f	Stiel exudes an Oriental vibe – with bright Eastern motifs, warm tones and wicker furnishings, this is as cosy as it gets and you immediately feel at home. The front-of-house team is beautifully in sync with the enthusiastic kitchen brigade, who you can see at work in the open kitchen. Often inspired by Indonesia, their wide range of dishes to share (a regular menu is also available) pack the spicy punch you would expect. House-made dim sum with veal and five spices, a rich curry with prawns, juicy satay kambing – this is a veritable feast for the taste buds!	paganialex	\N	\N
3339422365	TOV	Loet 8	Netherlands	Schagen	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restauranttov.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	TOV stands for Team Onvergetelijk Verrassend (literally, an unforgettably surprising team), giving an indication of what is in store at this trendy restaurant. The young staff are full of enthusiasm and everything is organised just as it should be. Resolutely contemporary-style cuisine created by an imaginative chef.	vargalucia	\N	\N
