3339949344	Ambrozijn	Plenkertstraat 45	Netherlands	Valkenburg	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.restaurantambrozijn.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Creative French	3.0	€€€	t	f	Previously a church, Irenekerk (1891) is now a restaurant where design reigns supreme. The organ has been converted into a bar, dark brick walls surround you, and the new roof truss is magnificent. You can also see the impressive Sven Nijenhuis in action in the completely open kitchen. This place is all the more exceptional because of the way the talented chef draws on French cooking styles and innovative techniques. He really makes his mark with his exquisite sauces and meticulous seasonings.	stannaomi	\N	\N
3331255250	Ferrugem	Rua das Pedrinhas 32	Portugal	Portela	Air conditioning	https://www.ferrugem.pt/	Nessun premio	Contemporary	5.0	€€	t	f	A particularly attractive restaurant occupying an old barn. In the dining room, with its high ceilings and rustic - modern ambience, discover contemporary cooking with a creative flair.	reinhardtgabriela	\N	\N
