3336225557	Le Sable	Zandoerle 5	Netherlands	Veldhoven	Car park,Terrace	https://restaurantlesable.nl	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	f	This old farmhouse radiates all the charm of the peaceful hamlet of Zandoerle – diners will particularly enjoy the welcome given by the ducks. Inside, the hushed and intimate ambience combines rusticity with modern elegance. They may be young, but chef Chiel and maître d' Laura bring a wealth of talent and experience to the table, delivering cuisine that reflects their youthful enthusiasm. Although he draws primarily on French cuisine tradition, the chef likes to add his own twist, serving dishes in a series of small plates. Think candied lamb, alongside a lamb shoulder stew (with a wonderfully intense jus!) and a medium-rare rack of lamb. The palpable sense of ambition at Le Sable makes it all the more appealing.	novakmonica	\N	\N
3333409161	Valuas	St. Urbanusweg 11	Netherlands	Venlo	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.valuas-hr.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	3.0	€€€	f	t	The stunning view of the Maas River from the terrace here is something you won't soon forget. The same goes for the warm welcome you will receive and the genuine hospitality that is so characteristic of the Limburg region. At this restaurant, they aim to please, as you will see from Eric Swaghoven's extensive menu. The range of delectable options includes a rich North Sea crab remoulade with textures of potato and an exquisite shrimp bisque, a guinea fowl and rabbit paté en croûte, mackerel sashimi, as well as a Mediterranean-style risotto. The experienced chef's versatility shines through, and the value for money is exceptional. Oenophiles will delight in the extraordinarily extensive wine list.	palmieridaniel	\N	\N
3336931333	De Beejekurf	Paterslaan 15	Netherlands	Venray	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.debeejekurf.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	t	t	De Beejekurf manages to blend a cosy, inviting atmosphere with sophisticated elegance. Hostess Hanneke's warm welcome and attentive service make dinners feel at ease right away. Chef Mathijs Jacobs allows his local suppliers to dictate what goes into his set menu. His creativity knows no bounds, yet his dishes, although made with an eye for detail, are remarkably straightforward. For example, he transforms poached veal tenderloin with its exquisite jus and sweetbreads into an interesting concoction with aubergine, a hollandaise sauce espuma, potato mousseline and truffle. This is cuisine that packs a punch!	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3334581649	Robuust	Kerkplein 12	Netherlands	Vollenhove	Terrace	https://robuustvollenhove.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	5.0	€€	t	f	This warm and welcoming restaurant is run by two larger-than-life brothers: chef Raimon and maître d' Peter Ian. You can look forward to dishes brimming with distinctive flavours, as in the finely spiced beurre blanc that lends a touch of indulgence to a perfectly fried slice of cod. Such culinary excellence characterises their classic fare as well as the more creative set menu. Be sure to ask your expert host for his beer recommendations – he has some real gems up his sleeve!	morettipaolo	\N	\N
