3336206272	Comunale Caffè e Cucina	Karađorđeva 2-4	Serbia	Belgrade	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://comunale.rs/	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	€	t	f	When the sun shines head for this super riverside spot in the shadow of Belgrade Fortress. It’s one of several whitewashed former customs warehouses with open terraces – but this one is owned by an architect, so inside it’s sleek and stylish. The classic Italian cuisine served here features traditional recipes such as tagliatelle al ragù, bruschetta, tiramisu and a few pizzas. Impressive choice of liqueurs and spirits, in particular gin, and good selection of cocktails and mocktails.	barbierisalvatore	\N	\N
