3338304105	Rempapa	Park Place Residences at PLQ	Singapore	Singapore	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://rempapa.sg/	Nessun premio	Singaporean	5.0	$$	f	t	In a smart, casual room with tan banquettes, powder blue chairs and terrazzo tiled floor, Damian D’Silva, a respected judge from the Singaporean edition of a popular cooking show, champions a novel cuisine that crosses boundaries among Chinese, Peranakan, Eurasian, Indian and Malay cooking. Hearty dishes sit comfortably next to century-old recipes, all prepared with shrewd judgment, and the right amount of oomph. Baca Assam (beef cheek) is unmissable.	popafarah	\N	\N
