3338004721	Budnamujip	434 Hyoryeong-ro	South Korea	Seoul	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking	https://www.budnamujip.com/	Nessun premio	Barbecue	4.0	₩₩	t	t	Since 1977, this family-style restaurant has garnered an appreciative following of barbecue lovers, often seeing three generations of loyal patrons from one family frequenting the shop. A popular locality for residents south of the river, it specializes in various cuts of meat exclusively from the cow including ribs, sirloin and tripe. The rich flavors of the exceptionally tender meat is enhanced simply with quality bay salt.	vecchimirko	\N	\N
3335357009	Byeokje Galbi	1-4 Yangjae-daero 71-gil	South Korea	Seoul	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking	https://www.bjgalbi.com/	Nessun premio	Barbecue	3.0	₩₩₩	t	f	Byeokje Galbi is a local institution that has been serving legendary barbecued beef short ribs since 1986. The restaurant’s attention to quality begins from the breeding of the cows at a local farm in Pocheon. Only the top 1% (BMS No9) are purchased, whole, at a daily auction, after which they are handled by an artisan butcher. The signature dishes are the beautifully marbled short ribs and ribeye grilled over charcoal. From a simple meal of cold buckwheat noodles and soup to an elaborate barbecue feast, Byeokje Galbi caters to all occasions.	testagabriel	\N	\N
3331878900	Gom Ba Wie	10 Yeongdong-daero 115-gil	South Korea	Seoul	Valet parking	https://www.gbw.co.kr/	Nessun premio	Barbecue	3.0	₩₩	f	t	Grilled tripe and large intestines reign supreme at Gom Ba Wie, which has seen three decades of customers hooked on their buttery, pleasantly chewy goodness. The original location and the new location stand back to back, offering a glimpse of the restaurant’s past and present. If beef intestines aren't your cup of tea, the restaurant also offers other cuts like ribeye, short ribs and brisket. All meats are grilled over wood charcoal.	vecchiatomichael	\N	\N
