3331722512	Gresca	Provença 230	Spain	Barcelona	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://www.gresca.rest/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	A reference for foodies, Gresca features an open kitchen that enables the bar area to be connected to the dining room. The cuisine here is based around delicious small plates with a contemporary feel.	volkovnatalie	\N	\N
3332460639	Nectari	València 28	Spain	Barcelona	Air conditioning	https://nectari.es/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€€	t	t	Chef Jordi Esteve endows his innovative cuisine with the exquisite nuances that locally sourced ingredients (he works closely with small-scale producers) bring to his dishes. The tasty cooking on offer in this centrally located restaurant with a distinct “barrio” feel is always focused on the seasons and is best represented on his tasting menu, where you’ll find courses such as foie and eel and the superb seafood “bisque” with prawn tartare.	romaniriccardo	\N	\N
3333960078	Ten's	Avenida Marqués de l'Argentera 11	Spain	Barcelona	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://tensbarcelona.com	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	A minimalist gastro-bar overseen by famous chef Jordi Cruz. The focus here is on individual tapas that include different types of oysters (“natural”, with Bloody Mary, gazpachuelo etc), an impressive array of “raciones” designed for sharing, elaborate desserts, plus a tapas tasting menu entitled Ten's that is only served to the whole table and is the perfect option to get a true insight into the cuisine here. One dish that bowled us over was the Japanese-style tiradito with cured gilthead bream, gazpachuelo, grapes, kumquat and seaweed.	tohnjohn	\N	\N
