3335611943	El Motel	Avenida Salvador Dalí 170	Spain	Figueres	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	http://www.elmotelrestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	A family-run restaurant with lots of history that first opened its doors in 1961^ as a result, both the classic decor and the service seem as though they are from a different era. The à la carte featuring a mix of traditional Catalan and international dishes is complemented by a menu (“Sabores de temporada”) that focuses on seasonal flavours. Don’t miss the cheese trolley!	huberflorin	\N	\N
