3338801771	Hostería de los Palmeros	Plaza San Telmo 4	Spain	Frómista	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.hosteriadelospalmeros.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	The extensive local and regional menu here is particularly strong on game dishes (woodcock, wood pigeon, teal etc) and locally grown vegetables (Saldaña beans, “menestra palentina” stew).	caprinivaleria	\N	\N
3330650023	Los Marinos José	Paseo Marítimo Rey de España 161	Spain	Fuengirola	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.losmarinosjose.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	€€€	f	t	Everyone is familiar with or has heard of Los Marinos José, an icon of maritime-inspired dining along the Playa de Carvajal on the Costa del Sol. Completely renovated in a modern, elegant style, it now features a kitchen open to the dining room, its always incredible display cabinets (its fish and seafood are striking for their exquisite quality) and a semi-glass-enclosed terrace. Everything is delicious here, but if we had to make a recommendation we would suggest the shrimp from Motril, the langoustine from Huelva, and the famous red prawns. Much of the catch is from the restaurant’s own boats!	bernasconikarl	\N	\N
3335641407	Charolais	Larga 14	Spain	Fuengirola	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.bodegacharolais.com	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€€	t	f	Located in the centre of Fuengirola, but just a few metres from the beach, Charolais is a restaurant serving traditional cuisine with a nod to the Basque country on a menu featuring tapas, “raciones” and dishes for sharing. In fact, you’ll find two adjoining and interconnecting restaurants (Charolais and Charolais Tapas) here, as well as a pleasant terrace. Standout options include the Huelva shrimp “al ajillo”, the tartare of avocado and Carabinero prawns, as well any of its meat or fish dishes.	bernasconikarl	\N	\N
3337142105	Alameda	Plaza Félix Azpilicueta 1	Spain	Fuenmayor	Air conditioning	https://www.restaurantealameda.com/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	This family - run restaurant is a respected name in the business thanks to the high quality of its ingredients. Highlights are the dishes cooked on the charcoal grill.	carlinikita	\N	\N
3334351371	El Visco	Carretera A-1414	Spain	Fuentespalda	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://torredelvisco.com/restaurant/?lang=es	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	Part of the La Torre del Visco hotel and accessed via a winding road, this restaurant offers the perfect experience for those keen to get away from it all thanks to its remote setting in the heart of nature (sightings of deer and wild boar are frequent here), surrounded by its own organic gardens. Its two contemporary-style menus are focused on the local area, sustainability and, first and foremost, the seasons of the surrounding ecosystem (they describe their cooking here as zero-“metres” rather than kilometres): one vegetarian menu entitled Vía Verde (the vegetables, herbs and fruits they use are accompanied by flowers and wild plants foraged every day)^ and a second more traditional option called “Create your own menu”, featuring meat from the Matarraña area and fish from the auction at nearby l'Ampolla. For a completely immersive full-day experience, make sure you visit “La Despensa de Esteve” farm, where growers explain the work they are doing in person.	monticristian	\N	\N
3337785859	Es Arraïtzes	Plaza Major 7	Spain	Garos	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.esarraitzes.com/	Nessun premio	Peruvian, Fusion	4.0	€€	f	t	This restaurant, which takes its name from the local Aranese word for “roots”, serves fusion cuisine featuring a mix of Peruvian, Aranese and Catalan flavours. The tasting menu is only available if pre-ordered.	schmittelisa	\N	\N
