3332654953	Gran Azul	Avenida Aragón 12	Spain	Valencia	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://granazulrestaurante.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	A spacious and modern restaurant that successfully focuses on rice and grilled dishes as highlighted by its own motto. Here, fish sourced directly from the market and top-quality beef take centre stage.	caputostefan	\N	\N
