3338563069	La Sitterie	Route du Rawyl 41	Switzerland	Sion	Terrace	https://www.lasitterie.ch/	Nessun premio	Creative	5.0	€€	f	f	Here you can tuck into appealing French-Mediterranean cuisine with plenty of creative touches, spices and aromatic herbs. There are several risottos, but also a tomato tartlet with serac ice cream^ crumbled Appenzell duck leg confit with savory^ iced vacherin with red berries. Quality ingredients, good workmanship and a delightful landscaped garden terrace.	raduionela	\N	\N
