3332356371	Rechberg 1837	Chorgasse 20	Switzerland	Zurich	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://rechberg1837.com/	Nessun premio	Innovative, Swiss	4.0	€€€	f	f	The Rechberg 1837 is a pleasant restaurant with a unique philosophy – it only uses regional produce that was available around 1837 (the year the house was built), i. e. before industrialisation. Innovative dishes such as slices of country pork on pea puree with fried barley and pickled onion are served in the evening, with a more traditional selection available at lunchtime. Cosy atmosphere and charming service.	impeiluca	\N	\N
3330897335	Baur's	Talstrasse 1	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning	http://www.bauraulac.ch	Nessun premio	International, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	f	The chic, rather imposing deluxe brasserie of the famous Baur au Lac hotel does full justice to the top-notch spirit of gastronomy with which the grand hotel is synonymous. It serves international cuisine firmly rooted in the classics and made with excellent ingredients. The wine list is compiled by one of the best sommeliers in the world.	fabbromikhail	\N	\N
3336130852	Haus zum Rüden	Limmatquai 42	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.haus-zum-rueden.ch/	Nessun premio	International, Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	This beautiful guild house on the Münsterbrücke bridge, only a stone’s throw from the town hall, dates back to 1348, as does the unique 11m-wide wooden barrel-vaulted ceiling in the Gothic Room. Dishes are based on seasonal ingredients and include classics such as Zurich-style veal and mushroom ragout in a cream sauce. Less expensive menu at lunchtime, plus a selection of dishes available in the modern bar with a terrace.	smirnovjessica	\N	\N
3335670770	Jhol	7/2 Soi Sukhumvit 18	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.jholrestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Indian	4.0	฿฿฿	f	t	Indian-born, New York-based restaurateur Hari Nayak creates South Indian coastal cuisine rooted in his youth and transformed by his years of experience in world-class fine dining establishments^ particularly representative is the delicious avocado mousse-filled Panipuri with passionfruit sauce. Meanwhile, the dining room balances vintage refinement with contemporary elegance and the beautiful Indian- and Thai-influenced cocktails are just as inspired.	ferraroedoardo	\N	\N
3336535434	La Popote	Church Farm	United Kingdom	Marton	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.la-popote.co.uk	Nessun premio	Classic French	4.0	£££	f	f	A characterful converted barn with brick floors, exposed beams and linen cloths, which add a brasserie deluxe feel. The chef-owner spent several years working in Paris, and this is evident in the cooking, which incorporates classic French techniques while displaying a subtle modernity in its presentation. Service is friendly and assured.	ruggieripablo	\N	\N
3337163457	Ornellaia	St. Annagasse 2	Switzerland	Zurich		https://www.ristorante-ornellaia.ch/de	Nessun premio	Italian	4.0	€€	f	f	Modern-inspired Italian dishes, such as carne cruda, filetto di vitello Rossini and ravioli carbonara, are prepared in kitchens that are visible from the dining area. The appealing wine list includes a selection from the famous Tuscan wine-growing estate, Ornellaia – from which the restaurant takes its name. You are waited on by a friendly team assembled around host Antonio Bordone, who puts his heart and soul into serving you. This gem of a restaurant is located in a beautifully refurbished building that was once a bank – the door even opens automatically. Sleek design meets historical-looking sandstone walls and decorative art, lending the distinctive high-ceilinged space a modern and elegant Tuscan ambience. At lunchtime there is a small selection of additional dishes.	tudoroh	\N	\N
3333469297	Accademia del Gusto	Rotwandstrasse 48	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.accademiadelgusto.ch/	Nessun premio	Italian, Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€€	t	t	This restaurant is a smash hit with its many regulars, which is hardly surprising considering the terrific food and lively and buzzing atmosphere. Over time, various dishes have achieved classic status. While Stefano Piscopo conjures up delectable creations such as home-made pasta (eg veal ravioli with sage butter) or marinated tuna tartare, his charming wife presides front-of-house. The handful of tables on the pavement tend to get snapped up quickly.	predapriamo	\N	\N
3338370124	Stapferstube da Rizzo	Culmannstrasse 45	Switzerland	Zurich	Car park,Terrace	https://www.stapferstube.com/	Nessun premio	Italian, Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	Here at Stapferstube, a well-known Zurich eatery, Italian dishes such as tris di pasta della casa, gamberoni aglio olio peperoncino, and brasato di manzo al Barolo are a hit with diners. In this vibrant and welcoming restaurant, regulars and first-time guests alike are treated to Mediterranean hospitality and a cosy atmosphere. Their quick lunch at a reasonable price is also popular.	cartasilvia	\N	\N
3337101038	Sala of Tokyo	Schützengasse 5	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.sala-of-tokyo.ch/	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	€€€€	f	f	Classic Japanese cuisine made from top-notch ingredients is the name of the game here. The sushi and sashimi, tempura, and robata grill specialities, as well as the sukiyaki and shabu shabu stews all come highly recommended. Another draw of this place is its inviting interior, which is sleek and simple, yet cosy at the same time. You can watch the sushi master at work at a small counter.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
3333331129	Mikuriya	Kurhausstrasse 65	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Car park	https://www.thedoldergrand.com/mikuriya/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary	4.0	€€€€	f	t	A one-of-a-kind experience awaits in the intimate Japanese restaurant of the venerable, art-filled luxury hotel The Dolder Grand. Upon arrival, diners are received at the hotel's front desk and escorted to a converted suite. The interior design is minimalist and elegant, and the setting has an intimate feel. Up to eight guests can sit at the counter and watch as chef Atsushi Hiraoka prepares the numerous courses of his omakase menu right before their eyes. Some of the ingredients used are locally sourced. Sake makes for the perfect accompaniment. Service begins at 7pm.	egorovzoe	\N	\N
3332823766	AURA	Bleicherweg 5	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.aura-zurich.ch/	Nessun premio	Meats and Grills, Grills	3.0	€€€	f	f	A stylishly urban restaurant, a top-flight events venue, a lounge or a club? AURA is a little bit of each, but above all the place to be for lovers of modern crossover cuisine with a weakness for grilled food – just watch the chefs at work! Located near Paradeplatz in the old stock exchange building.	gavrilovnora	\N	\N
3330667123	Heugümper	Waaggasse 4	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.restaurantheuguemper.ch/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€€	f	f	This venerable townhouse enjoys a fantastic location in the heart of Zurich – the small terrace is a lovely spot in the summer. With its elegant contemporary decor, the interior is also inviting, and the charming hostess provides attentive service. Prepared using select ingredients, the dishes draw on Mediterranean and Asian influences. Options on the menu range from veal cordon bleu with truffle Brie to tuna with sesame and a ginger and mango sauce. Shorter, simpler menu at lunchtime.	beckerradu	\N	\N
3338710829	La Muña	Utoquai 45	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.lareserve-zurich.com/de/	Nessun premio	Peruvian, Japanese Contemporary	4.0	€€€	t	f	Do you fancy Peruvian-Japanese cuisine? This restaurant on the sixth floor of hotel La Réserve Eden au Lac, on the shores of Lake Zurich, serves interesting and unfussy dishes made from top-notch ingredients. Up here you can dine in a cosy atmosphere beneath the exposed roof beams or out on the fantastic rooftop terrace – the view over the lake and the old town is magnificent! Exclusive wine list.	tarasovangela	\N	\N
3336829245	Bianchi	Limmatquai 82	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.bindella.ch/gastronomie/bianchi	Nessun premio	Seafood, Italian	3.0	€€€	t	t	A slice of la dolce vita! Located right by the Limmat River, this ristorante boasts a bright and modern interior where excellent service comes courtesy of a cheerful and adept front-of-house team. Made with top-notch produce, the Mediterranean-style fish and seafood dishes here are in high demand. Gorgeous little terrace.	nerielijah	\N	\N
3335563252	Brasserie Süd	Bahnhofplatz 15	Switzerland	Zurich	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://brasserie-sued.ch/	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, International	3.0	€€	f	t	This place has the potential to become a mecca for foodies! Located directly in the main railway station building, this restaurant is ideal for a meal when you are waiting for a connecting train, but it also attracts business people and locals. Within an attractive historical setting (notably the high ceiling and large arched windows), diners can immerse themselves in a vibrant brasserie atmosphere, or head to the outdoor terrace overlooking Bahnhofstrasse. The cuisine is seasonal and international, and there are daily specials. Complementing the menu is an intriguing wine list highlighting French and Swiss labels and featuring a well-curated selection of wines by the glass. Adept and well-organised service. Tip: Bouillabaisse is served every Friday^ brunch at weekends. For top-notch cocktails, head to Da Capo Bar.	pingliu	\N	\N
3331240238	White Elephant	Neumühlequai 42	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.whiteelephant.ch/	Nessun premio	Thai	5.0	€€	f	f	This restaurant in the Marriott Hotel is a must for fans of authentic Thai cuisine. Made with market fresh produce, the food is authentic and authentically spicy! Whatever you do, don’t miss the curries.	leonoscar	\N	\N
3331404909	Kronenhalle	Rämistrasse 4	Switzerland	Zurich	Air conditioning	https://kronenhalle.com/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€€	f	t	This building, constructed in 1862, is a Zurich institution, and is located on Bellevue Square. Be sure to take a look at the art collection put together over a period of decades. The atmosphere is traditional, as is the cooking.	georgesculalla	\N	\N
3339455701	Marktküche	Feldstrasse 98	Switzerland	Zurich	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.marktkueche.ch/	Nessun premio	Vegan, Seasonal Cuisine	3.0	€€€	f	t	One tip at the outset: be sure to reserve in good time – this restaurant always gets booked up, so it's hard to get a table! The clue is in the name: the cuisine takes its cue from what the market has to offer, dispensing with meat and fish. Diners can look forward to a vegetarian surprise menu made up of four to eight courses. There is also a lunch menu available on the penultimate Friday of every month.	costasergio	\N	\N
3334018101	J Parc	1 Dexing Street	Taiwan	Kaohsiung	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Creative	4.0	$$$	t	f	After formal training in the US, the chef-owner launched J Parc in 2023. His 10-course prix-fixe aligns with the seasons, presenting audacious creations that celebrate local vegetables and Japanese seafood, underpinned by French, Italian and American techniques. Mildly sweet bread made with chestnut flour is a nod to the harvest season. Ask for counter seats for up-close views of the chef at work in the semi-open kitchen.	d'angelonino	\N	\N
