3333063855	FRASSI	299 Lequn 3rd Road	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Interesting wine list	https://www.frassi.com.tw	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	$$$$	f	f	Tuscan chef Frassi has styled his restaurant to remind diners of his roots (Leaning Tower of Pisa, church ceiling dome and Romanesque colonnade). The counter seats offer front row views of a kitchen in constant motion^ the private rooms are perfect for intimate occasions. This place opens for dinner only, serving one tasting menu. Signatures such as spaghetti with blood clams and bottarga meld Italian traditions with local flavours.	horvathmaria	\N	\N
3333425879	Tutto Bello	15	Taiwan	Taipei	Interesting wine list,Valet parking	https://www.tuttobello.com.tw	Nessun premio	Italian Contemporary	4.0	$$$$	t	f	A smart Italian restaurant where the owner and his team strive to ensure that “everything is perfect”. The cuisine is firmly based upon classic dishes but is interpreted by the talented chef in a light, modern style. Well-presented dishes show care, quality ingredients and well-judged subtlety, especially with their flavours^ the homemade pasta is a highlight. A substantial wine list includes some impressive French and Italian producers.	sannamateo	\N	\N
3337726257	Dasuke	375-2 Siwei Road	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Notable sake list	https://tw.sakemaru.me/pages/dasuke	Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	$$$	t	f	The dining room features two areas – counter seats for diners ordering à la carte, and itamae for the omakase menu. The chef hailing from Niigata, Japan reinterprets flavours of his home prefecture using first-rate local ingredients, such as taro and root vegetables in a flavourful stew, known as noppe. His signature Dasu burger is only available on the omakase menu^ the ingredients of the deep-fried patty change often.	gavrilovnora	\N	\N
3334891824	Kohaku	15	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Japanese	5.0	$$$$	f	f	The serene Japanese garden is matched by the minimalist wood-clad room and exquisite tableware. Celebrating a career that spans over 20 years, the Japanese chef serves a single season-driven tasting menu dominated by the freshest catch from Kyushu, Japan. Seasoning is intentionally light-handed and nuanced for diners to appreciate the natural flavours. The soy-free seared sesame tofu appetiser is heavenly. The sake list is short but sweet.	costantinitomas	\N	\N
3335537242	Shi	39-1	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.shikappou.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	$$$$	f	t	The miniature Japanese garden at the entrance aptly sets the mood for a cosy, tranquil dining experience. The two head chefs prepare dishes in the kappo tradition, with occasional sushi courses and some minor adjustments to cater to the Taiwanese palate. Most of the ingredients are sourced in Japan, but super fresh seafood from Taiwan’s northeastern coast also makes it to the dining table. The menu changes daily depending on the availability of top-notch ingredients.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
3339528070	Tsuki Yo Iwa	9	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://tsukiyoiwa.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	$$$$	t	t	Taiwan’s first crab-themed kaiseki restaurant ships live matsuba and taraba crabs from Japan every week. Kegani crabs and puffer fish are also offered when in season. Four set menus showcase the crustaceans in all their glory using different preparations and techniques. Even the claypot rice is nothing short of stunning. Ask for counter seats to be close to the action or a room for more privacy. Book at least one week ahead.	fioreerik	\N	\N
3337718815	Uke	37	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Japanese	5.0	$$$$	f	f	The understated room behind a Zen garden is tucked deep in a residential area. Behind the 600-year-old solid fir counter, Chef Uke – with over 20 years of experience – marries fish from Kyushu, Tokyo and Hokkaido with sushi rice dressed in white or red vinegar according to their taste profiles. If you let him know prior to your visit, he can serve more sushi and sashimi instead of cooked Kappo dishes, or you can pay extra for an all-sushi meal.	rossettijonas	\N	\N
3338582279	Uosho	24	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning	https://unagiuosho.co.jp	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	$$	f	f	Uosho was founded in Japan’s Saitama Prefecture in 1883. This restaurant is the century-old unagi-ya’s only outpost outside of Japan. The room juxtaposes light and dark woods with neutrals in a modern Japanese style. The signature una-jyu uses Taiwanese eel that is steamed before grilling to order à la Kanto style, and served in a lacquered box over a bed of rice, drizzled with a sweet-savoury glaze. Try also the fluffy unagi tamagoyaki while you wait.	moldovanmelly	\N	\N
3333562559	Wamaki	22	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	$$$	t	f	The head chef of Amis descent hailing from Taitung has over 20 years of experience in Japanese cuisine. At Wamaki, he creates kappo dishes over charcoal fire, using mostly Taiwanese produce and native herbs such as prickly ash seeds and Maqaw pepper. The chef even travels to his hometown on weekends to pick his own herbs. For lunch and dinner, there is only one set menu, but the chef can tailor the menu for you with advance notice.	grafpaola	\N	\N
3331101801	Aleisha	16	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning	https://www.aleisha.tw	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	$$$	f	f	The Argentinian-Irish owner-chef Nico Gellon crafts a new take on pan-Mediterranean cuisine with eclectic influences. The tasting menu, cooked in purebred Italian or French style and seasoned with Middle Eastern spices, alongside Greek staples such as olives and eggplant. The dishes satisfy both the eye and the tastebud. Choose the counter seats to stay close to the action or book a room for more privacy.	hatajfiorello	\N	\N
3333572434	Komboi	28	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	5.0	$$$	t	t	Komboi is the homophone of the Taiwanese phrase for ‘empty plates’, as the chef hopes his guests enjoy their meals down to the last bite. Modern dishes embody his novel ideas, finessed by techniques acquired when travelling in France. While a shorter set menu is offered at lunch, we recommend the unabridged ‘experience’ menu to best appreciate his vision. The minimalist room boasts warm hues, dark wood furniture and ribbed glass pendant lamps.	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
3334048902	Orchid	83	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Wheelchair access	https://www.orchid-restaurant.com.tw	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	$$$$	f	t	Perfect for a date, this restaurant has gold chain curtains hanging mid-air, theatrically lit against a dark ceiling. The young Japanese chef has worked and travelled extensively in Japan, Australia, Singapore and Taiwan, gaining culinary insights along the way. His season-driven menu sees eclectic influences through a global lens, providing diners with a choice of three mains. The meticulously plated food has a distinctly modern look.	ferraririccardo	\N	\N
3332870485	Muji Beef Noodles	239 Wuxing Street	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Noodles	5.0	$	t	f	The three sisters who run the place are very specific about their cooking. The flavoursome broth is made with beef bones and meat, Chinese herbs, scallion, garlic and a secret fruit that lends a subtle sweetness. The signature beef noodle soup uses only local beef for its unrivalled meaty flavour. Equally addictive is their jinbing – a fluffy pancake made to order with beef or pork wrapped inside. Don’t miss their marinated food either.	novotnycecilia	\N	\N
3339716877	Really Good Seafood	222	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	http://www.reallygoodseafood.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	$$$$	t	f	As its name suggests, seafood is big on the menu – and it’s good! Diners can pick from the live fish tanks and the staff is more than happy to recommend cooking methods. Salt-baked virgin mud crab, salad of bamboo shoots and bottarga from wild-caught mullet are among the highlights. Solo diners are also pampered – a number of menus for one lets them sample an array of specialities. Its convenient location next to a metro station is a further bonus.	palombogiada	\N	\N
3335411847	Tajimaya Shabu Shabu	5F	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Shabu-shabu	5.0	$$$	f	f	The owner believes hot pot dinner is the perfect occasion for diners to chat and have a good time. That’s why the servers here cook the food for them so that they won’t be distracted from their conversations. Apart from local seafood and veggies, he also imports wagyu and Tajima beef directly from Japan to ensure the quality. If you feel like splurging a little, order a whole fish or a Filipino lobster to share.	landirobert	\N	\N
3339791617	Gi Yuan	324	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Sichuan	5.0	$$	f	f	Regulars come for the signature chicken soup casserole – it takes 10 hours to make the milky rich chicken stock before free-range chicken, ham, dried scallops and pork trotters are added and cooked for two more hours. Other famed Sichuan dishes are also on the menu, such as dry-fried French beans and Kungpao chicken. Some dishes can be customised with condiments of your choice. It’s always busy so early reservations are recommended.	dinusauru	\N	\N
3334523191	Shih Chia Big Rice Ball	58	Taiwan	Taipei	Cash only		Nessun premio	Small eats	4.0	$	f	f	Founded in the 1960s, Shih Chia is synonymous with savoury glutinous rice balls with juicy pork and vegetable filling in Miaoli Hakkanese style. The second-generation owner strictly follows his mother's recipe and uses only year-old, round-grain sticky rice to make the toothsome elastic dough^ the broth seduces with the umami of bonito flakes and the tangy depth of preserved cabbage. There are also snacks from Fujian and other Chinese provinces.	pellegriniloren	\N	\N
3336766542	Su Lai Chuan	4	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Small eats	4.0	$	f	t	Famous for ba-wan and taro cake, this institution celebrated its 70th anniversary with a facelift in 2024. The third-generation owner still makes ba-wan like his grandparents did – freshly ground rice milk is poured into a bowl before a filling of pork shin, shiitake, chestnut and bamboo shoot is added. The steamed dumpling is then poached in oil, and drizzled with a sweet bean paste and miso sauce. Add garlic purée or home-made chilli sauce for an extra kick.	serrakevin	\N	\N
3338144210	Chope Chope Eatery	4F	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Terrace,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	South East Asian	3.0	$$$	t	t	While ‘chope’ means to reserve a seat by putting a tissue pack on it in ‘Singlish’, you can call to book a table here. The Singaporean chef helming JL Studio in Taichung opened this Kopitiam concept to celebrate casual Singaporean dining. Try har cheong gai (fried wings in fermented shrimp sauce), kopi pai kut (coffee ribs) and house-made murtabak bread. Asian-inspired cocktails such as Tan herbal tea in a plastic bag are both fun and delicious.	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3332090167	Jarana	8	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Spanish	4.0	$$$	t	f	Nestled in serene grounds near Songshan Cultural and Creative Park, this bustling joint is the brainchild of a Madrilenian chef. The small menu is heavy on Spanish classics, encompassing the essence of the cuisine and the chef’s experience spanning over two decades. Try oreja a la plancha, and fideuà with foie gras. The chef can tailor a paella or fideuà to your liking if you pre-order a week ahead. Round it out with his signature 5-cheese cheesecake.	raduionela	\N	\N
3333813524	Fresh & Aged	2F	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Wheelchair access	https://www.mayfull.com.tw/	Nessun premio	Steakhouse	4.0	$$$$	f	t	Owned by the largest meat importer in Taiwan, Fresh & Aged specialises in premium beef cuts from Nebraska, U.S.A, typically dry-aged for 28 days in a custom-made chamber. Diners can even pre-order steaks dry-aged up to 128 days. Non-beef choices are also ample and include Cherry Valley duck breast and SRF Kurobuta pork dry-aged for 21 days. The annexed supermarket selling a smorgasbord of raw meats is worth checking out. Pre-ordering is recommended.	demurtasarianna	\N	\N
3336247021	N°168 Prime Steakhouse (Zhongshan)	4F	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://grandvictoria.com.tw/en/dining/n168-prime-steakhousedazhi/	Nessun premio	Steakhouse	5.0	$$$$	t	f	The dining room boasts an ultramarine colour scheme dotted by oak logs and panels. Top-quality U.S. Kobe ribeye, Australian grade 9+ and Japanese Miyazaki A5 Wagyu are grilled to perfection in an oak wood-fired oven imbuing steaks with a lovely smokiness. The set menu with starter, soup, main and dessert represents good value. Service is smooth, prompt and friendly and the open kitchen keeps your eyes entertained.	bernasconikarl	\N	\N
3339695825	Mochi Baby	111 Raohe Street	Taiwan	Taipei	Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	5.0	$	t	t	The transparent case houses gooey mochi – they’re freshly made every day and have a strong sticky rice fragrance.	marianiadrian	\N	\N
3331749145	Shan Nay Chicken	Nanjichang Night Market	Taiwan	Taipei	Cash only		Nessun premio	Street Food	3.0	$	f	t	Good-value steamed chicken is feted for its springy skin and juicy flesh. Come before 8 pm for chicken legs.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
3338643311	Sasa	6	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Sushi	5.0	$$$$	f	f	The owner gave serious thought to every detail in this renovated shop. Most of the fish is flown straight from Tokyo’s Toyosu market and aged for different periods of time to enhance taste and texture. Tuna belly is smoked with cherry wood^ salmon roe is removed from skeins and cured in-house^ and rare and highly prized catches such as tuna from Oma and Tenjyo amberjack are also sourced. Only omakase menus are served.	testagabriel	\N	\N
3337708395	Sushi Masuda	5F	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.thearcade.com.tw/brand_floor.php?floor=5&id=131	Nessun premio	Sushi	5.0	$$$$	f	f	Mosaic tiles, mirrors and a chandelier with hundreds of floating glass balls make this dining room hipper than most sushi spots. This joint venture by its Tokyo namesake and the Arcade is helmed by Chef Kosugi and supervised by Chef Masuda, the head chef at the Tokyo flagship who also sources ingredients for this outpost, mostly from Toyosu Market. Don’t miss the maguro from Aomori prefecture with its silky texture and lovely sheen. Omakase only.	ricciardisimone	\N	\N
3334063516	Sushi Nanami	6	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Sushi	4.0	$$$$	f	f	This place feels like a secluded Japanese home – the kimono-clad hostess walks you through the garden to the dining room with 12 seats at a cypress counter. The Japanese chef serves an omakase menu that draws on both tradition and innovation with dishes such as octopus with house-made ricotta. The sashimi shows intricate knife skills and the sushi rice is dressed in a special vinegar blend. The panna cotta with honey rounds off the meal nicely.	magnanipavel	\N	\N
3330984145	Sushi Nomura	4	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Sushi	3.0	$$$$	f	t	Renovated in 2023, the room now features clean, simple lines and muted hues. Chef Nomura, who moved to Taiwan years ago, still serves several set menus, with Edomae sushi being the main event. A mix of Koshihikari and Nanatsuboshi rice is cooked in Mount Fuji spring water and dressed in a blend of akazu and regular sushi vinegar. To sample a greater variety of sashimi, opt for the menus at higher prices.	fabbromikhail	\N	\N
3330655128	Sushi Touryuumon	16	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Sushi	5.0	$$$	f	f	When Sushi Amamoto became off-limits for non-members, Chef Amamoto opened this offshoot in 2022 so that all food lovers could experience his culinary vision. Run by his protégés, Sushi Touryuumon uses the freshest catch mostly from Fukuoka, Japan, alongside sushi rice from Hualian, Taiwan. The chef’s signatures like crispy deep-fried eel, kombu saba nigiri, and soufflé tamagoyaki made with free-range chicken eggs are also available. Book ahead online.	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
3331218407	3927	14	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park	https://3927.com.tw/home.html	Nessun premio	Taiwanese	3.0	$$	f	t	3927 reimagines traditional Taiwanese food in a bold, modern and unconventional way. The head chef has extensive experience in Taiwanese cooking and has worked overseas. He draws on globally sourced produce and techniques from various cuisines to create new flavours that tap into diners' collective memories. The mixologists are more than happy to stir up a concoction to your liking.	benedettifilip	\N	\N
3336673904	44 SV	10	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning		Nessun premio	Taiwanese	4.0	$$	f	t	The founder used to live in Forty-Four South Village, one of Taiwan's many juan-cun – post-war villages for military families. At this cosy bistro, he cooks spruced-up, refined juan-cun classics using quality ingredients. His signature red braised pork belly is made with caramelised sugar and honey instead of soy sauce for exceptional depth. All items need to be pre-ordered two days ahead^ small à la carte menu for add-ons only.	popescumaya	\N	\N
3333616063	Cheng Jia	6	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Taiwanese	4.0	$$	f	f	After honing his skills in an establishment of classic Taiwanese cooking for over 20 years, the head chef opened his own restaurant with only three tables in an alleyway hectic with street food stalls. Taiwanese all-time favourites are given a new spin here and his chicken soups are hugely popular. Try also sautéed shrimps with scrambled eggs in lettuce wraps. Book a table on social media and discuss the menu with the owner in advance.	mancinialberto	\N	\N
3338240638	Chinese Cuisine	Grand View Resort Beitou	Taiwan	Taipei	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.gvrb.com.tw	Nessun premio	Taiwanese	5.0	$$$	t	f	Breath-taking mountain views and hot spring baths aside, the food alone is reason enough to visit this resort. The head chef has been honing his skills for over 10 years and his set menus and à la carte choices are nothing short of impressive, such as his abalone and pork tendon in a three-cup sauce steeped in deep savoury flavours. The complimentary Taiwanese tea is a nice touch. Check out the day-trip hot spring deals with meal options.	polakcristina	\N	\N
3332147455	Ms.Maria & Mr.Singh	2F	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Valet parking	https://www.mariaandsinghbkk.com	Nessun premio	Indian	4.0	฿฿฿	f	t	Inspired by a Mexican-Indian love story, two cultures combine in both gastronomy and design at this sensorily striking restaurant. Vibrant oranges and blues make for a colourful setting. The food also makes a statement, playing with spices and textures to twist conventional styles. The well-judged fusion cooking includes dishes like pork vindaloo tacos and papdi chaat served on a mini taco shell. The service team provide fabulous hospitality with their high energy and friendly manner.	ricciardisimone	\N	\N
3335047570	The Local	32 Soi Sukhumvit 23	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace		Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	฿฿	t	f	This colonial-style building provides an elegant contrast with the skyscrapers of Bangkok. Its private dining rooms ooze old world charm, while the main restaurant has thick wicker chairs and artful murals. The secret family recipes pay homage to the diversity offered by Thailand’s regions. We recommend the deep-fried seabass: deboned and served in large slices with an intense sweet and sour sauce. The assortment of desserts with homemade ice-cream makes for a refreshing finish.	lorenziarthur	\N	\N
3330148234	Punjab Grill	GF	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.punjabgrillbangkok.com	Nessun premio	Indian	3.0	฿฿฿	t	f	Like its sister restaurants in India and across the world, Bangkok’s Punjab Grill serves authentic yet contemporary Northern Indian cuisine. The menu features creative twists on dishes like chaat, which includes chutney-dressed avocado and puffed rice with yoghurt espuma. Equally flavourful are classics like biryani and tikka. Vegetarian dishes are offered à la carte and as part of tasting courses. A glass wall in the elegant dining room provides a view of the tandoor action.	hatajfiorello	\N	\N
3330678367	Canvas	113/9-10 Soi Sukhumvit 55	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.canvasbangkok.com	Nessun premio	Innovative	3.0	฿฿฿฿	f	t	Food meets art at Chef Riley Sanders' plush establishment. Every dish of the culinary journey is depicted as a painting on the menu, like an art gallery brochure. The talented Texan sources seasonal ingredients from all over Thailand and transforms them with a modern interpretation. Counter seats offer views of the chefs, while tables upstairs offer more privacy. Wine pairings are available to complete the experience.	impeiluca	\N	\N
3336069687	Gaggan	68 Soi Sukhumvit 31	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Valet parking	https://www.gaggan.com	Nessun premio	Innovative	4.0	฿฿฿฿	t	f	Sit front-row at Gaggan’s immersive 14-seater chef’s counter, an experience featuring changing light effects and a thumping soundtrack. Chef Gaggan’s bold personality shines through in the 22-course tasting menu, sharing apocryphal stories and a vibrant narrative. His progressive Indian cooking, using modern techniques and global ingredients, crafts intriguing dishes, each telling a unique story.	barbierisalvatore	\N	\N
3338253900	Small Dinner Club	1109 Charoen Krung Road	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.smalldinnerclub.com	Nessun premio	Innovative	5.0	฿฿฿฿	f	t	Set in a 2-storey house in the historic town, Small Dinner Club exudes mystery and charm. The dimly lit interior sports a striking black colour scheme. In his own words, Chef Sareen “pulls apart, questions and reimagines Thai cuisine”. Unafraid of challenging conventions, he includes savoury ingredients in sweet recipes and sweet ingredients, like seasonal fruit, in savoury dishes, resulting in intelligently crafted and artistically presented Thai food.	leonechristian	\N	\N
3335431670	Cadence by Dan Bark	225 Soi Pridi Banomyong 25	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Valet parking	https://www.cadence-danbark.com	Nessun premio	Innovative, Creative	5.0	฿฿฿฿	t	t	Drawing on his Korean-American heritage and experience in some of Chicago's top restaurants, chef Dan Bark uses a clever array of components to craft progressive American cuisine. The elegant space sets the stage for an artful marriage of Western and Asian flavours. The restaurant's commitment to excellence goes beyond the food, with an impressive wine selection, astutely curated cocktail pairings and charming service from a smartly turned-out team.	urbanalessia	\N	\N
3334049222	Eat Me	1/6 Soi Phiphat 2	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.eatmerestaurant.com	Nessun premio	International	5.0	฿฿฿	t	f	Though hidden in a side soi, Eat Me is hardly a secret. Since 1998, it has been known for carefully cooked dishes that join global influences with local flavours. The best meals here start with Thai food-inspired cocktails at the ground floor bar. They continue at the minimalist second-storey dining room or leafy balcony with the star of the menu—mixed clams served with nam, or fermented Thai sausage, and coriander lime broth—and one of the unmissable desserts.	fiorentinolukas	\N	\N
3334066606	100 Mahaseth	100 Mahaseth Road	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning	https://www.100mahaseth.com	Nessun premio	Isan	5.0	฿฿	t	t	This nose-to-tail inspired offal restaurant serves elevated Isan fare made from quality locally sourced ingredients. The chef takes great care to balance the flavours and present attractive plates. The Isan complementary set includes somtam, crispy pork skin with Thai chimichurri and chaeo sauce. The hot and sour soup with baby pork ribs and chamuang leaves has lovely acidity with a hint of shrimp paste. Check the blackboard for Thai aged steak specials.	svobodagreta	\N	\N
3338780776	Antito	14F	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view	https://www.eastinhotelsresidences.com/eastingrandsathornbangkok/dining/antito	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	฿฿฿	t	t	Located on the 14th floor of Eastin Grand Sathorn, Chef Amerigo Sesti’s restaurant-bar offers a creative take on Northern Italian classics from his childhood, complemented by stunning city views. The stylish dining room features pop art and cosy seating. Try the handmade Italian pasta or tiramisu, showcasing the chef’s flair for authentic flavours. A DJ sets the mood from Thursday to Sunday nights.	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3337758313	Clara	69 Soi Prasat Suk	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.clarabangkok.com	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	฿฿฿	t	f	Popular among both Thai and foreign foodies and housed in a Bauhaus-style villa surrounded by sculpture-filled gardens, Clara is an elegant Italian fine-dining restaurant from a seasoned Italian chef and his wife. The villa’s two-floor interior has a warm minimalist vibe. The set menu balances flavours and complex textures which are matched by the fine service. Pair with wine for a complete experience.	locatelliflorian	\N	\N
3331297855	Enoteca	39 Soi Sukhumvit 27	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Interesting wine list,Valet parking	https://www.enotecabangkok.com	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	฿฿฿	f	t	The name means ‘wine library’, so it will come as no surprise to find a list of nearly 400 bottles here, including a fine selection of Barolo. While it sits in the city’s bustling business district, this Italian restaurant is a haven of tranquillity. Floor-to-ceiling windows offer charming garden views, and the cosy, friendly atmosphere makes you feel as though you’re dining in an Italian home. All regions of Italy are represented, with ingredients flown in from Europe and used in dishes with a modern twist. Risottos are a highlight, and for the Secondi Piatti, don’t miss the Barbecue Pigeon. They also offer set menus for more variety.	farinellifarah	\N	\N
3332964893	Giglio Trattoria Fiorentina	149 Soi Sathon 12	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Counter dining,Terrace,Valet parking	https://www.gigliotrattoria.com	Nessun premio	Italian	4.0	฿฿฿	f	t	A love of tradition, simplicity and authentic flavours are the guiding principles behind this Tuscan-focused restaurant from the former chefs of Bottega di Luca and Appia. The result is their version of a quintessential trattoria, serving savoury dishes like the recommended home-made pici pasta with fresh black truffle slices and fresh cream and the dry-aged sharing steak. While there’s no on-site parking, valet parking is available^ and booking is essential.	palombasauro	\N	\N
3339886113	Lenzi Tuscan Kitchen	69/2 Soi Ruam Ruedi 2	Thailand	Bangkok	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking	https://www.lenzibangkok.com	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	฿฿฿	f	t	It’s a family affair at this authentic Tuscan restaurant, from the top-notch meats and cheeses sourced from chef Francesco Lenzi’s family farm in Pisa to his mother’s limoncello. The chef uses traditional cooking techniques from back home and often pops out of the open kitchen to greet diners like family. Start with antipasti or an iI primi like Risotto Taleggio e Tartufo and then try the flavoursome Filetto Alla Rossini. Reservations are recommended.	amicowilliam	\N	\N
