3330798451	We-La-Dee	291 Mu 9	Thailand	Chiang Mai	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	฿฿	t	t	We-La-Dee brings central Thai cuisine north in an airy industrial-style dining room marked by playful accents. The restaurant’s large collection of action figures and a floor-to-ceiling installation of artificial flowers inspire photographs. Its extensive menu, which includes some original recipes from the chef, inspire both relaxed meals with family and friends and afternoons spent sipping coffee or tea and enjoying dessert.	stepanekgrace	\N	\N
3330400956	The Redbox	6 Soi Jannsaap	Thailand	Chiang Mai	Air conditioning,Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restaurantredbox.com	Nessun premio	Thai contemporary	3.0	฿฿฿	t	t	With business acumen and cooking techniques gleaned from their travels, Chef Dan and partner Pimmada offer modern Thai with Malaysian and Brunei influences. They import select ingredients like salted eggs from Chaiya, and Gula Melaka (Malaysian palm sugar) to create treats like Siam Ruby, a signature dessert. We recommend the signature creation cocktail with a complexity of flavours before your unforgettable meal. Seating is limited so bookings are essential.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3333944532	Aeeen	4/13 Mu 5	Thailand	Chiang Mai	Car park,Cash only	https://www.neoshokudo.com	Nessun premio	Vegetarian	5.0	฿฿	t	f	Aeeen goes the sound of Ken’s unique laughter, according to wife Yuki. Under the concept of Neo Shojin Ryori, the Japanese couple craft their plant-based menu using seasonal ingredients. The dining areas span two floors of a cute wooden house that feels like rural Japan. Lines of jars contain the fermented ingredients they use in the food. We recommend the perfectly judged soymilk udon noodles and refreshing mango with ginger and honey drink.	zimmermannanna	\N	\N
3332178415	Indian by Nature	306 Chateau Dale Complex 64-68 Thappraya Road	Thailand	Chon Buri	Air conditioning	https://www.indian-by-nature.com	Nessun premio	Indian	5.0	฿฿	t	t	This fine dining spot delivers authentic Indian cuisine in an inviting ambiance featuring contemporary Indian paintings and decorative touches. With creative twists on North Indian staples, highlights include chicken tikka and dal makhni. Main dishes are thoughtfully served in small pots over a flame to keep them warm. For solo diners, the traditional thali sets comprise tasty samples of signature à la carte dishes.	lebedevhazel	\N	\N
