3333993197	Krua Taan	65/16 Mu 7	Thailand	Phra Nakhon Si Ayutthaya	Car park,Cash only		Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	฿฿	t	t	In this spacious, open-air pavilion, Aunty Taan serves traditional-style cooking that has won the hearts of local diners and tourists alike. Do try the prawn and herb spicy salad, which features just-right grilled prawn meat and various refreshing herbs bound together with a flavourful dressing. The fiery stir-fried minced pork cartilage is also delicious and aromatic. This is the perfect stop after visiting the nearby floating market and elephant village.	florescumelissa	\N	\N
3333308689	O	252/21 Soi Wilai Sena	Thailand	Phra Nakhon Si Ayutthaya			Nessun premio	Thai	5.0	฿฿	f	f	Set in Sena district's old market, this charming wooden house backs onto the River Noi. The relaxed atmosphere and delicious food make it a local favourite, with popular dishes like stir-fried river prawns with salt and pepper, and deep-fried fish with fish sauce.	romanosimone	\N	\N
