3337586285	Jampa	The Community House	Thailand	Phuket	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.jamparestaurant.com	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	4.0	฿฿฿	t	t	Chef Dingen’s inventive contemporary European menu embraces a philosophy of sustainability and zero waste. À la carte is available all day, but we recommend the exquisitely prepared Jampa Experience for lunch, which features complex natural flavours that change with the seasons. For a unique lakeside experience on Saturdays, Hideaway’s 4-course lunch, cooked over a wood fire, both tantalises the tastebuds and educates the diner about sustainable farming.	landirobert	\N	\N
3334789610	L'Arôme by the Sea	247/5 Phrabaramee Road	Thailand	Phuket	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list	https://www.laromegroup.com/laromebythesea	Nessun premio	French Contemporary	3.0	฿฿฿฿	f	f	Start with a refreshing cocktail and enjoy the sea breeze on the rooftop before descending to the main dining room for stunning ocean views and the 'Vue sur la Mer' tasting menu. The seafood is of high quality, but the roasted pigeon with eggplant is also a standout. Meanwhile, the creamy foie gras and langoustine showcase the chef's culinary skills.	dinusauru	\N	\N
