3336263963	The GALLIARD Vadistanbul	Ayazağa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://www.thegalliard.com	Nessun premio	International, Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	₺₺	t	f	The upscale Vadistanbul shopping mall is home to The Galliard, a restaurant that exudes contemporary elegance and boasts a spacious waterfront terrace. The extensive menu comprises international favourites including a unique take on sea bass ceviche, creamy risotto-style creations, generous pizzas, stews quietly simmering in the background… and even soufflés for dessert! Don't be put off by the sheer number of options – these chefs work to the highest standards and their skills are second to none. Those who stay later in the evening can look forward to an electrifying DJ set.	ferraroedoardo	\N	\N
3336256654	Fauna	Küçükbakkalköy Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.fauna.com.tr	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	₺₺	t	t	Lunch at Fauna is the perfect excuse to visit the Ataşehir district, just outside the city centre. You sit at long tables, often next to other diners, and watch the pasta being freshly made behind the counter. At Fauna, Italian and Turkish cuisine come together in rich, shareable dishes. Think ravioli with a hearty Karayaka lamb and walnut filling. The superb sorbet of organic strawberries, with a creamy texture and nicely tart, is just one example of the focus on local produce. Booking is strongly recommended!	romaniriccardo	\N	\N
3338190117	Akira Back İstanbul	Ataköy 2-5-6. Kısım Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.istanbulakiraback.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	5.0	₺₺₺	f	f	The view of the Sea of Marmara is the highlight of this modern and inviting restaurant located in the JW Marriott hotel. Be sure to go for a spot on the terrace! Akira Back has restaurants all over the world and has appointed one of his right-hand men as head chef in Istanbul. The dishes embody a distinctive fusion of predominantly Japanese and other Asian cuisines. Fine sushi, tasty gyoza, beef tataki that melts in the mouth, perfectly robata-grilled prawns… You will definitely want to come back for this contemporary whirlwind of Eastern flavours.	gentilenoah	\N	\N
3330782117	Itsumi	KULE - İşkuleleri Kule 2 Entrance floor No:43	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	http://www.itsumijp.com	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	₺₺	f	f	You'll have to venture out of Istanbul's city centre to find this rather simple restaurant, but you certainly won't regret making the trip. At Itsumi, authentic Japanese cuisine is expertly prepared using the finest ingredients. This is the place to be if you're in the mood for finely cut salmon sashimi, deep-fried prawns in a delicately spiced sauce, or squid and tuna sushi. You can rely on the chef to deliver the specialities of his homeland with all the necessary nuances. NB: The omakase menu has to be booked in advance.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
3336439960	Nobu İstanbul	Süzer Plaza	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.noburestaurants.com/istanbul/nobu-istanbul-japanese-restaurant-bar-and-lounge/	Nessun premio	Japanese	5.0	₺₺₺	t	t	Located in the Ritz Carlton Hotel, the Istanbul branch of the Nobu restaurant chain embraces the Eastern facets of this cosmopolitan city. Whether you choose a table on the large terrace, in the bar or in the restaurant, the setting is as hip as it is minimalist. The stunning view over the Bosporus and the Asian part of the city is quite a sight to behold. Modern Japanese and South American influences are blended here with great precision. Think sea bass cooked in a light tempura batter and served with a vinaigrette in which chopped pineapple and orange create surprising nuances. The menu is impressive, and the omakase menu aptly captures the essence of the kitchen's offerings. The selection of signature cocktails, Turkish wines, and sakes is simply delightful.	valentimatteo	\N	\N
3330712972	ROKA	Kılıçalipaşa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Notable sake list,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.rokarestaurant.com/restaurant/roka-istanbul/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary	4.0	₺₺	t	f	Are you in the mood for aubergine gently cooked in miso/soy/sesame with katsuoboshi, or would you prefer chicken given a smoky flavour on the robatayaki grill? Or how about nigiri sushi with sea bream and a crispy squid tempura? At ROKA, lovers of contemporary Japanese dishes will find a great selection to suit their tastes, accompanied by cool cocktails and fine wines. And thanks to the location on the Galataport promenade, you also get to enjoy stunning views of the Bosporus at this stylish, lively restaurant.	lazarmaya	\N	\N
3332875428	Zuma İstanbul	İstinye Park No:461	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access	https://zumarestaurant.com/locations/istanbul/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary	4.0	₺₺₺₺	t	t	The Istanbul branch of this chic Japanese restaurant is on a par with those in London and Dubai, among other places. That means top-notch ingredients showcased by a contemporary approach to authentic Japanese cuisine. On the menu: sushi, tempura dishes, fish from the robata grill, vegetarian options... High-quality produce and subtle influences from the East always hit the mark. Rest assured, the cosmopolitan Zuma feels right at home amid the most exclusive fashion boutiques.	rusnakhannah	\N	\N
3331829430	Lokanta Feriye	Yıldız Mahallesi Çırağan Caddesi No:44	Türkiye	Istanbul	Great view,Terrace	https://feriye.com/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	₺₺	f	t	Dining in the gardens of the fully refurbished Feriye Palace is a new experience each time. Here on the edge of the Bosphorus – some diners even arrive by boat – you have the ever-evolving backdrop of the constant coming and going of the ships. And there is something magical about the view of the illuminated Ortaköy Mosque and Bosphorus Bridge, especially when you have a delicious cocktail in hand. This restaurant strikes a fine balance between chic and relaxed, and the service is attentive. The chefs, who can be seen at work in the open kitchen, let the ingredients speak for themselves. Their dishes are not overly elaborate, but rather classic fare with subtle zesty and spicy nuances. They give aubergine purée a delightful tang by mixing in yoghurt, making it an excellent accompaniment to barbecued lamb.	friedrichteresa	\N	\N
3335044839	Ruby	Yıldız Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.rubyistanbul.com/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	₺₺	f	t	With stunning views over the Bosphorus, a roof that can be fully opened when the weather is fine, and a terrace that turns into a DJs' playground at weekends: Ruby is one of the hot spots in Ortaköy. The menu comprises dishes for sharing, traditional Turkish fare and a tempting range of pasta and risotto options. And whether you opt for the penne puttanesca or the grilled sea bass with spinach and orzo in a cream sauce, rest assured that your meal will be indulgent and brimming with rich flavours.	valentinicolas	\N	\N
3331730086	The Red Balloon	Yeniköy	Türkiye	Istanbul	Terrace	https://theredballoon.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	t	f	The Red Balloon is a tranquil oasis in the heart of Istanbul. The terrace is a breathtaking sight, with its contemporary design and towering trees. Chef Ulaş Durmaz sources ingredients as locally as possible to create Mediterranean dishes with a North Aegean twist. For example, he roasts squid from Babakale rendering it intensely aromatic, and he makes his mark by finishing the bold jus with fruity, crisp notes of tangerine. His creative approach and youthful enthusiasm give familiar flavours a new lease of life.	palmieridaniel	\N	\N
3334157429	Giritli	Yenigüvey Sokak No:9	Türkiye	Istanbul	Terrace	https://www.giritlirestoran.com	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Traditional Cuisine	5.0	₺₺₺	f	t	In summer, Giritli welcomes you to its atmospheric terrace, where the kitchen is also located. If the weather lets you down, you can always cross the street to the romantic Mediterranean-style sister restaurant. Be sure to explore the enticing mezze set menu (drinks included), which inventively showcases the traditional flavours of Crete. The perfectly seasoned and generously portioned dishes feature impeccably fresh produce. Think marinated sea bass with fresh herbs, or potato salad with a judicious touch of vinegar and vibrant tzatziki. A real feast!	puglieseadam	\N	\N
3339432159	Aila	Büyükdere Caddesi No:76/B	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking	https://fairmontquasaristanbul.com/restaurant/aila/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Turkish	5.0	₺₺	t	f	Aila radiates luxury and grandeur. Smooth marble, high ceilings, dark wood: the decor is a feast for the eyes. Turkey's rich cuisine is given a contemporary twist, with the focus on spices – they even have a spice library – and getting the most out of top-notch produce. This modern take on tradition should definitely be combined with a glass of raki – what a selection!	grimaldimorko	\N	\N
3336682927	Avlu Restaurant	Cankurtaran	Türkiye	Istanbul	Brunch,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking	https://www.fourseasons.com/istanbul/dining/restaurants/avlu-restaurant/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Turkish	3.0	₺₺₺	t	f	Every detail of the Four Seasons hotel in Sultanahmet exudes luxury. One of the hotel's hidden treasures is its Mediterranean-style courtyard. In this tranquil oasis, you can relax and escape the hustle and bustle. Your meal starts with some delicious bread from the wood-fired oven and continues with this fresh take on indulgent Turkish fare. The chef strikes the perfect balance between rich manti stuffed with beef, the freshness of buffalo yoghurt and the pep of spiced butter and a pulled beef marmalade. The extensive and varied selection of Anatolian delicacies is impressive!	egorovzoe	\N	\N
3330974993	The BARN	Gazitepe Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Garden or park,Terrace	https://www.grandmaswonderland.com/en/the-barn/	Nessun premio	Regional European, Turkish	4.0	₺₺₺	t	f	Leave central Istanbul behind and head to Grandma's Wonderland in the Silivri district. This establishment set in verdant surroundings has both a hotel and this cosy restaurant, as well as a farm that supplies poultry, vegetables and other ingredients. Local produce is treated with great respect and, specialising in plant-forward cooking, the kitchen team adopts a zero-waste approach. The menu features skewers, veal tongue pastrami with cherry sauce, kasseri cheese tortellini, spinach and a butter sauce with white wine and sage. The farm-to-table concept is taken seriously here. A spot on the terrace, in the company of the resident dogs, and with a glass of wine from the estate in hand, is a must!	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
3337579270	1924 İstanbul	Istiklal Caddesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.1924istanbul.com	Nessun premio	Russian, Turkish	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	The original incarnation of this restaurant was opened by Russian refugees in 1924. Today diners can relive those glory days in a beautifully restored and opulent setting that exudes historical grandeur and features eye-catching panelling and mirrors. Live music makes for a buzzing atmosphere. Here they put a modern spin on Russian specialities. Think generous portions of stuffed pirozhki and beef Stroganoff, juicy meat and amazing flavour. And to drink? A glass of vodka from their impressive selection, of course!	rossigiovanni	\N	\N
3338553166	AQUA	Yıldız	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.fourseasons.com/bosphorus/dining/restaurants/aqua/	Nessun premio	Seafood	5.0	₺₺₺₺	f	t	Everything revolves around water at the fish and seafood restaurant of the Four Seasons Hotel, which is also right on the waterfront. Not only can you enjoy a unique view of the bustling strait and Bosphorus Bridge, but this elegant restaurant also provides a romantic backdrop. Delicious seafood is showcased in typical Mediterranean fare, modern Asian creations and dishes cooked on the grill. Aromatic, subtly spiced, accompanied by rich buttery sauces: this is generous cuisine prepared using premium produce.	brunettibruno	\N	\N
3335267499	Menu Gordon Jones	2 Wellsway	United Kingdom	Bath		https://menugordonjones.co.uk	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	££££	t	f	This tiny, highly likeable restaurant has a relaxed, cheerful feel, which is a reflection of its easy-going Chef-Owner. The room is dominated by an open kitchen, where you can watch Gordon preparing creative, complex dishes. The daily changing surprise menu delivers punchy flavour combinations and several playful elements. He serves many of the dishes himself and chats with guests, adding to the feel that this is a very personal operation.	landirobert	\N	\N
3335043448	AZUR	Yeniköy Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://azuristanbul.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	₺₺₺	f	t	As you make your way through this chic restaurant, you will certainly be drawn to the modern works of art and the panoramic view of the Bosporus. But what really catches the eye at AZUR is the seafood on display. The quality is second to none! All that excellent produce is showcased in dishes that fluidly blend Turkish and Mediterranean culinary traditions. Think Atlantic bluefin tuna tartare with creamy stracciatella, super-fresh fish on the plancha, paella or pasta. Meat fans are also well catered for. The servers will be happy to give you a few pointers to help you get the most out of this culinary adventure.	baranovrachel	\N	\N
3334661177	Balıkçı Kahraman	Rumeli Kavağı Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	http://www.balikcikahraman.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	₺₺₺	f	f	Be sure to try the fish kokoreç, a traditional dish made with grilled fish offal^ the perfectly grilled turbot, which is the house speciality, is also a must^ and let's not forget the dried mackerel, nor the buttery-soft tuna lakerda prepared with house-made olive oil. A word to the wise: The best way to experience Kahraman Altun's cosy fish restaurant is to bring friends and sample as many of his traditionally prepared delicacies as possible. Afterwards, you should definitely take the time to explore the surrounding fishing village of Rumeli Kavağı (also known for its figs). This peaceful corner of Istanbul is sure to enchant you.	lazarmaya	\N	\N
3331623024	Calipso Fish	Küçükyalı Sahil	Türkiye	Istanbul	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking	https://www.calipsorestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	₺₺₺	f	t	Istanbul residents come to this sun-drenched restaurant to escape the hustle and bustle of the city. The waiters give expert advice on the wide selection of mezze in the display fridge – the salads are beautifully fragrant! And that's just the beginning, because the traditional preparation methods accentuate the rich flavours of super-fresh fish and seafood. Whatever you choose, the chef will cook it according to your wishes: the bluefish, for example, can be barbecued whole and served with al dente vegetables. This is ingredient-led cuisine that never fails to impress.	rossettijonas	\N	\N
3338298132	Eleos Yeşilköy	Ümraniye Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Terrace	http://www.eleosrestaurant.com/yesilkoy	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	₺₺	f	t	Yeşilköy is a residential area outside the centre of Istanbul with airs of a seaside resort. A couple of streets away from the marina, you will find this exciting restaurant reminiscent of a Greek tavern. Delicious seafood is the speciality of the house. Think various mezze bursting with Mediterranean freshness. The sea bass is grilled to perfection and served simply, allowing the natural flavours of the fish to shine through. This is a great place to enjoy good no-nonsense food made from fresh, simple ingredients.	tottifrancesco	\N	\N
3330272575	Kıyı	Haydar Aliyev Caddesi No:186/A	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Credit cards not accepted,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.kiyi.com.tr	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	If you're looking for an atmospheric seafood restaurant adorned with beautiful paintings and affording breathtaking views of the picturesque marina, then this perennial favourite is the place for you (ask for a table upstairs)! Start with a selection of mezze and then choose from the bountiful array of fish and seafood, which will be prepared according to your desires. Our inspector opted for sole from the display fridge, which was flawlessly pan-fried before being filleted at the table. It's all about the produce here!	vecchimirko	\N	\N
3332262554	Park Fora	Muallim Naci Caddesi No:54/A	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.parkfora.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	Grilled, meunière, steamed, tandoori – however you like your fish, Park Fora has it covered. At this traditional seafood restaurant, the produce is always in season and super fresh. As you enter, you will see crates of the day's catch stacked and waiting and numerous aquariums filled with king crabs, lobsters and other creatures. Specify your cooking preferences – for us, it was sole à la meunière – and then savour! It will be cooked to perfection and accompanied by carefully prepared accoutrements. Factor in the waterfront location, with views of the boats coming and going on the Bosphorus, and you will really feel like you are on holiday!	munteanuclaudia	\N	\N
3338315229	Rumelihisarı İskele	Yahya Kemal Caddesi No:1	Türkiye	Istanbul	Great view,Terrace,Valet parking	https://www.rumelihisariiskele.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	₺₺₺	f	f	At this classic waterfront pavilion, every table enjoys panoramic views of the mighty Bosporus, with its endless stream of boats – a breathtaking setting in which to savour the finest seafood. Having sampled the aromatic mezze presented at your table, you pick your fish from the abundant selection and indicate if you would like it steamed, barbecued or deep-fried. The kitchen puts the emphasis squarely on flavour, without any unnecessary flourishes. The Iskele special, a seafood pan with octopus, prawns and more, is seasoned only with paprika and chilli.	popafarah	\N	\N
3333011796	Çok Çok Thai	Asmalı Mescit Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://cokcokthai.com/	Nessun premio	Thai	5.0	₺₺	t	t	Take a seat on the lively terrace at the front or opt for the authentic interior, and let your mind drift off to exotic Thailand. Here you can enjoy typical dishes such as sweet and sour spring rolls with crunchy vegetables and a spicy aubergine and pepper curry. Crisp, fresh produce, authentic flavours and respect for tradition make this a great place to eat.	grafpaola	\N	\N
3338514508	Çok Çok Pera	Meşrutiyet Caddesi No:54/A	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://cokcokpera.com/	Nessun premio	Thai contemporary	4.0	₺₺₺₺	f	t	Exotic artwork by a Singaporean designer gives this elegant restaurant a distinctive South Asian feel. Having spent time in Thailand, the chef has gained an intimate understanding of the nuances of its cuisine. Skilfully balancing spicy and sweet notes, he presents a diverse spectrum of flavours. As an example, he tempers a chilli sauce with the sweetness of fruit and a bold fish sauce. Signature dishes such as green curry with scallops and red curry with duck unfurl their depth and umami-rich profiles here. A slice of Thailand in the heart of Istanbul!	pisanipiso	\N	\N
3336680015	Khorasani	Alemdar Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	http://www.khorasanikebab.com	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Grills	3.0	₺	t	f	The Sultanahmet neighbourhood is known for all its tourist restaurants, where menus consist of photographs of dishes. In that respect it's no different at the rustic-style Khorasani, but what sets this grill restaurant apart is the chef's dedication to quality. The meat, barbecued to order, and the kebabs are second to none. We thoroughly enjoyed the kebab with succulent lamb, crisp vegetables and, of course, the wonderful pita bread that comes with it. For flavoursome food with no nonsense, Khorasani is the place.	taddeisimone	\N	\N
3330143892	Lokanta by Divan	Asker Ocağı Caddesi No:1	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Valet parking	https://www.divan.com.tr/restoran/lokanta-by-divan-istanbul	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	The Divan hotel, close to Taksim Square, boasts a restaurant named Lokanta that exudes the same traditional splendour. The first room is dominated by a piano, which is regularly used for performances. The cocktail bar is the focal point of the second room, and the last room is ideal for family gatherings. In this exquisite setting, you can order à la carte from a selection of traditional Turkish dishes. Tempting options include layers of brick pastry stuffed with braised lamb, tenderised mutton and paprika, and steamed sea bass with an aromatic pil-pil sauce. Lokanta offers a fine dining experience featuring bold, no-nonsense flavours.	donatidiego	\N	\N
3335211017	Atölye	Süzer Plaza	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.ritzcarlton.com/en/hotels/europe/istanbul/dining/atolye	Nessun premio	Turkish	4.0	₺₺₺	t	t	The fine dining restaurant of the Ritz-Carlton hotel boasts a laid-back but luxury vibe. The colourful interior and views of the sea and Besiktas football stadium will draw your eye. Authentic Anatolian recipes are prepared with generosity, sometimes with a dash of innovation and often with a fresh Mediterranean touch. Spicy mezze, aromatic hummus, freshly caught sea bass, rich pide: this is the place to come for authentic flavours accompanied by fine wines.	florescumelissa	\N	\N
3339920770	Borsa Restaurant	Vaniköy Caddesi No:12	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	http://www.borsarestaurants.com	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺₺	t	f	The Adile Sultan Palace is an events venue that is as spectacular as its name suggests. A stroll through the building will give you a sense of its grandeur and splendour – characteristics that Borsa is fortunate to share. To dine against a breathtaking backdrop of the Bosporus, head to the terrace. This upmarket restaurant showcases traditional Turkish cuisine on an à la carte basis. In his dish featuring medium-rare lamb ribs, spinach and roast potatoes, the chef allows the distinctive flavours of the ingredients to shine through. Less is more at Borsa. Make sure you leave room for dessert – the classic katmer (crispy filo pastry filled with pistachio) is very tempting!	colombostefano	\N	\N
3335772975	Deraliye	Divanyolu Caddesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://deraliyerestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺₺₺	t	f	Deraliye is a landmark of the historical Sultanahmet neighbourhood, where there is one tourist restaurant next to the other. The colourful, opulent decor immediately catches the eye and, like the cuisine, is a tribute to the Ottoman Empire. The extensive menu features an array of dishes devised for sharing and specialities such as mezze, barbecued offerings and kebabs. Tempting options include duck stew in filo pastry with fragrant spiced rice, or a lamb and tomato dish, slowly simmered in an earthenware pot to let the flavours meld. Here, you can savour sumptuous Ottoman cuisine, occasionally presented with a touch of showmanship. Good to know: Deraliye also organises cookery classes.	baranovrachel	\N	\N
3333294601	Lokanta Göktürk	Göktürk Merkez	Türkiye	Istanbul	Terrace	https://lokantagokturk.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺₺₺	t	t	Leave the centre of Istanbul, head to Eyüpsultan district and sit down on the terrace or in front of the open kitchen. That's it, your work is done. Now all you have to do is enjoy! Muhsin Ertürk draws inspiration from, and puts a new spin on, recipes from Anatolian tradition, and has a penchant for regional produce. For instance, you can enjoy wonderfully creamy hummus, as well as prawns marinated in ginger then fried in garlic butter and served with creamy risotto, strands of soft cuttlefish and an aromatic clam broth. A creative blend of old and new!	montanarijack	\N	\N
3336933894	Seraf Mahmutbey	Mahmutbey Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.seraf.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Turkish	4.0	₺₺	t	t	Sinem Özler sets great store by goods from local producers. You can taste and see this for yourself, because they are also for sale in the shop of this spacious, modern restaurant, just outside the city centre. For example, she works with Trakya Kivircik lamb in a bid to keep traditional recipes alive. The İçli Köfte with the same lamb is an absolute must. To bring those ancient Anatolian flavours to the table, this chef likes to use a wood-fired oven, and she never loses sight of the changing seasons and her surroundings.	medvedevkatie	\N	\N
3337269707	Seraf Vadi	Ayazağa	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	http://www.seraf.com.tr	Nessun premio	Turkish	5.0	₺₺₺	f	t	Start your meal with the içli köfte, a house speciality combining a creamy yoghurt sauce with a steamed bun stuffed with highly aromatic lamb. And be sure to sample the other mezze, such as the imam bayildi: stuffed aubergine with a subtle smoky flavour, caramelised onion and candied red pepper. The main courses featuring various cuts of lamb are to die for. This contemporary restaurant not far from Vadistanbul Shopping Mall is a celebration of Anatolian culinary heritage.	kralrosa	\N	\N
3335078388	Yeni Lokanta	Kumbaracı Yokuşu No:66	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	http://www.yenilokanta.com	Nessun premio	Turkish, Creative	3.0	₺₺₺	t	t	A side street off the famous main road of Istikal Caddesi, a bright Mediterranean decor and the creativity of a discerning chef – welcome to Yeni Lokanta! Here you can enjoy Turkish flavours that draw on original ideas, resulting in fresher and lighter dishes that lose none of their exuberance. Order à la carte or opt for the set menu (a selection from the menu) and discover how the focus on vegetables, local produce and Turkish wines makes this dining experience all the more engaging.	schr�derfedericha	\N	\N
3333546652	29	Ulus Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.29.com.tr	Nessun premio	Turkish, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	f	f	As soon as you enter, you realise how exceptional this upscale restaurant is. The views of the bustling Bosphorus, the enchanting minarets and the Istanbul skyline are unparalleled! To really make the most of your fine dining experience at the elegant 29, book a table on the expansive terrace. The generosity and spiciness of traditional Turkish cuisine are given a subtle modern twist, often incorporating Mediterranean touches. Both the authentic mezze and the smooth mushroom risotto make this place the trip. Featuring an impressive selection of top-flight labels, the extensive wine menu is worthy of attention.	florescumelissa	\N	\N
3337803323	Boys Hall	Boys Hall Road	United Kingdom	Ashford	Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.boys-hall.com	Nessun premio	Traditional British	5.0	£££	t	t	Built in 1616 for the Boys family, this charming old house has been sympathetically converted into a hotel with eye-catching features at every turn, plus 3 acres of gardens and land. The restaurant sits in an extension to the main house and serves local Kent produce, with Romney Marsh lamb a firm favourite. Great wines, also from Kent, are available to pair with your food and, should you wish to grab a drink before dining, the grounds also house a pub with a terrace.	schneidermihai	\N	\N
3332897533	Apartıman Yeniköy	Yeniköy	Türkiye	Istanbul	Terrace	http://www.apartimanyenikoy.com	Nessun premio	Turkish, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	₺₺	t	f	A mostly youthful and hip crowd frequents this pleasant bistro, which matches the energy of its neighbourhood. Lounge music plays in the background, the impressive drinks list features a notable selection of orange wines. The kitchen is run by a female chef who has composed an extensive and enticing menu that combines Mediterranean verve with Middle Eastern spiciness. For instance, she barbecues lamb to medium-rare and serves it with orzo cooked in a kokoreç broth and greengage. Tip: For a truly filling meal, consider ordering an additional starter.	dinusauru	\N	\N
3339688601	Şans	Hacı Adil Caddesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking	http://www.sansrestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Turkish, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	This elegantly appointed villa has been a favourite destination for business clientele since 1992. They come for the attentive service, private dining options and expert wine recommendations (be sure to try one of the Turkish reds!). But the principal draw is undoubtedly the cuisine: a fusion of authentic Turkish flavours and Mediterranean influences. From steaming cheese dumplings to a creamy mushroom risotto and slow-cooked lamb neck with barbecued vegetables: generosity is always on the menu here. A firm favourite with many foodies.	naldinadia	\N	\N
3330256982	Aheste	Asmalı Mescit Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://ahesterestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Modern Cuisine	5.0	₺₺₺	t	f	Once you enter the premises, leaving the bustling Pera district behind, you have a choice between a trendy bistro and a more romantic dining space with a vaulted ceiling. In either case, you'll be charmed by the mystical ambiance and the staff's enthusiasm and dedication – and that's before you've even discovered the restaurant's modern take on mezze! Traditional Turkish specialities, such as barbecued lamb heart with roast potatoes, share the menu with in-vogue options, including vegetarian dishes. The tasting menu offers a wonderful opportunity to savour delicacies such as flaky pastry filled with a creamy tuna tarama.	impeiluca	\N	\N
3339976997	Alaf	Arnavutköy	Türkiye	Istanbul	Counter dining,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.alafkurucesme.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Modern Cuisine	5.0	₺₺₺₺	t	f	Alaf is a bustling restaurant with a fabulous cocktail bar on the roof terrace – perfect for a romantic dinner for two overlooking Istanbul's eastern coastline. Chef Deniz cooks up dishes with various influences: sometimes it is inspired by Yörük cuisine, sometimes Kurdish, the list goes on. With his wood-fired oven, he enthusiastically melds authentic traditional Turkish recipes with new-age cooking methods. Whether it's al dente squid with an exciting Mediterranean twist using sun-dried tomatoes, or medium-rare goose breast elevated by satsuma and harissa, a diverse journey of discovery awaits your taste buds!	ricciardisimone	\N	\N
3331468989	Lokanta 1741	Alemdar Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace,Valet parking	https://lokanta1741.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Modern Cuisine	3.0	₺₺₺	f	t	This beautiful contemporary restaurant with a romantic roof terrace is right next to Cağaloğlu Hamam. It serves Turkish culinary classics, some dating back to 1741, with a modern twist. The chef sometimes introduces surprising textures and flavours but never loses sight of tradition. In the evening, they serve only a more sophisticated fine dining menu. Here, you can savour a zesty sea bass ceviche, as well as lamb brochettes with distinct barbecue notes and a punchy aubergine caviar. Oenophiles should definitely take the opportunity to explore the wine cellar.	zaitsevvictoria	\N	\N
3330555083	Tuğra Restaurant	Çırağan Caddesi No:32	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://tugrarestaurant.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Modern Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	f	f	At Tuğra you'll feel like royalty. Here you can bask in the historical splendour of the magnificent Çırağan Palace – the luxuriousness never fails to impress. Look beyond the marble pillars and admire the sparkling Bosphorus. Ottoman culinary tradition goes hand in hand with the customs of haute cuisine. Chef Emre Inanir puts his own spin on classic flavours. For instance, grilled beef liver is paired with crispy börek, deliciously unctuous on the inside, and an onion compote seasoned with sumac. What a combination!	krausmartina	\N	\N
3334840362	Herise İstanbul	Reşitpaşa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://www.heriseistanbul.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Regional Cuisine	4.0	₺₺₺	f	t	Asude and Bahadir are ambassadors for Anatolian cuisine. She will gladly tell you all about their concept while providing attentive service and bringing refreshing mocktails to your table (no alcohol served here). He works to a single set menu that celebrates traditional flavours. Variations of tomato and pepper are a common theme in his diverse range of dishes, whether vegetarian or meat-based. His less-is-more approach is exemplified by the millefeuille of dry figs with Aegean olive oil, or the refined combination of rosewater, saffron, currants and rice. Herise Istanbul is one of a kind.	pesciroberto	\N	\N
3338995544	OCAK	Hobyar Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://ocak.ist/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Traditional Cuisine	5.0	₺₺₺	t	t	OCAK has breathed new life into this former tobacco warehouse in the Old City, turning it into an intimate restaurant with exposed brick walls, soft lighting and marble finishings. The chef proposes only a single set menu that showcases his unique take on Turkish cuisine. He elevates chickpeas to new heights in a variety of dishes, including an amazing crispy deep-fried creation. He consistently strikes a perfect balance between tradition and modernity. Your curiosity will be piqued by every dish.	benesemily	\N	\N
