3334555470	Hus Şarapçılık	Kuşçular Mahallesi	Türkiye	Izmir	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.huswines.com/mutfak	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	5.0	₺₺	f	f	The terrace of this inviting restaurant is the best place to experience the charm of Hus Wines estate to the full. The sight of the vines and olive trees has an immediate calming effect. Pressed on site, the wines pair beautifully with the revamped Mediterranean dishes that are made to order here. Having started with the addictive house-made focaccia, for example, you could move on to the perfectly cooked medium-rare lamb saddle seasoned with rosemary. Vanilla, isot pepper and a bold zesty cherry sauce elevate the dish's rich flavours. Finish off with a Turkish coffee for a final burst of intensity!	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3336078054	Ortaya Alaçatı	Alaçatı	Türkiye	Izmir	Terrace	https://www.ortaya.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Turkish	5.0	₺₺	f	f	A little removed from the busy tourist area, this open-air restaurant is like a slice of Ibiza. The setting is laid back and trendy, and they serve an appealing range of cocktails and sharing dishes: Think cheesy barley noodles with intensely flavoursome mushrooms and thyme, or pearl couscous cooked al dente in a beef stock, topped with butter-soft shredded beef and a rich paprika oil. The Mediterranean spirit of generosity is celebrated here through delicious food. Be sure to make a reservation!	neagufilippo	\N	\N
3339790117	Birinci Kordon Balık Restoran	Alsancak	Türkiye	Izmir	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.birincikordon.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood	3.0	₺₺	t	f	Fish, fish and more fish – that's what you can expect at this rather simple restaurant. The refrigerated display counter immediately catches the eye as the charcoal grill works overtime in the kitchen. After some freshly prepared mezze, for example, allow the chef to delight you with succulent barbecued calamari rings in a chilli crust, or just as expertly flame-grilled sea bass. Such incredible flavours! No frills here: the focus lies squarely on unadulterated top-quality produce. A gem among the many restaurants on the quayside.	palombasauro	\N	\N
3336215887	Gula Urla	Kuşçular Mahallesi	Türkiye	Izmir	Car park,Terrace	http://www.gulaurla.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	4.0	₺₺	t	t	Whether you're soaking up the sun on the verdant terrace or cosying up by the fireplace, Gula Urla is inviting all year round. The fresh fish on display makes it clear that the sea is the restaurant's main supplier^ vegetables and cheese are also sourced locally. After a delicious cocktail or glass of local wine, you can savour a shrimp salad with mango and avocado, or perhaps a tandoori-style squid dish, before finishing off with a creamy katmer with red berries. The extensive menu is a seafood lover's dream come true!	morozovmegan	\N	\N
3333145033	SOTA ALAÇATI	Alaçatı Mahallesi	Türkiye	Izmir	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://sotaalacati.com	Nessun premio	Seafood	5.0	₺₺	t	f	The lobster and oyster tanks give away the fact that this open-air restaurant's main supplier is the sea. SOTA's Mediterranean soul is evident in everything from its mosaic tiles to the fresh seafood on the menu. The squid has the perfect firm texture and is seasoned to have just the right amount of zing. The seafood is super fresh and wonderful in combination with al dente tagliatelle. There is also an irresistible selection of sushi. This restaurant is dedicated to showcasing the sea's rich bounty.	fioreerik	\N	\N
3334017234	Levan	Kuşçular	Türkiye	Izmir	Car park,Terrace		Nessun premio	Turkish	5.0	₺₺	f	f	Dining with a view of the vineyards, or surrounded by the grapevines on the terrace, is an experience that will leave a lasting impression. Levan offers a convivial atmosphere in a charming and intimate setting. On the chalkboard, you will find a dozen dishes, from mezze to share to main courses to savour on your own. The traditional cuisine of the Aegean coast is given a subtle new twist here. Rice-filled vine leaves served with a yoghurt cream and tomato sauce, and rich lamb stew cooked in white wine: get ready for a Mediterranean feast!	pierimarco	\N	\N
3332919698	Divia by Maksut Aşkar	Hisarönü Mahallesi	Türkiye	Marmaris	Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Valet parking,Wheelchair access	https://www.dmarisbay.com/en/dining/divia-by-maksut-askar	Nessun premio	Turkish, Modern Cuisine	5.0	₺₺₺₺	t	t	Take the panoramic lift down to the main beach of luxury resort D-Maris Bay. Once you reach the pavilion that houses DIVIA, you will be greeted by a breathtaking vista of the sea and luxury yachts. Chef Maksut Aşkar, the man behind the MICHELIN-starred Neolokal in Istanbul, has put together a team that creatively reimagines traditional dishes with an emphasis on vegetables. Their take on kadin budu features fish rillette that has been briefly fried and combined with potato foam, crispy fish skin, candied lemon peel and a green herb oil. This innovative interpretation of Turkish cuisine delights both the eye and palate!	brandtclara	\N	\N
