3335481370	Yaatra	4 Greycoat Place	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.yaatrarestaurant.com	Nessun premio	Indian	4.0	£££	f	t	A Grade II listed former fire station plays host to this smart, warm and colourfully decorated restaurant, which is run with enthusiasm and sincerity. You can choose from an extensive selection of different menus^ they all take their influences from across India and her many states, as well as from neighbouring countries. The nicely balanced dishes are prepared with skill, care and understanding.	lombardiemanuele	\N	\N
3332689200	Zaika	1 Kensington High Street	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://zaikaofkensington.com	Nessun premio	Indian	3.0	£££	f	f	There are many original features on display in this wonderfully ornate former banking hall and, while it’s a spacious place, the team look after diners with consummate ease. Authentic cooking methods are used to create dishes from all corners of India^ go for the tasting menu to sample the range.	urbanalessia	\N	\N
3335820935	Akub	27 Uxbridge Street	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Brunch	https://www.akub-restaurant.com/	Nessun premio	International	4.0	££	t	t	Named after the flowering thistle that’s also known as 'cardoon', Akub celebrates traditional Palestinian recipes, while simultaneously invigorating them with contemporary twists. The colours and intense flavours are particularly evident in sharing dishes like the ‘crunchy mansaf’, which consists of crispy golden parcels stuffed with rice and tender lamb shoulder. Everything is served in a bright, airy space situated on an equally colourful Notting Hill street. Accompany the food with wine from a list combining French favourites with options from Palestine and Jordan.	iordachelilly	\N	\N
