3336501772	Pizarro	194 Bermondsey Street	United Kingdom	London	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://josepizarro.com/venues/pizarro-restaurant-bermondsey/	Nessun premio	Spanish, Mediterranean Cuisine	3.0	££	t	t	José Pizarro has a refreshingly simple way of naming his establishments: after José, his tapas bar, came Pizarro, a larger restaurant a few doors down. A selection of small plates – like croquetas, boquerones and padrón peppers – are joined by larger main courses including presa Ibérica, with dishes proving to be satisfying and cleanly executed. The surroundings are stylish and an all-Spanish wine list boasts some big names.	cellericelina	\N	\N
