3338941572	Esta	27 Tran Quy Khoach Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Counter dining	http://www.estasaigon.com	Nessun premio	Asian Contemporary	3.0	₫₫₫	t	f	The menu is depicted by spot-on fusion Asian cuisine, influenced by trips to Japan, Korea and China and the chef’s Vietnamese roots. The theatrically visible kitchen showcases his culinary wizardry, founded on high-quality ingredients. Esta believes in sourcing vegetables from independent farmers and fish caught by small boats.	venturaroman	\N	\N
3332196938	Oryz	51 Tran Nhat Duat Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Air conditioning,Car park	https://oryzsaigon.com/	Nessun premio	Asian Contemporary	4.0	₫₫	t	t	Rice is the staple ingredient that links all Asian culinary cultures, so the chef named the restaurant after the Latin word for rice. Naturally, he endeavours to present the grain in various forms, from puffed rice and deep-fried rice noodles to koji and sparkling sake. Familiar Asian recipes are reimagined with a flourish. Try his version of cơm lam, or glutinous rice in a bamboo tube with shrimp and 18-day home-cured pork and sausage.	ttuyungim	\N	\N
3331858237	Lai	28F	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Air conditioning,Car park	https://laivn.com	Nessun premio	Cantonese	4.0	₫₫₫	t	t	Bringing 30 years' experience to the table, the Malaysian-born chef has worked in six major cities across Asia. The interior is done out in traditional Chinese décor featuring modern paintings and flowers. The menu combines classical Cantonese with contemporary elements and a twist of southern Asian in a creative presentation. Be sure to try the há cảo thủy tinh (crystal shrimp dumpling) and the xá xíu ướp thao được quay kieu 'truyền thống' (traditional roasted pork belly with herbs).	vitolajose	\N	\N
3337982507	Elgin	27 Mac Dinh Chi Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Air conditioning	https://elginsgn.com	Nessun premio	European	3.0	₫₫	f	t	Orange banquettes and soft lighting enhance and offset the dark green wall tiles. Run by an energetic and passionate young team, Elgin can be relied upon to pamper its patrons. The menu, which changes regularly, showcases deftly prepared European dishes made mostly with local produce. Try the pork belly with fried brussels sprouts or gnocchi with lamb sugo, both of which are rich in flavours.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
3335320815	Fashionista Café	22B Phung Khac Khoan Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Terrace	http://www.fashionistacafe.com	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	5.0	₫₫	f	f	Food and fashion are the passions of many tastemakers. This café annexed to a two-storey clothing store seamlessly melds the two under one roof. With only two tables indoors, most seating is al fresco. The food is essentially Gallic with Vietnamese twists. Local tropical fruits and nuts are generously used in the sauces and seasoning, while soigné plating pays tribute to fine French dining. Lunch set menus offer great value.	semenovirene	\N	\N
3339373401	Lửa	2 Street No. 11	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://luawinebarvn.com	Nessun premio	European Contemporary	5.0	₫₫	t	f	The al fresco wine bar, whose tables are set in a courtyard surrounded by lush greenery, is perfect for a drink and nibbles. There are about 100 wine references to choose from with a substantial by-the-glass selection. The wine list changes every month, but the home-brewed sake, a firm fixture, is worth trying. The menu, which features only organic produce from small local farms, combines European dishes with a twist of Japanese elements as both the manager and head chef hail from Japan.	bergmannalexandru	\N	\N
3333357465	Mía Dining	12G2 Nguyen Thi Minh Khai Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Car park,Valet parking		Nessun premio	European Contemporary	3.0	₫₫	f	f	The soft lighting, minimalist interior and romantic soundtrack make this venue the perfect spot for date nights. The most prized seats are at the counter offering intimate views of the kitchen. Three set menus star modern European recipes jazzed up by a scattering of local produce and seasonings. The must-try duck breast is velvety and juicy, clad in crackling skin as crisp as peanut brittle. Expect sound wine tips from the sommelier.	nerielijah	\N	\N
