3333184803	MaSa French Eatery by Hervé	204/20 Nguyen Van Huong Street	Vietnam	Ho Chi Minh City	Terrace,Valet parking		Nessun premio	French Contemporary	3.0	₫₫	f	t	Abutting the swanky upmarket Hervé Dining Room, MaSa (Manipulator of Savours) is the same chef’s more accessible sibling eatery. As opposed to a multi-course experience, the menu focuses on French tapas to share. The food shows a hint of Asian accents, paired with a well curated wine list. Try Black Angus hanger steak from Korea, and the signature snickers dessert. Al fresco dining with a pond and a charcoal grill dripping in unique charm.	santoronicola	\N	\N
