3333833884	Al Piave	via Cormons 6 - Fraz. Corona	Italy	Mariano del Friuli	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.trattoriaalpiave.it/	Nessun premio	Friulian, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€	t	t	This welcoming family - run trattoria comprises of two attractive dining rooms and a beautiful summer garden. It specialises in regional dishes that vary according to the seasons. Guinea fowl cooked with chives is one of the house specialities.	criscuololorenzo	\N	\N
3332897526	Osteria Madonnetta	via Vajenti 21	Italy	Marostica	Terrace	https://www.osteriamadonnetta.it/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€	t	t	Situated just a stone’s throw from the square with its famous chessboard, this authentic trattoria boasts a warm, inviting dining room and an outdoor space shaded by wisteria. Run by the same family for 120 years, the restaurant serves regional specialities such as tripe soup, bigoli pasta with various sauces, Vicenzo-style bacalà (salted cod), Venetian liver and desserts such as zaeti biscuits and macafame bread pudding. As there are just a few tables and the restaurant is very popular, booking ahead is recommended.	lehmannlucian	\N	\N
3336046333	Burro & Alici	lungomare Colombo 98	Italy	Marotta	Terrace	https://www.ristoranteburroealici.it/	Nessun premio	Seafood, Classic Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	With just a road separating it from the beach (in summer, the large windows open completely, so that the dining room has the feel of an outdoor terrace), this simple restaurant is similar to the many others dotted along the seafront in Marotta. However, it’s the food that is the main attraction – the colourful, generous cuisine of the Adriatic, with fish served in classic recipes occasionally finished with an imaginative and personal twist. Fish also take pride of place on the delicious gourmet pizzas served here.	friedrichteresa	\N	\N
3338177038	Trattoria Losanna	via San Rocco 40	Italy	Masio	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Piedmontese, Regional Cuisine	5.0	€	t	t	This friendly restaurant has a pleasantly convivial and lively ambience. Try a selection of homemade antipasto to start, followed by generous portions of traditional cuisine from Monferrato.	raduionela	\N	\N
3332220644	La Villa	Contrada Cavallerizza	Italy	Melfi	Air conditioning,Car park	https://www.lavillamelfi.it/	Nessun premio	Cuisine from Basilicata, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€	f	f	This country restaurant owes its welcoming atmosphere to the special attentions of the family management. The menus are based on traditional recipes that do full justice to the local produce.	bassioleg	\N	\N
