3330108220	Il Cedro	via di Camaldoli 20	Italy	Moggiona		https://ristorante-il-cedro.business.site/	Nessun premio	Tuscan	3.0	€	f	t	A few kilometres from the monastery of Camaldoli, Il Cedro celebrates home-style Tuscan cooking, which is simple yet full of flavour. Two sisters are at the helm here: one in the kitchen, and the other offering friendly service front of house, where she announces the daily specials at your table. Fresh produce and specialities from the Casentino are to the fore.	vecchiatomichael	\N	\N
3338640155	Taverna del Grappolo Blu	scale di via Moglio 1	Italy	Montalcino	Air conditioning,Terrace	http://www.grappoloblu.com	Nessun premio	Tuscan	5.0	€	t	f	Accessed via a steep, narrow flight of steps, this restaurant boasts a traditional and friendly ambience. The cuisine is traditionally Tuscan (pici pasta with ragu and tripe are among the most popular dishes on the menu), while the interesting wine list includes a selection of Brunello wines arranged by year, as well as some top-quality vintage options which will delight wine-enthusiasts. The owner oversees the informal yet attentive service.	guerravictor	\N	\N
