3332342321	Da Gregorio	strada provinciale 101 136	Italy	Morrano Nuovo	Terrace,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Umbrian	3.0	€€	f	t	A family-run trattoria which is simple in style yet offers professional and courteous service. The menu focuses mainly on Umbrian specialities, fresh pasta, grilled dishes and an impressive selection of vegetables.	ionescuamy	\N	\N
