3338938984	Le Miniere	piazza Martiri 1944 4	Italy	Traversella	Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.albergominiere.com/	Nessun premio	Piedmontese, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€	t	t	Situated on the main square of a charming village, this hotel-restaurant dates back to the late 19C and is run by the friendly Arsini family. The setting here is truly picturesque, thanks to the village’s location on a green and sunny ridge in the Val Chiusella, surrounded by cyclamen bushes and majestic birch and chestnut trees. Meanwhile, the Piedmontese dishes offer excellent value for money, with a focus on local ingredients and produce from the wider region. If you’re a fan of traditional cuisine, don’t miss the tripe alla campagnola with polenta taragna whipped with butter, while in season the roast cardo gobbo served with a delicious bagna cauda and truffle is a must. A stroll around the small village offers the perfect conclusion to your meal.	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
