3339945206	Racines	8 passage des Bains	France	Annecy	Terrace	https://racines-annecy.fr	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	The roots of this bistro go back to the family history of the proprietors, a young couple: on one side of the family, a butcher's shop specialising in choice meats (especially milk-fed veal from the Limousin) and on the other, chickens and orchards. The chef, former second in command at L'Esquisse, knows all about good produce, as his dishes show: slow-cooked egg, crozets pasta, brezain cheese^ onglet de veau (veal steak), polenta, grilled leek, garlic condiment.	schulzchiara	\N	\N
