3334577278	Schlosskeller Wirtshaus	Seggaubergstraße 5	Austria	Leibnitz	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.schlosskellersuedsteiermark.at/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	This cosy restaurant decorated with gorgeous wood panelling is another culinary option within the Schlosskeller world of gastronomy. As an alternative to Gourmetstube, Wirtshaus serves up flavoursome dishes that tap into the regional repertoire and are in step with the seasons. Austrian classics such as Backhenderl (Viennese fried chicken) also feature on the menu. Save room for the apricot dumplings for dessert! The sharing menu for two, comprising eight small courses is also a good idea (Thu-Sat). Pizza is served on Wednesdays. The cordial and highly proficient service extends to competent wine recommendations. The fantastic view of the picture-perfect landscape of vineyards and forests draws guests to the terrace in summer.	fontanagiuseppe	\N	\N
3333415959	Göttfried	Hofgasse 5	Austria	Linz	Terrace,Wheelchair access	http://www.goettfried.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Run by husband-and-wife team Simone and Christian Göttfried, this inviting restaurant boasts a charming location in the old town – the main square is just around the corner and the Danube is also very close by. The interior beautifully combines modern style with historical features such as a vaulted ceiling and wood panelling. Front of house, the owner and her team provide attentive service. Meanwhile, chef-patron Christian Göttfried focuses on cooking excellent food – expect regional, seasonal cuisine with a Mediterranean twist. Both the organic veal Wiener schnitzel and the branzino with a parsley vinaigrette are highly recommended. The wine list boasts some 350 labels, principally of Austrian provenance. There is also a small wine shop and tables are laid out in the lovely quiet courtyard. The hotel offers contemporary, cosy guestrooms.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
