3334956121	MAST Weinbistro	Porzellangasse 53	Austria	Vienna	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list	https://www.mast.wine/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Set in a historical town house, this trendy place is a winning combination of modern wine bar and upscale bistro. It is very popular for its great food, is made with seasonal ingredients sourced from local producers – and at fantastic value for money. Organic and biodynamic wines are recommended to accompany your choice of dishes. There is an appealing outdoor dining area, too.	rizzogabriele	\N	\N
