3331145768	Mochi	Praterstraße 15	Austria	Vienna	Terrace	https://www.mochi.at/	Nessun premio	Japanese	3.0	€	t	t	A lively, informal restaurant serving authentic Japanese cuisine with some more modern twists, at very moderate prices. You can watch the chefs at work, preparing sushi rolls, yakitori or gyu don. At lunchtime, the food is served in bowls^ in the evening the presentation is a bit more elaborate. Tables are much sought after, so book early!	basileryan	\N	\N
