3334633399	Zur Blauen Gans	Seepark Weiden	Austria	Weiden am See	Car park,Terrace	https://www.zurblauengans.at/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	5.0	€€	f	t	Located close to the lake, this delightful restaurant wins diners over with its delicious seasonal cuisine, attentive service and inviting decor. The wide-ranging culinary options include Backhendl (breaded fried chicken) and whole roasted Oberwasser char – there is also an eight-course set menu. The use of unconventional ingredients such as glazed catfish liver is also intriguing. Food is served inside, in bright, charming rooms with lovely wooden floors, or on the splendid terrace looking out onto the surrounding greenery and the marina.	basileryan	\N	\N
3333792234	Ziegelwerk Gasthaus	Ziegelofengasse 28	Austria	Wimpassing an der Leitha	Car park,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.ziegelwerk-gasthaus.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	This haven of culinary delights is housed in a former brickworks. The design of the interior purposefully drew on and preserved long-standing structures such as brick and quarry stone masonry, combining them with sleek, modern elements. A restored old oven makes for an eye-catching feature. Large windows allow the light to flood in while affording diners views of their surroundings. In summer, you can sit in the glorious beer garden. Owner Werner Tschiedel channels the spirit of a modern inn, serving flavourful, straightforward and strictly regional cuisine, such as greaves dumplings, warm cabbage salad, caraway juice or venison schnitzel in a pumpkin seed crumb, potato salad with mayonnaise, cranberries. To be washed down with a wine from a predominantly Austrian selection, many of which are organic or biodynamic.	alfieriigor	\N	\N
3330931706	s'Morent	Zöblen 14	Austria	Zöblen	Car park	https://www.morent.at/	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	Reference to a farm in the centre of the village first appears in 1764^ many years later it was taken over by the Morent family and became a village inn. Now the presence of daughter Lisa and her partner is like a breath of fresh air. They devise a short, season-focused menu comprising tasty, pleasingly pared-back dishes made from good – predominantly regional – ingredients. The space has a rustic-style wooden ceiling and a beautifully sleek and modern feel. Per sitting, this amiable couple can accommodate 20 diners, who are treated to cordial and attentive service. From the entrance area, you can catch a glimpse of the action in the kitchen.	hofmannelena	\N	\N
3335031219	Borse van Amsterdam	Grote Markt 26	Belgium	Aalst	Terrace	https://www.borsevanamsterdam.be/	Nessun premio	Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	Borse is a landmark of Amsterdam, as much for its colossal architecture and historic Flemish décor as for its restaurant. With its huge terrace overlooking the Grand-Place, it has been a blue-chip value for donkey’s years. The menu focuses on generous helpings of time-honoured family favourites and you will instantly be able to taste the deft hand of a seasoned chef who knows how to enhance authentic flavours.	fioreerik	\N	\N
3338522823	Au gré des Saisons	rue d'Achet 70	Belgium	Achet	Car park,Terrace	https://www.augredessaisons.net/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Italian	4.0	€€	f	f	Welcome to the achingly scenic village of Achet in Condroz, the location of an excellent eatery, clad in characteristic Ardennes stone. Gregorio Clavello adds a subtle twist to his Italian roots, rustling up flavoursome modern dishes. Mediterranean tangs and a few judicious oriental notes perfume the food that respects seasonal availability. Balanced, authentic, delicious!	vasilievamelia	\N	\N
