3337876886	Appel Thaï	rue du Pommier 439	Belgium	Anderlecht	Car park,Terrace	https://www.appelthai.be/	Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	€	t	t	Appel Thaï, which is a firm favourite with fans of Asian fare, makes the most of its lush green oasis in Anderlecht. Choose between the peaceful terrace or the buzzier, casual vibe indoors. Fresh, spicy, intense flavours crafted by a veteran chef. Home-made nems served with a tingling sauce, rich massaman curry or a Pad Thai all cooked to textbook perfection: high-flying Thai cuisine in an unstuffy, relaxed setting. Wide variety of choice and dependable first-rate quality.	zaitsevvictoria	\N	\N
3339666450	Bizie Lizie	Vlaamse Kaai 16	Belgium	Antwerpen	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://bizielizie.be/	Nessun premio	Belgian	4.0	€€	f	f	At Bizie Lizie you can choose from a modern brasserie dotted with vintage details or a swish, bordering on Baroque interior. However, those who find it difficult to make up their mind, may well find the amazing choice on the menu somewhat daunting! The menu that will find favour with lovers of nostalgic nosh features heart-warming brasserie fare, such as shrimp fritters, calf’s tongue in Madeira sauce or eels in sorrel.	szabosofia	\N	\N
