3330326714	l'Amitié	Vlaamse Kaai 43	Belgium	Antwerpen	Terrace	https://lamitie.net/	Nessun premio	Sharing	5.0	€€	t	f	As you cross the threshold, it won’t be friendship, but something more akin to love that you will feel in this warm bistro beneath the benevolent eye of a gigantic street art-inspired fish on the wall. Quality produce is revered and lovingly presented in small plates free of fussy frills and designed to be shared. Tartare of seabass with umeboshi served in a shiso leaf is the house signature dish. If you close your eyes while sampling the Padron peppers and croquetas of Iberico jamón, you may well believe that you are in an authentic Spanish tapas bar buzzing in hipster vibes. A place of sanctuary for fans of fine food and friendship.	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3339498194	Schnitzel	Paardenmarkt 53	Belgium	Antwerpen	Terrace	https://www.schnitzelantwerpen.be/	Nessun premio	Sharing	4.0	€€	t	f	Good simple food is the ethos of this vintage-inspired bolthole which offers 5-, 6- and 7-course menus. Gert Weyn hits the nail on the head with intuitive personal inventions crafted with just a few ingredients. He has a knack for pairing the gutsy flavours of black pudding with slices of radish, sorrel leaves and herby fromage blanc, for example. Food that is refreshingly hearty, wholesome and oozing with flavour: such is the hallmark of Schnitzel.	dragomirpippo	\N	\N
