3334886008	De Vous à Nous	rue de Grand Bry 42	Belgium	Montigny-le-Tilleul	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.restaurantdevousanous.be/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	t	t	De Vous à Nous (From You to Us) sports a stylish interior, a peaceful, lush green landscape and eater-friendly prices. The know-how and generosity of chef François Duvivier are outstanding and he doesn’t hesitate to add a personal flourish to traditional recipes, such as croquettes of pheasant, pigeon with a gutsy sauce or Belle Hélène pear jus that will knock your socks off! A safe bet every time!	grasomarkus	\N	\N
