3337203886	Le Barathym	rue du Parvis 10	Belgium	Nassogne	Terrace	https://www.lebarathym.be/fr/	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	Barathym is synonymous with good food in a casual, warm vibe, whether on the terrace or in the updated rustic village cafe interior. The tasty seasonal fare is traditional, although sprinkled with modernity, often in the form of Asian or Mediterranean accents. Don’t expect fussy plating, but rather the simple joy of a tender juicy cut of meat served with a crisp salad dressed in a spicy sauce. Good country cooking that our grandmothers would have been proud to serve adapted to today’s tastebuds and ethos. All of which at unbeatable eater-friendly prices!	langalice	\N	\N
3337784816	l'Apropos	rue Bonry 146	Belgium	Neupré	Car park,Terrace	https://resto-lapropos.be	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Farm to table	3.0	€€	t	f	After a facelift, L’Apropos now sports a warm, bright interior with colourful artwork. Chef Fournier shares his love of world, Mediterranean, Asian and North - African food, which he skilfully mixes and prepares, demonstrating a flawless sense of balance.	giordanopietro	\N	\N
