3333701945	Izakaya	Selska cesta 90b	Croatia	Zagreb	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.izakaya.hr/	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary	3.0	€	f	f	Although not in a central location, this modern restaurant serving delicious, carefully prepared Japanese cuisine is situated in an area that has a lively evening atmosphere. Don’t miss the chef’s signature rolls, including the excellent Kanji Uramaki (with swordfish tartare) and Age Lobster roll (with lobster in panko bread). The pleasant outdoor space is perfect for an after-dinner cocktail.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
3334300037	Tač	Vrhovec 140	Croatia	Zagreb	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://restac.hr/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	Situated on Vrhovec hill in a residential area not far from the city centre, this restaurant run by the Miletić family seems more like a private home than a conventional restaurant. There’s no menu – instead, whatever dishes the kitchen has prepared that day are announced at your table. Options often include fish carpaccio or tartare, fresh scampi from the Adriatic and locally reared meat, all served in traditional recipes that are generous both in flavour and portion size. Sharing dishes is normal practice here, which adds to the enjoyment of the experience. The wines are from Croatia or its near neighbours – again, there’s no wine list but staff are happy to make recommendations.	sannamateo	\N	\N
