3339110349	Le Voyage d'Ernestine	182 Grand-Rue	France	Alvignac	Terrace	http://www.le-voyage-ernestine.fr	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	A family affair! A team of three (twins – a brother and sister – plus her partner) take their guests on a culinary journey featuring carefully selected local ingredients (lamb from the Bouscarel farm, vegetables from Tauriac, trout from Le Gouffre du Blagour fish farm etc). Trained as a butcher and charcutier, the brother is an expert when it comes to cuts of meat. As for this widely travelled couple, they punctuate their dishes with international touches (eg labneh, black lemon, lamb jus emulsified with tahini). A top-notch culinary experience in a restaurant that is firmly in tune with the times.	valentinicolas	\N	\N
