3335474769	Auberge La Grange aux Loups	8 rue du 11-Novembre	France	Apremont	Garden or park,Terrace	https://lagrangeauxloups.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	f	This village inn, dripping in style, has been revamped in a modern vibe by an enthusiastic couple. The menu focuses on carefully crafted, mouth-watering dishes (pastilla of pork, wild garlic and broad bean pickles^ roast king prawns, Camargue rice, chorizo and fennel^ citrus fruit-flavoured rice pudding and orange sorbet). Service with a smile and a lovely patio for alfresco dining in fine weather.	schneidermihai	\N	\N
3335090418	Le Bistronôme	62 rue de Faramand	France	Arbois	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://le-bistronome-arbois.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Small in size, big in quality! In an exquisite location on the banks of the River Cuisance, Lisa and Jérôme have made their establishment a firm fixture of Arbois’ culinary scene. The chef’s seasonal recipes, emblematic of his technique and flair, are a festival of mouth-watering delicacies from his signature dish, Planches trout stuffed with morel and oyster mushrooms, vin jaune sauce to farm-reared Jura pork chop, pepper and tonka bean meat gravy and dauphine potatoes. The desserts are to die for! Their “au fil du jour” daily special is a steal and the service is refreshingly unstarched and friendly: remember to book!	popovchloe	\N	\N
