3339034804	Auberge du Pont	1 route de Marcenat	France	Billy	Car park,Terrace	https://www.auberge-du-pont-billy.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	The cuisine is meticulous, tasty and flavoursome, with sauces to die for… Enjoy crispy shoulder of lamb with red onion and Taggiasca olives, or opt for more surprising original dishes such as gravlax beef glazed with rice vinegar. When the weather is fine, make the most of the shady terrace overlooking the Allier River. At lunchtime, they serve a single set menu – the menu du marché – and amenu-carte in the evening. Not to be missed!	lebedevhazel	\N	\N
3332731172	Le Pressoir de Bacchus	50 route des Vins	France	Blienschwiller	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Wheelchair access		Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	Such is the renown of Sylvie Grucker and her son that this pretty restaurant on the wine route is greatly in demand. Sylvie combines traditional recipes with an inventive streak in a bid to showcase regional fare: bacon-flavoured choucroute soup or duck shepherd’s pie, mushrooms and 12-spice sauce, side by side perennial favourites like granddad’s snails, ravioles of carp in a creamy, smoked sauce or Sylvie’s meringue and ice cream extravaganza! Local winegrowers and producers from the village (thirty or so) take pride of place on the enticing wine list.	grimaldimorko	\N	\N
3335125380	Racines by Daniel Gallacher	59 rue Georges-Bonnac	France	Bordeaux	Air conditioning	https://racines-bordeaux.com	Nessun premio	Creative	3.0	€€	t	f	This self-taught chef with Scottish roots rustles up inventive and exuberant cuisine that flies in the face of convention. He changes his menu every week according to what produce is to be had at the market. His fresh and meticulous dishes, such as Atlantic monkfish with carrots, satay and passion fruit, are dependably delicious. Recently redesigned, the restaurant is always busy.	sommerlaura	\N	\N
