3338939127	Akashon	L'Heliopic	France	Chamonix-Mont-Blanc	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://restaurant-akashon.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	Part of L’Heliopic hotel resort, Akashon turns out hearty, flavoursome food poised between local gastronomy and more modern fare, such as a tonnato-style tartare of veal and lobster. Untreated metal and granite set the scene in the minimalist interior, the terrace of which commands a fantastic view of the mountains.	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
