3335072962	Baca'v par Gilles Choukroun	6 rue des Fossés-Saint-Marcel	France	Paris	Terrace	https://www.bacav.paris/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	t	Indulgence and good wine: Gilles Choukroun has taken his friend Émile Cotte's motto and made it his own! In the lively atmosphere of a Parisian bistro, he serves up his generous take on hearty bistro classics: marinated herring and potato salad^ calf's head, tongue and brains in sauce ravigote^ floating island with praline and crème anglaise… Appealing menu-carte on the blackboard.	petrovmelissa	\N	\N
