3330999863	L'Ourdissoir	40 rue Saint-Bonaventure	France	Cholet	Air conditioning	https://lourdissoir.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	Slightly outside the city centre, this modest establishment, whose name refers to a rich weaving heritage, sports a warm interior of stone and wood that provides the perfect foil for spot-on, modern food that generously keeps pace with the seasons. Elegant presentation and a concise, original culinary score, with unexpected combinations, like veal tartare paired with beetroot and raspberries in a masterful blend of fresh, acidic and sweet notes. More traditional but just as deftly crafted and tasty is the combination of Paimpol cranberry beans, loin of cod and a mild curry emulsion. The desserts are fully equal to this feelgood feast of culinary delights.	bernasconikarl	\N	\N
