3339237590	Bistrot du Pollet	23 rue Tête-de-Bœuf	France	Dieppe		https://le-bistrot-du-pollet.zenchef.com/	Nessun premio	Seafood, Traditional Cuisine	3.0	€€	t	t	Let us make no bones about it: in this bistro, it is the sea that decides, and the dishes depend directly on the local catch. Enjoy squid, foie gras du pêcheur, sole du bistro or scallops with lentils. Quality and freshness are the order of the day, and what generosity in the preparations!	ciobanuciprian	\N	\N
3334364758	DZ'envies	12 rue Odebert	France	Dijon	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://dzenvies.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	This chic, trendy canteen with its white walls, pale wood furnishings and black ceiling serves up an appetising menu in a lively neighbourhood near the indoor market. The menu showcases traditional cuisine and local produce, with a focus on seasonal ingredients such as persillé de Bourgogne (jellied ham with parsley), œufs en meurette (eggs in a red wine sauce) and beef cheeks à la Bourguignonne. The lunch set menu is a steal – enjoy on the terrace in fine weather.	bernasconikarl	\N	\N
