3333903979	Le Bistrot du Château de Berne	Château de Berne	France	Flayosc	Car park,Garden or park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.chateauberne.com/gastronomie/bistrot/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	The simple, sun-drenched menu is packed with ingredients that call to mind the surrounding landscape. Crunchy local asparagus^ rack of Duroc de Bataillé pork with an Asian twist^ apple pastry, almond cream and caramel. These fresh, unfussy dishes are accompanied by wines from the estate. The prices are reasonable, and efficient service is provided by a team who are able to converse with the substantial English-speaking clientele.	balazsaurora	\N	\N
