3332075605	Auberge des Deux Magots	1 place du Bouffay	France	La Roche-Bernard	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.aubergedesdeuxmagots.fr/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	All the charm of an old Breton house in a pretty little town full of character. The refined and creative cuisine showcases seasonal regional produce. At lunchtime, there's a mouth-watering market-inspired set menu that represents remarkable value for money. The line-caught pollack served with buckwheat risotto with squid ink is on point! Even better, the chef bakes the bread himself.	dinusauru	\N	\N
