3330066584	Le Carré de l'Ange	Chemin du Parc (Palais des Évêques)	France	Saint-Lizier	Car park,Great view,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.lecarredelange.com/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Paul Fontvieille presides over the kitchens here with the same enthusiasm and infectious good mood as ever. This passionate chef composes delicious and savvy dishes ranging from the creative, such as artisanal soba noodles made with buckwheat from Ariège in a fresh herb broth, to the more traditional, eg comforting veal axoa. Bag a table on the terrace, which boasts a breathtaking view over the verdant valley… you'll be in seventh heaven!	benesemily	\N	\N
