3335602293	Bistro des Chenapans	2-14-1 Kyomachibori	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Cash only - lunch,Counter dining		Nessun premio	French	3.0	¥¥	t	f	The chef of this bistro takes pride in his meat cuisine, having studied meat processing in Paris. Casual prix fixe menus of hamburger steak and the like are popular at lunchtime. In the evening, guests can dine à la carte from the charcuterie, cassoulet and so forth. In a bow to the chef’s roots in Shiga Prefecture, Omi beef is used in the steak and fries. Meat is drizzled in oil as it grills to bring out its aroma, and seasoned simply with salt and pepper.	bianconathan	\N	\N
3338537997	La bonne tâche	4-1-8 Nishitemma	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	French	5.0	¥¥	f	t	Red bell-pepper mousse, smoked salmon, roast duck^ ever since it opened, the fare here has been simple, out of respect for the ingredients. The chef seeks to draw closer to perfection every day, advancing in his craft. Cooking skill, recipes and spirituality are all things he learned as an apprentice. Cast your eye around the kitchen and notice how all the pots and pans are gleaming. Respect for the tools of his trade drive the chef to keep honing his technique.	cernyfrida	\N	\N
