3331416486	Macauda	2-1-3 Tokiwamachi	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://macauda.jp/	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	¥¥	t	f	Tuna tartare^ simmered squid in ink^ mackerel meunière- the large number of fish dishes derives from the chef’s apprenticeship days. Working in the southern Italian regions of Puglia and Sicily, he was struck by the similarity of its food culture with Japan’s, with its emphasis on seafood. The chef respects the region’s techniques while incorporating ingredients in season. Always on the lookout for opportunities to hone his skills, he spends evenings focusing on hand-made pasta.	vitaleraffaele	\N	\N
3336898239	Osteria La Cicerchia	3F	Japan	Osaka	Air conditioning,Counter dining		Nessun premio	Italian	4.0	¥¥	t	t	The ‘Marches cuisine specialty restaurant’ certificate from Italy proudly adorns the wall, and indeed the gastronomy of this region on Italy’s Adriatic coast is what the chef excels in. Meat-stuffed olive fritti, homemade salsiccia and rabbit-and-tomato stew are all staples of the Marchese dining board. Cicerchia beans are a classic legume grown in the town where the chef stayed. Their flavour can be tasted in her minestrone soup.	fioreerik	\N	\N
