3332786118	Nova	Rottekade 31	Netherlands	Bergschenhoek	Car park,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-nova.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	5.0	€€	f	t	Located on the edge of the Bergse Bos forest, with a romantic terrace and a pontoon on the River Rotte to the front, and a cosy, luxurious atmosphere inside, Nova is a really wonderful establishment! Your elegant hostess extends a warm welcome, and chef Vaandrager proposes an appealing menu. His contemporary dishes combine playful ideas with impressive culinary expertise. Whether preparing a salade niçoise with mi-cuit tuna or giving pink-roasted lamb a southern twist with a ratatouille garnish, he puts the focus firmly on bold flavours – and all at excellent value for money. Don't miss the chance to take a boat trip on the Rotte, perhaps with some snacks. You won't be disappointed!	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
3334026083	Bistrôt Chapeau	Huizerweg 1	Netherlands	Blaricum	Terrace	https://www.chapeaublaricum.nl	Nessun premio	French	5.0	€€	f	f	Experience the charm of its colourful bistro decor, the peace and quiet of the terrace and a soothing ambience in this restaurant straight out of quintessential Burgundy! Here, Nicky Quarz revives often forgotten French classics without any unnecessary frivolity yet teeming with authentic flavours. Through his sauces, intensity etc, enjoy a welcome return to the very roots of French cuisine.	buonvinogino	\N	\N
3336246521	Escobar	Spuiplein 15	Netherlands	Breskens	Credit cards not accepted,Terrace	https://www.escobarbreskens.nl/	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine, Spanish	3.0	€€	t	f	This colourful restaurant has a real holiday feel, with its lively Spanish ambience and friendly, enthusiastic staff. The menu features a wide selection of dishes, from well-known tapas to more unusual and less conventional options. An excellent restaurant in which to enjoy a Spanish meal with friends.	coppolaartem	\N	\N
3334332644	Uit de Kunst	Vijlenberg 76	Netherlands	Vijlen	Car park,Great view,Terrace	https://www.uitdekunstvijlen.nl/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Hikers and cyclists who test themselves to their limits on the Vijlenberg are rewarded by this modern restaurant situated right at the top. The superb view from the terrace is a feast for the eyes, while the traditional dishes served here are a treat for the taste buds. Simple yet refined and delicious cuisine.	palombasauro	\N	\N
3337623147	Le Vieux Jean	Heilige Geestkerkhof 3	Netherlands	Delft	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.levieuxjean.nl/	Nessun premio	Classic French	5.0	€€	f	t	Robert-Jan Polman's romantic restaurant has been delighting French cuisine enthusiasts since 1974. The robust flavours, subtle undertones and timeless cooking methods are a testament to his culinary skill. The rich lamb jus infused with thyme, which accompanies perfectly roasted Dutch lamb, and the crispy veal sweetbread with a lobster and crayfish sauce are simply divine! The incorporation of Dutch produce, notably game, gives his dishes a unique character. Be sure to try the cheeses too! As you might expect, the wine list gives pride of place to French labels, which perfectly complement the menu.	bauergiulia	\N	\N
