3338133917	LEV Foodbar	Waterstraat 28	Netherlands	Doetinchem	Terrace	https://www.levfoodbar.com/	Nessun premio	Modern French, International	5.0	€€	t	t	The relaxed atmosphere at LEV perfectly matches the concept behind this food bar: sharing dishes and enjoying good food together. The dishes (in snack-sized portions) are not overcomplicated^ a couple of ingredients suffice to create amazing taste sensations. Steak tartare, pork tenderloin, cauliflower tempura, truffle risotto... At LEV, the table quickly fills with irresistible delicacies, often prepared using produce from the Achterhoek region. The perfect accompaniment to one of the many beers!	ivanovsophia	\N	\N
3330895389	Lucie Cocina	Kleine Berg 34b	Netherlands	Eindhoven	Counter dining,Terrace	http://www.lucie-cocina.bar	Nessun premio	Spanish Contemporary, Creative	5.0	€€	t	f	Lucie Cocina boasts a hip, lively atmosphere that captures the essence of an authentic tapas bar. From the moment you step inside, you will be won over by the decor with its vintage-style globe chandeliers, floral-patterned mosaic floor and bar stools at the counter where the seafood is displayed. The menu features an irresistible array of options, from traditional ham croquettes and tortillas to more inventive tapas creations. How about steamed zamburiñas with antiboise, finely chopped jalapeño and a hollandaise foam? Or rather braised veal cheeks with mojo rojo and deep-fried potato cubes? The fantastic value for money means you can sample a wide variety of dishes without breaking the bank. ¡Buen provecho!	beloveva	\N	\N
3336462066	Niemeijer	Akerkstraat 20	Netherlands	Groningen	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.restaurantniemeijer.nl/	Nessun premio	Creative French	3.0	€€	f	f	Janick and Leonie Niemeijer's light and airy restaurant has a distinctly natural and serene feel to it. The couple have put together an extensive à la carte menu and take great pride in their garden, from which they source vegetables and honey, among other produce. These are showcased in creative dishes that often incorporate a nod to Dutch culinary tradition. The way the chef cooks quince from the garden in a cassis syrup with hibiscus and combines it with full-fat vanilla yoghurt, almonds and fresh lemon sorbet is testament to his eye for presentation and his talent for marrying flavours. Unbeatable value for money!	barbierisalvatore	\N	\N
3337298361	De Grote Frederik Bistro	Frederiksplein 7	Netherlands	Groningen	Terrace	https://degrotefrederik.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	4.0	€€	t	t	In this cosy local bistro you immediately get the feeling that guests always come first. This is typified by the excellent front-of-house hospitality of host Marjon, who is delighted to offer advice on a superb selection of wines to accompany chef Arnejan’s unique dishes, which are playful and unpretentious, yet which feature wonderful and surprising flavours.	brandtclara	\N	\N
3331243652	Café Samabe	Korte Veerstraat 1	Netherlands	Haarlem	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://samabe.nl	Nessun premio	Indonesian, Balinese	4.0	€€	f	f	The spicy aromas hit you the moment you enter this colonial-era building dating from 1899. An abundance of wood and an exotic colour scheme make for a uniquely charming setting inside – this place calls itself a café because of its casual atmosphere. The home-style Indonesian cuisine, with a slight preference for Balinese specialities, is indulgent and packs a punch. Think aromatic martabak, rich authentic rijsttafels (including vegetarian options) with spicy rendang and intensely flavoursome sambal goreng telor… At Café Samabe, a feast awaits!	veselyolivia	\N	\N
3338267039	DiVino	Kerkstraat 27	Netherlands	Hapert	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://divino-hapert.nl/	Nessun premio	Contemporary, Mediterranean Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	This former school has been transformed into a warm, urban restaurant, including a graffiti portrait of Don Corleone! You can see the chefs working their magic in the open kitchen, where they create French and Mediterranean dishes full of creativity and nuanced flavours. The risotto puttanesca and the conchiglioni served with game stew and a rich jus are intensely flavoured dishes. Thanks to the wide range of sharing dishes and snacks, and the possibility of ordering half portions of the pasta dishes, you can decide how lavish your meal will be. The fabulous Italian wine library is also a hit, with quite a few guests coming in simply for a nice glass of wine or a cocktail. Cosy!	guerravictor	\N	\N
