3334127701	La Fleurie	Rijkesluisstraat 4	Netherlands	Oirschot	Terrace	https://www.lafleurie.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French, Creative	4.0	€€	t	t	You can really taste Martino Verbruggen's passion and experience in every bite of his dishes. His robust sauces are out of this world. Take, for example, the beautifully reduced veal jus that complements the succulent veal tenderloin and crispy sweetbreads. His cuisine is sophisticated and refined, with occasional international nuances adding an exciting twist. A judicious squeeze of kaffir lime adds a refreshing zing to the seasonal fish tartare. Hostess Loes is always on hand and contributes to the laid-back atmosphere that sets La Fleurie apart. A delightful dining experience!	mancinialberto	\N	\N
3338392912	Alma Bodega	De Lind 45A	Netherlands	Oisterwijk	Counter dining,Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://www.alma.nl/bodega	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Contemporary	4.0	€€	f	t	The more down-to-earth little brother of MICHELIN-starred Alma has its own personality. Chic marble and stylish design give this laid-back restaurant flair. You can drop in any time of day to indulge in a fresh take on familiar flavours. The menu features a variety of dishes that will tempt your taste buds, including gyoza, köfte, pâté en croûte, perfectly done entrecôte with a delicious veal jus, rum baba and more. The skilfully prepared and generously flavoured dishes never fail to impress. Curated by Malou Hagenaars, the wine list always includes some exciting finds. Be sure to make your reservation in good time to avoid disappointment!	mazzaviktor	\N	\N
3334129635	Boompjes	Irenestraat 1	Netherlands	Overloon	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://boompjes-restaurant.nl/	Nessun premio	Country cooking, Cuisine from the Marches	4.0	€€	t	f	As you enter, you pass the brasserie, where you can enjoy a casual lunch or snack. The space at the rear of the restaurant is like an oasis, with trees, plants and wood setting the tone. The terrace seamlessly merges with chef Jaap Volman's kitchen garden. An ambassador of Dutch cuisine, his cooking style is very much French-inspired, but his creative use of vegetables and fruit adds lightness and freshness . The velvety consommé with its subtle acidity accompanying the succulent pork cheeks was just as delightful as the vibrant medley of garden-fresh vegetables and herbs. What a way to showcase Dutch produce!	bassioleg	\N	\N
3333126456	Bistro TWO	Roerkade 11	Netherlands	Roermond	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://bistrotwo.nl/	Nessun premio	Farm to table	3.0	€€	t	t	If you're craving comfort food and a glass of fine wine, Dux hotel's vibrant bistro, with its lovely terrace on Roerkade promenade, is the place for you. With an extensive à la carte selection and a more playful set menu created by Lambert Walter, there's something to suit every taste. A duck liver terrine to start? Then perhaps Livar pork belly with an exquisite shallot sauce, freshly cut fries and a salad with a zingy vinaigrette? Or would you prefer their Mediterranean aubergine dish, before finally tucking into your tarte Tatin? Here, familiar flavours are given a subtle modern twist, without skimping on the portions – and its fantastic value for money!	de angelislucas	\N	\N
3337171591	Waers	Bakkerstraat 30	Netherlands	Roermond		http://www.restaurantwaers.nl	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine, Scandinavian	4.0	€€	t	f	Waers is the incarnation of anti-conformity, which sums up Dennis Vermeulen to a T! In his restaurant showcasing a strong sense of Scandinavian purity, he brings out the very best of market-fresh ingredients and the seasons. There’s no fuss here, just original, well-balanced dishes with a contemporary feel that are well worth discovering and offer excellent value for money.	guerravictor	\N	\N
3338410341	Umami by Han	Binnenrotte 140	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Terrace	https://umami-restaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Asian, Chinese	5.0	€	t	f	A colourful restaurant with a winning culinary concept: intensely flavoursome Asian cuisine with a French twist. The extensive menu features a tempting array of dishes that are also perfect for sharing. Exquisite sea bass ceviche, crispy duck with an orange cream, vegetarian gyoza with a kimchi and chilli mayonnaise sauce… deciding what to order will not be easy! With plenty of wonderful vegetarian options and its €25 lunch deal, this place is a real asset to Rotterdam's dining scene.	galbanielena	\N	\N
3332017382	Asian Glories	Westewagenstraat 74	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.asianglories.nl/	Nessun premio	Chinese	3.0	€€	t	f	The natural light and high ceilings are the first things to catch your eye when you walk into Asian Glories, but it is the view of the church and the canal that really wins you over. Understated Asian art lends a touch of individuality to the decor. The open kitchen affords glimpses of hanging Peking ducks and busy chefs at work. The culinary traditions of Canton and Sichuan prevail here, served up in generous, umami-rich dishes. Dim sum, prepared in house, chicken tempura, a beautifully light and airy steamed bun with pork belly confit: good luck choosing from the extensive à la carte and set menus!	tudoroh	\N	\N
3339383509	Gym & Gin	Kralingseweg 224	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace	https://www.gymandgin.nl/	Nessun premio	International, Asian Influences	3.0	€€	t	f	The name Gym & Gin is a reference to the balance we all have to find between pleasure and healthy living. After a workout in the gym upstairs, unwind in this lounge-like establishment with its vintage colour scheme and designer furniture. The cocktail/gin list as well as Kevin Valkhoff's set menu and à la carte options are all as impressive as each other. Inspired by exotic subtleties, he brings flavours to life with original flashes of inspiration, such as adding red pepper to cucumber and mango in order to give salmon some extra pep. If you fancy an afternoon aperitif and a light bite, the good news is that Gym & Gin is always open.	habiliragip	\N	\N
3330130653	Huson	Scheepstimmermanslaan 14	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.huson.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Huson is a trendy establishment where a lively industriousness always prevails. Here guests' mouths will water at the marvellous pairing of creativity with international ingredients in small dishes which are as subtle as they are exuberant. The chef is a dab hand at beautifully balancing fullness of flavour with freshness, as his signature dishes show.	bassioleg	\N	\N
3338889312	Vineum	Eendrachtsweg 23	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Interesting wine list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.vineum.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	f	f	The wine list is the linchpin of this warm, aptly named restaurant with an intimate urban garden to the rear. Owner David van Steenderen, a world-class sommelier, has a knack for finding new gems. He takes great pleasure in letting his diners taste his discoveries for themselves, offering a choice of wine pairings. The food is just as sophisticated. Classic techniques meet innovative ideas and expertise, creating dishes that complement the wines beautifully. Savour ceviche made with young mackerel, or salmon tartare with a millefeuille of chicory and sorrel oil. With an extensive à la carte selection and set menus, one is spoilt for choice!	nikiforovevelyn	\N	\N
3331060978	Rotonde	Goudsesingel 230	Netherlands	Rotterdam	Counter dining,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://restaurantrotonde.nl/	Nessun premio	Vegetarian, Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	They pick up their vegetables in an electric van. The aim is to utilise every part of their produce, which is grown with respect for nature and the seasons. All of their wines are biodynamic or natural. This vintage-style restaurant is deeply committed to sustainability and is always looking for ways to do better (visit their website to learn more). This vision is brought to life in creative, intriguing and entirely vegetarian dishes that are incredibly flavoursome, sophisticated and full of surprises. Think bell pepper confit and an XO sauce made from mushrooms to elevate a sapid leek stalk. A spot by the open kitchen is a must if you want to watch the chefs tame the flames of their wood-fired barbecue!	bergmannalexandru	\N	\N
3337225758	De Beleving	Hertog Hendrikstraat 6	Netherlands	Sint-Oedenrode	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.debeleving.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	4.0	€€	t	t	At this spacious brasserie, perfect for relaxed dining, a warm and welcoming atmosphere awaits. The wide-ranging à la carte selection and surprise menus draw on Dutch, French and Mediterranean influences. The dishes are hearty and satisfying, without being overly complicated. Options include al dente tagliatelle with prawns and a rich lobster bisque, perfectly seared ribeye steak with a robust red wine sauce, hasselback pumpkin, and tiramisu: the choices are seemingly endless! At this Bib Gourmand restaurant, incredible value for money is guaranteed.	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3333422641	Bovenmeester	Woldpoort 57	Netherlands	Steenwijk	Air conditioning,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.bovenmeestersteenwijk.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern French	5.0	€€	t	t	The head teacher might have left a while ago, but it is still evident that this place used to be a school building – even the children's coat hooks remain. Nowadays, this is a warm and welcoming restaurant with a cosy lounge area. French cuisine unveils all its generosity here. Think unctuous duck liver terrine served with toasted brioche^ sea bream on a bread crust and a spicy sauce with saffron… Unbeatable value for money!	habiliragip	\N	\N
3338748511	Resumé by 6&24	Bierkade 16A	Netherlands	The Hague	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.resumeby6en24.nl	Nessun premio	International	5.0	€€	f	f	A glass of crisp rosé with a fine selection of cured meats in the wine bar or on the canal-side terrace, a few small plates to share, or a complete meal in the restaurant, with its floral, slightly tropical-looking decor… You have plenty of options here. The tempting menu includes an intensely flavoursome ceviche, a vegetarian dish based on dry-aged beetroot, and a rich tarte Tatin. The chefs are just as happy to play with exotic seasonings as they are to turn out distinctly Dutch dishes. In short: delicious, inspired and generous!	landirobert	\N	\N
3337661247	De Basiliek	Korte Houtstraat 4a	Netherlands	The Hague	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.debasiliek.nl/	Nessun premio	Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	f	With its trendy, lively atmosphere, colourful decor and pretty terrace at the front, De Basiliek has a decidedly convivial atmosphere. The tempting menu features fresh Mediterranean dishes full of generous flavours, with vegetables playing an important role. The chef draws on his culinary expertise to deliver exciting cuisine brimming with clever combinations. The impressive wine list proposes plenty of options by the glass and in half-bottles. Excellent value for money!	carlinikita	\N	\N
3338200137	Basaal	Dunne Bierkade 3	Netherlands	The Hague	Terrace	http://www.restaurantbasaal.nl	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	f	With a delightful waterside terrace for sunny days and a cosy interior with a Scandinavian and vintage feel for when the weather is cooler, this inviting neighbourhood restaurant has plenty going for it. But, of course, the focal point is the kitchen, where chef Daan van Munster creates honest market-fresh cuisine. Whether you prefer to share with your dining companions or go solo, you can compile your own set menu from a tempting list of options, including some rather unconventional dishes. Think creamy veal neck and foie gras terrine, or tender veal tongue with coco de Paimpol beans and a robust veal stock sauce. This chef takes his cue from the seasons, and vegetables are always a key part of his dishes. The moderately priced wine list is the icing on the cake.	schr�derfedericha	\N	\N
3336835281	Restaurant ñ	Nobelstraat 22	Netherlands	The Hague	Counter dining,Terrace	https://www.restaurant-n.nl/	Nessun premio	Spanish	4.0	€€	f	t	The yellow façade of this relaxed restaurant gives it a southern feel, which is further enhanced by the aromas of typical, authentic Spanish and Mediterranean dishes that greet you as you step through the door. The delicious options on the menu include fresh seafood, spicy chilli peppers, and dishes served with fresh, sophisticated sauces, as well as an excellent selection of cheese and charcuterie.	grecodavide	\N	\N
3333724204	Tapisco	Kneuterdijk 11	Netherlands	The Hague	Air conditioning,Terrace	https://www.tapisco.nl/	Nessun premio	Spanish	4.0	€€	f	t	For centuries this was a famous bookshop^ today this restaurant full of character and with a Mediterranean flair is regarded as the place to go for Spanish tapas and Portuguese petiscos. The experienced chef creates small typical dishes prepared with quality produce, not too complex but full of flavour, that take guests on an incredible Mediterranean journey.	barbierisalvatore	\N	\N
3339830020	Te Koop in Tilburg	Jan Pieterszoon Coenstraat 71	Netherlands	Tilburg		http://www.tekoopintilburg.nl	Nessun premio	International, French Contemporary	3.0	€€	f	t	Crispy fried soft shell crab with broccoli and couscous, tomato tartare with a Manchego foam and herb oil, or beef bavette steak with veal jus infused with cloves and cardamom… Located just outside Tilburg city centre, this cosy neighbourhood restaurant with a warm and welcoming decor has it all. The chef, who enjoys tapping into international flavours and makes sure to cater to vegetarians, showcases his cuisine in an appealing choice of courses from which diners compile their own set menu. What's not to like?	d'angelonino	\N	\N
