3333089122	The Little Pickle	Jens Bjelkes gate 9A	Norway	Oslo	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Wheelchair access	https://www.thelittlepickle.no/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	It’s not often that restaurants in Oslo are influenced by British cuisine, but that’s exactly what you’ll find at this minimally decorated neighbourhood bistro. Operations such as London's St. John are the inspiration for the kitchen, with dishes like beef brisket pie and mash providing suitably gutsy flavours and hearty generosity. They even serve a traditional roast dinner on Sundays! French influences come into play as well, as with the madeleines for dessert. Friendly service creates a lovely, welcoming atmosphere.	melnikovstella	\N	\N
3335763587	FAGN-Bistro	Ørjaveita 4	Norway	Trondheim		https://fagn.no/	Nessun premio	Norwegian, Modern Cuisine	5.0	€€	f	f	This simple bistro is set on the floor above FAGN restaurant and uses the same top quality local produce as its Michelin-Starred sibling. The Norwegian dishes are rustic with punchy flavours^ choose between an à la carte or tasting menus of 3 and 5 courses. The waiting staff and chefs add to the relaxed buzz.	fiorentinolukas	\N	\N
