3331527507	Treinta y Tres	Olivia Centre	Poland	Gdansk	Air conditioning,Interesting wine list,Wheelchair access	https://www.oliviastar.pl/restauracje/treinta-y-tres/	Nessun premio	Spanish	3.0	€€	f	t	The 33rd floor of the Olivia Centre skyscraper provides spectacular panoramic views for this buzzing restaurant where Spanish guitar music soundtracks your visit. The cooking has a similar tone, with a selection of classic tapas to begin – the Ibérico ham croquetas are terrific – before a choice of main dishes. If you’re dining with company, the 800g lobster rice for two is the most eye-catching option on the menu. A genuine warmth from the service team and a comprehensive, largely Spanish wine list complete the picture.	bianchiandrea	\N	\N
