3338515320	La Cartería	Camino Real 49	Spain	Cartes		http://www.restaurantelacarteria.com	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	Cartes is a small town of particular interest along the historic “camino real” that once connected the region of Castille with the port of Santander. Here, in this 17C mansion that once served as the post office, chef Enrique Pérez offers his guests updated traditional cuisine that is delicate and lovingly prepared, with a focus on presentation and flavours that will leave their mark on the palate. The welcoming, rustically inspired dining room is complemented by a few tables beneath a balcony at the entrance – a perfect setting for a drink as you watch the world go by in one of the country’s most delightful streets!	martinooliver	\N	\N
