3334584094	Les Curiades	Vieux-Lully 10	Switzerland	Bernex	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.restaurantlescuriades.ch	Nessun premio	Regional Cuisine, Farm to table	4.0	€€	f	f	A truly historic restaurant which has been serving food since 1850. The present chef has experience in some of the finest restaurants, and it shows! His cuisine is elegant and refined, including dishes such as chuck beef braised in beer (paying tribute to the chef’s Belgian origins) and a delicious vegetarian menu which is always available. An unqualified success!	cellericelina	\N	\N
3338221317	Nest- und Bietschhorn	Talstrasse 16	Switzerland	Blatten im Lötschental	Car park,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.nest-bietschhorn.ch/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, International	3.0	€€	f	t	This cosy rustic restaurant enjoys a wonderful location at 1 490m above sea level. It is housed in the Lötschental's oldest hotel, which opened in 1868 (the modern Alpine-style guestrooms are gorgeous!) and serves exceptionally good food. The dishes are prepared with regional and seasonal ingredients. Tip: leave some room for one of the fabulous desserts! To accompany your meal, there are Valais wines. Overlooking the valley and mountains, the delightful lounge and terrace area is adorned with flowers and herbs. Shorter menu served 2-5pm.	galassiniccolo	\N	\N
3334022695	Agorà	Via Muro degli Ottevi 10	Switzerland	Brissago	Terrace	https://www.agorabrissago.ch/	Nessun premio	Italian, Classic Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Located in relaxing Brissago, this historic bistro features a pleasantly retro ambience and well-maintained wood furnishings. The courteous service is accompanied by the delicious flavours of dishes that follow the seasons and include traditional and Mediterranean touches. The ravioli del plin stuffed with braised wild boar are a highlight.	ferrijacopo	\N	\N
3335166955	Stadthaus	Kirchbühl 2	Switzerland	Burgdorf	Car park,Wheelchair access	https://www.stadthaus.ch/	Nessun premio	International, Seasonal Cuisine	3.0	€€	f	f	In the restaurant of the grand Hotel Stadthaus, you can either dine in the casual Stadtcafé or the elegant La Pendule^ the same flavoursome cuisine is served in both areas. There are classics such as cordon bleu, vegetarian dishes and a bistro set menu – an ambitious gourmet set menu is also served on Thu-Sat evenings. The range of wines available by the glass and bottles is also impressive.	georgesculalla	\N	\N
3333921811	Bistrot du Lion d'Or	Rue Ancienne 53	Switzerland	Carouge	Interesting wine list,Terrace	https://liondorcarouge.ch/	Nessun premio	Classic French	5.0	€€	t	f	In the restaurant of this hotel dating from 1750, the team offers - in a friendly and relaxed atmosphere - delicious French cuisine with seasonal products, such as artichoke, smoked whitefish from the nearby lakes and buckwheat, or pan-fried sweetbreads, morels and asparagus. The well-curated wine list is also worthy of your attention. In fine weather, the pleasant terrace to the rear of the building is a peaceful little haven for diners.	weberdragos	\N	\N
3332464880	Ivy 23	Rue Ancienne 23	Switzerland	Carouge	Terrace	http://www.ivy23.ch	Nessun premio	Farm to table, Modern French	5.0	€€	f	f	A lively restaurant and bar in the historical centre of Carouge. Whitewashed brick walls and 1930s-style decoration, such as lamps and old posters evocative of the prohibition era in the US, make for a distinctive atmosphere, underscored by a soundtrack of jazz/swing sounds. They serve modern and seasonal food with a French twist. Pleasant little terrace in the courtyard to the rear.	serafinidmitri	\N	\N
