3334549856	Chappeli	Allerheiligenstrasse 218	Switzerland	Grenchen	Car park,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.chappeli-grenchen.ch/	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Farm to table	3.0	€€	f	f	In this pleasantly laid-back restaurant overlooking the village, the Hausmann/Köhli husband-and-wife team propose a really fun dining experience! The chef-patron cooks up delectable dishes that are delightfully down-to-earth: drawing inspiration from the region, they are big on flavour, with options including, for example, leek and bacon ravioli with fresh morels, or pork steak with Meaux mustard, mashed potatoes and vegetables. Nicely curated wine list and highly attentive service courtesy of the lady of the house, whose natural charm shines through. Be sure to bag a table on the delightfully verdant garden terrace!	impeiluca	\N	\N
3334282344	The Mansard Restaurant	Untergstaadstrasse 26	Switzerland	Gstaad	Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://www.the-mansard.ch/	Nessun premio	International, Regional Cuisine	4.0	€€	f	f	Located on the ground floor of boutique hotel Miiro The Mansard, this restaurant has a modern and elegant brasserie-style interior with an Alpine feel. There is a terrace with a few tables out on the pavement – this is a place to see and be seen. Martin Bieri is in charge of the hotel, restaurant and kitchen. Using top-notch ingredients, many of them Swiss, he and his team cook up flavoursome international cuisine to be ordered à la carte. The menu includes dishes such as Lauenen dried meat with Gstaad mountain cheese, and Balfego tuna carpaccio with a sesame marinade. You can also look forward to a well-curated wine list and friendly service. Tip: For a cool rooftop bar experience with stunning views, head to the bar The Mansard Rooftop on the fourth floor, which serves drinks, cocktails and a small selection of snacks. Thanks to its central location close to the Gstaad Promenade, the hotel is also an ideal starting point for a stroll around the shops.	schneidermihai	\N	\N
