3337234142	Brasserie Le Gogant	Route de France 8	Switzerland	Le Brassus	Air conditioning,Car park,Great view,Wheelchair access	https://www.hoteldeshorlogers.com/de/dining	Nessun premio	Seasonal Cuisine, Modern Cuisine	4.0	€€	t	t	Both this restaurant and the designer Hôtel des Horlogers in which it is housed exude a stylish and upscale ambiance. A feast for the eyes awaits: aside from the elegant interior design, guests can relish the panoramic vistas of nature through expansive floor-to-ceiling windows, or opt to observe the captivating culinary artistry in the kitchen, visible through a generously sized glass pane. The seasonal dishes harmoniously blend classical and traditional flavours (with rich stocks and delectable sauces), presented in a contemporary fashion. The aesthetics and impeccable quality of these creations seamlessly complement the overall setting.	d'angelonino	\N	\N
