3337975643	Centrale	via Locarno 2	Switzerland	Losone	Car park,Terrace	https://www.ristorantecentrale-losone.ch	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine, Seasonal Cuisine	5.0	€€	t	t	Particularly renowned and popular with locals, this restaurant has a delightful family ambience. It offers delicious regional cuisine that can be enjoyed outdoors on the lovely terrace in fine weather.	kralrosa	\N	\N
