3338233177	Chao Ming	53 Zihciang 1st Road	Taiwan	Kaohsiung	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Taiwanese	5.0	$$	t	f	Now helmed by the second generation of the family, this well-known landmark of Taiwanese home-style cooking has been in business for over 60 years. Masterful control of heat and a dexterous use of sauces depict the food, most of which comes in three portion sizes. Hallmark dishes include stir-fried pork belly with garlic sprouts and stir-fried clams with mung bean sprouts. Wild-caught marine fish, braised or pan-fried, is also popular.	de angelislucas	\N	\N
