3331317187	Morakot Kitchen	28 Mu 4	Thailand	Pathum Thani	Cash only		Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	฿฿	t	f	For over 120 years, this no-frills kitchen in a wooden house on a main road has been dishing up intensely flavourful, comforting Thai fare. Don't miss the fish cake, made from authentic spotted featherback fish and heavenly spiced, served with the sweet house-special dipping sauce.	iordachelilly	\N	\N
3336232179	Niou Jia Juang	19 Xinfeng Street	Taiwan	Taichung	Air conditioning,Car park,Wheelchair access	http://www.nioujiajuang.com.tw	Nessun premio	Hakkanese	4.0	$$	f	t	This 60-year-old household name is undergoing an 18-month renovation and is temporarily operating at a spot 50 metres from the original shop. From the cartoon cow on the sign to cow-shaped decorations inside, beef is obviously the staple offering here. Local yellow beef is cooked nose-to-tail in traditional Hakkanese ways and the offal is unmissable – try scallion bone marrow, and cold beef tripe dressed in sweet and sour sauce.	romanosimone	\N	\N
