3331578729	Por. Pochaya	654-656 Wisut Kasat Road	Thailand	Bangkok	Cash only		Nessun premio	Thai-Chinese	3.0	฿	t	f	For over half a century, unwavering quality and rare dishes have kept loyal fans visiting this traditional Thai-Chinese spot, which is now run by the third generation of the same family. Among the top-sellers are crab omelette and stir-fried beef with cumin leaves. Crowds are to be expected, so make sure you book to avoid disappointment. It’s closed on weekends and holidays.	georgesculalla	\N	\N
