3336395685	Agave	153 Phalorangrit Road	Thailand	Ubon Ratchathani	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Vietnamese	3.0	฿฿	t	f	The owner, an agave plant enthusiast, has adorned this cosy space with agave plants throughout. Vietnamese home cooking, enhanced with local Isan spices, fills the air, accompanied by instrumental music in the high-ceilinged room. All ingredients are homemade, offering a choice of pork or fish sausage for the namneung. Don't miss the standout sticky rice waffle served with sun-dried pork, infused with local Isan flavours.	volkovnatalie	\N	\N
3331423704	Indochine	170 Sappasit Road	Thailand	Ubon Ratchathani	Air conditioning,Car park,Cash only		Nessun premio	Vietnamese	4.0	฿฿	t	f	The name Indochine is derived from the connection between two countries - Vietnamese family recipes have been served here for over 50 years. And family is the key to this popular business where everyone pitches in. The restaurant boasts vintage décor, using old wooden furniture and tables made from defunct sewing machines. The Vietnamese rice cake with grille pork is highly recommended, while the signature namnueng comes in a big basket with a mix of fresh local vegetables.	serafinidmitri	\N	\N
3338551313	Krua Khun Nid	64 Soi Nonnivet 1	Thailand	Udon Thani	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Isan	4.0	฿	f	f	For over four decades this restaurant has been a mainstay for locals. Focusing on freshwater fish and meat, it serves large sharing portions. Seasonal options and occasional fish specials accompany enduring classics, such as the flavourful deep-fried Pla Som, or snakehead fish in flavoursome tom yum soup. The friendly staff are happy to share their recommendations.	scarpatacco	\N	\N
3333588845	Samuay & Sons	103/8 Si Chomchuen Road	Thailand	Udon Thani	Air conditioning,Car park		Nessun premio	Isan	5.0	฿฿	f	f	After studying and working in San Francisco, brothers Num and Joe returned to Thailand to open a fine dining restaurant not in Bangkok, but in Udon Thani. Samuay & Sons serves a contemporary Isan tasting menu and great value à la carte dishes in a loft-style space. For the full experience, try the excellent seasonal tasting menu, which not only balances flavours but is also nutritionally balanced.	shirocky	\N	\N
3330528589	Peng Duck Noodles	439 Nong Tao Lek Road	Thailand	Udon Thani	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Noodles	5.0	฿	f	f	The strength of this shop is its locally sourced free-range meat. The tender braised duck noodles, including neck, wing and thigh, are highlights. Their slow-cooked pork is equally exceptional. Try the duck rice with a smooth blood jelly and five spices.	bellandigiorgio	\N	\N
3333082107	Khao Soi Thai Yai	331/4 Mu 5	Thailand	Udon Thani	Cash only		Nessun premio	Northern Thai	4.0	฿	f	f	The original owners moved to Isan more than 20 years ago and brought the flavours of Northern Thailand with them. The owner doesn't compromise on quality, ensuring the spices are well utilised to produce bold, balanced and authentic flavours. Khao Soi is the speciality here. For groups, order the Northern Thai set – the homemade sausage won't disappoint. Round off your meal with a refreshing dessert.	weberdragos	\N	\N
3339108779	Majchapasuk	166 Mu 8	Thailand	Udon Thani	Air conditioning,Car park,Terrace		Nessun premio	Thai	3.0	฿	f	f	A serene pond encircled by wooden pavilions is Majchapasuk's tranquil setting. Each spot in the expansive seating area has a soothing atmosphere, ideal for savouring local seafood steeped in over 40 years of Isan culinary heritage. Standout mains showcase Isan tradition with seabass and snakehead fish. Don't miss the crispy deep-fried spring rolls stuffed with minced pork and pork skin. Evening promises optimum weather conditions and idyllic pond views.	bellandigiorgio	\N	\N
3333473728	Kao.Piak.Sen	20/20 Si Suk Road	Thailand	Udon Thani	Air conditioning,Cash only		Nessun premio	Vietnamese	5.0	฿฿	f	f	Formerly a street food stall, the owners have upped the quality of the menu and the dining experience. Kao Piak’s stylish restaurant seamlessly blends timeless and contemporary styles, drawing inspiration from Vietnam’s architectural heritage. Their signature aromatic pork broth is simmered for 8 hours yielding exquisitely tender meat. Don't miss out on the grilled lemongrass-marinated pork kebabs and Vietnamese sausage.	lehmannlucian	\N	\N
3337827710	Otantik Ocakbaşı	Atatürk Caddesi No:46	Türkiye	Bodrum	Terrace	https://otantikocakbasi.com/	Nessun premio	Grills, Turkish	5.0	₺	f	f	The barbecue and wood-fired oven will catch your eye as soon as you enter this congenial establishment, which has a cosy terrace in the lane to the rear. The chef expertly tames the open fire to cook delicious dishes, such as kebab and grilled dry-aged steak. The mixed grill is a signature dish here: a variety of juicy meats, oven-fresh bread and a judicious sprinkle of sumac. This restaurant offers great value for the money, serving delicious food without pretensions.	venturaroman	\N	\N
3330833933	Arka Ristorante Pizzeria	Çarşı	Türkiye	Bodrum	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.arkapizzeria.com/	Nessun premio	Italian, Pizza	5.0	₺	f	f	With its red-and-white check tablecloths, photographs and paintings from Italy, vintage decor and a terrace overlooking the pebble beach, this trattoria is the embodiment of Mediterranean charm. The menu features an extensive range of tempting traditional dishes. The Neapolitan-style pizzas and creamy risotto with super-fresh seafood are especially popular. There are also 12 different dishes with house-made pasta to choose from. This generosity is just one example of why Arka has been a Bodrum favourite for so long – and rightfully so!	orlovclaire	\N	\N
3331338607	İki Sandal	Kumbahçe Mahallesi	Türkiye	Bodrum	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.ikisandal.com.tr	Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	3.0	₺₺	t	t	It's impossible to pass by this charming meyhane, a traditional tavern, where the conviviality is infectious. The wide range of cold and hot mezze on offer is based on recipes that are sometimes centuries old. Think sea bass steeped in herbs and spices in an earthenware pot for 10 days, or subtly spicy dolmasi stuffed with lentils. And then there is the intensely flavoursome lamb that melts in the mouth… Watch out, or you will end up ordering everything on the menu!	pirijiri	\N	\N
3339197696	Beynel	Adliye Caddesi No:63	Türkiye	Bodrum	Car park,Terrace,Valet parking		Nessun premio	Turkish	5.0	₺₺	t	f	Take a seat on the terrace of this open-air restaurant, among the mandarin and lemon trees, and prepare yourself for some Anatolian generosity. The mezze- and kebab-style dishes are perfect for sharing with friends or for a romantic dinner for two. Tempting options on the menu include roasted aubergine stuffed with meat seasoned with paprika and a yoghurt dressing, and flatbread with a lamb brochette, lamb pastrami, Golot cheese and an onion salad with sumac and fresh herbs. Discover a world of rich flavours that won't break the bank!	vitolajose	\N	\N
3339551495	Araf İstanbul	AG/E İç Kapı	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.arafistanbul.com/	Nessun premio	Contemporary, Turkish	3.0	₺₺	t	f	Kenan and Pınar Çetinkaya are your cordial hosts at this cosy restaurant, where seating is limited. A spot at the dining counter is best if you want to watch how the chefs expertly tame the open fire. The dishes bring out the core essence of their main ingredient, and their apparent simplicity belies their depth of flavour. The kitchen team conjure up a vegetarian creation centred on beetroot just as deftly as they prepare offal. For instance, they fry the lamb brains twice to achieve a crispy crust and soft interior. A sweet fermented chilli paste, aioli and yuzu sauce, and pickled onion provide a delicately sour counterbalance. Thanks to the small portions, you can explore the enticing menu thoroughly.	guerravictor	\N	\N
3338569053	Aida - vino e cucina	Caferağa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://aidavinoecucina.com	Nessun premio	Italian	3.0	₺₺	f	f	The lively atmosphere of the coastal district of Moda is taken up a notch in this bustling restaurant spread over three floors. As the name suggests, it brings you a taste of Italy. The dishes served here are not unnecessarily complicated, but they have that je-ne-sais-quoi that makes Italian cuisine so beloved. The menu includes mouthwatering options, such homemade salsiccia made with succulent lamb, salty pecorino cheese and pancetta with a celery puree, as well as an original take on vitello tonnato. Rest assured: at Aida Vino e Cucina you can relish delicious food without breaking the bank.	fioreerik	\N	\N
3336752475	Inari Omakase Kuruçeşme	Kuruçeşme Caddesi No:11	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Notable sake list,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Valet parking	https://www.inariomakase.com	Nessun premio	Japanese Contemporary	5.0	₺₺	t	f	Inari Omakase Kuruçeşme is a contemporary-style designer restaurant with two faces. In the afternoon, it is a quiet place in which to savour Japanese classics with a smattering of hip Californian influences. In the evenings it feels more like a nightclub, with louder music courtesy of live DJs. Either way, this is a popular destination where you can share mouth-watering creations, and delight in the, at times, surprising flavours and fine textures of nigiri, sashimi, tempura, teppanyaki and more. The fine balance between the fresh, sweet and spicy nuances of the deep-fried squid rings with lime zest, wasabi mayonnaise and chilli is simply irresistible!	rossidino	\N	\N
3339005674	Cuma	Firuzağa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://cuma.cc	Nessun premio	Mediterranean Cuisine	5.0	₺₺	f	t	A stroll through the trendy Çukurcuma neighbourhood, which is famous for its antique shops, should certainly include a meal at Cuma. At this cosy establishment – be sure to secure a spot on the front terrace – you can tuck into a traditional Turkish breakfast or Mediterranean-style lunch or dinner. Seasonal ingredients are showcased brilliantly in tapas such as sea bass ceviche, generously topped pizzettas, aromatic pasta dishes etc. The chef places special emphasis on vegetarian dishes, such as mushroom skewers and halloumi cheese with braised onion, pomegranate and deep-fried polenta. Everyone is sure to find something to their liking here, and at great value for money!	colombostefano	\N	\N
3335491248	SADE Beş Denizler Mutfağı	Teşvikiye Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace		Nessun premio	Traditional Cuisine	5.0	₺	t	f	The never-ending hustle and bustle of the lively Nişantaşı neighbourhood is what characterises this cosy establishment. Locals and international diners come here for either a quick bite or a substantial dinner with friends. Genuine Turkish hospitality and great value for money are the biggest draws of SADE Beş Denizler Mutfağı. Anatolian delicacies such as spicy beef tongue salad with chilli and manti (Turkish ravioli) served with potato, kokoretsi meat and yoghurt are celebrated here with the generosity you would expect. No fuss, just rich flavours you won't be able to get enough of.	salluis	\N	\N
3330446358	Ali Ocakbaşı	Arap Camii Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.aliocakbasi.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺₺	t	t	A narrow street leads you to this somewhat hidden gem. The waterside setting is a draw in itself, but the main attractions are the barbecue and tandoori oven. With a sure hand, the chefs flame-grill aubergine, for example, and then season it with chilli and five-spice powder. Their marinated lamb and beef are cooked to juicy perfection, generously spiced and served with lavash bread that has been briefly crisped up on the barbecue. The various mezze, salads and desserts such as halva stay true to tradition. And for this price point, the value is fantastic!	giulianijames	\N	\N
3333335657	Karaköy Lokantası	Kemankeş Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://www.karakoylokantasi.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺₺	t	t	Intensely flavoursome tarama with toasted bread, crispy deep-fried courgette with yoghurt, sea bass elevated by a spicy mustard-based remoulade… With a selection of over 80 mezze, a whole host of sharing platters and other traditional dishes, you're spoilt for choice. The chef uses top-quality ingredients and avoids unnecessary complexity. His dishes pack a punch, with subtle Greek influences appearing throughout. This bustling establishment with its quiet terrace has earned its popularity. Delicious food and great value for money!	bigazzimattia	\N	\N
3332884529	Nazende Cadde	Caddebostan	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Terrace		Nessun premio	Turkish	4.0	₺₺	t	t	Head to the neighbourhood of upmarket Bağdat Avenue and experience the cosiness and friendly atmosphere of Nazende Cadde. This is a great place in which to share all kinds of delicacies with friends. The tempting menu changes daily to take advantage of the best market offerings, but the chefs also have a few signature dishes up their sleeves, including succulent barbecued squid rings with a fiery kick. They like working with offal, and spice up lamb liver, for example, with a judicious touch of chilli. This is a lively establishment where generosity comes from the heart.	tottifrancesco	\N	\N
3332790873	Tavacı Recep Usta Bostancı	Altintepe	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://tavacirecepusta.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Turkish	3.0	₺	t	t	This spacious restaurant specialises in lamb and mezze. It is here that traditional Turkish cuisine unfolds in all its generosity. It is such a pleasure to feast on dishes like dolması stuffed with minced lamb, tomato and rice, or the delicious grilled aubergine and pepper with juicy minced lamb. No pretension, just pleasingly robust flavours. The numerous photographs of the celebrities who have dined here are proof that this place has been a crowd pleaser for over 40 years.	rinaldisamuel	\N	\N
3333381697	EFENDY	Nisbetiye Caddesi No:13	Türkiye	Istanbul	Restaurant offering vegetarian menus	https://www.efendyistanbul.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Contemporary	3.0	₺₺	f	t	Famed local chef Somer Sivrioğlu has assembled a talented team at Efendy, a vibrant restaurant with a warm Oriental ambiance. At this restaurant, traditional Anatolian cuisine is reimagined with a modern twist. Ancient techniques, such as cooking over an open fire, are combined with fresh ideas to create exciting dishes. The sea bass is cooked to perfection, with a crispy exterior and juicy interior. A fermented tomato jus adds a touch of sweetness and acidity, while lime and fennel add zing. A delightful juxtaposition of old and new!	molnarbianca	\N	\N
3336558991	Tershane	Arap Cami Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning,Great view,Terrace	https://www.tershanerestaurant.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Grills	4.0	₺₺	t	f	Fancy experiencing the contemporary version of Istanbul? Then head to the eighth floor of Hotel Momento. Its large windows afford views of the city's historical skyline (on the ninth floor, there is an even better view from the terrace!), and the decor is sleek and stylish. The menu is dedicated to mezze, kebabs and barbecued lamb dishes. You can watch the chefs at work in the open kitchen, skilfully blending spices and smoky flavours^ presentation is also taken very seriously. Turkish bread from the barbecue, for example, is served with an indulgent barbecued bell pepper cream that brings out the natural sweetness of the vegetable, and a judicious touch of smoked paprika and olive oil for an extra kick. Generous, spicy, unctuous and bold: a true Turkish feast!	svobodagreta	\N	\N
3334792897	Pandeli	Rüstempaşa Mahallesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://www.pandeli.com.tr/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Traditional Cuisine	4.0	₺	f	t	Take the stairs to the first floor above the Egyptian bazaar and marvel at the characteristically Turkish decor with its blue mosaics on the walls and its historical cachet. In addition to the main dining space, there are two more private rooms if you would prefer a more intimate setting. The chef resolutely sticks to traditional Turkish dishes: think fragrant dolmas stuffed with rice, berries, pine nuts and a dash of vinegar, or courgette flower filled with feta, deep-fried and paired with a rich and spicy yoghurt dip, to name but a few. This perennial favourite never disappoints!	caputostefan	\N	\N
3330926898	Tatbak	Valikonağı Caddesi	Türkiye	Istanbul	Air conditioning	https://www.tatbak.com/	Nessun premio	Turkish, Traditional Cuisine	4.0	₺	f	t	Tatbak has been the go-to kebab place for many an Istanbulite since 1960, and at no point in that time has it compromised on quality. With its lovely stained-glass windows and marble finishings, the vintage-style decor is attractive, but the local vibe and fantastic value for money are the main draws. Take, for instance, the Gaziantep version of spicy lahmacun (Turkish pizza), generously topped with vegetables and parsley, or the kebab with lamb sausages and minced beef – both are house favourites. The experienced chef skilfully balances sweet, spicy and tangy nuances, without losing sight of the importance of the right textures. Tatbak is a mecca for foodies!	carlinikita	\N	\N
3330000381	LA Mahzen	Kuşçuburun Mahallesi	Türkiye	Izmir	Air conditioning,Car park,Garden or park,Great view,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://lawines.com.tr/restaurant.aspx	Nessun premio	International	3.0	₺	f	f	The Lucien Arkas vineyards are well worth a visit. Take some time to stroll among the vines. It's the perfect way to spend a romantic day with your loved one. The spacious and inviting restaurant overlooks the estate and is a real ambassador for the winery (bottles are for sale at the entrance). The chef's Mediterranean dishes are a feast for the senses, with their simple presentation and bold flavours that perfectly complement the quality wines produced here. Courgette flowers generously stuffed with cheese and herbs, creamy mushroom risotto… Here, the focus is on honest flavours, both in the glass and on the plate.	leonoscar	\N	\N
3330712989	Hiç Lokanta	Yeni Mahallesi	Türkiye	Izmir	Air conditioning,Restaurant offering vegetarian menus,Terrace	https://hicurla.com/hic-lokanta/	Nessun premio	Organic, Seasonal Cuisine	4.0	₺	t	f	This trendy establishment housed in a former Greek theatre in the picturesque old town of Urla is all about sustainability. Respect for the environment is evident in every detail, from the wild-foraged ingredients used to the water conservation and waste management measures in place. The restaurant's freshly pressed olive oil is a highlight of its modern cuisine, which is full of personality. Acidity and spiciness are used to bring life to the dishes, as seen in a salad of wild herbs, berries, and a vinaigrette made from fermented beans and pollen. This is where nature's complexity comes alive!	melnikovstella	\N	\N
3337494528	tipo	110 Hanover Street	United Kingdom	Edinburgh	Air conditioning,Counter dining	https://www.tipoedinburgh.co.uk	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	££	t	t	Named after the fine Italian '00' flour that’s used for making pasta, this relaxed and comforting restaurant could quickly become your go-to in Edinburgh’s New Town. British, Mediterranean and Italian cuisines all influence the menu, which provides plenty of flavour and value for money. The small plates selection is mightily appealing, but it's the seriously good homemade pastas like bigoli cacio e pepe that most catch the eye.	bianconathan	\N	\N
