3336329000	Palmito	16 Western Road	United Kingdom	Brighton and Hove		https://www.palmito.co.uk/	Nessun premio	Asian, South American	5.0	££	t	f	The plates are small and the flavours are big at this wonderful little neighbourhood restaurant. The style of the food is described as ‘spice driven’ and draws on multiple global cuisines across the selection of affordable dishes. The décor is simple and understated, but the cooking is bold and interesting, with an appropriate degree of care taken in the kitchen. Kick your evening off with a colourful cocktail, and make sure to end it with a delicious dessert.	montesialessandro	\N	\N
3334219989	Cin Cin	60 Western Road	United Kingdom	Brighton and Hove	Counter dining	https://www.cincin.co.uk	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	££	t	t	Cin Cin’s loyal band of customers come for its great value Italian food, where fresh ingredients are simply cooked and natural flavours are allowed to shine. You can create a different experience every time you visit by sitting in a different place: in front of the open kitchen, at the horseshoe counter, gazing out the window onto the street or in the calmer rear room. Wherever you choose, the terrific homemade pasta is a must – look out for the daily special on the blackboard. An all-Italian wine list completes the picture.	silvestritommy	\N	\N
