3333148081	Marmo	31 Baldwin Street	United Kingdom	City of Bristol	Air conditioning	https://www.marmo.restaurant	Nessun premio	Italian	5.0	££	t	f	The former Guardian Assurance Building makes a charming spot for a restaurant, thanks to its characterful interiors with high ceilings, parquet flooring and panelled walls. The rustic look is a perfect fit for this osteria-cum-wine-bar, where the concise menu of classic Italian dishes adheres to the old adage that 'less is more' – straightforward options like hand-rolled strozzapreti with wild boar ragu deliver bags of flavour with just a few ingredients. If you needed more reasons to visit, the service is confident and personable, and it all comes with an appealing price tag.	frolovjulia	\N	\N
