3330982533	Noto	47a Thistle Street	United Kingdom	Edinburgh	Counter dining	https://notoedinburgh.co.uk/	Nessun premio	Asian Influences, Modern Cuisine	4.0	££	f	t	Following the success of aizle, Stuart Ralston took inspiration for his next restaurant from time spent in New York, naming this small plates spot after his NYC roommate, Bob Noto. It’s been a hit ever since, offering well-conceived dishes at sensible prices that are ideal for sharing. The culinary influences span the globe, with a particular focus on a range of Asian cuisines, be that through duck bao buns or a luscious chocolate and miso dessert.	silvestritommy	\N	\N
