3334759434	Kushi-Ya	14a Low Pavement	United Kingdom	Nottingham	Air conditioning,Counter dining,Terrace,Wheelchair access	https://kushi-ya.co.uk	Nessun premio	Japanese	4.0	££	t	t	Head through the arch of Enfield Chambers and you'll be transported to this uber-cool setting. The Japanese cooking revolves around small plates and skewers, cooked over a charcoal grill with consummate skill. Bright, authentic and generous, each dish is a joy to eat and sensibly priced too. If you're coming for lunch, get here early as they don't take bookings and the lunchtime offer is phenomenally good value. Efficient service, a dynamic atmosphere and a courtyard terrace all add to the already considerable appeal.	martinooliver	\N	\N
